window.AKK_AFTER_REBIRTH_I_WAS_FORCED_TO_BECOME_THE_MAFIA_PRINCESS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AFTER_REBIRTH_I_WAS_FORCED_TO_BECOME_THE_MAFIA_PRINCESS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":601,"title":"Chapter 601: 601. The Former Member Who Took a Wrong Turn.","paragraphs":["With a loud bang, the door to the chess and card room was kicked open from the outside!","A group of figures in black suits, whom Brother Snake was very familiar with, suddenly appeared at the doorway.","Then, a young man with parted hair walked into the room, looking at the panicked Brother Snake with a half-smile on his face.","When Brother Snake saw who it was, his face instantly drained of color.","Zhang Tao, one of the founding members of the Wanlong Society, and currently the head of their internet cafe projects.","He happened to be inspecting the internet cafe branches in Wushui County today when he ran into this matter, so he rushed over with his men from the county.","Zhang Tao and Brother Snake used to be in the same batch of brothers who followed Ma Da and the others to collect fish catches. Later, one chose to stay, and the other chose to quit, embarking on completely different paths from then on.","\"Oh, isn't this Little San? Long time no see.\"","Brother Snake stammered, \"Brother... Brother Tao.\"","His real name was Li Sansan, a rather weird name. At the time, everyone jokingly gave him the nickname Little San.","Zhang Tao looked Li Sansan up and down. \"Little San, you seem pretty busy. Are you going on a long trip?\"","Brother Snake managed to squeeze out a smile that was uglier than crying. \"Brother Tao, why... why are you here? You didn't even give me a heads-up so I could prepare...\"","\"Prepare what? Prepare to run away?\"","Zhang Tao walked over to the mahjong table and poked at the pile of cash in the bag with his finger. \"Not bad, Little San. You've struck it rich now, haven't you? Carrying over a hundred thousand in your bag at all times. Should I be calling you Boss Li from now on?\"","\"Brother Tao, you're... you're joking. I'm just doing a little business, just enough to feed myself.\"","Zhang Tao pulled up a chair, took out a pack of cigarettes, put one in his mouth, lit it, and took a drag.","\"You're too modest, Little San. Your business isn't small at all. You've been swindling people in Wushui County under the banner of our Wanlong Society, collecting protection fees, and tricking people into paying to join the gang. You're making money even easier than the internet cafe branches I manage.\"","\"No! Brother Tao, I absolutely did not use the Wanlong Society's name!\"","Li Sansan flatly denied it. \"I was just bragging, trying to look tough. I really didn't dare to ruin the reputation of our Wanlong Society.\"","Zhang Tao raised an eyebrow. \"Is that so? Bring them in, then.\"","As soon as he spoke, several men in black escorted Sun Neng and four others, along with Li Sansan's lackey named Little Jun, into the room.","Upon entering, Sun Neng and his group saw Brother Snake, Li Sansan, as if they had found a lifesaver, and hurriedly cried out.","\"Brother Snake! Brother Snake! What is going on? Why did the big brothers from the Wanlong Society grab us?\"","\"Brother Snake, hurry up and tell these big brothers, we're on the same side!\"","\"That's right, Brother Snake, we already paid the money. You promised to bring us into the society. Please, explain it to them!\"","\"...\"","Hearing their clamor, Li Sansan instantly panicked. \"Shut up! All of you, shut the hell up! Stop talking nonsense! Who is on the same side as you? Who took your money?\"","Sun Neng and the others didn't expect him to deny it outright and became anxious too.","\"Brother Snake, what are you saying? What do you mean we didn't give you money? Just now, right here, we handed you a hundred and twenty thousand in cash. How can you deny it now?\"","\"Brother Snake, you even said you could get us into the society tomorrow. Are you trying to turn your back on us and pull a double-cross?\"","\"Aren't you a founding elder of the Wanlong Society? Don't you have a group photo with Brother Ma? Just explain to them that we're on the same side.\"","\"Yeah, Brother Snake! Could it be that you're a scammer who deliberately tricked us out of our money?\"","\"Brother Snake, you must give us an explanation!\"","\"...\"","Right at this moment, Zhang Tao slowly spoke up.","\"Little San, they just said you still kept that group photo with Brother Ma? Come on, bring it over and let me have a look.\"","Li Sansan didn't dare to refuse. Trembling, he took out his phone and handed it over.","Hearing Zhang Tao's words, Sun Neng and the others breathed a slight sigh of relief. They really thought Brother Snake was a scammer just now, but hearing this Wanlong Society big boss also mention the photo, they figured things were taking a turn for the better.","Zhang Tao took the phone, pressed a few buttons on the keypad, and his gaze landed on a somewhat blurry group photo.","The background of the photo was a private room in a restaurant. Over a dozen people were gathered around a round table. The slightly chubby young man sitting in the middle was raising his glass and smiling, and sitting right next to him was Li Sansan, who was smiling very happily.","Seeing this photo, Zhang Tao's eyes did change slightly—not with anger, but with melancholy.","Back then, they were still driving a broken-down minivan in the countryside to collect fish catches. When they came back in the evening, Brother Ma treated everyone to a meal at a restaurant to reward the brothers who worked with him.","At that time, Little San was still a newcomer who worked quite hard.","But a year later, everything had changed.","\"Little San, I remember Brother Ma was quite happy that time. He said that although you were a bit slick, you were diligent and clever. That's why he specifically let you sit next to him, telling you to eat more and work hard in the future.\"","Hearing Zhang Tao bring this up, Li Sansan felt a sourness in his nose and almost genuinely shed a tear.","Although it was hard and tiring back then, everyone's goals were aligned, and their hearts were at ease. The Young Lady and Brother Ma truly never mistreated their brothers.","\"Later, The Young Lady knew that going up against Niu Ben would be very dangerous, so she gave everyone a choice. She would never mistreat those who were willing to follow her, and she also gave severance pay to those who wanted to leave, allowing everyone to part on good terms.\"","\"You took the money and left back then. None of us said you were wrong; everyone has their own ambitions.\"","Zhang Tao suddenly turned stern. \"But what the hell are you doing now!!!\"","\"You use this photo to swindle people everywhere, saying you are a founding elder of the Wanlong Society? Saying you are Brother Ma's trusted confidant? Saying you can arrange for people to join the gang? You are really asking for a prison sentence!\" Saying this, he angrily picked up the phone and threw it directly at Li Sansan.","Li Sansan didn't dare to dodge. The phone smashed forcefully against his head, making him bare his teeth in pain, but he didn't utter a single sound.","At this point, after hearing the whole story, Sun Neng and the others completely realized what was going on. This bastard really was a scammer!","\"You bastard! Li Sansan! Screw your ancestors! You really are a scammer!\"","\"My money, give me my money back!\"","\"You dog, you'll die a horrible death!\"","\"...\"","Being cursed at by Sun Neng and the others, Li Sansan knew that everything was over. He then scrambled over to Zhang Tao's feet, kowtowing loudly and crying for mercy.","\"Brother Tao! Brother Tao, I was wrong! I'm not human! I let greed blind my heart!\"","\"For the sake of the times we used to hang out together, please spare me this once! I won't take a single cent of that money, I'll pay it all back in compensation! I'll compensate!\"","\"Also, I promise to disappear immediately and never appear in front of you or the brothers of the Wanlong Society for the rest of my life.\"","\"I beg you, Brother Tao, give me a way out! I know I was wrong, I really know I was wrong!\"","Zhang Tao's face remained entirely unmoved. Instead, he asked him a question.","\"Little San, tell me, for someone like you who has swindled hundreds of thousands, how would you be dealt with according to the law? Let's hear it.\"","Li Sansan's crying hitched for a moment, and he answered instinctively, \"This... this counts as an exceptionally huge amount. According to the penal code, defrauding public or private property of an exceptionally huge amount carries a sentence of three to ten years in prison. If there are other particularly serious circumstances, the penalty is ten years to life in prison, along with a fine or confiscation of property...\"","After rattling off the legal statutes, he froze. A flash of panic crossed his eyes, as if he had only just realized what he had let slip.","A brief silence fell over the card room.","Sun Neng and the others went deathly pale.","What did he mean, ten years or more? Life in prison?","Damn it, what kind of organization was the Wanlong Gang anyway? Could they really just hand out criminal sentences to people directly?","Were they actually that ruthless?"]},{"number":602,"title":"Chapter 602: 602, Recovery of Funds.","paragraphs":["Zhang Tao stared silently at Li Sansan for several seconds.","Suddenly, he laughed.","It wasn't the mocking smile from before, but a laugh of extreme disappointment mixed with absolute fury.","\"Heh... Hahahaha...\"","\"Li Sansan, oh Li Sansan, you really make me look at you in a new light time and time again!\"","As one of the earliest followers of the Eldest Miss, they were also the first to learn legal knowledge from top lawyer Zhao, and Brother Snake, Li Sansan, was naturally no exception.","What Zhang Tao didn't expect, however, was that after all this time, Li Sansan could still remember these legal provisions so clearly. This only made him angrier, absolutely enraged.","Bang! He slammed his hand hard on the mahjong table.","\"You fucking knew everything, yet you still dared to do this!\"","\"Since you knowingly broke the law! Deliberately committing a crime! Then I have even less reason to let you off!\"","The more Zhang Tao spoke, the angrier he got. He suddenly kicked Li Sansan flying and shouted sternly.","\"Take them away! Take them all away! Execute them on the spot!\"","\"Yes, Brother Tao!\"","The men in black instantly swarmed up, directly subduing the limp Li Sansan, Sun Neng, and the rest, dragging them out.","Li Sansan probably still understood what the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's \"execute on the spot\" meant—most likely, they'd beat them up first and then send them behind bars.","But Sun Neng and his crew didn't know that.","What did \"execute on the spot\" mean? Did it mean they were going to be offed right then and there? Assuming they hadn't failed their language classes, that is.","At this thought, Sun Neng and the others were instantly scared out of their wits, howling like pigs being slaughtered.","\"No! Spare us, Brother Tao! We'll never dare to do it again! Don't kill us! Don't kill us!\"","\"Boss! Boss! We just scammed a little money, it's not a capital offense!\"","\"Please let us go!\"","The underling named Xiaojun was the most bewildered. \"Wait, boss, I'm just an errand boy! Ten bucks really can't buy Chunghwa cigarettes and a leg of lamb, don't kill me!\"","This group cried and screamed miserably. Especially in the dead of night, the penetrating power of their voices was much stronger than during the day, instantly spreading all around and alarming quite a few people.","Some nearby residents and punks loitering on the streets heard the commotion and ran over to peek secretly.","\"Good heavens, are they catching pigs in the middle of the night? Screaming so miserably?\"","\"What catching pigs, they're catching people! See that? Black clothes, black cars, looks like people from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.\"","\"Holy crap! It really is the bosses from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!\"","\"Who's so unlucky to have offended the bosses of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society?\"","\"Must have clashed with their people. The ones getting caught are probably some arrogant fools who kicked an iron plate.\"","\"Did I hear wrong, or were they yelling about not killing people? Does the Ten Thousand Dragons Society really kill people? I heard they were doing legitimate business now? Some formal company?\"","\"That's just on the surface. You guys haven't seen the Ten Thousand Dragons Society make a move in too long. If you knew their history, you'd know how fierce and dark these guys used to be. Back in the day, even Niu Ben, the local tyrant who dominated Wushui County for years, was offed by them, let alone a few small fries like these.\"","\"Damn! We better be careful in the future.\"","\"Sigh, I thought the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had restrained themselves and were doing proper business, bringing daylight to Wushui County. I didn't expect them to still be so dark.\"","\"Tell me about it.\"","\"........\"","After catching the men and sending them to the police station, Zhang Tao called the Eldest Miss to report the situation.","This incident served as a wake-up call for them. As the Ten Thousand Dragons Society grew larger, there would always be scoundrels using their name to do evil.","Liu Yutong subsequently notified Ma Da to conduct a massive sweep. If anyone was found scamming people under the banner of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, every single one of them was to be sent to jail without leniency. They absolutely could not let those rats ruin the Society's reputation.","Hearing this, Ma Da felt a bit weird. Did the reputation of their Ten Thousand Dragons Society even need maintaining?","However, he immediately stated that he would notify the heads of all departments tomorrow to conduct an in-depth inspection.",".....................","The next morning, Duan Village.","A group of elderly people had already gathered in the village square, each looking worse than the last.","They had been arriving one after another since the crack of dawn, eagerly waiting for their deposits to be refunded and to receive their welfare benefits. But they waited and waited. Watching the sun gradually rise, there was no sign of the two cars from yesterday on the road, only the occasional agricultural vehicle and passing villagers.","\"What time is it already, why aren't they here yet?\"","\"Could they have been delayed on the road?\"","More than half an hour passed, and there was still no news. The crowd began to grow restless.","\"Something's not right. Didn't that Manager Sun leave a business card yesterday? Why can't I get through on the phone?\"","\"I called too, couldn't get through at all. It's an empty number.\"","\"I called as well, empty number.\"","\"Oh no, could they have run away?\"","The moment the words \"run away\" came out of a villager's mouth, everyone instantly panicked.","\"That can't be, right? They looked quite professional, and they even had that certificate from some international association.\"","\"My son-in-law in the city said you can get those certificate things made at any random print shop.\"","\"But they said they would come again today, and they even said they'd give us big gift bags and bring more good stuff...\"","\"You actually believed words meant to coax you?\"","\"Oh my God! My money, my three thousand yuan!\" A middle-aged woman was the first to break down, slapping her thighs as she cried and shouted.","With her crying, others quickly followed suit.","\"I spent five thousand, bought some decoration that just hurts my body.\"","\"I spent one thousand..........\"","\"And me...\"","Just then, an old man couldn't bear the blow. His body suddenly convulsed, and he collapsed toward the ground.","Fortunately, the people next to him were quick to catch him, preventing the back of his head from hitting the ground. However, the old man's face looked terrible, his lips were trembling, and it looked like he was about to stop breathing, terrifying everyone.","\"Old Man Wang! Old Man Wang! What's wrong?\"","\"Quick! Pinch his philtrum!\"","\"We're doomed, we're doomed. If he dies from this shock, what are we going to do?\"","\"Quick, go find a doctor, hurry!\"","The square instantly devolved into a mess.","Just then, a cold, clear voice sounded behind them.","\"Everyone, don't panic. Spread out a bit and let Grandpa Wang get some air.\"","Everyone turned to look, only to see that Liu Yutong and Lan Die had somehow arrived behind them.","Liu Yutong walked over, squatted down, and first checked Old Man Wang's breath and pulse, then peeled back his eyelids to check.","\"Yutong girl, Old Man Wang is suffering from a severe anxiety attack. His two thousand yuan was his pension money that he saved up for a long time, and now it's all been swindled.\"","Liu Yutong nodded, signaling everyone to be quiet.","\"Everyone, don't worry yet. Grandpa Wang is fine, he's just too agitated. Also, those scammers were caught by my people in the county town last night. The money they swindled has all been recovered and is currently being verified and counted.\"","\"At the latest by tomorrow, the scammed money should be refunded into everyone's hands.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the expressions on everyone's faces instantly turned to pleasant surprise.","\"They were really caught?\"","\"Is the money really coming back?\"","\"Is it true? Yutong, my dear, you're not lying to us, are you?\"","Liu Yutong nodded firmly. \"It's true, so please don't worry too much. Your money isn't gone.\"","Old Man Wang, who had been lying flat on his back, suddenly snapped his eyes open. With a swift kip-up, he leaped to his feet and cried out in agitation, \"Girl! What did you just say? We can really get our money back?\"","This sudden burst of agility gave everyone a fright. Was this some sort of medical miracle?","Even Liu Yutong was caught off guard. She hadn't expected Grandpa Wang, a man in his seventies, to still be capable of such an acrobatic stunt.","After making sure Grandpa Wang was truly alright, Liu Yutong turned her attention back to the elderly villagers and emphasized her point once more.","\"We were just lucky to recover the money this time. Everyone needs to learn from this lesson and stop trusting strangers. From now on, whenever money is involved, you must keep your guard up and discuss it with your families first. I was fortunate enough to catch those scammers this time, but we won't be so lucky next time.\"","\"We'll remember! We'll remember!\"","\"We definitely won't dare fall for it again!\"","\"I'm going to throw out those useless bottles and junk mattresses the moment I get home!\"","..........","With the village's crisis resolved, Liu Yutong packed up that very afternoon. She gathered Yaya, bid farewell to her grandparents, and headed out.","Aside from the fact that Yaya needed to get back to kindergarten, there were two urgent matters waiting for her. The first was organizing the promotional campaign for the launch of Weibo.","The second was dealing with Ji Zhe and Chu Hai, her two investors, who were currently storming her way to aggressively demand an explanation.",".........."]},{"number":603,"title":"Chapter 603: 603, Is Wanhui Youxuan Digging Its Own Grave","paragraphs":["Recently, several pieces of explosive good news have been circulating in the financial media circles.","\"Epic Move! Four Trillion Yuan Investment Plan to Secure Economic Growth!\"","\"National Promotion Plan for Home Appliances in Rural Areas Officially Launched, Featuring a 13% Financial Subsidy!\"","\"Color TVs, Refrigerators, Mobile Phones, and Washing Machines: The Consumption Potential of Hundreds of Millions of Farmers is About to be Unleashed!\"","With the successive implementation of these two super policies—the four trillion yuan investment and the rural home appliance subsidy—the pessimism that had previously permeated due to the global financial crisis was swept away. The entire market was injected with a shot of adrenaline, instantly boiling over with excitement.","The stock market's reaction was the most direct. The A-share market spent almost the entire week in the green, surging wildly.","The home appliance sector was particularly notable. For example, Qiming Electronics, which had recently experienced a power struggle, saw its stock price perform brilliantly, with a cumulative increase of nearly 70% over half a month. A massive boon!","Of course, amidst this overwhelming wave of positive news, the global dark horse of group-buying websites, Wanhui Youxuan, unexpectedly found itself the subject of a series of negative reports.","Naturally, these negative reports primarily appeared in the financial sections.","\"Wanhui Youxuan Announces Sudden New Welfare Policy, Monthly Costs Surge by Tens of Millions, Casting a Shadow Over its Path to IPO.\"","\"Comprehensive Insurance for Delivery Riders: Is the Group-Buying Upstart Being Idealistic or Committing Financial Suicide?\"","The most impactful was the headline on the financial page of a certain web portal, which gave off a truly shocking vibe.","\"Wanhui Youxuan Sabotages Itself, Investors in Collective Panic: Could the Recently Completed Series C Funding be its Last?\"","\"Will Wanhui Youxuan's 6.8 Billion Valuation Turn Out to be a Bubble?\"","Just yesterday, Wanhui Youxuan issued an announcement declaring that it would purchase complimentary accident insurance for all its delivery riders and fully cover the mandatory social insurance and housing provident fund for its full-time riders.","At the bottom of the announcement was a bright red official seal, along with the signature of General Manager Yu Xin.","The signature was very beautiful!","The content was explosive.","And the investors' mindsets were equally explosive!","...........","Downstairs at the Shunchang Building.","A black Mercedes-Benz pulled up to the entrance.","Ji Zhe pushed the door open and stepped out, looking up at the characters for Shunchang displayed on the building in front of him.","Shunchang carried multiple meanings. It could mean smooth and prosperous. Of course, it also had another implication: those who submit will prosper, and those who resist will perish.","He leaned more towards the latter, simply because this was the headquarters of the Wanlong Syndicate.","The door on the other side opened, and Chu Hai also got out of the car carrying a briefcase. He then turned to look at Ji Zhe. \"President Ji, what are we going to say in a moment?\"","\"We will say exactly what needs to be said. This is a matter of principle. No matter how capable Liu Yutong is, she can't just act this recklessly.\"","After saying this, Ji Zhe strode toward the building, his back giving off a somewhat solemn and tragic aura.","Chu Hai quickly jogged to keep up. \"President Ji, we just need to maintain this momentum. As long as we keep this imposing manner, we will definitely be able to overpower Liu Yutong.\"","Ji Zhe nodded. \"Naturally, I won't let our momentum falter.\"","After entering the lobby, the two walked toward the reception desk. Originally, they had intended to speak politely, but seeing the receptionist actually looking down and playing on a phone during working hours, combined with the anger accumulated in their hearts, they instantly erupted. A hand slammed onto the desk with a loud bang.","\"We want to see Chairwoman Liu! She must give us an explanation today!\"","\"Exactly! She must give us an explanation!\"","However, when the receptionist raised his head, the two were instantly dumbfounded.","The receptionist wasn't a receptionist, but someone they were very familiar with: Ma Da.","Ma Da was still chewing gum. His emotionless gaze swept across their faces, and then he blew a bubble from his mouth.","With a pop, the bubble burst.","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai shuddered violently, snapping back to reality.","The next second!","The two began to smile obsequiously, like ancient eunuchs greeting their master.","\"Oh my, it's you, Boss Ma. I was just wondering why the magpies wouldn't stop singing when I left the house this morning. It turns out I was in for a stroke of good luck to run into you. Boss Ma, are you personally experiencing grassroots work? Truly observing the conditions of the people, low-key and pragmatic. It makes us feel ashamed, truly ashamed!\"","\"Boss Ma, your complexion today is truly vigorous and full of restrained dominance! And this chewing gum... hmm... at first glance, it's clearly a major international brand. Even the bubbles it blows are different!\"","Ma Da looked at the two wrinkled, chrysanthemum-like faces before him and asked with a half-smile, \"Looking for the Young Lady?\"","\"Yes, yes, yes!\"","\"We just have a tiny, insignificant business issue we want to discuss with Chairwoman Liu... no, report to her. We absolutely don't mean anything else. What just happened was a misunderstanding. It's an old habit of mine; whenever I get excited, I can't control my hands. Don't worry, I'll chop this useless hand off as soon as I get back!\"","\"Right, right, we didn't do it on purpose.\"","The two hastily explained.","Ma Da stuffed his phone back into his pocket, stood up, and spat his chewing gum into the trash can with a ptui sound.","\"The Young Lady is upstairs. Also, keep your voices down when you're downstairs, so you don't cause any more misunderstandings.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai went stiff all over, the fawning smiles on their faces growing even thicker.","\"Understood! Understood! Thank you for the reminder, Boss Ma! Look how clumsy I am!\"","\"We will definitely keep it down, keep it down!\"","Ma Da nodded and said, \"I'll be taking off then. Make yourselves at home.\"","\"Take care, Boss Ma!\"","\"Get back to your busy schedule!\"","It wasn't until Ma Da's figure disappeared out the front doors that Ji Zhe and Chu Hai simultaneously let their shoulders slump, letting out a long sigh of relief.","Then, the two looked at each other and scratched their heads in a bit of embarrassment.","\"So, shall we go up?\"","\"Alright!\"","The two tacitly refrained from mentioning anything about overpowering Liu Yutong with their momentum again. After all, Ma Da alone had scared them half to death.","After stepping into the elevator.","Making sure no one could eavesdrop, Chu Hai finally spoke up. \"President Ji, what do you think Chairwoman Liu is thinking? Wanhui Youxuan's group-buying business has been running for less than a year, and the model hasn't even been fully validated yet. Shouldn't we be putting all our effort into expanding into new cities and seizing market share right now? After all, we have the first-mover advantage. But instead, she suddenly decides to buy insurance and pay social security for all the delivery workers. Isn't this just messing around?\"","When he first saw the announcement issued by Wanhui Youxuan, his immediate reaction had been: Why on earth is Your Majesty rebelling against herself!","Ji Zhe replied, \"I want to know even more than you do. We just raised 300 million dollars in Series C funding, and the investors are eagerly waiting for us to push for an IPO next year. With this single move, she has completely blown a hole straight through our income statement.\"","\"Yeah, our future is completely up in the air now!\"","As capitalists, they knew very well how massive the risk of Liu Yutong's actions was, because it completely inverted the priorities of the two core elements of the internet industry: costs and expansion.","Right now, the domestic internet sector believed in a single golden rule: In the world of martial arts, only speed is invincible.","The primary purpose of the frantic injection of capital was to buy speed and scale—to open up new cities faster and to snatch up market share more fiercely.","Under this premise, any expenditure that could not be directly converted into growth data was viewed as an invalid cost, let alone spending on the grassroots group of delivery workers, whom they considered to be highly replaceable.","Right now, Wanhui Preferred held a distinct first-mover advantage. As the very first group-buying platform both domestically and globally, this was the time to burn cash relentlessly to acquire traffic and seize market share. According to their projections, Wanhui Preferred was on track to go public next year, and they would all get to ring the opening bell at NASDAQ.","Yet, at this critical juncture, Wanhui Preferred had chosen to focus on building a welfare and security system for its delivery riders—a move that contributed absolutely nothing to their growth metrics, or at least, that was how the investors saw it.","The group-buying model had been around for nearly a year. In that time, the market had exploded from Wanhui Preferred being the sole player to hundreds of competing platforms, with the numbers still climbing rapidly.","For Wanhui Preferred to suddenly pull a stunt like this at such a crucial moment was akin to a sprinter stopping to tie their shoelaces in the middle of a hundred-meter dash. They were at serious risk of losing their absolute dominance and being directly overtaken by competitors, which would inevitably drag out their IPO process.","From the perspective of these investors, this was an absolute nightmare!","That was exactly why the two of them had traveled all this way, ready to drop to their knees and beg Liu Yutong for an explanation!"]},{"number":604,"title":"Chapter 604: 604. Providing the Benefits of Security, Yet Digging Pits","paragraphs":["With a ding, the elevator stopped at the top floor.","As soon as the doors opened, a woman in professional attire was already waiting at the entrance to welcome them.","\"President Ji, President Chu, the boss is waiting for you in the office.\"","Ji Zhe and Xu Hai exchanged a glance, giving each other an encouraging look.","After all, they were about to face the true boss of the Wanlong Syndicate. To say they weren't intimidated would be a lie.","Just as the two of them reached the office door, the assistant, Su Mansu, pushed it open. \"Boss, President Ji and President Chu have arrived.\"","Inside the office, Liu Yutong and Yu Xin were sitting on the sofa, sipping tea and chatting with smiles on their faces, seemingly discussing something delightful.","Seeing Ji Zhe and his companion enter, Liu Yutong set down her teacup and turned her gaze toward them, a faint smile still lingering on her face.","For some reason, even though the girl before them was beautiful and her smile was lovely, Ji Zhe and Xu Hai still felt an invisible pressure.","\"President Ji, President Xu, please have a seat,\" Yu Xin stood up and gestured with her hand.","The two sat down.","Chu Hai habitually took out a voice recorder and placed it on the table, but after a moment of hesitation, he quietly put it back away.","Damn it, this was the Wanlong Syndicate. If he accidentally recorded something he shouldn't, he might be silenced for good.","Ji Zhe took a deep breath, preparing to speak up and question them. However, when he met the calm gazes of Liu Yutong and Yu Xin, the little bit of momentum he had managed to muster faded away.","Honestly, cooperating with the Wanlong Syndicate was quite miserable. As investors, wherever else they went, weren't they treated as honored guests? Didn't they hold the initiative? They could make money while standing tall.","But here at the Wanlong Syndicate, they were practically begging on their knees.","\"Chairman Liu, we came here today because we wanted to talk to you and President Yu about the company's newly introduced rider welfare policy. I wonder if you and President Yu have seen the reports outside?\"","\"We have,\" Liu Yutong nodded.","Yu Xin also nodded in agreement.","Ji Zhe said, \"Chairman Liu, since you've seen them, why did you still do it? You have no idea how many calls we received from investors in just one night. They practically cursed us to death.\"","\"Even if you want to do a good deed, shouldn't you at least wait until the company goes public and the stock lock-up period ends? Doing this now, aren't you just throwing us all under the bus?\"","After listening quietly, Liu Yutong asked, \"So, President Ji, what do you think we should do?\"","Ji Zhe replied, \"Of course, we should retract the policy and issue a supplementary statement. We can say that the previous welfare policy was poorly considered and needs adjustment, so it will only cover full-time riders for now, while part-time riders will be discussed later.\"","Liu Yutong shook her head and said, \"Constantly changing a policy that has already been announced will cause even greater damage to the company's reputation.\"","\"That's still better than watching the company be dragged down!\"","Ji Zhe became a bit agitated. \"We've done the math. If we do this, the company's monthly costs will increase by at least twelve million, which is over a hundred million a year. Moreover, Wanhui Youxuan's net loss this year has already exceeded four hundred million. It wasn't making money to begin with, and now with such a massive sudden increase in labor costs, the pressure is simply too great.\"","\"And think about it, we are doing group buying and delivery, which is still an emerging model. At a time like this, we should be concentrating our resources on seizing the market and building barriers, rather than spending money on delivery personnel.\"","\"If things continue like this, whether we can even turn a profit will be a problem, let alone going public. What investment bank would dare to take our case?\"","Liu Yutong slightly raised her delicate eyebrows. \"You guys!\"","\"Wasn't it you who agreed in the beginning that Wanhui Youxuan's case would be left to you, and told me not to worry? I took that seriously. Could it be that you were joking with me?\"","Ji Zhe and Xu Hai suddenly choked up, hurriedly waving their hands. \"It wasn't a joke, not a joke. You must be kidding.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Since it wasn't a joke, then you should proceed with what you need to do. We will operate Wanhui Youxuan properly, so there is no need for you two to worry about it further.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai exchanged another glance, only bitterness remaining on their faces.","Damn it, do we really have no human rights left at all!","Is this still a normal relationship between investors and investees?","They had talked their hearts out for so long, and they were just brushed off so lightly?","Honestly, at this moment, they really wanted to ask: Can we withdraw our investment?","It was just that they didn't dare.","If Liu Yutong were to turn around and claim they had no money, wouldn't the tens of millions they invested just go down the drain?","Due to certain well-known reasons, the investment agreement they signed with the Wanlong Syndicate was much looser compared to other projects. It did not mandate that the Wanlong Group must buy back their shares if problems arose with the project.","Therefore, if Wanhui Youxuan ultimately failed to go public, they would suffer massive losses and could only consider themselves unlucky.","Right then, Yu Xin, who had been listening quietly from the sidelines, felt it was about time. She picked up the teapot and stood up to refill their cups with hot water.","\"President Ji, President Chu, have some tea first to cool down.\"","\"All the issues you were worried about just now, like costs, profitability, and so on, we have already calculated internally.\"","\"Precisely because we have run the projections, we are even more convinced that doing this now is the right move. It can quickly build a solid moat for us.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Ji Zhe was confused.","Right now, the entire industry was competing on financing, subsidies, and the speed of city expansion. Shouldn't a moat be based on technology, scale, or capital? How could it possibly have anything to do with delivery personnel welfare?","It wasn't their fault for having this conventional mindset.","Currently, many corporate employees in the country still didn't have basic social insurance, and many bosses and capitalists had long comfortably believed that costs in this area could be saved. Especially for highly mobile positions like delivery personnel, in their eyes, there was even less need for investment. Outsourcing it would save so much money, which had to be better than their current choice.","Yu Xin, however, explained the benefits of doing this from another angle.","\"You two presidents, I believe that as investors, you are well aware of how strong the replication capabilities of the domestic internet industry are. Take our Wanhui Youxuan as an example. Although we are the first platform to do group buying and delivery, it hasn't been long, and several formidable competitors have already emerged, such as Kuaisong Network and Pinshihui.\"","\"To put it bluntly, no matter how good an idea is, if a strong moat isn't built, it can still easily be overtaken or even eliminated by others.\"","\"Why do I say this policy is building a moat? Because Sister Yutong and I have always believed that for a group-buying platform, 'people' and 'good service' are the most important things.\"","\"President Ji, you just said we should concentrate our resources to seize the market and build barriers. Then let me ask you, in this group-buying model, what is the ultimate barrier? Is it lower prices? Kuaisong Network and Pinshihui can also raise a lot of money, and they might even subsidize more aggressively than we do.\"","\"Is it the large number of onboarded merchants? As long as the commission you offer is low enough and your ground promotion is fierce enough, merchants can also be poached away.\"","\"We believe that what truly makes users return time and again, and even choose us first when prices are similar, is the real moat.\"","\"To achieve this, the most crucial thing is the experience. It is the smoothness, reliability, and peace of mind throughout the entire chain from placing an order to receiving the goods. The most fragile link in this chain, and the one that best reflects differentiation, is delivery.\"","If the two investors, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai, had not come to demand an explanation, they might still have thought that their competitors would catch up. But now, they were almost certain that those rivals would not do so. Inertial thinking is hard to change in a short period of time.","And this was the best opportunity for them to consolidate their position in the future market competition, rather than waiting until several competitors who were too powerful to deal with emerged. By then, it would be too late.","\"The turnover rate of the delivery team is very high right now, which you two should be aware of, right? Why is it so high? It is because of unstable income, lack of security, and a low sense of professional dignity. A rider delivering food today might go work at a construction site tomorrow.\"","\"Under these circumstances, is it realistic for us to demand that they provide service with a smile, pay attention to details, and work regardless of the weather? In reality, they will only calculate the time, snatch orders, and avoid being fined for exceeding the time limit too much. Good service is out of the question; it is already good enough if they do not carry resentment.\"","\"Our new policy this time is to fundamentally change this situation. Buying accident insurance for all riders is to relieve them of their worries, so they do not have to fear going bankrupt just from a fall. Paying for the comprehensive social insurance and housing fund for full-time riders is to give them professional identity recognition and long-term security. They are not just errand boys, but official employees of Wanhui Preferred, enjoying rights protected by law!\"","\"A rider who feels secure and has a sense of belonging will definitely provide better service. With better service, word-of-mouth among users will improve. When all these details accumulate, user stickiness will become much higher.\"","\"All of these will work together to build a powerful moat!\"","\"I suggest you two think carefully. If other platforms cannot provide any security, which platform will those riders choose to take orders from?\"","\"Without riders, your delivery efficiency will drop, the user experience will worsen, and then you will slowly fall into a vicious cycle.\"","\"When that time comes, what will they use to shake our dominant position? Our leading status will be indestructible!\"","Yu Xin's final words were logically clear and resoundingly powerful.","After listening, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai could not help but fall deep into thought.","Following her analysis, this policy indeed sounded like a highly visionary strategy.","They also knew that since the emergence of Wanhui Preferred, copycat group-buying websites had sprung up like mushrooms after rain. To maintain an absolute advantage, they really needed something distinctive...","Before the two could fully sort out their thoughts, Liu Yutong suddenly spoke up.","\"If you two have not figured it out, you can go back and think about it slowly. Since you are here today, let us talk about the next investment project. The new project does not require a large amount of financing, about ten billion will be enough.\"","Ji Zhe: \"???\"","Xu Hai: \"???\"","Wait, what did that mean?","We have not even jumped out of this pit yet, and you have dug an even bigger one for us?"]},{"number":605,"title":"Chapter 605: 605: The Investor Who Was Almost Driven Crazy","paragraphs":["\"What! Miss Liu, you're not joking with us, are you? You want to make chips?\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai jumped up in sheer shock. They even changed how they addressed her, showing just how agitated and out of sorts they were.","Just a moment ago, they were inwardly complaining about whether she was digging a giant pit for them to fall into. They never expected that this pit wasn't just big!","It was practically a black hole!","The office fell silent for a moment.","Liu Yutong looked at them calmly. \"Do I look like I'm joking?\"","\"Chairman Liu, but those are chips, semiconductors!\"","\"Could it be that you've poached Zhang Rujin?\" Ji Zhe asked.","If that were the case, then it might be worth investing in.","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"No, I don't even know him.\"","Chu Hai then asked, \"Then do you have the technology on hand? Or rather, do you personally understand the technology in this field?\"","Liu Yutong: \"No, and I don't understand it.\"","Ji Zhe: \"What about an engineering team? You must have relevant talent, right?\"","Liu Yutong still shook her head. \"I don't have that either.\"","Hearing this, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai's hearts turned completely cold.","No technology, no talent, and even the boss knows absolutely nothing about the industry. How are they supposed to play this game? Is this a joke?","Liu Yutong saw their concerns. \"Isn't it enough that I have money?\"","Ji Zhe: \"...\"","Chu Hai: \"...\"","They really wanted to say, \"The money you're talking about is our money, right? You really don't treat us like outsiders!\"","Ten billion!","Although the capital behind them was abundant and losing a few hundred million to play along with her wasn't something they couldn't afford, this was ten billion!","What is the concept of ten billion? Buying a cup of milk tea every day, you could drink it for over five million years.","\"Chairman Liu, can we be a bit more pragmatic? I know you're a business genius, otherwise you wouldn't have built such a massive empire today. If you said you wanted to invest in group buying or other internet industries, we would follow without a second word.\"","\"But the leap to chips is just too big, isn't it?\"","\"First, we have no technological accumulation. Second, we have no top-tier talent. Third, we have no supporting industries... Ultimately, this isn't something that can simply be built by throwing money at it.\"","\"And even if we raised ten billion, which sounds like a lot, throwing it into the chip industry might not even make a splash. Building production lines and buying lithography machines cost astronomical figures. Furthermore, ASML won't even sell us their most advanced lithography machines!\"","At this point, the two investors, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai, were practically ready to kneel down and beg her.","\"Chairman Liu, can't we just focus on taking Wanhui Select public and making steady money? Why touch a field where you have a one in ten chance of survival... no, where survival is completely impossible?\"","\"You are both right,\" Liu Yutong said. \"But I still want to do it. Let's invest ten billion in the initial stage. I can put up five billion, and you two can figure out the remaining five billion.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai were on the verge of a breakdown. They had painstakingly tried to persuade her for ages, but it turned out she hadn't listened to a single word.","\"Why! Why must you make chips!\"","\"Oh my mother, why don't you see how much the meat on my bones is worth and just sell me!\"","\"Chairman Liu, you must give us a reason, a reason that can convince us. Otherwise, even if you kill us, we absolutely won't provide this money.\"","Liu Yutong gestured to Yu Xin. Yu Xin understood and immediately took two non-disclosure agreements from Liu Yutong's desk, handing them to Ji Zhe and Chu Hai.","\"You two bosses, sign these first.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai were both stunned. \"Chairman Liu, President Yu, what is this?\"","\"A non-disclosure agreement,\" Liu Yutong said. \"Sign the NDA, and I can tell you why I want to make chips.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai looked at each other in dismay, but ultimately they both signed their names and handed them back to Yu Xin.","\"Signed. Now can you tell us the reason?\"","Liu Yutong said, \"My reason is very simple. It can make money.\"","Ji Zhe: \"???\"","Chu Hai: \"???\"","Wait, she acted all mysterious for ages and even made them sign some bullshit NDA, just for this?","Ji Zhe opened his mouth, wanting to curse, but in the end, he swallowed his words. If he was going to curse anyone, he should curse himself; he shouldn't have come to Pearl City.","Liu Yutong continued, \"I really don't understand lithography machines, nor do I know how transistors are designed. I can say I know absolutely nothing about the technical aspects. But I do know that after the financial crisis, many international semiconductor companies are downsizing. A window period for talent mobility has appeared, making it a great time to poach people. Plus, the higher-ups have just introduced the four-trillion stimulus plan, which includes an inclination toward high-tech industries. This in itself is a business opportunity. Once we build the factory, as long as we can catch up with Zhongxin in Magic City, this investment will be extremely profitable.\"","\"That's why I said doing this can make money. It's that simple.\"","Hearing this, Ji Zhe and the others' expressions finally looked a bit better. If looked at from the perspective of business development trends, this reason was indeed quite sufficient.","However, this was still far from enough to convince them.","\"Chairman Liu, we trust your business acumen, but relying on these factors alone is still not enough. The semiconductor chip industry is simply too unique,\" Chu Hai said.","\"Exactly!\" Ji Zhe also nodded.","Liu Yutong smiled lightly. \"What if I told you that I recently completed the acquisition of a foreign semiconductor equipment company?\"","She wasn't speaking without basis. After acquiring an 80% controlling stake, she used offshore capital to purchase the remaining 20% of the shares. The company itself had some issues and didn't escape the fate of bankruptcy in the future.","Of course, in the future, it actually had a chance to avoid bankruptcy, for example, by bringing in investment from the Dragon Kingdom. Unfortunately, due to some external interference, it ultimately failed to materialize and was acquired by ASML.","\"What?!\"","\"Chairman Liu, we didn't mishear, did we? You said you acquired a semiconductor equipment company?\"","\"Are... are you sure it's the kind we're thinking of?\"","The two were shocked once again, almost to the point of incoherence.","\"Chairman Liu, are you sure you're not pulling our legs?\"","Liu Yutong: \"The semiconductor equipment company I acquired mainly deals with the manufacturing and maintenance of some subsystems for lithography machines, as well as licensing some previous-generation technology. The scale is relatively small. I used an offshore capital structure to complete a wholly-owned acquisition, and now I have 100% controlling ownership.\"","\"Is this a matter of small scale?\"","\"Chairman Liu, do you know how strict the West is with reviewing technology and equity transfers for this type of company? How could you possibly acquire it all so quietly?\"","Ji Zhe's speech was even a bit clumsy as he spoke. This was just like someone saying they wanted to build a space shuttle but didn't even have blueprints, and the very next second, they casually told you they had just bought a rocket engine factory.","It was just that absurd!","Chu Hai also hurriedly asked, \"Can I ask which company it is? Is it Micro Measurement? Or Sigma Optics? No, wait, those aren't purely lithography machine manufacturers. Could it be a spun-off division of ASML?\"","Liu Yutong didn't directly name the company. \"It has nothing to do with those industry giants. It's just a small-to-medium enterprise struggling with operational difficulties. However, to me, its value doesn't lie in immediately producing a lithography machine that rivals ASML. Rather, it lies in the fact that it has a fully intact team of professionally trained engineers, a solid technical foundation in optical processing, and intellectual property and patents for certain key technologies.\"","\"Besides all that, there's one more crucial element. Through this company, we've essentially secured a guest pass into the global semiconductor equipment supply chain club. It provides us with a legal channel to access and study the industry. If necessary, we can even stea... cough, cough... borrow some technical concepts. In short, it gives us a lot more room to maneuver moving forward.\"","Hearing this, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai were left completely speechless.","Their main concerns previously had been a lack of technology, a lack of talent, a lack of supporting industries, and the fear of being at the mercy of others when it came to equipment.","They never expected the situation to completely turn around in the blink of an eye.","Sure, that company might only be capable of manufacturing low-to-mid-end lithography machines, or perhaps just certain components for them. But the gap between being able to build them and not being able to build them at all was like night and day.","With this overseas stronghold, importing technology would become much smoother, and it would also be significantly easier to secure national policy support."]},{"number":606,"title":"Chapter 606: 606, Loongson","paragraphs":["\"When exactly did you start working on this? And how did you do it? How much capital must this have required? Did you really not encounter any obstacles along the way?\" Chu Hai asked a barrage of questions in one breath. After all, it was genuinely difficult to digest all this information so quickly.","He also suddenly realized that the energy and operational tactics of Miss Liu, who was sitting right in front of them, might far exceed their previous imaginations.","She wasn't just daring enough to think big; she actually dared to execute and could deliver results!","Liu Yutong picked up her teacup and took a sip to moisten her throat. \"The specific details are highly classified commercial secrets, so it's inconvenient to disclose them for now.\"","\"Now let's return to the topic we started with: why am I making chips? As I said before, I am a businesswoman, and I believe it can make me money. I already have my first stepping stone—a factory located somewhere in the West, filled with a group of engineers currently working for me.\"","\"Of course, for certain reasons, I don't plan to import the equipment from that company. Although their technology is good, there are some issues regarding mass production. My idea is to first hunt down a batch of phased-out secondhand equipment internationally and set up the domestic factory. We can start with mature categories that have relatively low chip manufacturing requirements but massive market demand, such as television chips, set-top box chips, and so on.\"","\"You two are well aware that the country is vigorously promoting the policy of bringing home appliances to rural areas, and televisions are the top priority. However, the core chips of current mainstream domestic TV brands, whether CRT TVs or the emerging LCD TVs, almost entirely rely on imports. This is a massive market worth tens of billions annually, and with the upgrading of televisions, the demand will only grow. We can absolutely use this as our entry point into the market.\"","Hearing this, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai began to rapidly calculate in their minds, and they soon came to a conclusion.","\"The manufacturing process requirements for these types of chips are indeed not as stringent as those for mobile phone processors or computer CPUs. Many are still using the 130-nanometer or even 90-nanometer process. There is a considerable inventory of phased-out secondhand equipment for such production lines internationally, so it really is relatively easy to get our hands on them.\"","\"Exactly!\"","Liu Yutong took over the conversation and continued, \"We aren't chasing the most advanced production lines; we couldn't get them even if we tried. We only seek production lines that are usable, sufficient, and capable of quickly forming production capacity. Although the importation and calibration of secondhand equipment come with technical thresholds, we can completely resolve these issues through the Western equipment company I control.\"","\"My plan consists of three steps. Step one: leverage the technical team of the overseas company as consultants and support to establish the first 8-inch wafer production line in the country, primarily using secondhand equipment, targeting the 90-nanometer to 130-nanometer process nodes. This technical level is enough to cover the needs of most televisions, set-top boxes, and basic home appliance control chips.\"","\"Step two: simultaneously assemble a chip design team. Poach talent! And I already have a target candidate for the CEO position!\"","\"Step three: link manufacturing and design together. President Ji, President Chu, I assume you know about how I recently acquired a significant stake through the secondary market to become the major shareholder of Qiming Electronics?\"","As soon as Liu Yutong said this, a flash of lightning crossed Ji Zhe and Chu Hai's minds. Many previously seemingly scattered moves were instantly connected by this thread, forming a complete strategic map.","Qiming Electronics!","Right! How could they have forgotten about this?","In the recent highly publicized battle for control of Qiming Electronics, wasn't the biggest winner and disruptor behind the scenes the very Miss Liu sitting right in front of them?","Acquiring shares on the secondary market, forcefully entering the board of directors...","Could all of this just be a coincidence?","If at first they thought Liu Yutong entering the chip industry was suicidal, they no longer felt that way. Instead, they felt it held immense promise.","The situation had completely reversed!","Now, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai had basically figured out the threads Liu Yutong had laid down.","The furthest upstream, and also the most crucial link, was her controlling stake in a Western equipment company. This company might not be able to provide lithography machines, but it possessed a comprehensive technical team that could entirely solve the technical and partial core component issues of the subsequent domestic wafer factory. There was even a chance to steal... borrow the most advanced technology to facilitate future process improvements.","Midstream, which was what they were discussing now, involved raising funds to build a domestic wafer factory responsible for manufacturing.","Downstream was Qiming Electronics, which she controlled. It was important to note that Qiming Electronics was currently a domestic giant in appliance production and sales, with an extremely high demand for chips, making it a massive potential client.","Most crucially, this company knew exactly what kind of televisions and set-top boxes the market needed, where the cost constraints lay, and what the user pain points were. Based on these factors, they could propose chip specification requirements that were closest to the market, pass them to the chip design team for realization, then have the newly built wafer factory produce the wafers. Finally, the chips would return to Qiming Electronics, be installed in their TVs and set-top boxes, and be pushed into the massive national market for rural home appliances.","From the core technological fulcrum to the manufacturing backbone, and finally to the brand and end-user market—the upstream, midstream, and downstream chains were fully integrated, forming a closed industrial loop!","\"Damn, she... she shortened the supply chain just like that?\"","\"Is she even human?\"","The more Ji Zhe and Chu Hai thought about it, the more shocked they became, and the more terrifying they found this woman.","What kind of forward-thinking strategy was this?","First, she controlled the end brand through the capital market, then drove upstream chip design and manufacturing in reverse, while simultaneously using overseas acquisitions to secure a technological fulcrum... Every step was interlocked, pointing toward the same strategic goal.","How did this grand scale of long-term planning and industrial integration look like the work of a nineteen-year-old woman?","This vision, this boldness, this execution—she was practically a monster in the business world! A female monster!","They yielded!","They were utterly convinced!","Right now, they really wanted to kneel down and sing: \"Conquered by you just like this...\"","They really had no choice but to submit!","If she had taken things this far and still didn't succeed, then there really was no justice in the world.","They no longer felt that this ten billion was a massive pit; it was clearly Liu Yutong handing them a giant gold brick.","As long as this wafer factory could be built and reach the scale of Zhongxin, this investment would yield a massive profit!","Liu Yutong said, \"So, do you still think throwing ten billion into this is just tossing money into the water to hear a splash?\"","Ji Zhe took a deep breath, trying hard to calm himself down. \"Director Liu, please accept my deepest admiration! Your strategic layout is the most forward-looking, god-tier maneuvering we've seen in our ten-plus years in the industry! I take back all my previous doubts.\"","Chu Hai added, \"Me too, Director Liu. I am entirely in awe of your business vision and strategic boldness! We will follow you with this funding!\"","\"Director Liu, have you decided what to name our chips?\"","Liu Yutong paused for a moment. \"They will be called Dragon Chips!\""]},{"number":607,"title":"Chapter 607: 607. I Still Fell for It","paragraphs":["As Ji Zhe and Chu Hai gradually understood the resources Liu Yutong held and her strategic layout, their attitude noticeably warmed up. They began to proactively discuss various details with her, including shareholding ratios, alternative locations for domestic factories, policy alignment, and so on.","Yu Xin took notes on the side, occasionally adding a few points.","Just as their discussion was nearing its end, Liu Yutong brought up a condition.","\"I have a clear requirement regarding the capital structure of this project. Besides the funds from our two parties, we must bring in a portion of foreign capital and establish a joint venture to operate this. As for how to bring in external capital, that is a problem you need to solve.\"","\"In short, I will only handle half of the investment. You two must help me secure the other half.\"","Both Ji Zhe's Qixing Capital and Chu Hai's AEG Capital actually had international backgrounds. Strictly speaking, they were merely the partners and heads of the Long Country region.","It was precisely because of this background that Liu Yutong wanted to pull these two in for investment.","With their network, they were fully capable of drawing in some overseas capital. As long as those international capitals participated, the initial construction of Longxin would go much more smoothly.","Just as Liu Yutong had mentioned earlier, her first step was to import some second-hand semiconductor equipment. Although the target was relatively mature manufacturing processes, it would still involve many sensitive technical aspects subject to export control reviews.","If Longxin's investors included major international capital, especially those with Western backgrounds, the scrutiny and resistance faced in many aspects—whether equipment procurement or technology licensing negotiations—would be significantly reduced.","This was equivalent to acquiring a business card that granted easy passage in certain situations.","As for whether bringing in too much capital would affect her control, Liu Yutong wasn't worried about that at all.","As long as the factory was located in Long Country, within the territory covered by the Wanlong Society, to put it bluntly, if you dared to come and cause trouble, you might have to crawl out on your knees.","With things laid out so clearly, it was impossible for Ji Zhe and Chu Hai not to guess Liu Yutong's intentions.","What Liu Yutong wanted wasn't other people's money, but an endorsement. If this project carried the label of internationalized capital, the room to maneuver would be vastly different. At the very least, the other side would have fewer reservations during the approval process, and the procedures would likely be smoother.","\"Director Liu, you are truly thoughtful, looking ten steps ahead with every move,\" Chu Hai couldn't help but sigh in admiration.","At the same time, he realized something else. Their visit to Pearl City this time was probably no accident either. The other party seemed to have anticipated long ago that once Wanhui Preferred announced its new policies, they would definitely come looking for her.","To put it plainly, they were actually part of her calculations too.","So saying Liu Yutong calculated ten steps ahead was an understatement.","This woman was truly terrifying! They had never seen such a terrifying woman!","The two of them had invested in many companies over the years, so many that they probably couldn't even remember the exact number.","Having invested in so many enterprises, they had long drawn a conclusion: investing, in the end, is investing in people.","Just like the numerous online shopping websites, why did only Ali break through? Why did successful foreign e-commerce sites like Amazon fail when they entered the domestic market?","It wasn't necessarily because they couldn't adapt to the local environment; frankly, it was the gap between the people running them.","They had seen too many founders, both successful and unsuccessful, but they had never seen a founder like Liu Yutong, who seemed to be using cheat codes.","As long as you sorted out her line of thought, you would find that many things seemed to fall into place naturally, succeeding before you even realized it.","To achieve this, one must possess an advanced strategic vision, which was practically no different from cheating.","After they finished chatting.","Liu Yutong said solemnly, \"This matter still requires your full support. Your connections in the overseas capital circles are crucial to Longxin. I hope you won't let me down.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai immediately stated their stance, \"Rest assured, Director Liu. We will start contacting our overseas resources as soon as we get back.\"","\"Very good.\"","\"Then we will divide the upcoming work. You are responsible for persuading overseas capital to invest, while I will handle team building, site selection for the factory, and government communication. Yu Xin will act as the general coordinator to ensure our information is synchronized.\"","At this point, Liu Yutong stood up and extended a hand. \"Here's to a smooth cooperation. Let's light up this Longxin together.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai hurriedly stood up and shook hands with her.","\"Happy cooperating!\"","Liu Yutong didn't see the guests out; Yu Xin took over and escorted the two downstairs.","Just as they were about to get in the car, Yu Xin reminded them, \"Please make sure to keep this a secret. If the news leaks, it won't just be a matter of losing money.\"","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai glanced at the group of men in black standing behind Yu Xin to see them off, and hurriedly waved their hands.","\"We wouldn't dare! We wouldn't dare!\"","\"We will definitely keep our lips sealed!\"","\"Yes, yes, we swear!\"","After getting into the car, Ji Zhe and Chu Hai instinctively wiped the cold sweat from their foreheads.","Cooperating with the Wanlong Society was truly thrilling at every step; they had to be extremely careful!","Fortunately, the project was profitable, which served as a small comfort to their fragile little hearts.","On the way to the airport, Chu Hai suddenly remembered something and called someone to check on Zhongxin's recent situation.","If he remembered correctly, when Zhongxin first went public a few years ago, its market value broke 40 billion. It should be even higher now, right?","As investors, the industries they paid attention to were actually quite mixed, but the chip industry was never within their investment choices, so they rarely followed up on semiconductor companies like Zhongxin afterward.","After all, this field was indeed difficult to invest in domestically, and there were very few investable enterprises.","Ten minutes later, when the investigation results came back, both of them were dumbfounded.","\"What? Zhongxin's stock price has fallen below 3 billion, dropping 95% compared to when it went public? Holy shit!\" Chu Hai couldn't help but curse.","\"We've been fooled, we've been fooled!\"","\"We shouldn't have agreed so readily. We should have gone back and checked before talking!\"","\"Five billion! Is it really going to go down the drain?!\"","\"...\"","The two slapped their thighs in regret. Just moments ago, they felt that following Liu Yutong had a bright future, but looking at it now, was the future ruined?","Actually, they couldn't be blamed for having such a huge reaction.","Although they didn't understand chip technology, they were very clear about Zhongxin's status in Long Country. Back then, it was hailed as the top stock in the domestic semiconductor industry and was the third-largest chip foundry IPO globally at the time, with a boundless future.","Zhongxin's founder was also Zhang Rujin, a big shot in the industry.","But who could have imagined that just four years later, the stock price would plummet by 95%? If this wasn't a massive loss, what was?","The person on the phone also reported some of the reasons why Zhongxin had fallen so hard.","The first was the patent dispute with Taijidian. This lawsuit had been going on for a long time and was about to reach a conclusion. The founder, Zhang Rujin, was highly likely to leave Zhongxin, which was a huge blow to the stock price.","The second factor was the impact of the global financial crisis, which led to a massive slump in demand across the semiconductor industry, inevitably dragging Zhongxin down with it.","The third was the frequent turnover of upper management, leaving their operations in a state of absolute chaos.","It was the culmination of these compounding factors that caused Zhongxin's stock price to plummet.","Of course, none of that was the main point. The real issue was that if Zhongxin—hailed as the number one stock in the domestic semiconductor industry—had been reduced to such a pathetic state, was there any guarantee that Longxin would fare any better?","At this thought, a wave of pessimism washed over the two men once again.","Ji Zhe: \"Mr. Chu, why don't you go back and talk to Chairman Liu? See if we can hold off for a while?\"","Chu Hai: \"I'm not going. You go if you want to.\"","Ji Zhe: \"I wouldn't dare.\"","Chu Hai: \"You wouldn't dare, but you think I would? What a joke!\"","Ji Zhe: \"...\"","\"Forget it. I believe Chairman Liu has what it takes to make Longxin a success.\"","\"Well, if you believe in him, then I suppose I do too.\"","After exchanging those words, both men simultaneously cursed each other in their minds with utter disdain: \"Coward!\""]},{"number":608,"title":"Chapter 608: 608. The True Function of the Weibo Farm.","paragraphs":["Not long after Ji Zhe and Chu Hai left.","In the conference room on the 19th floor of the Shunchang Building, a group of people sat around, looking at the large projection screen in front of them.","The massive screen displayed a somewhat cartoonish web interface. The screen featured several plots of farmland, flanked by a seed shop and a warehouse, along with a few adorable farmer and puppy characters.","At the top of the interface, the logo for Weibo Farm was prominently displayed.","This was the incubation project team for Wanlong Weibo.","Project manager Zhang Dalong was discussing with other members of the tech team about this gift the eldest miss had given them—a vegetable farming game.","Just as they were deeply engrossed in their conversation, Liu Yutong appeared at the door of the conference room. Seeing her, the people inside immediately stood up.","\"Miss!\"","\"Boss!\"","\"...\"","Liu Yutong walked over to the main seat and sat down, waving her hand at the crowd. \"Have a seat, everyone.\"","Only then did everyone take their seats.","Liu Yutong asked, \"How is it going? It looks like you've already embedded the farm into Weibo?\"","Zhang Dalong nodded and said, \"Yes, Miss. The closed beta data for our Weibo is out, and everything looks good. But are we really going to invest all our promotional resources into this little game?\"","\"Although the game you had someone make is indeed quite interesting and the gameplay is very simple—just virtual planting, harvesting, and stealing vegetables from friends—can this thing really bring in and retain users? I just feel that it doesn't offer much substantial help to the core value of Weibo. Users might find it novel for a couple of days and then lose interest.\"","\"I think we should focus more on optimizing the news feed algorithm and perfecting the celebrity verification system, promoting and polishing the product from those angles.\"","Although the other core members of the project team in the conference room didn't speak, their eyes more or less revealed similar doubts to Zhang Dalong's.","They were all veterans who had followed Zhang Dalong from the very beginning. Over the course of about two months, they had witnessed Weibo being built from scratch and genuinely wanted to make this product a success.","The boss had previously said she would give them a gift once Weibo was set up, but what they hadn't expected was that the gift would turn out to be such a seemingly childish web mini-game.","They had playtested this mini-game and found it undeniably fun. But as to how much it could actually drive Weibo's development, no one was sure.","After patiently listening to Zhang Dalong's concerns, Liu Yutong didn't argue. Instead, she smiled and asked a question: \"Engineer Zhang, do you usually browse our Weibo yourself? Aside from work, what do you use it for personally?\"","Zhang Dalong froze for a moment, then answered honestly, \"I do. I mainly follow the tech-related posts shared by colleagues in the group, and occasionally I'll check out some gossip and leave a few likes.\"","The Weibo closed beta had been pushed internally within the group. More than half of the Wanlong Group employees had registered for Weibo and would post things on it.","Of course, for the group employees, their actions were purely to support the group's new project. After all, the current version of Weibo had too little content and nothing particularly interesting.","\"Then do you open it at specific times every day, multiple times a day, or with a sense of anticipation?\" Liu Yutong continued to ask.","\"I don't do that.\"","Zhang Dalong shook his head. \"That's too hardcore. For me, Weibo is just a tool for gathering information.\"","Liu Yutong nodded, her gaze sweeping across everyone present, and said, \"Engineer Zhang is right. In the eyes of many, especially us internet professionals, our Weibo is more like an information tool, a media platform. But I believe the essence of a social network isn't just the connection of information and media; it must also involve the connection of emotions and behaviors.\"","\"Let's first review the core driving forces behind a user's use of a social product. For example, in the early stages, it's curiosity, getting information, or following friends or celebrities. But what happens after that? How can we turn users from occasional visitors into people who can't tear themselves away every single day? This requires stronger stickiness. And where does that stickiness come from?\"","At this point, she stood up, picked up a marker, and wrote two phrases on the whiteboard.","Social Graph and Interaction Ritual.","\"The social graph is something we are building through the follow mechanism. But having only follow-based interactions can be quite weak. Liking, commenting, and sharing—the threshold for these interactions still exists, and they lean heavily toward feedback after content consumption.\"","\"Therefore, we need to create a lighter, more frequent, and emotionally colorful and fun daily interaction ritual. Ideally, this ritual should be embedded within the users' social relationships and be capable of organic growth.\"","\"This is the role Weibo Farm is meant to play. In my view, it is not an independent game; it is the catalyst for Weibo's social graph.\"","\"Think about it carefully, everyone. Wouldn't you want to know when your friend's crops are ripe? Wouldn't you feel a secret thrill from stealing someone else's vegetables? Wouldn't you be annoyed if your own crops were stolen? In fact, this kind of interaction naturally carries conversational value and viral potential.\"","\"For example, 'Look, so-and-so's crops got stolen!' or 'Hurry, so-and-so's vegetables are ready to harvest!'\"","\"These things themselves are the driving forces that compel users to open Weibo and check their friends' updates.\"","\"Moreover, over time, it's very easy for users to become emotionally invested. The farm that users spend time and effort managing will become their virtual asset and a place of emotional attachment. Dogs need to guard the door, land needs to be reclaimed, decorations need to be bought... In short, this emotional bond will firmly tie the users down.\"","\"There's another key point. To expand the farm, you need more friends. To steal more vegetables, you also need more friends. This will strongly motivate users to proactively invite and add their real-life acquaintances to register on Weibo. The quality and efficiency of this are much higher than us pouring money into ads to invite user registrations.\"","\"This is what the professional terminology calls viral fission.\"","Having said this, Liu Yutong looked again at Zhang Dalong and the others, who had fallen deep into thought. \"So, our Weibo Farm is not just a game. It is a high-frequency interaction engine custom-built for Weibo to strengthen social relationships. Its primary goal is not profitability, but rapid user acquisition and boosting user engagement.\"","\"When users open Weibo dozens of times a day just to steal crops or guard their own, what is the probability that they will casually scroll through the Weibo feed? What is the probability that they will see a topic of interest and join the discussion? What is the likelihood that they will become even more reluctant to leave this platform because of these social interactions?\"","\"All of these are feedback that we will be able to see intuitively through the data.\"","The conference room was completely silent.","All the previous doubts harbored by Zhang Dalong and the others were completely shattered in the face of Liu Yutong's analysis, which struck straight at the heart of human nature.","He realized he had fallen into a huge misconception. He had been looking at this feature from the perspective of a product manager, while the young miss, Liu Yutong, was viewing it from the perspective of a social ecosystem.","Different perspectives naturally lead to different insights.","\"Miss, I understand now. This gift of yours is truly amazing! We will definitely make good use of it!\"","Liu Yutong laughed. \"Engineer Zhang, never underestimate the drive of ordinary users to seek simple pleasures in a virtual world, and never overestimate the so-called high-end users' immunity to childish things.\"","\"When your colleagues, classmates, and friends are all playing it, all discussing who stole whose vegetables, that kind of peer pressure and environmental influence will make even those who were initially dismissive unable to resist clicking in to take a look. This is the network effect of social products, and Microblog Farm is the nuclear bomb we are dropping to detonate the internet.\"","\"Alright, that is about all I have to say. Now, you all need to continue optimizing the product. Engineer Zhang, I will allocate an initial twenty million for your advertising and promotion. Yu Xin will also coordinate with you; if you need anything, just go to her.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\" Zhang Dalong replied.","Finally, Liu Yutong offered some words of encouragement to the team. \"Keep up the hard work, everyone. At the year-end annual meeting, I hope to see every single one of you up on the podium, receiving the rewards you deserve!\"","The crowd's spirits instantly soared, and they replied in unison, \"Yes, Boss!\""]},{"number":609,"title":"Chapter 609: 609. The Sudden Popularity of Weibo Farm","paragraphs":["After Liu Yutong left, the team's enthusiasm soared even higher. Everyone was fired up, determined to produce results as quickly as possible.","\"Did you hear that? The eldest miss set the tone herself!\"","\"An initial promotion budget of twenty million is no small sum. Brothers, give it your all and polish this nuclear bomb until it shines.\"","The technical director immediately said, \"Engineer Zhang, we need to get the server expansion plan ready right away. Based on the scenario the boss just described, if this game really blows up, our current closed-beta setup won't be able to handle it!\"","The operations manager also started listing a series of requirements on the whiteboard: \"We need to pick up the promotion pace quickly. Step one, get all group employees to open a farm as soon as possible and add at least ten friends. We need our own people playing first to create an internal atmosphere and stress test the system. Step two, blast the ads out through Wanhui Youxuan's massive delivery rider network. I think the ads should be simple, just one headline: 'Did you steal vegetables today?'. Step three, Weibo registration rewards must be tied to farm gift packs; the tech team needs to get this done ASAP. Step four, I want ads on all major portal websites to snatch up new users at maximum speed...\"","After listening, a young product manager excitedly raised his hand. \"I think we can set up some special items, like a crazy little dog. After using it, friends can't steal your vegetables for a certain period, but to get it, you have to share the game to three different groups or invite a new user. Also, the harvesting effects could be cooler, making people feel prouder when they share it...\"","The more they discussed, the more excited everyone became.","Not to mention, there wasn't much time left until the New Year. If they could produce quick results, they would have a very comfortable holiday. The boss's attitude had already made everything clear—the rewards would definitely be substantial.","...","A week later, Weibo Farm officially ended its closed beta and opened to the entire internet, accompanied by an overwhelming advertising campaign.","The over one hundred thousand delivery riders of Wanhui Youxuan became mobile billboards. Their delivery boxes, the backs of their uniforms, and even the windshields of their electric scooters were prominently printed with that charmingly naive farmer logo and a soul-striking slogan: [Did you steal vegetables today? @Weibo].","Coupled with ads on Wanhui Youxuan's homepage and other platforms, the unfamiliar yet slightly thrilling concept of \"stealing vegetables\" began to infiltrate the daily lives of urbanites.","In addition to this, the operations team's ads started appearing on the homepage banners and pop-ups of major portal websites, recommended spots on major download sites, and even with high-traffic webmasters.","The ad creative was simple and direct: a sneaky hand reaching toward a juicy radish on the screen, accompanied by tense yet comical sound effects, finally freezing on the Weibo Farm login interface with massive text offering benefits: [Register to get a deluxe gift pack and upgrade your farm faster than everyone else!].","Social media also grew lively. For instance, massive amounts of organic recommendations and suspected paid posts began appearing in various QQ groups, Tieba forums, and message boards.","[Help! I've been kidnapped by Weibo Farm; I set eight alarms a day!]","[Looking for friends to steal from each other! My friend list is empty and I'm about to cry!]","[Shocking! This little game actually got me talking to my ex-girlfriend whom I lost touch with years ago!]","After a few consecutive days of advertising, the first batch of users attracted by the ads registered for Weibo out of curiosity. They didn't sign up to read trending news, but headed straight for that fun-looking farm. After a simple tutorial, they got their first piece of land and a few seeds.","Plant, wait, harvest... the simplest loop of happiness began to take effect.","However, this single-player farming would quickly get boring, so the system would timely prompt: [Your friend list is empty. Go invite friends to play together! Stealing each other's vegetables doubles the fun!]","Or when they tried clicking the \"Go Steal Vegetables\" button and saw an empty friend list, that feeling of having nowhere to start strongly drove them to dig through their phone contacts and QQ friends, unable to resist sending invitations: \"Come add me on Weibo, there's a super fun little game!\"","The viral spread started just like that.","It went almost exactly as Liu Yutong had predicted; the act of stealing vegetables became the strongest relationship glue and topic generator.","In just a few days, Liu Yutong heard many classmates at the University of Finance and Economics chatting about farming.","\"I have a class at one o'clock, help me keep an eye on my vegetables!\"","\"I don't have an 8 AM class tomorrow, so I can camp out in my dorm and steal vegetables, hahaha...\"","\"Damn it, don't even think about stealing mine. I'll skip class to guard my corn.\" \"Holy crap, you stole my tomatoes. You're dead. When you fall asleep tonight, I'm stealing your potatoes.\"","\"...\"","Beyond the school campus, the atmosphere in the Wanlonghui Group's offices also changed. Since Weibo was a product under the group, employees wouldn't be criticized by management for playing it during their downtime, which led to a different kind of vibe.","\"Sister Liu from the finance department actually planted waxberries, a rare crop! Everyone, keep a close eye on it!\"","\"Oh man, I got up to use the restroom in the middle of the night yesterday and conveniently stole my manager's vegetables. He was furious when he found out this morning.\"","\"Hahaha...\"","As for the core members of Wanlonghui, it was even more direct.","\"Old Zhang, how dare you steal my rare peaches! I'm challenging you to a duel, let's go spar at the martial arts hall!\"","\"Hahaha, Liuzi, you've got guts. You actually dared to steal Lawyer Zhao's vegetables. You're done for, you'll have to copy the criminal law out by hand at least once as punishment.\"","\"I was wrong, great lawyer, please let me off! At worst, I'll pay you back with a few rare seeds.\"","\"...\"","Similarly, external discussions about stealing vegetables grew increasingly heated. In just five days, the viral reaction exploded.","Zhang Dalong and other technical backbones kept their eyes glued to the data at the company.","On the first day of the promotional launch, thanks to organic promotion by internal employees and initial ad teasers, new users surpassed 50,000.","On the third day of the launch, new users soared to 150,000, and Zhang Dalong ordered the first round of server expansion.","On the fifth day of the launch, the weekend effect combined with word-of-mouth completely erupted. The topic of stealing vegetables was hotly debated in more offline settings and online communities, with the peak of daily new users hitting 300,000. Weibo Farm's concurrent online user count constantly hit new highs. The tech team began 24-hour rotating shifts, with takeout and Red Bull becoming their standard gear.","Moreover, various data showed that the user invitation rate remained stable at an astonishing 25% or higher, meaning that every new user was organically pulling in even more new users for the platform.","Half a month after the launch, the growth curve not only showed no signs of slowing down but continued to climb. The maximum daily new users broke through the 500,000 mark, and the total number of registered users snowballed rapidly toward 5 million.","Back-end data showed that the average daily login frequency per user reached a staggering 18 times, with an average session duration of over 40 minutes. The vast majority of this time was dedicated to the Farm. Setting alarms to steal crops or to prevent others from stealing them had become a new daily habit for millions of users.","The back-end servers were constantly hitting their limits during this time! Emergency capacity expansions! Hitting the limit again! Expanding again...","\"This is crazy! Absolutely crazy! Hahaha...\"","Looking at the nearly vertical growth curve on the screen, Zhang Dalong could not hold back his laughter any longer.","Even when Big Goose first launched back in the day, it did not have such an absurd growth trend, did it? They had actually achieved the miracle of surpassing five million registered users just half a month after going online!","At this moment, Zhang Dalong felt incredibly fortunate to have a boss who understood the social ecosystem so deeply. This grand gift was massive indeed.","This was no mere minigame!","It was simply a tireless perpetual motion machine for user growth!","The microblog's own information feed was also stimulated by the Farm's explosive popularity. Because massive numbers of users were frequently logging in to steal crops, they would inevitably catch glimpses of the status updates and shared news from the people they followed on their homepages. Amusing anecdotes, complaints, and other Farm-related topics also became trending content on the platform, further boosting the community's overall engagement.","Now that the foundation was laid, the next step was to invite celebrities to join the fray.","For a social media platform geared toward the general public, the celebrity effect was absolutely crucial."]},{"number":610,"title":"Chapter 610: 610: Weibo Registrations Surpass 20 Million","paragraphs":["Weibo Farm spread at an almost viral speed, far exceeding the project team's expectations.","Its growth curve was even more exaggerated, shooting up in almost a straight line.","Three weeks after its launch, the number of new daily users broke through the 800,000 mark for the first time. This figure was roughly equivalent to the total user base that many small and medium-sized internet companies had accumulated over several years of hard work. The servers barely stabilized after undergoing a fifth round of emergency expansion.","The operations department then enriched the contents of the novice gift pack, including rare seeds, rapid-growth fertilizer, and a guard dog (low-level version).","The appearance of that crazy little dog further accelerated the process of user fission. To obtain this guardian beast that could leave friends helpless to steal for 12 hours, users had to share the game link to three different social groups or successfully invite a new user to register.","Sharing and inviting went from being optional choices to mandatory requirements for acquiring scarce game resources.","At the same time, the dazzling special effects upon harvesting and the server-wide broadcasts upon leveling up (visible only to friends) greatly satisfied the users' vanity and desire to show off, stimulating them to share the game again.","Because acquiring special items like the crazy little dog strongly relied on social sharing and bringing in new users, players needed to expand their vegetable-stealing range by sharing. Weibo's registration links spread like a virus across QQ, forums, blogs, and other places. Even during offline gatherings, many people's catchphrase became: Add me on Weibo, let's steal vegetables together!","Exactly one month after launch.","A number that shocked the entire internet industry was born: Weibo's total registered users exceeded 10 million!","This was a landmark milestone.","Going from zero to tens of millions of users took many veteran portal websites years to achieve.","Yet Weibo took only thirty days.","Peers and investors in the outside world boiled over with excitement, hurriedly producing analysis reports.","Once the reports came out, everyone was astounded.","Weibo's user activity was extremely high. Out of ten million registered users, the daily active users stabilized at over six million. The activity rate far exceeded any social or community product of the same period; it was simply outrageous!","The average number of daily launches per user exceeded 20, and the daily stay time approached one hour. The farm page became an absolute traffic black hole and the main contributor to screen time.","Actions such as Weibo follows, likes, and comments generated based on farm friendships also rose with the tide. Weibo's information feed activity and content production volume increased significantly.","After evaluating Weibo's data, domestic investors practically blew up the phone of the project manager, Zhang Dalong.","Even Liu Yutong was not spared.","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai had just flown to the West to pull in investments for Dragon Core when they heard this bad news right after. It would be a lie to say they weren't uncomfortable in their hearts.","No, Miss Liu, you've hidden this quite deeply, haven't you?","You didn't reveal a single thing about such a great project. This Weibo looks extremely promising at first glance; isn't it more profitable than this bullshit chip? And there's hardly any risk.","The most crucial point was that she didn't bring them along for the ride. Was that appropriate?","The resentment of the two men practically overflowed from the other end of the phone.","Liu Yutong immediately promised that when Weibo was ready for its Series A funding, she would prioritize them, but the prerequisite was that they had to put more effort into the Dragon Core project.","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai immediately beamed with joy, their motivation surging even higher.","As the influence of the vegetable-stealing game expanded, social discussions increased, and imitators even began to appear.","Those veteran portal websites, in particular, smelled the crisis and started developing new microblogging platforms, imitating the farm game to intercept a wave of traffic.","Of course, in this life, Liu Yutong would absolutely not allow imitation without authorization.","If you want to imitate it, that's fine; go talk to my Lawyer Zhao.","The law firm had been sharpening its sword for so long, recruiting so many law school graduates and lawyers, wasn't it precisely for this day?","Of course, if they proactively paid the licensing fee, authorization could still be granted. After all, this kind of thing couldn't be completely blocked by just one law firm; it was better to make a wave of money first.","Following the farm's success, Liu Yutong had the game team start making similar products, such as a parking space game, where players parked various luxury cars and upgraded them for even better ones, continuing to enrich the gameplay within Weibo.","Unknowingly, time had reached mid-January 2009, and the Spring Festival was only a few days away.","Weibo's registered users also broke through the 20 million mark.","The project team held another summary meeting.","Zhang Dalong first reported the latest competitive dynamics.","So far, according to the information we've received, at least three major tech companies are making the same game, with a gameplay imitation rate of over 80 percent... In addition, at least six top-tier VCs have contacted us, expressing a strong desire to invest. The highest valuation offered has already reached 200 million US dollars.","After this number appeared, a chorus of gasps immediately echoed in the conference room. Everyone was utterly shocked.","Two hundred million US dollars was undoubtedly an astronomical figure for Weibo, which had only launched a little over a month ago.","The reason Ji Zhe and Chu Hai were in such a hurry to call Liu Yutong initially was that they too saw Weibo's potential. Especially since the premium on internet products was still very high, investing in this wave would mean a guaranteed massive profit.","Liu Yutong said, Let's wait a bit longer on the financing front. Weibo is still far from the stage where it needs independent financing to develop. The funds of the Ten Thousand Dragons Association are enough to support its rapid expansion. Introducing external capital too early is not conducive to executing our long-term strategy. Reject them all for now.","Zhang Dalong nodded and then began to report the upcoming development plan.","Next, we will introduce a celebrity onboarding plan. Not just entertainment stars, but opinion leaders across various industries, experts, scholars, famous writers, entrepreneurs... In short, we want to build a diverse Big V system, using high-quality, unique content to attract and retain those users who are here for more than just playing the farm. At the same time, we plan to launch the Weibo Original Content Incentive Plan, taking out real silver and gold to encourage ordinary users to produce high-quality short essays, pictures, and even short audio content. This requires your financial support, Miss Liu.","Liu Yutong said, No problem. Let's allocate one hundred million for this Weibo Original Content Incentive Plan.","Her words were astonishing enough to wake the dead!","The heads of the various Weibo project departments attending the meeting below widened their eyes.","Wasn't Miss Liu being a bit too generous?","Originally, they thought giving five million or ten million would be about enough.","But Miss Liu opened her mouth and offered one hundred million right off the bat. This was simply too generous.","However, it had to be said that if this news were truly released, it would absolutely rush to the top of the trending searches.","After all, the number one hundred million was still an unreachable figure in the minds of countless ordinary people. Its weight and impact were far greater than millions or tens of millions.","Zhang Dalong also couldn't help but get excited. What kind of trust was this!","With a boss like this, why worry about not achieving great things?","Afterwards, he reported on the things that needed to be optimized next, such as the information feed algorithm, how to let users see the people and information they are interested in more quickly, reduce noise, and improve reading efficiency, among other things.","Although Liu Yutong did not know much about the technical side of things, she still listened attentively to the very end.","After wrapping up the meeting with the Weibo project department, she set off for the Magic City with Zhang Dalong to attend the year-end Internet Conference.","Aside from that, she also received an invitation from Yunshan Club member Bai Shisui to attend a fashion design show.",".........."]},{"number":611,"title":"Chapter 611: 611, Thank you to [Wu Dalang from Tianshui City] for the King of Gifts","paragraphs":["Shortly after the meeting ended, Liu Yutong took Zhang Dalong, Yu Xin, and several key members from Weibo and Wanhui Youxuan to the Magic City, preparing to attend the upcoming annual internet industry summit.","Before that, however, she had to go to Bai Shisui's place to watch a fashion show. The venue was set in an art park in the Magic City.","Bai Shisui was a member of the Yunshan Club. She had studied in the West for many years before founding her own designer brand, Suiyan.","Her design style was quite unique, blending modern elements with traditional Eastern charm.","However, in the current domestic market, it was incredibly difficult for independent designer brands to truly break into the mainstream. Usually, they had to squeeze into the official schedules or fringe shows of international fashion weeks, hoping to catch the eyes of international buyers and media. Then, they would use this overseas recognition to boost their domestic popularity.","Bai Shisui's show this time was also a warm-up for her upcoming overseas trip.","The show was held in a large hall within the park. The atmosphere was perfectly set, though the scale was somewhat small. Aside from a few fashion editors, buyers, and friends from the industry, the audience consisted mostly of outsiders like Liu Yutong and her team, who were not particularly familiar with fashion.","Sitting in the front row, Liu Yutong quietly watched the entire presentation.","After the show, in the backstage area, Bai Shisui pulled Liu Yutong aside. Although her face showed the excitement of having just displayed her work, it was overshadowed by anxiety.","\"Sister Yutong, what do you think?\"","\"To be honest, I have no confidence about going to Paris next. There are too many shows over there. A new face like us is likely just going along for the ride, barely making a splash. And even if we get some press coverage there, translating that into influence back home is very slow.\"","Liu Yutong touched a white suit jacket displayed nearby, which was embroidered with delicate intertwining branch patterns, looking thoughtful.","\"Shisui, have you ever thought that we don't necessarily have to play by the rules they've set?\"","\"Going abroad for a fashion show essentially means going to someone else's home turf, following their rules, and begging for their approval. Why can't we build our own stage, create a new set of rules, and expand our influence on our own terms? We could even turn the tables and make them pay attention to us.\"","\"Build our own stage?\"","Bai Shisui was taken aback for a moment, then shook her head. \"That's too difficult. The foundation and influence of domestic fashion design simply can't compare to foreign countries...\"","\"Do you have Weibo?\" Liu Yutong suddenly asked a seemingly unrelated question.","\"Huh? I do have an account registered, but I haven't used it much. Isn't everyone just playing farm games on it?\" Bai Shisui was a bit confused.","Liu Yutong smiled. \"The farm games are just the beginning. Weibo will soon cease to be just a gaming platform. It will become the largest, most real-time, and most interactive public opinion platform in the country.\"","\"What your Suiyan brand lacks isn't design, but an amplifier that can instantly push your design philosophy, the beauty of your work, and you as a designer to tens of millions, and eventually hundreds of millions, of users.\"","\"We can absolutely put on a different kind of show—a super launch event that completely integrates online and offline experiences.\"","Both Bai Shisui and Zhang Dalong, who was listening nearby, perked up.","\"First is the timing. I think we can set it around the Spring Festival. During that time, the public has both the desire to consume and the leisure time to pay attention to new things. It also avoids the schedule of the four major international fashion weeks, allowing us to become the center of attention.\"","\"Second is the format of the launch. I don't think we should limit ourselves to this kind of offline runway show watched by a few dozen or a few hundred people. We should do a live debut across the entire Weibo platform.\"","At this point, Liu Yutong looked at Zhang Dalong. \"Are there any technical issues?\"","Zhang Dalong shook his head. \"No problem. That's actually very easy to do.\"","\"Good.\"","Liu Yutong nodded and continued, \"But that's not enough. A live stream can't be one-way; we need to set up interactive segments. For example, we can start a trending topic on Weibo before the show even begins. We can release partial design sketches, fabric details, and stories behind the inspiration to attract users to guess and discuss. On the day of the show, we can set up a voting feature on the live stream interface, letting the audience choose their most anticipated look, the best outfit combination, and so on in real-time. The selected styles or outfits could come with priority booking rights or special discounts after the launch.\"","Bai Shisui's eyes lit up. This idea sounded so innovative!","She seemed to understand a bit more about Sister Yutong's purpose in creating Weibo.","This kind of model didn't seem limited to just clothing; couldn't it be applied to other products as well?","\"Then there's the matrix of celebrities and key opinion leaders.\"","\"We're already making progress in this area. Some artists signed under Xueqian Studio have already registered on Weibo. When the time comes, we can invite them to watch the show simultaneously and post their comments on Weibo. Every word they say will become a node for secondary dissemination...\"","\"And the final step is about how to elevate the brand's prestige by incorporating charitable elements. For example, we could select the most highly praised or most talked-about piece from the show and hold a charity auction on Weibo. The proceeds would be donated to a reputable arts education fund, or our own Wanlong Charity Foundation. The entire auction process would be public on Weibo, and we could invite celebrities or entrepreneurs to help promote the bidding. This won't just sustain the hype; it will also inject a sense of social responsibility into the Suiyan brand, shaping a high-end image that completely distinguishes it from fast-fashion brands that simply chase trends.\"","\"...\"","Liu Yutong shared many of her ideas in great detail.","Zhang Dalong's heart was racing as he listened. He had originally been pondering the direction for profitability after Weibo's user growth, but he never expected the eldest miss to outline such a clear path for commercial monetization in just a few words. If Bai Shisui's Suiyan brand could grow and strengthen by leveraging the Weibo platform, couldn't other top-tier brands do the same?","When that time came, the advertising revenue and commercial partnerships from this sector alone would be a massive sum.","Sure enough, the eldest miss's brain worked differently. Even her casual suggestions revealed her unique, forward-thinking business acumen.","The eldest miss wasn't just giving her friend ideas; she was also guiding him. She was telling him how to lay out Weibo's next explosive growth point, how to expand from gaming and social networking into fashion consumption and even content e-commerce, and ultimately, how to perfect Weibo's ecosystem.","\"Sister Yutong, this seems to require a lot of resource coordination. Won't it be too much trouble for you?\" Although excited, Bai Shisui also felt the pressure.","Since all of this seemed to rely on Liu Yutong, she inevitably felt a bit guilty.","Liu Yutong smiled and said, \"How could it be a trouble? Helping you is also exploring broader possibilities for our Weibo. It's killing two birds with one stone—a win-win situation.\"","\"Sister Yutong, you're the best. I declare that from now on, I'm going to cling to your coattails and never let go.\"","Bai Shisui truly hadn't expected that a problem which had troubled her for so long could be solved by Liu Yutong in just a few words.","She also sighed inwardly: how could the gap between people's brains be so huge?","She didn't dwell on it, though. As long as she could latch onto this powerful backer, everything would be fine.","Since Bai Shisui had to head back to her office, they parted ways for the time being, making plans to meet up for dinner later that evening.","..........."]},{"number":612,"title":"Chapter 612: 612. Declaring War on the Former Boss","paragraphs":["After leaving the industrial park's venue.","Zhang Dalong couldn't help but say, \"The Young Lady, this move of yours was truly brilliant. Once we successfully pull off this Weibo debut, it will become a benchmark case. When we go on to negotiate deep collaborations with other brands, or even push for an upgrade of the platform's advertising system, we'll have the most convincing case study.\"","Liu Yutong smiled faintly. \"The essence of the internet is connection, and the future of business lies in building an ecosystem. Weibo cannot just be a bustling public square; it must become a fertile soil capable of nurturing all kinds of possibilities. Helping Suiyan succeed is our way of showing everyone the value of this soil. In short, we must take things one step at a time, but our gaze must remain fixed on the long term.\"","Zhang Dalong nodded in deep agreement, genuinely acknowledging The Young Lady's profound insight from the bottom of his heart.","Just then, Liu Yutong suddenly remembered something and turned her head to ask him, \"You're going to see your former boss at the Internet Conference tomorrow. Do you have any special thoughts about that?\"","Zhang Dalong paused for a moment, then shook his head. \"Nothing in particular, really. I just didn't expect to be expressing my own views on such a grand stage so soon. It still feels quite surreal.\"","\"In the past, at my old company, a lot of us internally were mostly just imitating, especially with foreign models. We were always thinking about how to follow up faster and how to localize things better. Now, working on Weibo with you, I feel completely different. I feel like we are actually trying to define things ourselves.\"","\"So, do you think Weibo counts as an imitation?\" Liu Yutong pressed.","Zhang Dalong shook his head decisively. \"At the very least, we are innovating a lot of things, like the 'like' button, light apps, and so on.\"","Liu Yutong asked, \"Engineer Zhang, if I told you I wanted you to build an instant messaging app to defeat your former boss, would you dare take on the task?\"","\"Instant messaging? The Young Lady, are you sure you aren't joking?\" When Zhang Dalong said this, he felt his throat go dry.","If he remembered correctly, before he joined Wanlong Group, The Young Lady had mentioned this idea, though they ended up doing Weibo instead.","Now that Weibo had just taken its first successful step, she was suddenly bringing up the old topic. She hadn't given up on it!","\"Yes.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"And it will be a mobile-first instant messaging app. We won't even bother with a PC version.\"","\"This...\" Zhang Dalong instinctively wanted to shoot down the madness of this idea, but he swallowed the words before they left his mouth.","Having followed Liu Yutong for a while now, he had developed a conditioned reflex: The Young Lady never spoke without a target in mind. Perhaps she already had some brilliant idea or plan?","After thinking it over seriously, he spoke cautiously, \"From a technical standpoint, developing a basic IM app does present challenges for our current team, but it's not impossible. The biggest problem is that massive mountain in our way. The Young Lady, you know how strong Koukou's user stickiness is. If we launch a frontal assault, it will be very hard to win.\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"What if Koukou's infrastructure is starting to show cracks?\"","Zhang Dalong frowned. As a former employee, he knew Koukou's strengths all too well. What cracks could there possibly be?","Still, he asked humbly, \"What do you mean?\"","Liu Yutong countered with a question, \"Do you think Nokiya's defenses are solid?\"","Zhang Dalong didn't understand her point, but he nodded anyway. \"Of course. They are the absolute king of the feature phone era. Unbreakable.\"","Liu Yutong took a phone out of her bag—a phone that hadn't been officially released in the country yet, with a clear fruit logo printed on the back—and handed it to Zhang Dalong.","\"Now, do you still think Nokiya is unbreakable?\"","As soon as Zhang Dalong took the Fruit phone, he felt that it was completely different from the usual Nokiyas or Motorolas. It had a larger, thinner screen, and its overall design was incredibly minimalist, brimming with a futuristic feel.","As a tech guy, he obviously knew about the Fruit phone. When it was announced in 2007, it caused a sensation in the industry. It just hadn't been officially released domestically, so many ordinary people didn't even know this brand of phone existed.","But now, holding the actual device in his hands, he suddenly felt that he might have spoken too soon.","Nokiya didn't seem as indestructible as it appeared on the surface. In fact, it might be standing on the edge of a cliff.","\"A Nokiya can make calls, send texts, play Snake, and listen to music, but beyond that, it doesn't seem to have any other functions.\"","\"Now look at the Fruit phone in your hand. Besides making calls and sending texts, it can browse the internet and handle emails much more conveniently. It offers a relatively complete web experience... Essentially, it is entirely fair to call it a pocket-sized microcomputer.\"","\"Nokiya's empire was built on the era's consensus that a mobile phone is primarily a communication tool. But the Fruit phone, or rather, the smarter phones of the future, are redefining what a mobile phone is. When this new definition is accepted by more and more people, when network speeds get faster, when data costs drop, and when more apps and services are built around these smartphones, the world will undergo an earth-shattering transformation.\"","\"The same goes for Koukou. Its impregnability is built on the era's consensus that instant messaging is primarily about PC desktop social networking. But as smartphones like the Fruit phone become widespread, the primary arena for communication and social networking will irreversibly migrate to mobile.\"","\"Just like the transition from chat rooms to Koukou back in the day.\"","Zhang Dalong's heart skipped a beat. He suddenly recalled that during numerous meetings about Weibo, The Young Lady had repeatedly emphasized mobile experience. At the time, he thought it was merely a supplementary feature for Weibo. Now he realized her ambitions went far beyond that.","Liu Yutong paused for a moment before continuing, \"We are never going to just copy a mobile version of Koukou.\"","\"What we are going to build is a new species of communication and social networking—born on mobile and raised on mobile. It needs to be lighter, faster, and more tailored to mobile usage scenarios. I believe that in the early stages, we can even abandon Koukou's flashy features and just focus on doing one thing perfectly: allowing information to be presented among acquaintances in the most natural and simple way possible.\"","\"...\"","Zhang Dalong swallowed hard again. He truly felt that The Young Lady was becoming more and more unfathomable. She was simply too visionary and forward-thinking.","This wasn't just racing Big Goose on the same track; this was clearly anticipating the next intersection way in advance and preparing to lay down a completely new set of rails.","However, pulling this off would still be quite difficult. There was no way Big Goose wouldn't develop a mobile version of Koukou, and their massive user base would very likely stick with them.","\"The Young Lady, I understand your idea, but the promotion costs and the difficulty of shifting user habits are a bit steep. Plus, once Big Goose realizes we're trying to flank them, I'm afraid they'll strike back with everything they have...\"","\"That is exactly why we cannot rush this, but we must start laying the groundwork early.\"","\"Weibo will continue to advance at its current pace. After the New Year, you will slowly begin handing over the daily operational tasks. Of course, this is not to strip you of your authority. You are still the leader of the Weibo project; you just need to delegate the trivial matters to others while you steer the overall direction. Your main energy needs to be shifted to our new project.\"","Zhang Dalong felt the burden on his shoulders grow heavier. \"Understood, The Young Lady! I will assemble a new development team as soon as possible.\"","He suddenly realized that The Young Lady had brought him to the conference this time not merely to have him give a speech on stage, but more importantly, to have him personally declare war on his former boss.","\"Bring it on, President Ma.\"","\"I am coming to take you down!\""]},{"number":613,"title":"Chapter 613: 613, Reunion at Yunshan.","paragraphs":["The Bund, Magic City.","The members of the Yunshan Club arranged to meet at a top-tier sky bar called The Dome.","This was their first time gathering in Magic City, and likely their last full get-together before the Spring Festival. Gu Yebai and the others had originally planned to visit Bai Shisui's fashion show, but unfortunately, they were delayed by other matters.","Shen Hao had chosen this bar and was playing host for the night. Perhaps it was because he had recently secured the equity of Qiming Electronics from his family, solidifying his position as the new chairman, which put him in an excellent mood.","Naturally, the Yunshan Club members wouldn't stand on ceremony with him. To them, this amount of money was just pocket change anyway; it didn't matter who paid.","Yu Xin and Zhang Dalong didn't come because they had to prepare materials for tomorrow's conference. Only Liu Yutong came to the appointment, bringing along Lan Die and a few other bodyguards.","The moment Liu Yutong stepped out of the car, Shen Hao was already waiting at the bar's entrance.","\"Sister Yutong, welcome, welcome.\"","Liu Yutong smiled. \"It's not like I couldn't find the place. There's no need to be so polite.\"","Shen Hao chuckled, \"Hehe, I could skip coming down to greet anyone else, but when you arrive, Sister Yutong, I have to welcome you personally. You're my benefactor and the major shareholder of our company.\"","\"Alright, stop sweet-talking. Let's go, don't keep everyone waiting.\"","\"They're all upstairs. I saved the best spot for everyone.\"","As he led the way, Shen Hao said excitedly, \"Sister Yutong, you have no idea. I held a few meetings at Qiming Electronics these past few days and left those stubborn old board members completely speechless. The ones who used to doubt me for being too young to handle things don't even dare to utter a word now. It's all thanks to your support back then, otherwise I really might not have been able to take over the family business so quickly.\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"You earned it yourself. Qiming Electronics has a solid foundation. Manage it well and don't let this legacy down.\"","\"I will work hard.\"","Shen Hao said, then suddenly remembered something. \"By the way, Sister Yutong, there's a huge event at The Dome tonight. They're hosting a private, top-tier whiskey tasting. I heard the finale is a bottle of 62-year-old Dalmore, the legendary liquor with a global limit of only twelve bottles, known as the 'Angel's Share.' I had to pull some strings to ensure we could participate in this segment. I'll bid on it later to add to the fun.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong raised an eyebrow slightly. \"A 62-year-old Dalmore? That is indeed rare.\"","In truth, she didn't have much interest in alcohol and rarely drank, let alone tasted it. She just didn't want to spoil everyone's mood, so she didn't say much.","Chatting, the two walked into the exclusive elevator leading to the top floor.","The design of The Dome bar perfectly matched its name. A massive curved glass dome covered the entire space, allowing people to enjoy a nearly 360-degree view of the night scenery on both sides of the river.","The interior lighting design was also very exquisite, creating a luxurious and mesmerizing atmosphere without affecting the view. In the center was a dance floor and a DJ booth, surrounded by various booths and semi-open private rooms.","By the time Liu Yutong and Shen Hao arrived, the place was already bustling with people.","Shen Hao led Liu Yutong through the crowd to a circular booth with a superb location. The view here was excellent, facing the skyscrapers of the Bund directly while also offering a panoramic view of the bar's center and the tasting area, all with sufficient privacy.","Several people were already sitting in the booth.","Bai Shisui was excitedly chatting with a girl in a champagne-colored evening gown, Zhu Silin.","Gu Yebai, Zhou Muchen, and a few other guys were holding whiskey glasses, tasting the liquor while bragging.","\"Sister Yutong is here!\" Bai Shisui was the first to see her and immediately stood up to wave.","Everyone put down their glasses and stood up to greet her.","\"Sister Yutong.\"","\"Sister Yutong.\"","\"We were just waiting for you.\"","\"...\"","With that, all seven members of the Yunshan Club were present.","Liu Yutong smiled and nodded in greeting, sitting down in the main seat that Gu Yebai had just vacated.","Shen Hao called the waiter to order and specifically instructed, \"Remember to remind us when the tasting segment begins later.\"","The waiter respectfully agreed.","Then, Shen Hao waved his hand with the boldness of a host and said, \"It's my treat today. Drink as much as you want, and absolutely do not try to save me money!\"","Hearing this, Bai Shisui deliberately teased, \"Chairman Shen is so wealthy and imposing now, you even dare to steal my thunder as the host.\"","She didn't say this without reason, because among everyone present, only Bai Shisui could truly be considered to have opened her company in Magic City; the others basically had no businesses there.","Shen Hao chuckled, \"Not bad, not bad, thanks to everyone's blessings. Anyway, I'm the host tonight, and none of you are allowed to fight me for it.\"","Bai Shisui: \"Yes, yes, yes, Chairman Shen is generous, so we won't hold back.\"","Shen Hao patted his chest, \"Order whatever you want. Today is the first time our Yunshan Club has gathered in full in Magic City, so I have to arrange things perfectly. Louis XIII, Dom Perignon, open whatever you want. We won't go home until we're drunk tonight!\"","Liu Yutong said, \"It seems Shen Hao is determined to be the host, so everyone, feel free to order.\"","Everyone immediately cheered, all expressing that they would eat and drink Shen Hao into bankruptcy.","Zhu Silin even added, \"I heard there's a bottle of 62-year-old Dalmore tonight, Chairman Shen, you know what to do.\"","Shen Hao: \"Don't worry, just because Sister Yutong is here, I have to get it. I'll go bid on it later.\"","Liu Yutong waved her hand and said, \"Wine is just wine in the end, there's no need to waste that kind of money.\"","Shen Hao said, \"That won't do. No one has more face than Sister Yutong tonight, isn't that right, everyone?\"","Everyone immediately laughed and agreed, \"Yes!\"","The core of the Yunshan Club had always been Liu Yutong; this was universally acknowledged. Without her market operations, how could they have legally and legitimately made billions so quickly?","They were all partners in the later-established Yunshan Capital. The initial capital of about 30 billion they invested had now grown, with their holdings in investments and shares combined, to a value far exceeding 30 billion, reaching around 61 billion. The investment in Qiming Electronics alone had nearly quadrupled.","What was even more miraculous was that over 90% of the long-term stocks they invested in were actually rising; only a small amount was tied up. It was simply outrageous!","In short, in their hearts, Liu Yutong was the god of investment!","Just as everyone was having a great time chatting, a considerable commotion arose from the other side of the bar.","It seemed another group of guests had arrived, and their entourage was quite grand.","Liu Yutong's booth was elevated, allowing them to see the newcomers perfectly.","They saw four or five young people surrounding a young man wearing a globally limited edition leather jacket from a certain luxury brand walking in.","The young man looked about twenty-five or twenty-six, with an arrogant and domineering air about him. The men and women following him were all dressed luxuriously, bearing haughty expressions.","The general manager of the bar personally went up to greet them, his attitude even more enthusiastic than when he had received Shen Hao and the others earlier."]},{"number":614,"title":"Chapter 614: 614. Demon City Circle vs. Yunshan Society","paragraphs":["\"Hah, I wondered who it was. Turns out it's those guys from the Modu Supercar Club,\" Gu Yebai sneered, his words carrying obvious disdain.","As a wealthy young master from the neighboring province, he often visited Modu, so he was quite familiar with the local second-generation circles.","He pointed to the man in the middle and said to the others, \"That guy in the leather jacket is Qin Zi'ang. His father is Qin Zhenhua, the head of Modu's Zhenhua Capital, which specializes in cross-border mergers and energy businesses. His background is rock solid, and he has a lot of influence in the financial circles of Modu and the surrounding provinces. Qin Zi'ang is Qin Zhenhua's only son, notoriously arrogant. He started that Modu Supercar Club, and he even has a nickname, the Emperor of Modu, meaning he acts like the ruler of the city.\"","Zhu Silin frowned and said, \"I know of Zhenhua Capital; they are indeed very powerful. However, Qin Zi'ang seems to have a terrible reputation. Word is that he likes to form cliques, discriminate against others, and ostracize outsiders.\"","Gu Yebai nodded. \"You're right. Qin Zi'ang is just like some of those obnoxious guys in the capital circles. He has this built-in sense of superiority and looks down on us folks from other provinces.\"","\"But we don't cross paths with them anyway, so just ignoring him is fine.\"","Just as he finished speaking, they saw the bar's general manager respectfully leading Qin Zi'ang's group toward the giant, luxuriously decorated circular booth directly across from the dance floor, which offered the best view.","It had originally been empty; it was said that this spot wasn't open to the public and was reserved strictly for top-tier VIPs or the owner.","It seemed Qin Zi'ang was a top-tier VIP here.","Qin Zi'ang swaggered over and sat down. Immediately, waiters flowed in like water, serving drinks and fruit platters.","He crossed his legs and casually swept his gaze across the room, his eyes carrying an air of condescending arrogance. When he saw Liu Yutong's booth, he paused slightly, seemingly interested in these unfamiliar faces, especially the quiet but elegant girl in black sitting in the middle.","Moreover, this girl gave him a very special feeling. It was as if there was a black hole around her, not that she was gloomy, but rather that she absorbed all the light, making her appear exceptionally striking and eye-catching.","Besides that, she exuded an aura typical of an underworld boss, chaotic and intimidating.","He had to admit, in all his years in Modu, this was his first time seeing a girl with such a unique aura.","Just then, a companion next to him leaned into his ear and whispered a few words, his finger covertly pointing toward Liu Yutong's group.","Hearing this, Qin Zi'ang shifted his gaze back. This time, it was clearly more aggressive. He lingered on Liu Yutong's face for a moment, the corners of his mouth curling up slightly.","Then, he gestured to a nearby waiter.","A short while later.","A waiter in a vest and bowtie walked over to Liu Yutong's booth carrying a tray. On the tray lay an exquisite black business card and a pen.","The waiter bowed slightly to the people in the booth and said politely, \"Sorry to disturb you all. Young Master Qin from the booth over there would like to invite this lady over for a drink and to make friends. This is Young Master Qin's business card.\"","Saying so, he offered the card to Liu Yutong.","This kind of behavior was actually quite common in nightclubs, but for people of Liu Yutong's status, it was highly offensive.","The air in the booth instantly dropped to the freezing point; it felt much colder than the weather outside.","\"Take it back!\" Liu Yutong said only these three words.","The waiter froze, clearly not expecting her to refuse so bluntly, especially since she was personally invited by Young Master Qin.","\"Miss, Young Master Qin is the eldest son of Zhenhua Capital. He is very influential in Modu. It's just to make friends, just one glass of wine...\"","\"I said, take it back!\" Liu Yutong interrupted him, her voice sending an inexplicable chill down the waiter's spine.","Shen Hao and the others immediately stood up and scolded him angrily.","\"Are you fucking deaf? Didn't you hear her tell you to take it back? What Young Master Qin or Dog Qin, tell him to get the hell out of here!\"","\"Go back and tell that guy, if he dares to harass us again, don't blame us for being merciless.\"","\"Get lost!\"","The waiter fled in a panic, but the commotion on their side attracted the attention of many surrounding booths.","The people on Qin Zi'ang's side also looked over, and someone deliberately whistled.","Qin Zi'ang, in particular, put on what he thought was a charming, slightly roguish smile and shouted to Liu Yutong.","\"Hey! Beauty, you're really not going to give me face?\"","\"In Modu, there's no one Qin Zi'ang can't invite for a drink. You look unfamiliar, not a local, right? You're new here, and an extra friend means an extra path. As long as you come over and have a drink with me, I'll cover you in Modu from now on!\"","Gu Yebai sneered, \"Qin Zi'ang, what the fuck are you? You think you're worthy of saying you'll cover anyone here!\"","Only then did Qin Zi'ang notice Gu Yebai. After recognizing him, he laughed. \"I wondered who it was, turns out it's Young Master Gu. But even if she's your friend, coming to my turf, she still has to toast me a glass of wine, right?\"","Shen Hao said angrily, \"Your turf? Is this bar owned by your family? Always talking about your turf, you're addicted to acting like a local tyrant!\"","Zhou Muchen: \"Damn it, Zhenhua, right? Believe it or not, I can make your family's company disappear from HS Province!\"","Gu Yebai: \"That's a good idea. I think I can also take care of your family's company.\"","Zhu Silin: \"And me.\"","\"........\"","Qin Zi'ang's expression changed. \"Who are you all trying to scare? Young Master Gu, I admit you have some power, but don't think you can do anything to me just by bringing a few friends. Let me tell you, I wasn't raised on being scared...\"","Before he could finish speaking, a companion beside him had already found out the background of Liu Yutong's group and tugged at his sleeve.","\"Young Master Qin, these guys have pretty solid backgrounds. One is the eldest lady from BS Province, two are young masters from HS Province, one is the chairman of Qiming Electric, and one is the eldest lady of the Bai family. You already know Young Master Gu. As for the girl in black, we're not sure yet, but she definitely comes from a powerful background. This group all seems to be members of something called the Yunshan Society.\"","Qin Zi'ang's pupils shrank slightly. He hadn't expected this group of people to have such massive backgrounds. No wonder they all spoke with such arrogance.","To be honest, he wasn't afraid of Gu Yebai alone, especially in Modu. His own background wasn't as simple as an ordinary second-generation heir, otherwise, he wouldn't have the nickname Emperor of Modu.","But if this group joined forces against him, his family's business would definitely run into huge trouble.","However, even knowing their identities, he wouldn't cower before them. The supercar club he ran also gathered the top second-generation heirs and young masters of Modu; their influence was no smaller than theirs.","Of course, since he knew who they were, he naturally wouldn't offend them to the bitter end, but he absolutely could not lose face.","Then he looked at the bottle of Dalmore 62 in the display cabinet at the center of the stage and suddenly said, \"I heard you guys want to bid on this bottle too. As it happens, I've got my eye on it as well. Let's compete by the rules. But with just you bunch of out-of-town hicks, there's no way you can outbid me.\"","\"You!\" Shen Hao was furious and was about to rush forward, but Gu Yebai and Zhou Muchen held him back from the left and right.","Right at that moment.","Liu Yutong, who hadn't spoken much all this time, tapped her fingers lightly on the table twice.","The sound wasn't loud, yet it strangely managed to quiet the surrounding clamor for a moment.","\"Fine!\"","Liu Yutong looked at Qin Zi'ang and suddenly smiled.","The smile was incredibly beautiful, but it inexplicably sent a piercing chill down one's spine.","\"Since Young Master Qin wants to play, we'll play by the rules. However, just bidding is far too boring. The loser will simply strip off their clothes and streak around the Bund.\"","\"Shen Hao.\"","\"Sister Yutong!\" Shen Hao immediately looked at her.","\"I want this bottle,\" Liu Yutong said.","Shen Hao's spirits lifted, and he said loudly, \"Yes! Sister Yutong!\"","Qin Zi'ang's face darkened. He hadn't expected the other party to completely ignore conventions and propose such a massive wager, leaving him in a position where he couldn't back down gracefully.","There were still a lot of tourists at the Bund at this hour. If someone actually streaked around it, they would definitely make the headline news.","But under the watchful eyes of the crowd, there was absolutely no way he could chicken out and retreat.","\"Alright! I accept this bet. When it's time to take off your clothes later, you better not cry!\""]},{"number":615,"title":"Chapter 615: 615, Fifty Million","paragraphs":["The whiskey tasting segment soon officially began.","The spotlight hit the Dalmore 62-year-old placed in a glass display cabinet in the center of the stage. The amber liquid, reflecting the light, sparkled brightly like liquid gold.","\"Distinguished guests, next up will be the most exciting part of our evening, the special auction for this legendary 'Angel's Share', the Dalmore 62-year-old single malt whiskey! It begins now!\"","\"The starting price is 100,000! And there is no limit on the bid increments.\"","As the host's excited voice fell, Qin Zi'ang immediately raised his paddle without hesitation: \"500,000!\"","Shen Hao, not wanting to be outdone, followed up with his paddle: \"1,000,000!\"","He wanted to show a strong momentum right from the start.","\"1,500,000!\" Qin Zi'ang lazily raised his paddle himself, shooting Shen Hao a provocative glance.","\"2,000,000!\"","\"3,000,000!\"","The price soared at a staggering speed, quickly breaking the 5 million mark.","The other guests in the venue were completely reduced to spectators. No one dared to compete; they just excitedly pointed at Qin Zi'ang, Shen Hao, and the others, enjoying the drama.","A bidding war of this level had long exceeded the value of the liquor itself; it was purely a contest of face and wealth.","\"6,000,000!\" Shen Hao called out again, his palms sweating slightly.","Although Liu Yutong had said beforehand that they must get this bottle, this price was indeed a bit ridiculous.","It should be known that the last time a Dalmore 62-year-old was publicly auctioned, the final price was only a few hundred thousand. Today's price was already more than ten times that previous transaction.","Qin Zi'ang seemed to notice Shen Hao's lack of confidence, sneered, and raised his paddle again: \"6,500,000!\"","His attitude gave the impression that 6.5 million was just a drop in the bucket for him.","Gu Yebai whispered to Liu Yutong, \"Sister Yutong, it looks like this guy surnamed Qin is dead set on going against us.\"","Liu Yutong gave a soft \"hmm,\" and then called out her bid: \"6,500,000 and 10 cents.\"","Qin Zi'ang: \"???\"","\"No, is that how you bid? Just adding 10 cents?\"","Liu Yutong: \"I just need to be higher than you. The auction didn't specify a minimum increment. Also, I advise you, don't use your entire net worth to challenge my pocket money. Even if your father came, the result would be the same.\"","Qin Zi'ang was instantly angered into a laugh by her arrogant words. Wasn't she blatantly calling him a pauper?","\"Fine, since you like bragging so much, I'll let you brag to your heart's content!\"","\"I bid 8,000,000!\"","The whole venue was instantly in an uproar!","Eight million for a bottle of liquor, even if it was a Dalmore 62-year-old, was an astronomical price.","After shouting out this price, the smile on Qin Zi'ang's face noticeably faded, but he still deliberately provoked Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong acted as if she didn't see it and spoke again: \"8,000,000 and 10 cents.\"","\"8,500,000!\" Qin Zi'ang raised the bid again.","\"8,500,000 and 10 cents,\" Liu Yutong followed closely.","\"9,000,000!\"","\"9,000,000 and 10 cents.\"","\"10,000,000!\" Qin Zi'ang practically roared. He was obviously disgusted by Liu Yutong. What was the meaning of this? Deliberately adding 10 cents every time.","The venue became even livelier because of this. This was breaking a new record!","Ten million! Just to buy a bottle of liquor!","Ridiculous!","Right at this moment, Liu Yutong held up two fingers: \"20,000,000!\"","As soon as her voice fell, everyone instantly fell silent.","The feeling was like the calm before the storm, leaving everyone momentarily at a loss for words to describe the shock in their hearts.","In short, too fierce!","Qin Zi'ang's face darkened completely.","His family was indeed wealthy, but throwing down ten million just to prove a point had far exceeded his budget. Conversely, the other party had directly called out twenty million, and judging by her posture, she hadn't reached her limit yet.","Could it be that he, this rich second generation, was truly the poorest among the crowd?","From the moment he accepted this bet, he didn't quite believe that Gu Yebai and his group could completely crush him. After all, Gu Yebai and his companions were kids from the military compounds, so they shouldn't have much capital. As for Shen Hao and the eldest miss of the Bai family, their family backgrounds were solid, but he didn't believe the pocket money of these two second-generation heirs would be more than his.","His nickname, Emperor of Modu, wasn't for nothing. His spending power in the second-generation circle of Modu was top-tier, almost unrivaled. He even had a famous saying circulating in the circle: \"I don't care if the people I make friends with have money; anyway, none of them have as much money as I do.\"","He was just that arrogant!","Today, he seemed to have met his match; the girl dressed in black seemed to have more money than him.","Just then, one of his companions beside him couldn't help but advise: \"Young Master Qin, that's enough. Twenty million for a bottle of liquor is really not worth it, and this group from Yunshan Club seems determined to win...\"","\"Get lost!\"","Qin Zi'ang pushed him away. If he surrendered now, where would he put his face as the Emperor of Modu? Especially with the bet in place, if he stopped here, he probably wouldn't be able to mix in the circles of Modu anymore.","Thinking of this, he called out another astronomical price.","\"I bid 22,000,000!\"","\"However, I demand a verification of funds! Who knows if you outsiders are just making blind bids to intentionally scam me? Verify the funds! We must verify the funds!\"","This was obviously him starting to play dirty because he couldn't afford to lose.","But the possibility he mentioned wasn't non-existent. There were plenty of people who would randomly drive up prices at auctions, hoping others would foot the bill.","\"Qin Zi'ang, you're full of shit! You think we can't bring out the money? Who are you looking down on?!\" Shen Hao angrily retorted upon hearing his words.","Qin Zi'ang sneered: \"Empty words are no proof. Manager, I demand that their funds be verified, otherwise, I suspect them of malicious bidding!\"","The bar manager was caught in a dilemma; he couldn't afford to offend either side.","At this moment, Liu Yutong set down the wine glass in her hand: \"Want to verify funds? Sure!\"","Then she nodded to Lan Die, who was like a shadow behind her.","Lan Die immediately stepped forward and took out a black card from her handbag.","When the financial director took the card, his hand actually trembled slightly.","He had seen many black cards; after all, this was Modu, and there were plenty of people with assets in the tens of millions. Plus, their bar was a high-end establishment, and many of the guests who came to play here had net worths starting at ten million, and they all had black cards too.","However, those black cards were the ordinary kind, which you could get as long as your deposits exceeded ten million.","But today was his first time seeing such a special black card, which had a very obvious difference from the ordinary ones for deposits of tens or hundreds of millions. The texture of this black card was clearly better, with dark gold dragon patterns inlaid on the edges, and a special serial number 9 on it.","He had heard a rumor that one could only obtain a limited edition supreme black card if the deposits in the card exceeded ten billion.","Ten billion in liquid funds!","This was completely different from a person's so-called net worth. Looking across the entire Dragon Kingdom, the number of people who could obtain this kind of black card could be counted on one hand.","He never expected that the young woman standing before him would actually be one of them!","After confirming that the card was genuine, the manager broke into a cold sweat, his attitude becoming incredibly respectful. He first bowed deeply to Liu Yutong, then quickly walked over to the host and announced the result: \"Young Master Qin, and distinguished guests, after verification, there is absolutely no issue with Miss Liu's funds.\"","He didn't even dare to state the exact figure, but his attitude said it all.","It was undoubtedly a number that would make the bar's management, and even the boss himself, tremble in fear.","Qin Zi'ang froze.","His family's Zhenhua Capital was considered a corporate giant; what kind of black card hadn't he seen? However, he vaguely remembered seeing a similar dragon-patterned black card when he accompanied his father to meet a heavyweight client.","At the time, his father had told him that anyone who possessed such a card had a true behemoth of a background and must absolutely never be provoked.","Very quickly, he shook these thoughts out of his head.","Impossible!","This woman looked to be only around twenty years old!","His eyes must be playing tricks on him! They had to be!","\"Fine! Even if you have money! I bid 25 million!\" Qin Zi'ang completely lost his reason, shouting out another astronomical price.","Liu Yutong instead began to laugh: \"If Qin Zhenhua knew you were out here acting so recklessly, he'd probably want to have another kid to replace you.\"","She used Qin Zhenhua's full name, her tone as casual as if she were addressing a peer.","Of course, she had the right to do so. Strictly speaking, she was a first-generation founder, and so was Qin Zhenhua. A second-generation heir like Qin Zi'ang truly wasn't worthy of sitting at the same table as her.","Qin Zi'ang's mind buzzed, and he roared in absolute fury: \"Who the hell do you think you are, thinking you're worthy of mentioning my dad's name? I'll crush you with money today! 30 million!\"","Liu Yutong shook her head, seemingly finding the whole ordeal boring now. She reached out one hand, spread her five fingers wide, and stated a single number: \"50 million!\"","That sealed the deal!"]},{"number":616,"title":"Chapter 616: 616. Completely and Utterly Outclassed. Thanks for the QM270 Great God Certification","paragraphs":["Jumping straight from a starting bid of 100,000 to a staggering 50 million!","This crushing bid completely shattered Qin Ziang's last shred of hope.","His companions around him also instantly fell dead silent.","At this point, it was no longer just a simple matter of fighting for face; it was about being completely ground into the dirt by the opponent's absolute power.","At the manager's signal, the auctioneer, as if afraid the bidder would back out, hastily shouted, \"Fifty million going once! Fifty million going twice! Fifty million going three times! Sold! Congratulations to this lady!\"","The moment the gavel fell, the entire venue erupted in gasps of disbelief.","\"Did... did I hear that right? Fifty million? It actually sold?\"","\"Crazy! Everyone's fucking crazy! Fifty million for a bottle of wine! How many supercars could that buy!\"","\"Did you guys see the manager's expression during the capital verification just now? He looked like he'd seen a ghost. What exactly is the background of that black card?\"","\"I have a feeling that beauty in black isn't just rich; her background probably isn't simple either.\"","\"Old Li, you deal with financial institutions all year round. Did you see anything special about that black card?\"","\"It had a dark gold dragon pattern on the edge. If I remember correctly, that seems to be a 'Dragon' tier no-limit black card. I've only seen a big shot present a similar card at a high-level company gathering the year before last. At the time, even our CEO personally accompanied him, acting extremely respectful.\"","\"Hiss... A 'Dragon' tier no-limit black card. It seems this beauty has quite the background.\"","\"Just keep it to yourself, whatever you do, don't say it out loud. But Qin Ziang, this Emperor of Modu, really kicked an iron plate today. He's completely become a clown.\"","\"Yeah, do you think Young Master Qin will actually go streaking?\"","\"Not gonna lie, I really want to see if this guy's ass is pale or not.\" As the customer spoke, he even made a slurping sound.","\"???\"","\"Comrade, are you from CD?\"","Qin Ziang and his companions had long lost their previous arrogance; each of their faces was blacker than the bottom of a pot.","\"Young Master Qin, you... you aren't really going to streak on the Bund, are you?\"","\"Do we have a choice? Or should we just call the police? Just say we want to go to jail and drop the soap.\"","\"Get lost!\"","\"...\"","Over at the Yunshan Club's side.","Even though the group was already worth billions, they were still shocked by Liu Yutong's lavish spending. But more than that, they felt a thrilling sense of vindication.","What they wanted was to crush him!","That bastard Qin Ziang always felt he was superior because he was a local of Modu, but now wasn't he being ruthlessly ground into the dirt by outsiders like them?","The manager brought the wine over. Shen Hao excitedly took the bottle worth fifty million, stroked it, and looked at Liu Yutong: \"Sister Yutong, this wine...\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Open it and pour everyone a glass. We have to celebrate our victory.\"","\"Sister Yutong is so generous!\"","\"Thank you, Sister Yutong!\"","\"........\"","Bai Shi was even more excited: \"Sister Yutong, you're amazing! The way Qin Ziang looked just now, haha, I bet he'll have to take a detour whenever he sees you in Modu from now on.\"","Zhu Silin also pursed her lips and smiled: \"Now the Emperor of Modu is really going to be world-famous, just in a different way.\"","Gu Yebai and Zhou Muchen exchanged a smile, raising their glasses to Liu Yutong.","Everything was understood without being said.","At this moment, someone from a booth who didn't mind making a scene suddenly shouted loudly to stir the pot.","\"Young Master Qin, they're already drinking the wine! When is your healthy jog around the Bund going to start? We're all waiting to take pictures!\"","\"Yeah, admit defeat when you lose a bet! Emperor of Modu, show us your imperial demeanor!\"","\"Take it off! Take it off! Take it off!\"","\".......\"","The jeers grew in number and volume.","Qin Ziang couldn't take it anymore. He fiercely grabbed a wine glass from the table and smashed it hard on the ground!","Crash!","\"Fuck! This is going too far!\"","\"Beat them up for me! If anything happens, I'll take the fall!\"","As soon as his voice fell, Qin Ziang led his companions and a few underlings, charging toward the Yunshan Club group.","\"Protect Sister Yutong!\"","Gu Yebai shouted loudly, standing up simultaneously with Shen Hao and Zhou Muchen to meet them head-on.","The sounds of wine glasses, tables, and chairs being smashed rang out incessantly.","The scene instantly descended into chaos!","Just as Qin Ziang led a few underlings past Gu Yebai and the others toward Liu Yutong, a figure suddenly cut in front of him. Lan Die made her move.","She didn't hold back at all; her strikes were dirty and ruthless.","The three or four underlings who lunged forward from Qin Ziang's side were actually all knocked to the ground in a mere ten seconds.","Everyone was stunned by the woman's terrifying combat skills.","Qin Ziang also watched in disbelief as his underlings fell like they were made of paper.","\"Trash! A bunch of trash! You can't even handle one woman!\"","Qin Ziang was trembling with anger. In a fit of rage, he actually grabbed a wine bottle himself and charged recklessly toward Liu Yutong.","\"I'll fucking kill you!\"","\"Qin Ziang, don't you dare!\" Gu Yebai and the others were both shocked and furious, but it was too late to turn back and stop him.","On the other side, Lan Die didn't try to stop him either.","Just a useless second-generation rich kid; he posed no threat to the eldest miss.","Just as Qin Ziang approached Liu Yutong, she finally moved.","She didn't even stand up completely from the sofa. She merely uncrossed her casually resting legs and gently set them down. Her body swayed like a willow branch brushed by the wind, dodging slightly to the side, causing Qin Ziang's downward smash with the wine bottle to miss completely.","As Qin Ziang rushed forward due to momentum, a hint of bewilderment had just risen in his heart when his wrist suddenly tightened.","Liu Yutong's fingers had somehow locked onto the wrist holding the bottle. The touch carried a slight coolness, but the force was bizarre. Qin Ziang only felt his entire arm instantly go numb and sore, as if hit by an electric current, and his fingers involuntarily let go.","Clatter!","The wine bottle fell onto the carpet, making a muffled sound.","It all happened too fast. In the eyes of the bystanders, they only saw Qin Ziang lunging fiercely, while the woman in black seemed to just tilt her body slightly, reaching out to grab and pull. The aggressive Qin Ziang was like a clumsy puppet being casually manipulated.","Qin Ziang was both shocked and angry. He subconsciously clenched his other hand into a fist and swung it at her.","Liu Yutong immediately used the fingers clamping his wrist to nimbly press down. Borrowing the momentum of Qin Ziang's forward charge, she pulled him to her side and somehow hooked his foot.","Qin Ziang felt the world spin, and then with a loud thud, his body slammed heavily onto the floor below the booth, letting out a miserable shriek.","The entire bar fell into a deathly silence.","If Lan Die's previous moves were fierce and ruthless, making people feel terrified, then Liu Yutong's personal intervention gave off a special sense of beauty. She effortlessly threw such a large man off the platform.","\"Hiss~~~~\"","Someone gasped, breaking the silence.","\"Did you see clearly? How did she do that?\"","\"I didn't see clearly. It looked like she just touched him twice, and Young Master Qin went flying on his own?\"","\"What do you mean flying on his own? That's using the opponent's strength against them! This beauty is actually a trained martial artist.\"","\"Oh my god, she's gorgeous, filthy rich, has an unfathomable background, and can fight like a pro? Is she even giving anyone else a chance to survive?\"","\"That move just now was pretty badass, and her form was actually really graceful.\"","\"Qin Zi'ang really crashed and burned this time. Looks, money, power, and combat skills—he was completely and utterly crushed by a woman in every possible way. It's tragic!\"","\"I'm actually starting to pity him now, tsk, tsk, tsk...\"","Gu Yebai, Shen Hao, and the others were also stunned for a moment. They truly hadn't expected her to be hiding such a formidable skill.","Thank goodness they had chosen to befriend her from the start. If they had been any more arrogant back then, their fate probably wouldn't have been much better than Qin Zi'ang's.","Right at that moment, another group of people appeared at the entrance of the bar. Leading the pack was a middle-aged man in a suit. It was none other than Qin Zi'ang's father, the Chairman of Zhenhua Capital—Qin Zhenhua!","......."]},{"number":617,"title":"Chapter 617: 617, No Compensation Required.","paragraphs":["The moment Qin Zhenhua appeared at the entrance of the bar, he was immediately recognized.","As a renowned capital tycoon in the Magic City, many people in the bar knew him. Even those who didn't know him personally had heard of him because of his son, Qin Zi'ang.","As soon as Qin Zhenhua stepped into the bar, he saw his son wailing on the floor. His face darkened instantly.","\"Zi'ang!\"","He quickly ran forward, helped his son up, and after confirming that his injuries were not serious, he turned his gaze to the girl in black standing before him.","Seeing this, the surrounding guests couldn't help but sweat for Liu Yutong. It was well known that Qin Zhenhua was famous in the local business circle for his tough tactics and for being fiercely protective of his own.","Now that she had beaten up his son, the other party probably wouldn't let it go easily.","Just as everyone was guessing how Liu Yutong would smooth things over, her actions exceeded their expectations.","She simply sat back down in the booth, casually crossed one leg over the other, and looked down at Qin Zhenhua condescendingly.","\"President Qin came over so suddenly, is it specifically to vent anger on behalf of your son?\"","Qin Zhenhua's pupils shrank slightly. Having navigated the business world for over a decade and having read countless people, the young woman's fearlessness actually sent a chill down his spine.","Recalling some information he had received earlier, he increasingly felt that this Miss Liu's background was probably far from simple.","As for why he knew Liu Yutong's identity, it was because he was also a member of the Chaozhou Gang.","The Chaozhou Gang was not a gang in the traditional sense, but a highly influential chamber of commerce. For example, the richest man who recently went behind bars was also a member of the Chaozhou Gang, and Pony Ma of Big Goose, Li Ka-shing of the Harbor City, and so on, all had ties with the Chaozhou Gang.","When Boss Huang first got into trouble, it wasn't that no one in the gang tried to help pull strings. As a result, not only did they fail to bail him out, but he was also sentenced to over ten years.","Whether it was Qin Zhenhua or other members of the Chaozhou Gang, they were all dumbfounded at the time. Was it just because he offended one person that he got such a long sentence?","In fact, they also knew the reason for the sentence, but they leaned more towards the belief that Boss Huang had been set up.","This was also why, at this moment, even though Qin Zhenhua was filled with rage, he could only force it down.","\"May I ask how my useless son offended Miss Liu, that you had to strike so heavily?\"","Liu Yutong chuckled lightly. \"Chairman Qin might as well ask your son who tried to lay hands on who first. I was merely acting in self-defense, unlike some people who treat the law as nothing.\"","It would have been fine if she hadn't mentioned the law. By bringing it up, Qin Zhenhua immediately felt that she was warning him, warning him not to end up like the richest man Huang.","\"What a formidable girl, not forgiving at all,\" Qin Zhenhua cursed inwardly, then turned to look at his son.","Seeing his son stammering, he knew the other party was right; it was his son who provoked her first.","However, even if they were in the wrong, under the watchful eyes of everyone, he couldn't just let it go.","This concerned the face of the Qin family.","\"Even so, wasn't Miss Liu a bit too heavy-handed? Miss Liu, although you have a background, this is the Magic City after all!\" Qin Zhenhua's words were soft but firm, indicating that he was not blind to right and wrong, but also hinting to Liu Yutong that even a mighty dragon should not suppress a local snake.","Hearing this, Liu Yutong stood up directly.","\"I really like the Magic City, so I don't like people throwing their weight around here.\"","\"Today's matter is a personal conflict, and I can let it end here, but...\"","Liu Yutong walked up to Qin Zhenhua and his son before finishing her sentence.","\"There won't be a next time!\"","After saying that, she said to Lan Die behind her, \"Let's go.\"","Lan Die immediately stepped forward and took Liu Yutong's coat draped over the back of the sofa.","Shen Hao, Gu Yebai, and the others also grabbed their things and followed Liu Yutong out.","Qin Zhenhua stood in place, glaring at his son with a livid face. Then he took a checkbook out of his pocket, quickly wrote down a number, tore it off, and handed it to his assistant beside him.","\"Deliver the check.\"","The assistant nodded and immediately chased after the direction Liu Yutong and her group had left, holding the check.","Seeing this, Qin Zi'ang was unhappy. \"Dad, why are you giving her money? It was clearly that woman who hit me.\"","\"Shut up!\"","Qin Zhenhua interrupted him. \"Haven't you embarrassed us enough? Being beaten up by a woman, and you actually have the nerve to say it!\"","On the other side.","Qin Zhenhua's assistant chased out of the bar and caught up with Liu Yutong and her group just as they were about to get into their cars near the entrance.","\"Miss Liu, please wait.\"","The assistant panted slightly and offered the check with both hands. \"This is a small token from President Qin, to help Miss Liu recover from the shock, and also to apologize on behalf of Young Master Qin.\"","Lan Die directly reached out and took the check for Liu Yutong. After glancing at the number on it, she said something to Liu Yutong.","Hearing this, Liu Yutong smiled. \"President Qin thinks he can smooth over tonight's matter with such a small amount of money?\"","The assistant's face stiffened, not knowing how to reply.","\"Tell President Qin to keep his money for himself.\"","With that, she bent down and got into the car.","Lan Die held the check between two fingers and casually flicked her wrist. The check flew back with a whoosh, landing precisely on the assistant's chest. Fortunately, the assistant reacted fast enough to catch it.","\"Our eldest miss said there's no need,\" Lan Die dropped this sentence and also turned to get into the car.","Shen Hao, Gu Yebai, and the others also got into their respective cars.","After starting up, the cars quickly merged into the traffic and disappeared.","By the time the assistant returned to the bar, most of the guests had dispersed, leaving only the staff cleaning up the mess.","Qin Zhenhua was sitting in the booth where Liu Yutong had just sat, smoking a cigar with a gloomy face, while Qin Zi'ang sat across from him with his head bowed.","The assistant stepped forward and reported the situation in a low voice, placing the returned check on the glass coffee table.","Qin Zhenhua looked at the check, remained silent for a long time, and then exhaled a heavy ring of smoke.","\"She won't even accept the money. This is getting a bit tricky.\"","Not accepting the money meant that the matter was not over for her, or more accurately, she simply didn't take the Qin family seriously at all, hence she didn't care for it.","\"Dad, are we just going to let this go? She's too arrogant!\" Qin Zi'ang couldn't help but look up, his face full of defiance.","\"Let it go?\"","Qin Zhenhua sneered and crushed his cigar in the ashtray. \"Do you know how big of a disaster you almost brought to our family tonight?\"","\"Do you know how Boss Huang ended up in prison? She did it. This woman...\"","For a moment, he didn't know how to describe her, so he simply shared the information he knew. \"In short, several bosses in the Chaozhou Gang warned us long ago to try not to provoke this woman. Her background is extremely deep; even they can't fathom the bottom of it.\"","Qin Zi'ang had never seen his father talk about a person with such a wary tone, especially since the other party was a young woman.","But he was still somewhat unwilling to accept it. \"No matter how formidable she is, she's still just a woman. Even a mighty dragon shouldn't suppress a local snake...\"","Qin Zhenhua abruptly cut him off. Idiot! What is a local kingpin in the eyes of a true titan? Didn't you see clearly tonight? Are her skills something an ordinary person could possess? Is her aura something an average family could cultivate? Don't you know what kind of people make up the Yunshan Club? Have you ever stopped to think why those arrogant, privileged elites all treat her as their leader? Doesn't that tell you enough?","The barrage of questions left Qin Zi'ang completely speechless, his face flushing bright red.","Qin Zhenhua wearily rubbed the bridge of his nose. From today onward, you are to keep your head down and stay put. You are not allowed to go out and stir up trouble without my permission. As for this Miss Liu... I will look into exactly what she plans to do here in Mocheng. Until then, you must steer clear of her.","With that, he stood up and straightened his suit.","Let's go. We're heading back for now."]},{"number":618,"title":"Chapter 618: 618, Thanks for the Big God Certification from [Golden Pattern Elixir Daoist Who Likes Lobster]","paragraphs":["Magic City, International Conference Center.","The 3rd Magic City Annual Internet Summit was grandly held here. This was an extremely important gathering for the Dragon Country's internet industry following the financial crisis.","At 8:30 in the morning, both sides of the red carpet outside the venue were already crowded with media reporters. Holding their array of cameras, they aimed at the entrance, waiting for the arrival of the big shots who dominated the internet world of Dragon Country.","\"Look! It's Boss Ma from Ali!\" someone in the crowd of reporters suddenly shouted.","Ma Yunyun was seen wearing a suit, walking onto the red carpet with a face full of smiles, and casually answering a few questions raised by the reporters.","\"The financial crisis? In every crisis, there is an opportunity! Not only has Ali survived this year, but we will also develop even better in the future!\"","Immediately after, Pony Ma also arrived.","Compared to Ma Yunyun's outgoing and bold nature, he appeared much more reserved, merely nodding to a few familiar reporters.","Subsequently, Baidu's Li Yanhong, NetEase's Ding Sanshi, Xinliang's Cao Weiguo, Shengda Entertainment's Chen Sheng, Souhu's Zhang Yang... familiar faces appeared one after another.","The reporters discussed animatedly while taking photos.","\"The standard of this year's summit is really high. I heard the city leaders are coming too.\"","\"Of course. Under the financial crisis, the internet is seen as a new point of economic growth. The higher-ups attach great importance to this sector.\"","\"...\"","Just then, a black Maybach slowly pulled up to the red carpet.","The car itself was eye-catching enough, but when the woman who stepped out appeared in everyone's line of sight, even the experienced reporters fell into a brief silence.","Liu Yutong wore a black women's suit today, paired with a light gold silk shirt underneath, looking capable yet feminine. She wore a large pair of sunglasses that covered more than half of her face, revealing only a fair jawline and pale lips, giving her an air of deep mystery.","On her left was Zhang Dalong, and on her right was a woman with a completely different aura.","That woman was also dressed in a black suit. She had a standard oval face, curved eyebrows, and eyes that smiled. When she smiled, two shallow dimples appeared at the corners of her mouth, making her look sweet and lovely. She was none other than Yu Xin, the general manager of Wanhui Preferred, a subsidiary of the Wanlonghui Group.","Yu Xin wore exquisite light makeup today, with her eyeliner slightly flicked up, adding an imperceptible touch of charm to her sweetness. She walked beside Liu Yutong, her gaze occasionally sweeping over the media and onlookers on both sides of the red carpet, a sweet smile always on her face.","When the reporters' cameras focused on them, Yu Xin even tilted her head slightly, flashing an even brighter smile at several camera angles and waving gently. Her lively personality formed a sharp contrast with Liu Yutong's quiet composure.","\"Who are these two ladies?\" a young reporter whispered.","\"I don't know them. Are people like this on the invitation list?\"","\"Looking at their aura, they are definitely not ordinary people.\"","\"...\"","Liu Yutong didn't linger on the red carpet for long. She gave a polite nod to the media area and walked straight into the venue with Yu Xin and Zhang Dalong.","Only after their figures disappeared into the venue entrance did the reporter area begin to buzz with discussion.","\"Quickly look it up, who was that just now?\"","\"Could she be a representative from some investment firm?\"","\"Never heard of her. We basically know all the heads of famous domestic investment funds.\"","\"I know, I know who the one with the sweet smile is. She's Yu Xin, the general manager of Wanhui Preferred. She was on the BS Province news channel before. As for the other one, I have no idea, but I heard the big boss behind Wanhui Preferred is also a woman. Maybe it's her?\"","\"Really?\"","\"What about that middle-aged guy?\"","\"That guy seems to be Zhang Dalong, the general manager of the recently explosive Weibo. That farm game was made by his team.\"","\"Damn, you just reminded me! I haven't harvested my crops today yet, and they're all rare cherries. I hope they don't get stolen!\"","\"You actually have cherries? Bro, add me as a friend.\"","\"No way!\"","\"...\"","By 8:30, hundreds of internet company executives, investors, and industry experts had already gathered inside the venue.","The internet summit wouldn't officially start until 9:00, so everyone was currently greeting each other, exchanging industry information, or looking for cooperation opportunities.","When Liu Yutong and her group walked into the main venue, many eyes instantly turned toward her.","There were looks of curiosity, scrutiny, astonishment, and confusion.","\"Boss Ma, do you know her?\" Ding Sanshi, holding a cup of coffee, nudged Ma Yunyun beside him.","Ma Yunyun narrowed his eyes to study her for a few seconds, then shook his head. \"Never seen her before, but looking at her posture, she has quite the background.\"","\"Could she be an investor returning from overseas?\"","Li Yanhong also joined the discussion. \"I recently heard that a few overseas funds want to buy the dip in Dragon Country's internet sector during this winter, especially the internet companies listed overseas.\"","\"Let them buy the dip, I'm just afraid they'll short us...\"","\"...\"","The group's topic of conversation unknowingly drifted away.","In a nearby resting area, Qin Zhenhua was also chatting with several business partners from the Chaoshan gang. When he saw Liu Yutong walk in, his expression noticeably became unnatural.","This scene was coincidentally noticed by his friend next to him, who was in real estate.","In fact, not everyone attending the internet summit was an internet professional; many people from traditional industries liked to come to expand their networks, and Qin Zhenhua's friend was one of them.","\"Chairman Qin, is she the one you mentioned earlier?\"","Qin Zhenhua nodded. \"That's her.\"","\"Apart from being a bit young, she indeed looks extraordinary. But what is she doing at an occasion like this today?\"","\"What kind of question is that? If you, a real estate guy, can come, why can't she?\"","\"Hahaha... true enough.\"","At exactly 9:00, the summit officially began.","The leaders of Magic City gave their speeches, followed by the heads of industry associations, and then keynote speeches from several internet tycoons and up-and-comers.","Starting with Ma Yunyun, it went all the way until Yu Xin and Zhang Dalong took the stage to share the businesses they were respectively in charge of.","Only then did the audience clearly understand their identities. Especially after learning that these two were at the helm of Wanhui Preferred and Weibo respectively, many people visibly started to take them seriously.","In particular, the two Mas and Xinliang's Cao Weiguo paid the most attention to them.","Ma Yunyun's attention stemmed from the fact that Wanhui Preferred's model had a potential competitive relationship with his Ali to some extent. Ali was also considering entering the group-buying track to accelerate its layout.","Pony Ma focused mainly on the person. He hadn't expected to meet this former subordinate of his, who used to speak very little, right here. He was even more surprised that the other party had created Weibo and that innovative farm game in just a few short months.","Hmm... not bad. We must definitely borrow some ideas from it.","Of course, it would naturally be best if he could directly poach his old subordinate back, or acquire his current company. Constantly borrowing ideas easily drew criticism, and he cared about his reputation, after all.","Cao Wei from Xinliang was also keeping a close eye on Zhang Dalong, his expression heavily laden with solemnity. A similar project that his company had just recently approved had actually been preempted and completed by someone else. Furthermore, it had attracted twenty million registered users in just two short months. This sheer speed put him under an immense amount of pressure.","This microblogging platform was destined to be Xinliang's greatest enemy!","As time ticked by and the internet tycoons finished their speeches, the summit drew to a close. Lan Die, accompanied by several core members of the Wanlong Society, approached these internet moguls one by one with an invitation, using the exact same phrasing for each.","\"Mr. Ma.\"","\"Mr. Cao.\"","\"Young Mr. Ma.\"","\"Mr. Ding.\"","\"Mr. Chen.\"","\"...\"","\"Our Young Lady has already booked a restaurant and invites you all to gather there.\"","The group of internet tycoons were all taken aback upon hearing this. After learning that the invitation came from the Chairman of the Wanlong Society Group, they pondered for a brief moment before nodding in agreement one after another.","Both Wanhui Youxuan and Weibo, the new darlings of the internet industry, were controlled by the Wanlong Society. For this reason alone, they had no excuse to refuse.","What is more, they had vaguely heard that the ultimate fate of a certain Boss Huang was the handiwork of the Wanlong Society's leader. This made it even more impossible to decline.","And just like that.","In the new year following the financial crisis, a top-tier dinner gathering of the internet world came into being."]},{"number":619,"title":"Chapter 619: 619. Inviting Internet Tycoons to Invest.","paragraphs":["The restaurant Liu Yutong had chosen was hidden within a private club by the river, closed off to the general public.","Lan Die had already arranged everything flawlessly.","The core members of the Wanlong Society, dressed in uniform black suits, stood in neat rows on both sides of the path leading from the courtyard entrance to the main building's corridor, presenting a highly solemn atmosphere.","Liu Yutong stood gracefully before the foyer of the main building. She had changed into a milky-white silk dress, with a thin silver chain around her waist perfectly accentuating her slender figure. Her long hair was loosely pinned back, allowing a few stray strands to fall naturally against her neck. She wore no jewelry other than a platinum watch on her wrist, giving her a fresh and unearthly elegance.","However, the most striking thing about her was her face.","Having taken off the oversized sunglasses she wore at the summit, she now fully revealed her true appearance, making everyone who saw her unable to resist taking a second look. Her skin was a cool-toned white, like fine mutton-fat jade, and her features still held a trace of fading girlish innocence. Her eyes were incredibly bright, possessing a piercing quality. Her nose was straight, and her lips, a natural pale pink, were currently turned up slightly into a gentle smile.","\"President Ma, welcome.\"","Ma Yunyun was the first guest to arrive.","The internet mogul, famous for his eloquence, had a clear flash of astonishment in his eyes the moment he saw Liu Yutong's face clearly. But he quickly recovered his usual demeanor, smiling and reaching out his hand. \"Miss Liu, you are too kind to come out and greet me personally.\"","\"It's only proper.\"","Liu Yutong briefly shook his hand before letting go, her composed demeanor completely unlike that of a girl around twenty years old.","\"Please head inside first, President Ma. Yu Xin will take you to the private room to rest for a moment.\"","Yu Xin had also changed into a lotus-root-pink modern qipao, making her look even more sweet and gentle.","\"This way, President Ma. Let's have a cup of tea first. We'll start the banquet once the others arrive.\"","As Ma Yunyun followed Yu Xin inside, he couldn't help but look back at the white figure standing by the foyer.","She was excessively young, yet also excessively composed, hiding a subtle sharpness within.","It was the first time he had ever seen such a contradictory aura in a woman.","Soon after, Pony Ma, Ding Sanshi, Li Yanhong... one heavyweight figure in the internet industry after another arrived.","Almost everyone's reaction was identical to Ma Yunyun's: first stunned by Liu Yutong's youth and beauty, and then intrigued by her unique aura.","Only after everyone had gathered did Liu Yutong finally enter the banquet hall.","The guests took their seats according to the pre-arranged nameplates.","Liu Yutong naturally sat at the head of the table. To her left were Ma Yunyun, Ding Sanshi, and Li Yanhong; to her right were Pony Ma, Cao Weiguo, and Chen Sheng.","Yu Xin and Zhang Dalong sat a bit further down on either side of her.","\"Thank you all for honoring me with your presence.\"","Liu Yutong raised her teacup. \"I am young and a latecomer to the industry, so I still have much to learn from all of you. Today, I'll substitute tea for wine and offer the first toast to everyone.\"","The guests all raised their glasses in polite response.","Ma Yunyun smiled. \"You're too modest, Miss Liu. In the internet industry, age doesn't matter; it's vision and boldness that count. The success of Wanhui Youxuan and Weibo is obvious to all of us. Your future achievements will be remarkable.\"","\"It was just good luck, catching the right timing,\" Liu Yutong replied humbly, signaling the waiters to start serving the food.","As the dishes were brought out one by one, the group started chatting about today's summit, gradually shifting to the state of the industry following the financial crisis.","Although Liu Yutong didn't speak much, every time she opened her mouth, she hit the nail on the head. Her deep understanding of each company's business secretly surprised these seasoned veterans, making them wonder if this girl had secretly planted spies in their companies. How else could she know their operations so thoroughly?","After several rounds of drinks.","Liu Yutong's expression grew visibly serious as she finally revealed the true purpose of inviting them today. \"Actually, besides wanting to meet you seniors in the industry, I have a presumptuous request for you all today.\"","A momentary silence fell over the table.","\"Please feel free to speak, Miss Liu,\" Ding Sanshi was the first to break the silence.","\"It's like this: I'm currently preparing a wafer fab project, and I'd like to invite you all to join. To be precise, I'm hoping you can invest some money.\"","This was a decision she had made after careful consideration.","Everyone knew that a microchip project was incredibly difficult. Even though Liu Yutong had an overseas company, it would still be a tough endeavor. She needed to expand the project's influence, getting more people to pay attention, take it seriously, and even participate, so the success rate would be higher.","As for why she chose to invite these internet moguls to participate, the reason was simple.","Right now, pushing the chip industry to quickly catch up with advanced international standards on her own was extremely difficult. But if she could pull these top-tier internet companies together, it would be a different story.","In the future, these companies would inevitably need to design their own chips. Whether it was Ali's cloud computing or other operations, they could not do without the support of powerful, cheap, and abundant computing power.","The future expansion of every company essentially required the backing of more advanced chips.","So, couldn't everyone collaborate? If nothing else, they could at least place some orders, right?","Furthermore, the influence these internet companies brought could not be ignored.","When names like Ali, Tengda, Baidu, and Wangyi were linked to a national-level hard-tech project, the resulting public momentum, policy attention, and impact on the global supply chain would be unmatched by any single entity.","As soon as she finished speaking, a brief silence settled over the table.","Making chips?","Wasn't this girl being a bit too ambitious?","Was this really something they could just casually dabble in right now?","Li Yanhong pushed up his glasses and asked cautiously, \"Miss Liu, I'm not questioning your judgment. It's just that the barrier to entry in the chip industry is too high. Capital, technology, talent—every single aspect is a hurdle, and it's hard to see returns in the short term.\"","\"You're right, President Li.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"That's why this isn't a short-term investment project. It might take five years, ten years, or even longer. But if it succeeds, the returns will be highly substantial. Moreover, this isn't just about financial returns; it's about whether our Dragon Kingdom's internet ecosystem can achieve autonomy.\"","\"I believe none of you want to see us getting choked by outsiders in the future, right?\"","Her voice was particularly infectious as she said this, almost making people forget that she was just a young woman around twenty years old.","Pony Ma was rather direct, suddenly asking, \"How much funding do you need, Miss Liu?\"","\"Ten billion for the initial phase, but I've already secured five billion.\" Liu Yutong spoke so casually, as if treating ten billion like a mere hundred bucks.","The table fell silent once again.","Ten billion for the first phase—this number truly shocked them. Coming up with this amount was still somewhat difficult for them right now, even if it was just half of it.","\"That's no small number. Moreover, a heavy-asset, long-cycle project like microchips is quite different from the light-asset, fast-turnover model of our internet companies,\" Ma Yunyun said.","\"That's why I won't force it.\"","Liu Yutong smiled and said, \"If any of you industry veterans believe the future of Longxin is worth a gamble, you are more than welcome to reach out to me for an in-depth chat anytime. If not, that is perfectly fine too. Even a friendly little investment is enough for me to consider you a friend.\"","\"Oh, by the way. Actually, aside from Mr. Ma, I suppose I am already a shareholder in all of your companies. Wangyi, Baidu, Xinliang, Shengda, Souhu... I believe every one of your companies has incredible potential, so I bought some shares in each of them. You could say it is my way of showing a little sincerity in wanting to make friends.\""]},{"number":620,"title":"Chapter 620: 620. What We Need Is Endorsement.","paragraphs":["Hearing her say this, the internet tycoons all started laughing.","\"Miss Liu truly has a good eye.\"","\"It's mainly because I have confidence in the companies of all the bosses here.\"","\"I believe the internet industry will definitely become more and more prosperous, so I'm taking advantage of the low stock prices to stock up on some shares and wait for them to appreciate in the future,\" Liu Yutong said playfully.","\"Hahaha, then you definitely need to buy more.\"","\"Exactly, I should also buy more stock in everyone's companies.\"","\"...\"","Ma Yunyun, however, caught something unusual in her words. \"Wait, Miss Liu, what did you mean just now when you said 'except for me'?\"","Liu Yutong looked at him and said frankly, \"I mean that I haven't bought a single share of your company's stock, Boss Ma.\"","As soon as these words came out, the atmosphere at the table became subtle.","Everyone turned their eyes to Ma Yunyun, whose smile froze for a split second.","\"Does Miss Liu look down on our Ali?\" Ma Yunyun was a veteran of the battlefield, after all, and he quickly adjusted his expression, asking half-jokingly.","After all, Liu Yutong herself had said she bought stock in the companies of everyone present, except for his. This inevitably made it seem like she was looking down on him.","\"Not at all. It's mainly because I feel that Ali's current market value falls far short of its true worth. With your ambition and vision, Boss Ma, you certainly won't be satisfied with the status quo. I'm guessing you might consider delisting and restructuring someday. I'm personally a bit timid and don't really dare to touch stocks with such large potential fluctuations.\"","\"Pfft!\" Ding Sanshi nearly spat out a mouthful of tea and hurriedly covered his mouth with a tissue.","The others at the table had varying expressions; some held back laughter, some looked surprised, and others fell into deep thought.","Ma Yunyun's expression finally changed slightly.","His plan to delist Ali's B2B business from the Hong Kong Stock Exchange and pivot to the US stock market was currently just a thought. He hadn't even mentioned it to his internal staff. How on earth did this Liu Yutong guess what was on his mind?","Was it a coincidence?","Or did she really arrive at this conclusion solely through her assessment of the market value?","If that was the case, then she was a bit terrifying!","Liu Yutong continued, \"But seriously, Boss Ma, I think delisting and restructuring is a good thing. Ali's potential goes far beyond the B2B sector. In the future, tracks like e-commerce, digital payments, and cloud computing are all worth cultivating deeply and have immense development potential. When you relist on the US stock market, I will definitely be the first to buy in, without any hesitation.\"","These words of hers both affirmed Ali's value and pointed out its future development direction.","Ma Yunyun took a deep look at her and suddenly burst into loud laughter. \"Good! I'll remember your words, Miss Liu. When the time comes for us to actually ring the bell on the US stock exchange, I'll be sure to save a good spot for you.\"","The atmosphere at the table became lively again.","The way everyone looked at Liu Yutong gained a bit more depth.","This girl was very young and breathtakingly beautiful, but what was even more startling was her vision, which far exceeded her age, and her almost intuitive, keen insight.","When she mentioned earlier that Ali might delist and restructure, everyone initially just took it as a joke. After all, delisting was by no means a good choice for a company that had already gone public.","Usually, only companies with operational problems would choose to delist; otherwise, very few normal people would actively delist.","But when they observed Ma Yunyun's unnatural reaction, their hearts couldn't help but skip a beat. Boss Ma actually had such intentions, and might even be planning it already.","This was simply too terrifying!","What kind of insight did this girl possess? To be able to see the clues upon their very first meeting, or did she really plant spies in every company?","However, this possibility was unlikely, as there was no need for it.","Afterward, Liu Yutong shared some more of her views on future technological developments, such as the trend towards smart technology.","When the dinner banquet ended, it was not even nine o'clock in the evening.","On a whim, Ma Yunyun proposed that everyone take a group photo. Everyone gladly agreed; after all, a private gathering of the country's internet giants like this was indeed very rare.","In the end, it was Lan Die who took the group photo of their dinner party for them.","To fit everyone into the frame, Liu Yutong put on a pair of sunglasses and stood behind the two Mas. If it weren't for the fact that she was wearing a long white dress, her posture would have looked quite a bit like a behind-the-scenes boss holding down the fort.","With a click, the photo was captured.","Everyone successively said their goodbyes and left.","Liu Yutong personally walked them to the door.","Pony Ma was the last to leave. Right before getting into his car, he turned around, looked at the figure dressed in white under the lights, and suddenly asked, \"Miss Liu, you mentioned you're going to meet an important figure in the chip industry tomorrow. Can I tag along to have a look?\"","Liu Yutong nodded slightly. \"Of course, Boss Ma can contact me at any time.\"","\"Alright.\" Pony Ma nodded, then got into his car and left.","Yu Xin walked up to Liu Yutong and handed her a coat. \"Sister Yutong, it seems like our investment drive today wasn't very ideal. With so many big bosses, we barely scraped together a hundred million. They're clearly just humoring us.\"","Liu Yutong draped the coat over her shoulders and said, \"I never cared about exactly how much money they invested. All I want is the simple fact that they did invest.\"","Yu Xin looked confused. \"Sister Yutong, I still don't quite understand what you mean.\"","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and gave her an example. \"For instance, tomorrow we can publicly announce that the chip project has completed its angel round of financing, with a financing amount of ten billion. On the list of investors, not a single one of the companies present tonight can be missing; they must all be listed. However, we won't disclose exactly how much each company invested. Even if Boss Ma only invested one dollar, I would still put him on the list, side by side with everyone else.\"","\"Think about it. When the outside world sees this list, Ali, Goose, Baidu, NetEase, Sina, Shanda, Sohu... when these names simultaneously appear in the investor column of a chip project, what will they think? How will the media report it? Where will the attention of upstream and downstream manufacturers in the industry chain, domestic and foreign tech talents, and even higher-level authorities be drawn?\"","\"What I've wanted was never the money in their pockets, but the weight represented behind their names. It's the strong signal released by them collectively endorsing us. This signal is far more valuable than the funds they provide. It will act like a powerful magnet, attracting everything we need, attention, trust, opportunities, and resources. By the time this project, collectively backed by the country's top internet companies, is officially launched, no one will be able to easily ignore it, and no one will be able to easily stifle it. This is the true leverage effect.\"","Looking at Liu Yutong's profile, Yu Xin suddenly saw the light.","Unknowingly, Sister Yutong's control and manipulation of the situation had already reached a state of effortless mastery.","\"I understand now. Sister Yutong, you're way too amazing. I feel like I won't be able to catch up to you in this lifetime.\"","\"But this is pretty good too. I'll just follow you, so I won't have to use my brain, hehe.\"","Liu Yutong rolled her eyes at her. \"Don't even think about slacking off.\"","Then, she lifted her head and gazed at the dazzling Pearl Tower across the river.","The groundwork for her first step was essentially complete. Everything was in place; all that was missing was a true talent capable of spearheading the microchip project."]},{"number":621,"title":"Chapter 621: 621, Candidate for the Commander-in-Chief of Loongson.","paragraphs":["The river breeze carried a chill, blowing away the vanity of last night.","After getting up, Liu Yutong held a steaming cup of coffee, stood on the hotel balcony, and stared blankly at the scenery outside.","After parting ways with those internet tycoons yesterday, she had been thinking about the most critical candidate for the Longxin project. When she learned that an extremely important figure was about to join Huahong EC, she knew the time was ripe.","The preliminary preparations for Longxin were almost complete.","Abroad, Ji Zhe had already reached preliminary agreements with several internationally renowned investment banks. Coupled with the domestic investors they both pulled from their respective circles of friends, raising five billion in funds was not a major problem.","On Liu Yutong's side, Pearl Capital, Yunshan Capital, and Wanlong Capital had also prepared their funds.","On the policy front, she believed Uncle Li wouldn't be stingy either.","In short, with the funds, policies, and the group of allies she had just brought in last night, everything was basically ready. The only thing missing was the core stabilizing force, a commander-in-chief who could truly take charge of the overall situation and transform the paper plans into an actual production line.","This person must not merely be a top academic guru. He must have rich experience in every aspect, from project initiation, site selection, and factory construction to equipment introduction, process debugging, and final mass production. At the same time, he must also have experience working under different cultural and work systems in the East and the West, able to deeply understand international rules while leveraging domestic advantages to solve pain points.","In addition, he needed top-tier technical vision, as well as strong engineering management and team-building capabilities.","More importantly, he must have enough ambition and drive, daring to challenge a new project from scratch.","Through her investigations during this period, combined with memories from her past life, Liu Yutong found that at this point in time, the person with the best chance and who best met her requirements seemed to be only one person: Qiu Ciyun.","This legendary figure, respectfully called Master Qiu in the industry, was currently in a transition period.","Qiu Ciyun graduated from UC Berkeley in his early years, possessing a profound background in semiconductor physics and devices. His career spanned America, Taiwan, and the mainland. He was an early technical backbone of Taijidian, personally participating in and witnessing Taijidian's critical climb from struggling to catch up to leading the industry. He had invaluable first-hand experience in the introduction and mass production of advanced processes.","Later, he was invited by Zhang Rujin to join Zhongxin as Senior Vice President. During his time at Zhongxin, he relied on his outstanding abilities to personally build two wafer production lines, and was also responsible for the operation and technical research and development of multiple important factory areas. He was one of Zhongxin's founding heroes.","About three years ago, due to ideological differences on company operations and management with founder Zhang Rujin, he eventually chose to resign.","Liu Yutong also specially hired a headhunter to conduct a comprehensive investigation on him. This heavyweight was currently in the Magic City and had already resumed contact with Huahong.","If nothing unexpected happened, he would soon take over as the CEO of Huahong.","Huahong was also having a hard time right now. It seemed that due to problems with their capital chain, the 12-inch project they were working on had fallen into a semi-stalled state. Qiu Ciyun was highly likely going there to put out fires.","From Liu Yutong's perspective, he didn't need to put out fires at all. Huahong's biggest problem at present was a shortage of funds; attracting investment was the top priority. It would be hard for Qiu Ciyun to sort things out there in a short time. He might as well join Longxin, where he could truly maximize his value.","Just as she was thinking about this, her assistant Su Mansu, who had come over last night, knocked on the door and came in to report the situation.","Boss, everything is arranged.","According to your instructions, we contacted Huahong headquarters in the name of an inspection by Wanlong Capital, indicating that we have a long-term investment interest in the semiconductor manufacturing field and hoping to visit Huahong's current production lines, especially their 12-inch project. The other party has now replied and agreed, scheduling the inspection for the day after tomorrow.","Liu Yutong nodded. Don't forget to notify President Ma.","To be honest, among the many internet tycoons, only Pony Ma showed a genuine interest in semiconductor manufacturing, which surprised her a bit.","Could it be that Pony Ma sensed a crisis? Did he feel that his Penguin Empire might be impacted by the Wanlong Association, and thus came to enhance their friendship?","By the way, Boss, are we really going to invest in Huahong?","No investment, just an inspection.","Also, leak the word that we have ample funds on hand and are looking for potential semiconductor manufacturing projects in the country for strategic capital injection. Keep the tone as vague as possible, but the impact must be strong enough, Liu Yutong said.","Understood.","Su Mansu caught her drift. I'll handle it right away. I will definitely make Huahong's top management take it seriously enough, and ensure that everyone who needs to know hears the news.","Liu Yutong nodded again. The sooner, the better.","..............","Two days later, at Huahong headquarters.","When Liu Yutong and Pony Ma arrived, Huahong indeed gave them an extremely high-level reception. Not only did the current vice president personally welcome them at the door, but several deputy managers and technical directors were also all present.","Obviously, the rumor about an investor with heavy funds intending to invest had already reached the ears of these people.","After the financial crisis, in fact, not only Huahong, but other semiconductor companies were also fundamentally severely weakened, including another company also located in the Magic City, Zhongxin.","Zhongxin was also in a very difficult situation now. Coupled with external lawsuits, it was unknown whether Zhang Rujin could continue to helm Zhongxin this year.","Liu Yutong had actually considered Zhang Rujin, but the other party was deeply mired in various problems. If she poached him over at this time, it would probably bring a lot of trouble instead.","After thinking it over, Qiu Ciyun was still the most suitable.","After simple pleasantries, the group followed Huahong's top management into the factory area for a tour.","Liu Yutong was not very proficient in the semiconductor manufacturing field, so she specially had Su Mansu temporarily hire a knowledgeable expert to accompany them.","From yield data and equipment utilization rates to breakthroughs in key technical nodes, research and development investment ratios, and the status of that stagnant 12-inch production line, Liu Yutong asked detailed questions about everything.","Similarly, this also let the people at Huahong know that although this girl looked young, she was not easily fooled.","She was very astute.","Throughout the entire tour, it was almost entirely Liu Yutong asking questions. Pony Ma acted like an invisible man the whole time, hardly speaking at all, just quietly following by her side.","After touring the production line, the crowd finally arrived at the conference room.","Just as Huahong's vice president was preparing to start detailing their financing needs, a knock came at the conference room door.","A person looking like a secretary walked in and whispered a few words in his ear.","The vice president's face immediately broke into a smile as he said to Liu Yutong and Pony Ma, \"President Liu, President Ma, what a coincidence. Huahong's specially invited industry consultant, Dr. Qiu Ciyun, happens to be in the company today doing some preliminary research. I wonder if it would be convenient for the two of you to have a chat with him? Dr. Qiu is a leading authority in the industry, and his insights will definitely be of great help to your investment decisions.\"","Liu Yutong felt a sense of certainty in her heart; the fish had indeed taken the bait. She showed just the right amount of surprise on her face: \"Is it really Dr. Qiu Ciyun? It is truly our honor to meet him at your company. Of course, it's convenient.\"","A moment later, a figure walked into the conference room.","Qiu Ciyun was in his fifties, slim in build, wearing a simple dark down jacket and a pair of casual pants, along with rimless glasses. He perfectly fit the image of a technical expert in science and engineering.","\"Engineer Qiu, this is President Liu from Wanlong Investment and President Ma from Da'e, who are here to inspect the company today,\" the vice president introduced warmly.","Qiu Ciyun's gaze fell on Liu Yutong, clearly a bit surprised by how young she was. It was truly rare for someone of her age to be interested in the semiconductor industry. However, he still politely reached out his hand.","\"President Liu, a pleasure to meet you!\"","\"President Ma, a pleasure to meet you!\"","Liu Yutong stood up and shook his hand: \"Dr. Qiu, I've heard so much about you!\"","Pony Ma also stood up: \"Engineer Qiu, I've heard so much about you!\""]},{"number":622,"title":"Chapter 622: 622. Negotiation.","paragraphs":["Everyone took their seats again.","The vice president of Huahong impatiently steered the conversation toward the 12-inch project, talking at length about the broad prospects and funding needs after the project's restart, hoping Qiu Ciyun would put in a good word to persuade President Liu to invest.","In a sense, Qiu Ciyun was already considered one of their own, lacking only the formal onboarding procedures, so the vice president did not shy away from speaking in front of him.","As Qiu Ciyun listened, his brows furrowed almost imperceptibly.","When the other party finished, instead of following along to hype up the project, he spoke frankly to Liu Yutong: \"It's a good thing that President Liu is interested in semiconductor manufacturing. But investing in Huahong, especially restarting the 12-inch line, requires careful consideration. To be honest, my recent research shows that Huahong's current technological foundation and management system are still quite far from successfully operating an advanced 12-inch line. You'd have to wait at least three to five years to see any returns.\"","His words were quite blunt, even carrying a hint of sabotage.","Of course, he said this on purpose because he could tell that Liu Yutong and her team were not sincerely looking to invest, so he didn't beat around the bush.","Better to clear things up early and go home, rather than waste each other's time.","Hearing this, the faces of the Huahong executives immediately turned awkward, and they even somewhat regretted inviting him.","Who exposes someone's shortcomings like that?","After hearing this, however, Liu Yutong's eyes lit up. As expected of the man she had her eyes on—he had character.","\"Dr. Qiu's assessment is very fair, and this is also my biggest concern after my inspection. Semiconductor manufacturing is a marathon, not a short-term capital game. Without a clear and feasible technical path, a core team capable of fighting tough battles, and the determination to persist in long-term investment against all kinds of interference, even if you invest a massive amount of money, it might just go down the drain.\"","Her words unexpectedly coincided with Qiu Ciyun's views, being even sharper and more direct. It also implicitly stated her attitude: she wasn't just playing around; she was prepared for a long-term battle.","The conference room fell silent again. The expressions of the Huahong executives were no longer just awkward, but rather ugly.","Their understanding of Liu Yutong's words was different; it felt as if she was directly calling out Huahong for its chaotic management and lack of planning.","For the first time, Qiu Ciyun looked at Liu Yutong with a serious gaze.","Could he have misjudged? Was this young woman truly here to invest?","Liu Yutong said, \"Dr. Qiu, I have some questions I'd like to discuss with you privately. I wonder if it's convenient to step aside for a chat? After all, our investment decision requires the advice of a professional like you.\"","This request was perfectly reasonable.","Although the Huahong side was dissatisfied, they could not refuse, as they were still counting on Liu Yutong's investment.","Qiu Ciyun did not refuse: \"Sure.\"","...............","The two arrived at a relatively quiet small reception room within the park, with Su Mansu accompanying them to take notes.","As for why they didn't bring Pony Ma, it was because the subsequent conversation involved some confidential matters. Pony Ma would just have to suffer a bit and deal with the vice president and other Huahong executives.","The moment the door closed, the atmosphere in the room noticeably changed.","Liu Yutong didn't beat around the bush. Her commercial smile faded, replaced by earnestness.","\"Dr. Qiu, time is limited, so I'll be direct. My visit to inspect Huahong today is a facade; coming to see you is my true purpose.\"","\"I don't want you to join Huahong.\"","Qiu Ciyun's gaze suddenly sharpened. He was clearly surprised, but he didn't interrupt, just watching her quietly, waiting for her to continue.","\"I know you are currently in contact with Huahong and are very likely to take over as CEO. But I believe that's a massive quagmire, and it will be very difficult for you to pull it out quickly on your own. Most importantly, if you exhaust your time and energy there, you will only drift further away from your ultimate goal—building a truly internationally competitive, technologically independent and controllable advanced production line.\"","\"Forgive my presumption, but you should be around fifty this year, right? At this age, your energy is ultimately not what it used to be. Are you really willing to burn out your remaining passion in endless internal friction and compromises?\"","The corners of Qiu Ciyun's mouth twitched slightly, but he didn't deny it.","Liu Yutong's words had indeed struck a chord in his heart and moved him.","Whether at Huahong or previously at Zhongxin, there were truly a lot of messy problems. Often, as a manager, it was hard to focus on conquering manufacturing processes; instead, one's energy was consumed by many trivial matters.","At the end of the day, it was a lack of autonomy.","Seeing that the timing was right, Liu Yutong laid her cards on the table: \"So, I want to offer you another choice. A brand-new platform, a complete blank slate. The project is named Longxin. The goal is to build and mass-produce a 12-inch wafer fab with independent intellectual property rights within three years, catch up with world-class levels in five years, and completely surpass them in ten.\"","\"The initial investment is ten billion, and the funds are already fully in place. This is absolutely not an empty promise.\"","Qiu Ciyun was finally somewhat moved. Ten billion right off the bat—this girl's generosity was truly staggering!","\"I want to know where the funds are coming from? And how do you guarantee the sustainability of the funding?\"","\"The funds are jointly provided by my own capital firm, renowned overseas investment banks, and top domestic internet companies.\"","\"Companies like Ali, Penguin, and Baidu are all investors. They are willing to invest because they want to become Longxin's first major clients and ecological partners.\"","\"Dr. Qiu, let me just tell you the conditions I'm offering. You will serve as the CEO of Longxin Semiconductor, possessing absolute autonomy over technology and operations, an unlimited research and development budget, the authority to recruit a team globally, and a 10% equity stake in the company.\"","\"A 10% equity stake?\"","Qiu Ciyun abruptly looked up, his eyes full of disbelief.","Wait, giving him a billion for free before he had even done anything?","This... this girl was really making a grand gesture, or perhaps she was just too bold, giving off a more money than sense vibe.","You have to know that even when Zhongxin International was first established, it was very difficult for core executives to get such a high percentage of equity, including the founder, Zhang Rujin.","Besides the equity, what truly tempted him was the absolute autonomy. This meant he could build the factory and conduct R&D entirely according to his own concepts, no longer bound by capital or other people.","Why did he leave Zhongxin in the first place? Wasn't it because his ideals clashed with Zhang Rujin and some other executives?","\"In addition to your personal share, I will also set aside a 15% options pool,\" Liu Yutong added.","Revealing all her trump cards right upon meeting was actually a very foolish move. In a normal negotiation, who lays all their cards on the table at once?","But after seeing Qiu Ciyun in person and hearing his initial remarks, she felt there was no need to beat around the bush with someone of his personality.","She might as well be straightforward to the end.","Isn't there a saying? Sincerity is the ultimate weapon!","The 25% equity she was giving away in total was worth 2.5 billion in the early stages of the project, and it was solid, without any inflation. It would probably be hard to find a second boss as generous as her in the whole country, right?","Qiu Ciyun took another deep look at the young woman, who was young enough to be his own daughter. He had to admit, he was genuinely tempted.","If one overlooked the fact that she currently had \"almost nothing but money,\" her offer left Hua Hong's miles behind. It was incredibly hard to turn down.","Even so, he didn't want to agree so hastily. At the very least, he needed to learn more about the equipment and technical details.","\"President Liu, since you're looking to break into the semiconductor industry, you must have done your research. You should know that the most advanced lithography machines are currently impossible for us to buy.\"","Liu Yutong smiled.","Parting her pale pink lips, she named a company. \"I wonder, Dr. Qiu, have you ever heard of a company called Mapper?\"","At those words, Qiu Ciyun could no longer sit still. \"President Liu, you can actually get your hands on their equipment?\""]},{"number":623,"title":"Chapter 623: 623, Qiu Ciyun's Astonishment","paragraphs":["\"That company in the Netherlands developing electron-beam maskless lithography technology, President Liu, can you get equipment from them?\" Qiu Ciyun asked hurriedly.","Liu Yutong didn't hide anything: \"A few months ago, this company was wholly acquired by a fund registered in the Cayman Islands.\"","\"And the actual controller of that fund is me.\"","\"What?!\" Qiu Ciyun was completely stunned.","Although Mapper's electron-beam maskless lithography technology currently cannot match the speed of traditional optical lithography, it has unique advantages in specific process nodes and the manufacturing of advanced chips in small batches and multiple varieties. Moreover, with those patents, they could bypass ASML's patent barriers and export controls.","He never expected that someone could quietly complete the acquisition of Mapper. Even if this company had a different technological direction from ASML, it was, after all, a Western company possessing the foundational and core technologies of lithography machines.","This meant that the foundation of lithography machines, at least from zero to one, was already in their hands.","Beyond his shock, he quickly realized that this matter was definitely classified.","The West's technological blockade against the Dragon Kingdom was well known. If foreign governments found out that capital with a Dragon Kingdom background had acquired a domestic lithography company, they would inevitably try every means to find an excuse to snatch it back.","As for why use the word \"snatch,\" it was because the other party had bandit genes in their bones.","After calming his excited mood, Qiu Ciyun couldn't help but ask, \"Miss Liu, are you sure you're not joking with me?\"","\"Acquiring Mapper is just the first step.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Dr. Qiu, do you think I spent such a huge price just to acquire an alternative technological route?\"","\"In addition to acquiring Mapper, I also used Mapper as a technological and capital platform to successively complete the acquisition of some core patents and R&D teams from Qimonda and Spansion.\"","Both of these companies went bankrupt and reorganized under the impact of the financial crisis, and she took the opportunity to absorb some of their talent, patents, and other assets through the Mapper company.","Of course, this kind of thing could only be operated by an overseas entity like Mapper. If it were acquired by Dragon Kingdom capital, it would definitely fail.","Also, this was the one good thing about the financial crisis—there were more opportunities.","Qiu Ciyun gasped.","Qimonda, the once all-powerful DRAM giant, although bankrupted after the financial crisis, its storage technology, especially its legacy in stacked architectures and special storage fields, still held immense value. Spansion was also a pioneer in NOR Flash technology, possessing profound technological accumulation and numerous patents.","These two, combined with Mapper's electron-beam lithography technology, made it truly unimaginable how much talent and technology Liu Yutong had secretly taken control of.","He naturally also understood that these patents and technologies could only nominally belong to Mapper and could not be publicly linked to Dragon Kingdom capital for the time being. At least for now, they had to keep a low profile.","Thinking of this, the technical expert, who was over fifty years old, revealed a complex expression on his face.","For Liu Yutong to be willing to tell him such confidential matters showed an incredible level of trust and sincerity!","Likewise, it also demonstrated her determination to win.","\"Dr. Qiu, I need a commander-in-chief, a leader who can oversee all aspects from building the factory to mass production. In this project, you will have absolute dominance over the technological route, team building, supply chain selection, and all engineering decisions.\"","\"As for me, I will solve the funding problems for you and shield you from those boring social engagements. You just need to focus on your work, and I guarantee that no one will disturb you or our engineering team.\"","Every condition was so tempting and so sincere.","With abundant funds, a clear structure, secret weapons, a promise of complete autonomy, and the ability to let him peacefully conquer technological challenges without being bothered by other things—the more he compared, the less he wanted to join Huahong.","The gap between the two sides' preparations and vision was simply too great.","Qiu Ciyun looked at the very young girl in front of him, whose vision, courage, and strategic layout were unfathomably deep, and finally asked, \"Do you have a direction for the preliminary factory site selection?\"","\"The capital of HS Province. The policies have basically been negotiated.\" Liu Yutong told a lie; in reality, she hadn't formally finalized the specific support policies with Uncle Li yet, having only briefly discussed intentions.","After all, apart from money, she had nothing in the country. She hadn't even figured out the ideas for building the factory, so she simply had no way to negotiate further.","However, once she poached Qiu Ciyun, she could directly start the negotiations, and even begin building the factory right away.","\"Lucheng?\" Qiu Ciyun frowned. Although Lucheng was decent, whether in terms of resources or talent, it couldn't compare to Modu or those big cities in the south, right?","Actually, he leaned more towards Modu. Modu had money, talent, good policy support, and an even better geographical location.","But he forgot that there were already two companies there: Zhongxin and Huahong.","As a latecomer, Longxin would find it very difficult to fight for top-tier policy and talent preference from the two local giants, Zhongxin and Huahong.","As the capital of HS Province, if Lucheng could gain the full support of the provincial level, pooling the strength of an entire province to create a benchmark project, it might not be a bad choice.","Although the starting point was a bit lower, precisely because it was lower, the willingness and strength of the support might be beyond imagination.","It was like comparing a family with many children to a family with an only child; the attention and resources an only child received were often the most abundant and concentrated.","In the end, Qiu Ciyun did not directly reject Liu Yutong's choice. After all, she was his new boss, and he had to give her at least that much face, right?","He could also tell that this new boss was most likely from HS Province.","\"If we can truly get strong support from the province, it's not impossible. However, we need to get a detailed framework agreement regarding specific land, environmental assessments, supporting supply chains, and talent introduction policies as soon as possible. This relates to the pacing of factory planning, budget preparation, and team recruitment.\"","\"That's a given.\"","Liu Yutong smiled. She could hear that the other party had already accepted the invitation, otherwise, he wouldn't have asked such specific questions.","\"As soon as we sign the contract, we can immediately go for inspections and negotiations. I can set up meetings with the people there at any time. Besides that, the relevant technical data and core personnel lists for Mapper, Qimonda, and Spansion can be handed over to you at any time as well.\"","Qiu Ciyun took a deep breath and finally extended his hand: \"President Liu, happy to be working with you. I hope we can become the leading enterprise in the Dragon Kingdom's semiconductor industry.\"","\"We definitely will!\" Liu Yutong also reached out her hand.","At this moment, the Longxin project officially got on track."]},{"number":624,"title":"Chapter 624: 624. The Person Is Gone And the Investment Is Lost Too","paragraphs":["About an hour later.","Liu Yutong and Qiu Ciyun walked one after the other, returning to the conference room at Huahong's headquarters.","The Vice President of Huahong and several senior executives immediately stopped their idle chat with Pony Ma, all eyes turning toward the two of them.","\"Dr. Qiu, President Liu, how did the talk go?\" the VP of Huahong asked impatiently.","The other executives also looked on eagerly; at this moment, Qiu Ciyun was their lifesaver, and they prayed nothing would go wrong.","Looking at the eager eyes of the Huahong crowd, Qiu Ciyun pushed up his glasses and announced his decision.","\"President Zhang, President Li, Engineer Wang, since everyone is here, there is something I need to clarify with you all.\"","The VP of Huahong felt a surge of joy, thinking Qiu Ciyun was about to officially announce he was joining them and would put in a good word for Huahong to help secure the investment. He was just about to rally everyone for a warm round of applause.","But halfway through his motion, Qiu Ciyun's next words struck like a bolt from the blue, completely dumbfounding him.","\"After careful consideration and a comprehensive evaluation of various factors, I have decided not to join Huahong EC. I apologize for keeping you all waiting, and I am grateful for Huahong's sincere invitations over this period.\"","\"...\"","The conference room instantly fell into a dead silence.","The VP of Huahong stood with his mouth agape, his arm frozen in mid-air, ready for a handshake. He looked as if he hadn't heard Qiu Ciyun clearly, or perhaps couldn't believe what he had just heard.","Beside him, a technical director dropped the document concerning the technical difficulties of the 12-inch wafer line, which hit the floor with a smack.","What was going on?","Wasn't it already agreed that Dr. Qiu would join Huahong and lead them in solving their current production line issues?","Why the sudden change of heart?","After a brief silence, the VP of Huahong couldn't help but ask, \"Dr. Qiu, what did you just say? You're not joining? Was our hospitality lacking in some way? Or are you dissatisfied with the compensation? All of this is negotiable!\"","He simply could not accept this sudden, devastating news!","Just an hour ago, Qiu Ciyun was still earnestly conducting research and discussing technical issues with them. How could he suddenly change his mind after a brief private chat with this President Liu?","Could it be that President Liu had said something?","At this thought, he shot a fierce glare at Liu Yutong, his eyes filled with suspicion, questioning, and even a hint of imperceptible anger.","Yet Liu Yutong wore a smile on her face, standing quietly a half-step behind Qiu Ciyun, as if none of this had anything to do with her.","Pony Ma also walked over to Liu Yutong and asked in a low voice, \"President Liu, what's the situation? Don't tell me you poached him right out from under them?\"","He knew Liu Yutong was working on a microchip project; after all, he and several other internet moguls had thrown in some money as a friendly gesture, even if it wasn't much.","But knowing she was working on this project, it was easy to guess that Dr. Qiu had likely been intercepted by her mid-way.","He had chatted with the Huahong executives earlier and generally understood that this Dr. Qiu was indeed a rare technical leader, a titan in the industry.","Poaching such a key figure right inside another company's headquarters was, truthfully, a bit underhanded.","Liu Yutong whispered back, \"If President Ma knows, why ask? How about it, want to add some investment? Others might not, but I think you should. At the very least, I'll consider not suing you for copying my Weibo Farm.\"","Pony Ma: \"...\"","Was this a threat? Was this a threat?","Did she not know the illustrious reputation of their Goose Corporation's legal department? Was the Nanshan Pizza Hut moniker just for show?","If Liu Yutong knew what he was thinking, she would probably retort: My Tianyi Law Firm isn't just for show either, and it's far more ruthless than yours.","While the two were whispering, Qiu Ciyun shook his head and explained the reason for his choice.","\"This has nothing to do with compensation. President Zhang, Huahong is a company with history and accumulation, and everyone here works very hard. However, I personally believe that given Huahong's current situation and future development path, my absence won't have any impact. Furthermore, this conflicts somewhat with my own technical ideals and plans for my next career stage.","I want to go to a brand new platform to build and realize some of my ideas with my own hands. Thank you once again for your profound kindness, and I sincerely hope Huahong finds a more suitable candidate in the future.\"","His words were very clear, leaving no room for negotiation.","The VP of Huahong's face turned somewhat ugly, and a sudden sense of frustration surged within him, feeling as though he had suffered a double loss.","How long had it been?","The prospective CEO they had worked so hard to invite had just flown the coop.","He looked at Liu Yutong again. If she hadn't been a woman, he probably would have started cursing her out right then and there.","Wait, so you went through all the trouble of coming for an inspection just to mess with us?","It's one thing not to invest, but to come and poach someone right in front of so many executives? Where were her manners?","Liu Yutong simply stated her stance frankly: \"President Zhang, I am very sorry. After our conversation with Dr. Qiu just now and an urgent internal evaluation by our team, we believe that the risks of making a large-scale strategic investment in Huahong at this stage deviate somewhat from our investment strategy. Therefore, I'm afraid we will need to temporarily shelve our investment intentions. Thank you for your company's warm reception and detailed explanations.\"","The investment was completely dead!","A double blow!","The VP of Huahong felt his vision go dark. His hand trembled as he pointed at Liu Yutong: \"You... you... you are too much...\"","Before he could finish his sentence.","Liu Yutong suddenly changed her tune: \"Our Wanlong Capital will not be investing, but President Ma and I can personally invest two hundred million first.\"","Pony Ma: \"???\"","When did I ever agree to invest in Huahong?","Stop making decisions for other people!","What he didn't know was that Liu Yutong was actually handing him free money. Although Huahong was currently in difficulty, it would absolutely not collapse. With state-level support and backing, once they weathered this storm, their value would rebound in the coming years, and reaching a market capitalization of over a hundred billion should not be an issue.","Of course, that was pretty much the limit for this company, still a far cry from those microchip giants that started in the trillions.","In short, investing in this company definitely wouldn't result in a loss; rather, it would be highly profitable.","Most importantly, she considered this money as mental compensation for poaching their talent.","Naturally, investing two hundred million just to poach one person seemed a bit of a waste; she was also eyeing those engineers greedily.","Hearing the latter half of her sentence, the VP of Huahong's pointing index finger instantly turned into a thumbs-up as he burst into laughter: \"Good! Great eye! President Liu really has a great eye! I knew President Liu was no ordinary person. A personal investment shows that you highly favor us!\"","\"We must thank President Liu for your trust!\"","Two hundred million was not a small amount; at the very least, it could alleviate their current pressure.","Pony Ma: What about me? What about me? Why isn't anyone thanking me?","Liu Yutong smiled and said, \"You are too polite, Mr. Zhang. The one hundred million will be transferred to your account within three days. I will have my assistant, Su Mansu, coordinate the specific details with your company. I hope these funds will help Huahong develop better and move toward going public together.\"","Huahong's Vice President replied, \"Definitely, definitely. Thank you for your investment, President Liu.\"","After exchanging a few more pleasantries, Liu Yutong took her leave along with Pony Ma and his entourage.","Qiu Ciyun did not leave with them. As an advisor to Huahong, he still had matters to discuss with the people there.","When Pony Ma and Liu Yutong got into the car, he could not help but say, \"President Liu, giving a slap and then offering a piece of candy, all while making them praise how sweet the candy is—your tactics are truly brilliant.\"","Liu Yutong turned her head to look at him. \"Mr. Ma, doing business is all about making money through harmony. If you poach someone's foundation, you have to patch the hole you left behind. Otherwise, how can you survive in this industry? Besides, Huahong's core is still intact. Exchanging one hundred million for some shares and a favor is not a bad deal.\"","Pony Ma nodded thoughtfully, his gaze toward Liu Yutong deepening.","This woman had a sharp eye and was ruthless, yet she acted with a perfect sense of proportion. She was truly destined for greatness.","But as he thought about it, something felt wrong.","Wait? What one hundred million? If you put up one hundred million, does that not mean I have to put up one hundred million too?","That is going too far!","However, when he thought about how their QQ Farm over at Big Goose was almost ready to launch, he swallowed the words that had reached the tip of his tongue.","He would just consider it paying some copyright fees. Otherwise, if he got sued by this woman again, the losses would far outweigh the gains.","Most importantly, he felt that with a boss like her, Longxin truly had a promising future."]},{"number":625,"title":"Chapter 625: 625, So it's you, Cheng Yaojin","paragraphs":["After silently cursing Miss Liu in his heart, Pony Ma finally spoke.","\"President Liu, you've successfully secured Dr. Qiu, the crucial pillar. I assume the Dragon Chip project is officially setting sail now? Can you give me, an early investor, a little insight into the specific plans? You can't really let my ten million... oh wait, now I might have to add another hundred million for Huahong... go down the drain, right?\"","\"Honestly, in all my life, this is the first time I've been fleeced like this.\"","Liu Yutong smiled faintly. \"Rest assured, President Ma, that hundred million you invested in Huahong won't be a loss. Just consider it a diversified investment; not putting all your eggs in one basket should also give you a sense of security. As for Dragon Chip, with Dr. Qiu joining us, we've merely solved the problem of who will lead the effort. What comes next is the real tough battle.\"","\"The initial ten billion in funding is basically in place. Policy negotiations over in Lucheng will start within a week, and the main provincial leaders have already expressed preliminary support. With financial and policy backing, hardware issues like land, infrastructure, and supporting facilities won't be major problems.\"","\"It seems President Liu has a well-thought-out plan.\"","Pony Ma sighed, \"In that case, should I consider diverting a bit of that hundred million meant for Huahong over to Dragon Chip? After all, there's a difference between those close to us and outsiders.\"","Liu Yutong continued to smile, \"Speaking of which, President Ma, seeing as you are so actively supporting the Dragon Chip enterprise and even making additional investments, I've decided to return the favor and give you a gift.\"","Pony Ma was taken aback. \"A gift? What kind of gift?\"","He certainly didn't think Liu Yutong would suddenly give him anything good; he just hoped it wasn't a shovel meant to dig a hole for him.","Liu Yutong said, \"I heard your company's gaming division has recently been in contact with a small North American game developer called Riot, looking to invest in or even acquire a MOBA game they are developing, right?\"","Pony Ma's heart skipped a beat, and his expression changed slightly.","This was one of Goose Games' highly confidential overseas expansion projects. The contact and negotiations had been conducted in secret. How did this woman know?","\"President Liu is very well-informed. There is indeed such an intention. Why, is President Liu interested in games too?\"","\"I wouldn't call it an interest.\"","Liu Yutong waved her hand and said, \"However, my overseas investment team happened to see the potential of this project, so they also got involved and drove up the price a bit.\"","\"I just thought about it, and gaming isn't my main business after all. Plus, since you've been so supportive of my Dragon Chip, to show my gratitude, I've decided to have my people withdraw from the bidding for Riot Games. I wonder if President Ma is satisfied with this gift?\"","Pony Ma's face instantly darkened.","No wonder!","No wonder the negotiations with Riot hadn't been going smoothly, and no wonder the other party was holding so firmly to their price. They had been negotiating from last year to this year without closing the deal. It turned out it was because of an interloper like you causing trouble!","\"Liu! Yu! Tong! So you've been the one playing tricks behind the scenes all along? I was wondering why it was so hard to negotiate. It turns out your people have been driving up the price and tripping me up this whole time!\"","Liu Yutong looked innocent. \"President Ma, you can't say that. Business competition is all about relying on one's own abilities. I only participated after reasonably evaluating the project's value. Isn't my voluntary withdrawal a sufficient show of sincerity?\"","Pony Ma snorted in anger, but as he calmed down and thought about it, Liu Yutong's voluntary withdrawal cleared the biggest obstacle to his acquisition of Riot, and she truly hadn't brought up any additional conditions.","Although this gift came with a bit of frustration, it was undeniably a substantial one.","Their company was determined to win Riot and the 'League' project; it was crucial for Goose's gaming empire strategy.","\"You... you really are... sigh, I concede to you, President Liu. This isn't giving a gift; this is beating someone up first and then giving them a piece of candy, and making me have to thank you for the candy.\"","\"You flatter me, President Ma.\"","Liu Yutong smiled radiantly. \"So, shall we turn the page on the Riot Games matter? Let's talk about the advertising for the recommendation spots your QQ is giving our Weibo... can you give us a discount? ...How much? ...A huge discount... bah, just give a good discount...\"","After just a few minutes of chatting, Pony Ma couldn't help but mutter to himself, \"Strange, it's the middle of winter, why am I sweating so much?\"",".............","Magic City, inside a certain government conference room.","An internal meeting regarding the focus of high-tech industry investment promotion for the second half of the year had just concluded.","The city's top administrative leader and the administrative leaders of several major districts did not disperse immediately; instead, they continued to chat about the investment promotion situations of their respective districts this year.","After getting a general understanding of the situation, the top leader casually mentioned a piece of news he had recently heard.","\"I've heard some rumors that a new project has been circulating in the circles recently, something called Dragon Chip. They say they're going to pour ten billion into chip manufacturing. Do any of you know about this?\"","The leader of the Eastern District, sitting on the left, was taken aback when he heard it was a chip project and quickly asked, \"Ten billion? That's no small endeavor, leader. Where is this capital coming from? Is the background clear?\"","The two major chip manufacturing enterprises currently in Magic City, Zhongxin and Huahong, were both located in his Eastern District. This was his core industrial signature and an important foundation for his political achievements.","Now, a Dragon Chip project with a potentially even larger investment had suddenly popped up right under his nose, and he was completely unaware of it?","But no matter what, he had to fight for this project with all his might; he absolutely could not let the benefits flow to outsiders.","There are benefits to industrial concentration, right? It definitely wasn't because of political achievements.","The top leader put down his teacup and shook his head. \"I've only heard a bit of a rumor myself. The specific situation is still unclear, but it's being talked about so vividly, it shouldn't be fake, right?\"","There was a brief silence in the conference room as the district leaders exchanged glances, each with their own thoughts.","Just then, the leader in charge of the Southern District, sitting diagonally opposite Li Weiguo, coughed lightly.","\"Well, hearing the leader say this, I actually recall something too. A couple of days ago, when comrades from our district's investment promotion bureau were following up on a foreign investment project, they seemed to vaguely hear something from the other party mentioning this Dragon Chip. It is said that the lead is a very young female investor surnamed Liu. She recently snatched Dr. Qiu Ciyun right out from under Huahong.\"","\"Qiu Ciyun? I know this person. When Zhongxin was founded, he was one of its founding members. Later he left Zhongxin. Huahong submitted a report to us a while ago, hoping the district would assist in bringing him in. How did someone snatch him away?\" the Eastern District leader asked.","\"That's why this project is not simple at all. I had my colleagues at the investment promotion bureau look into it from the sidelines. Although this Dragon Chip project hasn't officially landed yet, it has already completed its first round of fundraising, a solid ten billion, which is more capital than your district's Zhongxin raised initially,\" the Southern District leader said meaningfully.","\"Really ten billion?\"","\"Is it really cold, hard cash?\" The head of the East District could no longer sit still.","The head of the South District nodded. \"The investors include several domestic internet giants, a few top-tier private equity firms, and foreign funds. Leading the charge is a local investment firm named Pearl Capital.\""]},{"number":626,"title":"Chapter 626: 626, Competing for the Project.","paragraphs":["The conference room fell silent for a few seconds.","\"Holy crap! What did I miss!\"","\"I can't believe I'm only just now hearing about such a massive investment.\"","A chip manufacturing project starting at ten billion yuan is a major investment that any city in the country would fight tooth and nail for. Even in a top-tier city like Magic City, a project of this scale is enough to command the undivided attention of the key leaders.","\"Where is the project landing now?\" the East District leader asked hurriedly.","The South District leader shot back, \"Why? Are you trying to poach it? I've already sent people to make contact.\"","The East District leader raised an eyebrow and spoke with righteous indignation, \"Who's poaching? District Head Zhou, you can't put it like that. Attracting investment is a matter of fair competition, relying on the strength and sincerity of each respective district. How can you call that poaching? Our East District has a mature chip industry ecosystem. If Dragon Chip comes here, it will be an alliance of giants, the icing on the cake, and the absolute best choice for the project's development! How is this poaching? This is being responsible for the project and thinking of the investors!\"","The South District leader chuckled, \"Don't get worked up, District Head Li. I didn't say we couldn't compete. However, shouldn't there be a sense of first come, first served? Our comrades in the South District have already taken the first step in making contact and have gathered more information. As far as we know, President Liu prefers an environment that can give the project the maximum amount of autonomy and room for development. Our newly planned high-tech park in the South District is a blank slate with flexible policies and few restrictions, perfectly allowing for a tailor-made setup. Unlike your East District, where Zhongxin and Huahong have been entrenched for years with deep-rooted and tangled relationships. If a new giant enters, whether it will lead to synergistic development or just end up being hindered is hard to say.\"","\"Hey, watch what you're saying!\"","The East District leader was getting a bit heated. \"Our East District's business environment is the universally recognized benchmark for the whole city! The policies of the Lingang New Area are a national-level innovation highland. We treat all enterprises equally, and our service efficiency is universally praised! All this talk of tangled relationships and hindrances is pure nonsense! District Head Zhou, you can't just tarnish our reputation out of thin air just to snatch a project!\"","Seeing the two of them going tit for tat, the smell of gunpowder grew stronger; they were on the verge of a physical fight.","District Head Wang, who was in charge of the West District, coughed and interjected, \"Gentlemen, gentlemen, calm down. If you ask me, what is the core competitiveness of the chip industry, especially for a high-end project like Dragon Chip? It's talent! It's continuous and innovative research and development capabilities! On this point, our West District has the most confidence. Not to mention anything else, the quantity and quality of our universities and national-level research institutes, as well as the number of microelectronics graduates we produce every year, rank first in the city and are among the best in the country!\"","\"If Dragon Chip settles in the West District, we can fully promote the establishment of a Dragon Chip West District University Integrated Circuit Joint Research Institute, achieving targeted talent cultivation and highly efficient local transformation of scientific research results. If they want policies, we will give them policies; if they want land, we will give them the best plots. We can even specially plan an exclusive science and education integration park that combines cuttingedge R&D, pilot verification, and high-end talent cultivation. This is the best choice based on a long-term perspective to build a century-old technological foundation for Dragon Chip!\"","\"District Head Wang makes a good point, but I don't think it's enough!\"","District Head Zhao, in charge of the North District, decisively joined the fray to grab the project. \"But chip manufacturing is not just about design and R&D; it ultimately comes down to actual production. Precision equipment, special materials, high-standard factories, and infrastructure—our North District has more advantages in these hard conditions. Our high-end equipment manufacturing park and advanced materials industrial park can absolutely provide Dragon Chip with the most reliable supply chain support, reducing logistics and time costs. Our industrial workforce is also ready-made and of excellent quality. Aren't these tangible supports more important than plans on paper?\"","The conference room instantly turned into an investment promotion site. The district leaders talked over one another, each revealing their trump cards in hopes of securing this tens-of-billions project.","\"Our East District has the most obvious comprehensive advantages!\"","\"Our South District can provide the largest policy space!\"","\"Our West District's talent and scientific research heritage are irreplaceable!\"","\"Our North District's industrial supporting facilities and hardware foundation are the most solid!\"","\".........\"","The Top Leader watched his capable subordinates arguing until they were red in the face. At first, he felt this was a manifestation of everyone's enthusiasm for work, but as he listened, it started to feel off.","If this continued, they might actually start throwing punches.","\"Alright! Everyone quiet down!\" The Top Leader slammed his palm on the table.","The arguing came to an abrupt halt. The district leaders all looked at The Top Leader, waiting for him to make a decision.","The Top Leader looked at the crowd with a helpless yet amused expression on his face. \"Look at you all, acting like fighting cocks. The project isn't even finalized yet, and our own people are about to fight? What would people say if word got out?\"","He paused for a moment and continued, \"This Dragon Chip project, whether real or fake, and whether the scale is truly tens of billions, since the rumors have spread and it doesn't sound completely unfounded, our Magic City must attach great importance to it and take the initiative. It's meaningless to argue over which district is better here. What is the most critical issue right now? It's that we haven't even met President Liu. We don't even know her true thoughts and specific needs. Maybe she has no intention of settling in Magic City at all. No matter how many advantages and policies you talk about, won't it just be wishful thinking in the end?\"","These words made sense, and the district leaders gradually calmed down upon hearing them.","He was right!","They hadn't even said where they wanted to land yet; wasn't it a bit too early to fight over it?","The Top Leader continued, \"The most urgent task is to establish contact with the other party, understand the situation, and express our sincerity. I don't care which of your districts has made contact before. From now on, the city will coordinate uniformly to avoid multiple contacts and inconsistent statements, which would leave a bad impression.\"","He looked at the secretary who had been sitting to the side taking careful notes. \"Xiao Chen, follow up on this matter personally. Verify the basic situation of the Dragon Chip project and President Liu as soon as possible. Also, in the name of the Municipal Government General Office, formally issue an invitation to Ms. Liu Yutong, inviting her to visit and inspect Magic City. I can personally step forward to meet and negotiate with her.\"","\"Yes, leader, I will do it immediately,\" Secretary Xiao Chen nodded and agreed at once.","The Top Leader looked at the district leaders again. \"Your districts should continue to do the necessary homework. Sort out your respective advantages and the conditions you can provide, and form a solid plan. But you are not allowed to blindly make contact in private anymore, and you are absolutely not allowed to undermine each other! When the guest is invited, we will openly and honestly display the overall strength of Magic City and the characteristics of each district, and let them choose for themselves. This is the bearing and order that an international metropolis should have!\"","Speaking of this, he knocked on the table, setting the final word and giving everyone no chance to bother him.","\"This matter is settled for now. Meeting adjourned!\"","......."]},{"number":627,"title":"Chapter 627: 627. Stopped by Street Bullies.","paragraphs":["While the Magic City government was investigating information related to the Longxin project, the name \"Longxin\" and rumors of a ten-billion-yuan investment inevitably leaked out, catching the attention of many in the industry.","An investment in the tens of billions was enough to make waves in any field, let alone in the highly scrutinized and high-barrier chip manufacturing industry.","Naturally, almost none of them were particularly optimistic about Longxin.","The reason was simple; one only needed to look at the current dilemmas facing Zhongxin and Huahong.","Technological blockades, talent shortages, equipment embargoes, massive financial losses...","This path was destined to be covered in thorns, not to mention that the boss of the Longxin project was rumored to be a girl around twenty years old.","Was this a joke!","In the lounge of a technical department at Zhongxin, a few engineers brought up Longxin during their idle chatter.","\"Have you heard? A new player seems to have popped up recently, called Longxin or something.\"","\"How could I not have? They're making quite a fuss. Opening their mouths to declare a ten-billion investment in manufacturing, they sure have a lot of nerve.\"","\"I had someone look into their background a bit, and guess what? The one spearheading it is a woman, supposedly not even twenty yet. It seems she hasn't even graduated from college, yet she dares to play around with chip manufacturing. This leap is wider than crossing the Pacific Ocean.\"","\"Not even twenty? A girl?\"","\"Are you serious? This has to be a joke!\"","\"What could a twenty-year-old girl possibly know about lithography machines? Does she understand etching processes? Or yield management? She probably can't even tell the difference between a silicon slice and a wafer!\"","The engineer's words caused his colleagues nearby to burst into laughter.","In this rigorous, seniority-based, and male-dominated hard tech industry, Liu Yutong's background and age inherently sounded like a joke. It was perfectly normal for them not to believe in her.","Of course, there were also those who felt this young woman was quite capable.","\"You can laugh at her, but she does have money. She raised ten billion for the first phase alone. Who else has the ability to do that?\"","\"That's true, she's definitely impressive in that regard.\"","\"I just don't know what those financial backers are thinking, daring to hand over so much money for a little girl to mess around with. If this money were invested in a mature enterprise with experience and a team, even if they invested it in Huahong or gave it to us to expand production, it would be better than throwing it down the drain like this.\"","\"Exactly, it's a pity about all that money.\"","\"...\"","A few days later, Liu Yutong once again traveled by car to Magic City.","After all, she had received a formal invitation from the main leaders of the Magic City government. Regardless of whether Longxin would ultimately settle in Magic City, since the other party had invited her, she needed to go in person out of reason and courtesy. It was basic etiquette.","Not long after her car entered the borders of Magic City, Lan Die, who was sitting in the passenger seat, suddenly frowned slightly and spoke up.","\"Miss, there are two cars behind us that don't seem right. They've been following us.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong tilted her head slightly and looked behind through the rearview mirror.","A white van and a black SUV were following them, keeping a steady distance.","\"Are you sure they're following us?\" Her assistant, Su Mansu, also grew alert.","\"I'm seventy to eighty percent sure. They've followed us through three intersections, and they change lanes whenever we do,\" Lan Die said.","Liu Yutong's expression remained unchanged. \"Don't be nervous. Keep driving and let's see what they want to do.\"","The car continued forward, but deliberately changed routes, arriving in a relatively remote area.","Sure enough, seeing an opportunity, the white van suddenly accelerated to overtake them, then sharply turned the steering wheel, blocking the front of the Maybach!","The car slammed on its brakes, the tires rubbing against the ground and emitting a sharp, piercing screech.","Fortunately, the driver was prepared and managed to keep control, preventing a direct collision. However, Liu Yutong and the others inside the car were still thrown forward by the inertia.","\"Miss, are you alright?\" Lan Die immediately turned her head around and asked with concern.","Liu Yutong sat up straight, her eyes instantly turning cold. \"I'm fine. Let's see what they are up to.\"","At this moment, the white van blocking their path slid open its side doors with a loud clatter.","Seven or eight people jumped out of the van. Each of them was dressed in flashy clothes, deliberately showing off the tattoos on their necks and arms. They were holding baseball bats and steel pipes in their hands, and one of them was even wielding a terrifyingly long machete.","At the same time, the black SUV behind them accelerated and caught up, blocking the Maybach's retreat.","With one car in front and one in back, the Maybach that Liu Yutong was riding in was completely boxed in.","Five people also got out of the black SUV, dressed similarly to the ones from the van. The leader was a slightly cross-eyed thug with a toothpick dangling from his mouth, giving off the illusion of being arrogant and insufferably haughty.","The cross-eyed thug first looked over the expensive Maybach in front of him, then spoke up: \"People inside the car, come down and have a chat, why don't you?\"","Lan Die was the first to get out of the car, standing protectively in front of the Maybach's door.","Seeing that a glamorous and aloof woman had stepped out, the group of thugs was visibly taken aback for a moment.","\"Are you the one in charge? Tell your boss to get out, our Brother Biao has something to discuss with your boss!\"","Lan Die's voice was icy. \"If you have something to say, say it directly to me.\"","\"Say it to you? Who do you think you are?\"","The cross-eyed thug spat disdainfully. \"We are looking for the main person. I heard it's a little chick surnamed Liu. Tell her to come out and talk.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, Liu Yutong, who was still inside the car, instantly deduced that this was not a random robbery or kidnapping. It was premeditated, and these people had likely been hired by someone who had a grudge against her, just to teach her a lesson.","A cold sneer tugged at the corners of Liu Yutong's mouth as she pushed open the car door and stepped outside.","Su Mansu followed closely behind.","Today, Liu Yutong was wearing an off-white trench coat, dressed in a rather casual style. Simply standing there by the car, the powerful aura radiating from within her instantly caused the rowdy group of thugs opposite her to quiet down significantly.","\"I am Liu Yutong. What can I do for you?\"","Seeing that their actual target was such a young, beautiful, and exceptionally elegant girl, the group of thugs couldn't help but start muttering among themselves again.","\"Damn, it really is a woman?\"","\"Nonsense! The employer already said it was a woman.\"","\"She's way too gorgeous, isn't she?\"","\"Shut up!\"","The cross-eyed Brother Biao turned back and glared at his subordinates, then turned to Liu Yutong, putting on a fierce expression. \"I wouldn't call it advice, little lady. I heard... uh, word on the street is that you're quite the troublemaker. It's one thing to jump around in other places, but coming to our territory in Magic City without paying your respects to the local bosses?\"","Liu Yutong frowned slightly. What was all this nonsense? Was this gang just here to be a joke?","Even a fool could see that they were acting on someone else's orders. To come up with such a lame excuse was truly hard to comment on.","\"I am just a legitimate businessperson. I didn't know Magic City still had such rules. Which boss do I need to send my greetings to? Why don't you tell me the procedure and how much money I need to pay, and I'll deliver it right to their door?\""]},{"number":628,"title":"Chapter 628: 628, Does It Sound Familiar","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong's serious demeanor of wanting to pay respects to the local boss and hand over protection money left Brother Biao completely speechless.","How would he know the specific procedures? What he just said was pure nonsense. They had come here on someone's orders to teach this little lady a lesson, tell her to get lost as far as possible, and preferably make her never dare to set foot in the Magic City again.","But her words completely threw him off. Could this be some kind of trap?","A lackey with dyed yellow hair nearby immediately roared viciously, Stop playing dumb! What Brother Biao means is that the Magic City doesn't welcome you! If you know what's good for you, get lost right now! Otherwise...","Otherwise what? Liu Yutong asked.","Otherwise... otherwise we'll let you taste the power of our Azure Dragon Gang! The yellow-haired lackey puffed out his chest, announcing a name that sounded quite majestic.","Azure Dragon Gang?","Liu Yutong repeated it and nodded slightly. The name sounds intimidating. I wonder if you've ever heard of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society?","The little thug instinctively shook his head. Never heard of it.","Liu Yutong smiled. Then you'll hear about it very soon.","As her voice fell, two more vans appeared behind the group of thugs and stopped. Over a dozen young men in black uniforms stepped out.","These men in black practically had I'm in the mafia written all over their faces; their aura was just too spot-on.","Seeing this, the leading Cross-eye's expression instantly changed, and he decisively shouted, Motherfucker, you dare to call for backup? Beat them up!","One hour later.","Big brothers and big sister, right this way, mind your step... Ouch, who threw this banana peel!","Cross-eye almost slipped and fell himself. He hurriedly steadied himself and turned back to give Lan Die an apologetic smile. It's nothing, it's nothing, I kicked it away for you.","Sister, it's just around the corner. Dynasty VIP Room 1 is right ahead, they're definitely inside.","Sister, do you smoke? I have some here... Oh, you don't smoke, okay, okay.","Sister, you don't need to lift a finger when we see that bastard later. It would dirty your hands. I'll deal with him for you. That son of a bitch provided fake intel and screwed over his allies... ah, no, he screwed us over, and even made us offend Miss Liu. He deserves to die a thousand times!","...","Cross-eye's complete change in attitude, looking like he couldn't wait to act like a dog for these men in black, resembled a traitor from the old days. The lackeys behind him couldn't help but lower their heads in shame.","Damn it! Following a boss like this, no wonder they suffered such a miserable defeat. He had absolutely no integrity!","An hour ago, when those men in black appeared, as the local snakes, they naturally charged forward bravely and fearlessly. But in less than two minutes, their so-called Azure Dragon Gang was beaten into a complete rout, utterly unable to fight back.","This further confirmed the underworld status of these men in black; otherwise, who could fight so fiercely?","And then, their boss knelt down at the speed of light, shamelessly giving up the mastermind, and even volunteered to take them to find the mastermind, which was how they barely escaped disaster.","However, they secretly made up their minds to ditch this boss as soon as they escaped the clutches of these men in black. It was too embarrassing!","At this moment, inside the Dynasty VIP Room 1 at the club.","Qin Ziang was singing and bragging with a group of his fair-weather friends from the supercar club.","Hahaha, the guys I found to scare that little girl had it in the bag.","Ziang, this move of yours is brilliant! You don't have to show your face. Just find some thugs to scare her, and that little out-of-town girl will definitely be scared shitless. From now on, she'll tremble just hearing the words Magic City. Let's see if she ever dares to come back.","But Ziang, I heard you ran into that Yunshan Society gang at the bar last time. Why didn't you tell us?","That was a minor thing last time. Those bastards from the Yunshan Society just rely on their numbers. I didn't need to bother Brother Yun to deal with them; I could handle it myself. I just couldn't be bothered to stoop to their level. Qin Ziang lied.","It wasn't that he didn't want to tell them, but given the situation at the time, calling them over to see his sorry state would have been even more humiliating.","A young man with dyed silver-gray hair interrupted with a grin, Exactly, what kind of scene hasn't our Young Master Qin seen? The Yunshan Society is nothing! In the Magic City, who dares to disrespect the members of our club? Especially with Brother Yun here.","Saying this, he looked at a young man sitting on the main sofa.","That young man was about twenty-eight or twenty-nine. His attire was noticeably more low-key than his companions around him. He was the member with the strongest background in this group, Lin Yeyun.","One of the top-ranking young masters in the Magic City, coming from a powerful political family compound, not just an ordinary rich kid, and also the backbone of their circle.","Ziang, you just said you taught an ignorant person a lesson? What's their background? Don't mess with someone you shouldn't.","Don't worry, Brother Yun, it's just a little out-of-town lady who doesn't know her place. I found 'proper' people to scare her a bit, just to let her know that the Magic City isn't a place where she can run wild.","Hearing this, Lin Yeyun frowned slightly, almost imperceptibly. He had a bit more sense than pure playboys like Qin Ziang, and he knew that the city had been paying close attention to certain foreign capital recently.","He didn't want to spoil Qin Ziang's fun, so he simply reminded him, Alright, just play around and leave it at that, don't make it a big deal. Things are a bit tight lately, and the higher-ups are keeping a close eye on some out-of-town investors.","I know, I know, Brother Yun, I know my limits! Qin Ziang nodded repeatedly, though he didn't take it seriously in his heart. He didn't personally go make trouble for that woman Liu Yutong, so she definitely wouldn't know who it was.","Besides, he had a pretty good impression of that Cross-eye. He chose to hire him to mess with Liu Yutong because he liked that rebellious face of his; he looked tough and seemed like he would keep his mouth shut.","At the time, Cross-eye even patted his chest and promised that as long as the money was right, he wouldn't sell out his employer even if he was beaten to death.","Just then, Qin Ziang's phone on the glass coffee table vibrated. The screen lit up, displaying Dad.","Qin Ziang made a shushing gesture to the crowd, and the people in the room immediately paused the music.","Hello, Dad? I'm discussing business with Young Master Xu and the others, a very important project!","I know, you've reminded me several times already.","Don't worry, I won't cause trouble for her.","Alright, it's good that you remember. Let me tell you, that Liu Yutong is over at the government side...","The words registered her name hadn't even been spoken before Qin Ziang impatiently interrupted.","I know, I know, so annoying! I'm with Brother Yun, what could possibly happen? Hanging up!","Just as he was about to hang up the phone.","Bang!!!","With a loud crash, the door to the VIP room was kicked open.","Listen up, people inside! Put down your weapons and surrender! The Impe... bah! The big brothers of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society are here, and you are surrounded! If you know what's good for you, hand over that bastard Qin Ziang right now!","Qin Ziang: ???","Why does this voice sound a bit familiar?"]},{"number":629,"title":"Chapter 629: 629, Be Courageous and Act, Go for It","paragraphs":["Qin Zi'ang turned his head stiffly. At the door of the private room, the guy he had hired with a hefty sum—the one who claimed he'd rather be beaten to death than betray his employer—was currently bowing and scraping next to a group of men in black.","The guy's face was covered in bruises, sporting a black eye on the right. But that wasn't the point. The point was that this guy was pointing at Qin Zi'ang with a face full of flattery, looking exactly like a traitor leading the enemy to make an arrest in a war drama.","\"Sis, bosses, it's him! It's this bastard who paid us to block Miss Liu's car and wanted us to scare her! He's guilty of the worst crimes! Everyone hates him! Please, bosses, eliminate this menace for the people!\"","\"Oh? If that's the case, then you go execute it,\" Lan Die said.","\"Okay, okay, I'll do it, I'll do it.\" Cross-eye didn't dare to bargain at all and directly called his brothers to charge forward.","The phone still connected in Qin Zi'ang's hand dropped to the floor with a clatter.","On the other end of the line, his father's anxious voice could faintly be heard.","\"Zi'ang? What was that sound just now?\"","\"Hello!\"","\"Who's yelling? Son, say something!\"","Qin Zi'ang couldn't care less anymore, because he had already been roughly dragged to the empty space in the private room, about to meet a brutal fate.","Lin Yeyun couldn't bear it any longer and shouted, \"Stop!\"","\"Friends, is there some misunderstanding? This is a private gathering, my name is Lin Yeyun...\"","\"No misunderstanding.\"","Lan Die directly interrupted his self-introduction. \"We are just here to watch a show. I advise you and your friends to sit quietly and not cause trouble. Fighting is illegal.\"","Hearing this, Cross-eye echoed, \"Right, right, right, it's illegal... Huh? What's illegal?\"","Lan Die glanced at him. \"This is none of your business. Just do what you have to do; we only want to watch the show.\"","Cross-eye nodded, half-understanding, and then prepared to tell his brothers to attack Qin Zi'ang.","Seeing that he couldn't escape, Qin Zi'ang immediately pointed at Cross-eye and cursed, \"F*ck you, Biaozi! What did you f*cking say when you took the money? You sold me out in the blink of an eye. Don't even think about surviving in Demon City anymore!\"","Cross-eye immediately retorted righteously, \"Bah! Who took your dirty money?\"","\"I was going deep behind enemy lines to gather evidence of you dealing with Miss Liu. Now the evidence is solid. I am forsaking the light for the dark! Bosses of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, please see clearly!\"","These shameless words, completely reversing black and white, almost made Qin Zi'ang vomit blood in anger.","But before he could continue cursing, Cross-eye immediately waved his hand. \"Beat him!\"","The group of thugs immediately swarmed Qin Zi'ang.","\"What do you want to do? Do you know who my dad is? Brother Yun! Brother Yun!\" Qin Zi'ang screamed in terror, begging Lin Yeyun for help.","Lin Yeyun stood up with an ashen face and fiercely smashed a cup on the floor. \"I said—stop!\"","Sure enough, with his explosive shout!","The clubs in the thugs' hands that were about to land on Qin Zi'ang stopped abruptly, and they all looked at him in unison.","\"I said my name is Lin Yeyun. My father works in the municipal government, and today is a private gathering for our club.\"","Lin Yeyun deliberately emphasized the words municipal government, his eyes fixed deadly on Lan Die. \"I don't know what trouble Qin Zi'ang caused out there, but you barging in like this and touching my brother right in front of me—aren't you disregarding me a bit too much?\"","\"If you stop now, apologize, and leave, I can pretend this never happened. Otherwise, I guarantee that you, and that Miss Liu behind you, won't be able to take a single step in Demon City. I do what I say!\"","As soon as Lin Yeyun said this, the other members of the supercar club in the private room straightened their backs, turning from frightened to arrogant.","\"Did you hear that? Brother Yun has spoken!\"","\"Why aren't you getting lost? Do you know who Brother Yun's dad is? Try touching us!\"","\"Daring to run wild in front of Brother Yun, you really don't know the meaning of death!\"","\"...\"","The thugs, including Cross-eye, also known as Brother Biaozi, were truly panicked now.","They really didn't expect that among this group of second-generation rich kids, there was actually a young master from the government compound.","Bullying ordinary people or scaring out-of-town merchants was fine. They wouldn't even be too scared to beat up a rich kid like Qin Zi'ang. But facing a government compound kid with an obvious special background like Lin Yeyun, they felt a deep, bone-chilling fear.","The ancient saying that commoners do not fight with officials wasn't just empty talk.","But when they turned around and saw the group of extremely gangster-like men in black at the door, they were equally terrified of them, and for a moment, they didn't know what to do.","Cross-eye looked at Lan Die with a miserable face. \"Sis, you see Young Master Lin has spoken... should... should we retreat first?\"","Seeing Cross-eye and his gang cower, Qin Zi'ang's courage instantly surged, and he shouted, \"Brother Yun, save me! These bastards are absolutely lawless, and there's Biaozi, this traitor! You definitely can't let them off!\"","Seeing that he had intimidated the other party, Lin Yeyun showed a hint of smugness on his face. \"What are you staring at? Are you deaf? Release my brother and get lost!\" As he spoke, he kicked the thug nearest to him.","The thug took the kick, bearing his teeth in pain, but he didn't dare to strike back, only looking at his boss in frustration.","Should they fight or not!","Cross-eye could only look at Lan Die again.","Lan Die raised her hand, making a gesture to stay calm and not be impatient.","Just as Lin Yeyun and the others thought the other side was going to yield, their arrogance grew even more. The few second-generation kids beside him also stepped forward proactively, wanting to teach Cross-eye and his lackeys a lesson to vent their anger for their brother Qin Zi'ang, and also to show off their own capabilities.","Just as a second-generation kid in a blue suit lifted his foot, preparing to kick Cross-eye...","A crisp, melodious female voice, carrying a bit of surprise, suddenly came from behind the group of men in black.","\"Oh my, it's so lively here. Why are people fighting?\"","The second-generation kid was also stunned by the voice. With his attention distracted, his raised foot didn't land in the right place. Hearing a ripping sound of fabric, he actually did a perfect split right there in front of everyone's eyes.","\"Ah!!!\"","\"My balls... got pulled! It hurts, hurts, hurts!!!\"","Everyone in the private room: \"...\"","No, seriously, why would a grown man randomly do a split? To show off how capable you are?","However, they didn't pay much attention to this ball-aching warrior. They all looked in unison at the stunning figure at the door.","\"In broad daylight—no, in the middle of the night—it's so unsightly for you to be fighting here. It sets such a bad example!\" Liu Yutong spoke again.","Seeing Liu Yutong, Lin Yeyun was stunned for a moment; this girl was incredibly beautiful. Then he guessed that this was probably the woman Qin Zi'ang wanted to deal with.","It was just that for some reason, after this woman appeared, he suddenly had a bad premonition in his heart.","\"You must be Miss Liu, right? This is none of your business. Please take your people and...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, he was interrupted by Liu Yutong.","\"Lan Die, why are you all here too? Didn't I tell you to go park the car first and then wait for me at the reserved spot?\"","Lan Die replied respectfully, \"Eldest Miss, we heard a commotion over here. It sounded like a fight had broken out. We were worried something might happen, so we came over to take a look.\"","\"Oh, so that's what's going on!\"","Liu Yutong nodded as if a sudden realization had dawned upon her. She then turned to look at everyone present. \"Then what are you all just standing around for? Hurry up and break it up! Fighting is wrong. We must stand up bravely for what is right, put an end to violence, and build a harmonious society. It is everyone's responsibility!\"","\"All of you, get in there!\""]},{"number":630,"title":"Chapter 630: 630. Thanks to the Perfect King Ai of Qi for the Great God Certification","paragraphs":["\"Everyone, get them... Ah, wait, no, go break up the fight!\"","\"Remember, break it up civilized! Stay safe!\"","Lan Die nodded. She immediately turned to the men in black and the still-dazed Brother Biao and his gang, ordering, \"Action! Remember the Eldest Miss's instructions: stop the brawl in a civilized, safe, and effective manner. Protect yourselves and the bystanders!\"","\"Understood!\" the men in black replied in unison.","Their strict discipline and absolute obedience made them look like they were about to execute some special ops mission.","Before Qin Ziang, Lin Yeyun, and the others could fully react, this group of men in black—who had previously stayed out of it and just watched coldly—seemed to instantly break free of some restraint. Their aura shifted drastically as they charged over like tigers and wolves.","\"Stop! Stop fighting!\"","\"Talk it out! Violence solves nothing!\"","\"You must calm down! Think of your families!\"","\"We are here to help you, we are here to break up the fight, please do not resist!\"","\"Win the fight, go to jail; lose the fight, go to the hospital...\"","The members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society shouted their slogans loud enough to shake the heavens, but their actions were utterly ruthless.","One man in black anxiously rushed toward the rich kid who had just kicked Brother Biao's lackey, shouting, \"Sir, calm down! Don't be impulsive!\"","After kicking the opponent, he 'slipped', let out a cry, and 'accidentally' crashed into the rich kid, sending both of them rolling to the ground. The man in black clumsily tried to get up, his elbows and knees 'unintentionally' striking the rich kid's face and body several times, making the rich kid howl in pain.","\"Sorry, sorry! The floor is too slippery, I didn't mean it.\" The man in black hastily apologized, only to 'accidentally' press down hard on the guy's most fragile ribs.","The rich kid immediately shrieked, \"Ah! Fuck! You're doing this on purpose!\"","The man in black instantly looked displeased. \"How can you curse at me? I'm breaking up the fight, don't slander me!\"","On the other side, two men in black were struggling to hold back Qin Ziang, who was trying to rush over and help.","\"Brother, calm down, don't make things worse!\" The two said while tacitly applying force inward at the same time, twisting Qin Ziang's arms behind his back into a textbook submission hold—just with a little bit too much force.","\"Pain, pain, pain! My arms are breaking! Let go! I didn't even want to fight!\" Qin Ziang's face was twisted in agony.","\"Oh, oh, sorry, we were afraid you'd get excited and hurt yourself or others, so we used a bit too much force!\" One man in black had just let go, but right as Qin Ziang was about to catch his breath, the other man in black 'lost his balance', tilted his body, and his shoulder 'coincidentally' slammed heavily into the bridge of Qin Ziang's nose.","\"Ah!!!\"","Qin Ziang let out a miserable scream, instantly getting a bloody nose, and crouched down.","Aside from Qin Ziang and his friend, the others also basically suffered the same 'heroic peacemaking'.","\"Ouch, you dare pinch me? You have a death wish!\"","\"No, no, Young Master Lin, I was afraid you'd fall, the floor is slippery!\"","Just as Cross-eye finished speaking, he was accidentally kicked by a man in black, lost his footing, and pounced right onto Lin Yeyun.","Lin Yeyun failed to dodge in time. Under the momentum, his body immediately fell backward, landing squarely on the guy who had just done the splits, torn his groin, and was currently clutching his crotch while howling.","\"Aooo!!!\" x2.","Two even more agonizing screams rang out.","For a moment, the entire private room descended into complete chaos.","After the men in black from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society enthusiastically joined in to 'break up the fight', Lin Yeyun's group was all 'taken care of' until they were black and blue. Of course, from the perspective of the peacemakers, these were all unavoidable 'accidental injuries' amid the chaos.","What was even more brilliant was that there were two men in black in the room holding small cameras, recording the scene.","Their camerawork was highly professional, always managing to 'coincidentally' capture the intense scenes of Lin Yeyun, Qin Ziang, and their group shoving, brawling, and cursing at the thugs. As for the little tricks the men in black were pulling, under the reasonable cover of the camera angles, not a single one was recorded.","The entire recorded video required almost no editing. The presented effect was roughly this: a group of arrogant rich kids and a gang of troublemaking street thugs got into a fierce physical altercation, while a group of 'passing by' 'enthusiastic citizens' braved the danger and recklessly charged into the fray to do their utmost to stop the violence. Although some physical collisions and accidental injuries inevitably occurred during the process, the 'enthusiastic citizens' always maintained restraint. Their goal was clear: to stop the brawl and protect the scene.","\"You are committing violent assault! I want to call the police! I want an injury assessment! I'm going to sue you for intentional assault!\" A rich kid who had been 'accidentally injured' into a bruised and battered state cried while angrily pointing at the man in black closest to him.","The man in black who was being 'slandered' heard this and immediately turned to the nearest camera lens. With a serious expression, he said, \"Sir, please calm down! We are fulfilling our civic duty to stop an ongoing unlawful infringement. We have a complete on-site video recording of the entire process as evidence. It was your personnel and the other party who first engaged in a conflict that escalated into a group brawl. We only intervened to stop it out of a spirit of acting courageously for a just cause when the situation threatened to deteriorate further and endanger others and public safety! If you continue to slander and defame me without any evidence, I will reserve the right to pursue your legal liability through legal channels!\"","Hearing the other party's words, the rich kid completely broke down. \"You're going to sue me? You're freaking suing me? This is too much!\"","He was clearly the one getting beaten up, yet the other party was turning around and threatening to sue him. This was completely upside down!","The man in black remained unmoved by this and continued with awe-inspiring righteousness, \"We are all law-abiding citizens. We firmly believe that the law will not only protect every law-abiding citizen but also absolutely not tolerate any illegal or criminal behavior. You must believe in the justice of the law!\"","His words were spoken with such resounding force that they directly choked the rich kid who still wanted to cry and complain. His throat clogged, he nearly couldn't catch his breath, and he almost passed out on the spot.","Damn it, is there no law and order anymore?!","Seeing this scene, Liu Yutong couldn't help but shake her head. \"Sigh, people these days just have too much of a temper. I told you that peace is the most precious thing. I told you that if you win a fight, you go to jail, and if you lose, you go to the hospital. Why won't you listen to advice? I hope when the police officers arrive, they can properly educate you all.\"","Then she changed the subject, \"Of course, as enthusiastic citizens who happened to pass by and bravely stepped up for a just cause, we will definitely explain the situation we saw truthfully to the police officers and fully cooperate with the police investigation. We will absolutely not shirk the responsibilities we should bear, and as for the issues that aren't our fault, we also believe the law will return our innocence.\"","She spoke flawlessly, completely presenting the image of a good citizen who was deeply righteous, mindful of the big picture, and cooperative with law enforcement.","Paralyzed on the ground, with a nosebleed flowing heavier than a menstrual period, Qin Ziang was utterly dumbfounded upon hearing her words, to the point where he even forgot the pain in his body.","He looked at the friends around him, and then at Lin Yeyun, whose eyes betrayed a mixture of furious disbelief and fear. He never expected that even a young man with such a formidable background would be terrified by them.","Finally, his gaze shifted back to Liu Yutong, who stood by the door looking completely calm and composed.","Just what kind of woman had he provoked?","She didn't play by the rules at all, and the people she brought with her were far from ordinary thugs.","What the hell? Who had ever seen underworld enforcers or hired muscle so well-versed in the law? And their execution was terrifyingly efficient!","This was a true eye-opener for him!"]},{"number":631,"title":"Chapter 631: 631, Accused.","paragraphs":["Lin Yeyun also felt as if his entire worldview had been turned upside down. With family members working in the judicial system, he understood the terrifying nature of their opponents far better than Qin Zi'ang did.","This wasn't just a simple beating to vent their anger. The other party was using legal methods to completely crush them, leaving almost no substantial evidence to be used against them afterward.","This was a hundred times more terrifying than sheer violence!","He even suspected that without using his family's connections and relying solely on standard procedures, it would be extremely difficult to do anything against these meticulous, law-savvy men in black.","Gritting his teeth, Lin Yeyun scrambled to his feet and spat out the bloody froth from his mouth. \"Miss Liu, I, Lin Yeyun, will remember what happened today. What goes around comes around. We will meet again!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, a look of concern appeared on Liu Yutong's face. \"Oh my, Young Master Lin, you don't look so well. Did those thugs hit you? Are you alright? Lan Die, quick, give Young Master Lin a check-up. We wouldn't want him to be left with any hidden injuries.\"","Lan Die immediately stepped forward and began to examine Lin Yeyun, pressing her fingers hard against the ribs and shoulders that had just been taken care of.","\"Hiss!\" Lin Yeyun gasped in pain, cold sweat breaking out on his forehead.","\"Does it hurt here? It might be a soft tissue contusion. What about here? Oh dear, the joint seems a bit dislocated... Young Master Lin, bear with it for a moment. I'll help set your bones, free of charge,\" Lan Die said enthusiastically.","\"N-no need!\" Lin Yeyun tried to dodge in a panic, but failed to escape.","\"Don't be polite! Since I'm doing a good deed, I might as well see it through to the end!\" Lan Die said, applying a little force with her hands.","With a loud crack, Lin Yeyun let out a miserable shriek.","\"Ah!!!\"","\"Alright, you should be fine now.\" Lan Die clapped her hands and took a step back, wearing the smile of someone who enjoyed helping others.","Lin Yeyun felt that the previously agonizing spots did seem a bit looser, but his sense of humiliation had reached its peak.","He had lost all his face today!","\"Wooo-wooo-\"","The sound of police sirens drifted up from downstairs.","Inside the private room, the enthusiastic citizens who had stepped up for justice finally stopped their actions.","Qin Zi'ang and the other second-generation heirs of the supercar club, along with the thugs, lay sprawled across the floor in a miserable state. However, upon closer inspection, most of them only had superficial wounds and joint sprains. The worst injuries were perhaps a broken nose bridge or some potential damage to the groin...","Yet, despite being in such a pathetic state, upon hearing the police sirens, Qin Zi'ang and the others couldn't help but laugh out loud through their tears, pointing at Liu Yutong and the men in black.","\"You're finished! You're dead meat!\"","\"The cops are here, none of you will get away!\"","Even though they could tell these men in black were highly professional, knew the law well, and understood how to avoid risks.","Just as Lin Yeyun had thought earlier, if no connections were used, there really might be nothing they could do against these men in black.","However, the police chief of this district was his uncle.","Soon, several uniformed police officers, led by the club manager, walked into the devastated private room.","The leader was a middle-aged officer. When he saw the injured people lying all over the floor, his brows instantly furrowed.","\"What happened here? Who called the police? Who is gathering a crowd to brawl here?\"","\"Officers, you're finally here!\"","Treating them like his saviors, Qin Zi'ang scrambled over to the middle-aged officer and pointed accusingly at Liu Yutong and the men in black. \"It's them! These people illegally trespassed into our private room and ordered those thugs... no, they joined those thugs in violently assaulting us! Look at what they did to us! Even Brother Yun was beaten by them. You have to seek justice for us!\"","Chief Lin then looked over at his nephew, Lin Yeyun. Seeing his bruised and battered face, his gaze narrowed slightly, and his expression grew even more serious.","With Lin Yeyun getting into this kind of trouble in his jurisdiction, he had to handle it properly, both for personal and professional reasons.","\"Yeyun, are you alright?\" Chief Lin asked with concern.","Lin Yeyun shook his head. \"Uncle, I'm fine, but the nature of tonight's incident is too malicious. We were just having a nice gathering here when this gang burst in and started attacking us. Especially those men in black from the Wanlong Society, I suspect they are part of a criminal syndicate. Please, Uncle, you must deal with them strictly according to the law!\"","With his nephew setting the tone, Chief Lin felt much more confident in his approach.","He looked at Liu Yutong and the group of men in black, who indeed exuded a strong underworld aura, and asked in a deep voice, \"Who are you people? What is your relationship with these men on the floor? Why did you assault them here? Please show your identification cards and cooperate with us by returning to the station for an investigation!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the police officers behind him stepped forward, ready to take them away at any moment.","A gleeful smile appeared on the faces of Qin Zi'ang and the others, as if they could already picture the pathetic sight of Liu Yutong and her group being handcuffed and taken away.","Act tough now! Let's see you act tough now!","Coming to their turf and acting so arrogantly, they were going to teach them a lesson they wouldn't forget!","Liu Yutong's expression was very calm. She even greeted Chief Lin politely: \"Hello, officer. We are employees of a legitimate company. Today's incident was a sudden brawl. We are just here in Demon City on a business trip and happened to encounter it. We stepped forward to stop it out of our civic duty. We have a live video recording of the entire incident, which can be provided to the police as evidence to prove that we were stopping an unlawful infringement. Although some unavoidable physical contact occurred during the process, we absolutely did not initiate any assault on others, let alone act as some sort of mafia.\"","She gestured to her side, and a man in black immediately handed over a video camera.","Through the playback, the entire process could be clearly seen.","Chief Lin took the camera and quickly scanned through the footage with a frown.","The playback clearly showed that it was indeed Lin Yeyun and Qin Zi'ang's side who first got into a scuffle with the group of thugs, and only then did the men in black intervene to break up the fight. The entire sequence of events showed almost no flaws.","However, his intuition still told him that something was off; he just lacked the evidence.","\"Uncle Lin, don't believe them! The video must have been tampered with. They are all in this together. Hurry up and arrest this gang of mobsters!\" Qin Zi'ang said anxiously.","He had guessed the officer's identity through the conversation between Lin Yeyun and the other party. This officer was an uncle from Lin Yeyun's family, which was why he changed his form of address to make them seem closer.","Just then, a somewhat magnetic male voice suddenly came from behind the police officers.","\"Officer, before accusing my client of any suspected illegal activities, especially when it involves a serious charge with a clear legal definition like an organized crime syndicate, I believe we must first clarify the facts, review the legality and completeness of the evidence, and ensure due process. Otherwise, it is simply slander!\"","The newcomer's voice was clear and carried a specific phrasing, a tone that only someone who had worked in the legal profession for a long time would possess.","Everyone turned to look, only to see a man wearing a suit and gold-rimmed glasses standing at the door, holding a black briefcase. It was unclear when he had arrived.","He was the one who had just spoken."]},{"number":632,"title":"Chapter 632: 632, Counter-accused","paragraphs":["Before Chief Lin could even ask about the background of this sudden arrival—a man whose appearance and aura screamed 'lawyer'—the man had already taken out his ID and began to introduce himself.","\"I am Zhao Tianyi, Chief Attorney at Tianyi Law Firm. Ms. Liu Yutong is my valued client and the victim whose lawful rights and interests have been severely infringed upon in this incident.\"","\"Regarding the video evidence provided by my client's side just now, I guarantee on the professional reputation of Tianyi Law Firm and myself that the footage is the original on-site recording, without any illegal editing or tampering. We fully support and welcome the police to commission a qualified third-party forensic agency to conduct a comprehensive and public technical appraisal of the video's originality, completeness, and the facts reflected therein.\"","Immediately after, he changed the subject, pointing at Qin Zi'ang, his tone suddenly turning severe: \"At the same time, based on existing evidence and preliminary investigations, I hereby officially and solemnly represent my client, Ms. Liu Yutong, to report to your department that the man before you, Mr. Qin Zi'ang, is suspected of organized and premeditated implementation of the following serious criminal acts...","\"First, he is suspected of illegally hiring and instructing idle members of society to openly intercept other people's vehicles on public roads, using weapons, blockades, and intimidation to carry out violent threats. This act is suspected of constituting the crime of picking quarrels and provoking trouble as stipulated in Article 293 of the Criminal Law, and the circumstances are egregious. At the same time, his behavior carries obvious violence and coercion, and may also be suspected of endangering public security with dangerous methods...\"","\"Second, his hired personnel were armed with weapons...\"","\"Third, organizing multiple people... suspected of engaging in illegal and criminal activities similar to those of underworld syndicates and evil forces...\"","\"Fourth...\"","Zhao Tianyi listed several of Qin Zi'ang's illegal and criminal behaviors in one breath, each sounding more serious than the last.","\"In summary, Mr. Qin Zi'ang's behavior shows great subjective malice, dangerous methods, and an egregious nature... We now officially request and urge your department to immediately file a criminal case for investigation into the above-mentioned serious illegal and criminal acts suspected by Qin Zi'ang, and to take necessary coercive measures against the relevant suspects in accordance with the law.\"","...","The private room was instantly in an uproar.","Highway robbery? Violent threats? Organizing a crime syndicate... Every single one of these charges sounded like a heavy felony!","Some people could not help but mutter in their hearts: This isn't right. Obviously, this group of men in black from the Wanlong Society looks more like a crime syndicate. How did Qin Zi'ang turn into the mobster coming out of this Attorney Zhao's mouth?","Sure enough, a lawyer's mouth... no, this was simply a silver tongue that could talk the living to death and the dead back to life. It was terrifying.","The color drained from Qin Zi'ang's face in an instant, leaving it as pale as paper.","He had hired Brother Biao to block Liu Yutong's car and scare her, originally just wanting to vent his anger. But he never imagined the other party would directly pin such serious charges on him. If these were proven true, it wouldn't be as simple as paying compensation and apologizing. He would really have to pack his bags for a long stay behind bars, and the sentence wouldn't be short.","\"You... you're making baseless accusations! Nonsense!\"","\"I just... I just found someone to warn her a bit, I didn't want to do anything at all, just to scare her. I didn't even want to touch a hair on her head! Uncle Lin, this is a false accusation, they are trying to ruin my life!\"","His eager defense was equivalent to personally admitting the facts of the other party's accusations.","This was exactly what Zhao Tianyi was waiting for. He let out an \"Oh,\" and said, \"Did everyone hear that? He admitted he did it.\"","Qin Zi'ang finally realized he had misspoken and hurriedly shook his head. \"No... I didn't mean that... I just wanted her to stop being so arrogant...\"","Just then, Lin Yeyun, who couldn't stand watching any longer, stepped forward.","\"Uncle, aren't we missing the point? Shouldn't responding to this call be about handling the fact that my friends and I were beaten up by this group of people?\"","\"Look at my face, then look at my friends, and then at the other party's people. It's obvious at a glance who the real victims are.\"","Chief Lin's face turned stern upon hearing this. He nodded and immediately assumed an official, strictly-business posture, though he was clearly leaning toward his nephew, Lin Yeyun.","\"Alright, stop arguing!\"","\"Attorney Zhao, your report and accusations have been recorded by the police. But right now, the situation at the scene is complicated, there are many people involved, the evidence is not yet clear, and there are major contradictions in the statements of both parties. All personnel involved in the brawl, including Miss Liu and your company's people, must return to the station with us for further investigation.\"","Zhao Tianyi knew as soon as he heard this that they were probably trying to smooth things over. He was just about to argue further.","Chief Lin saw his intention and said in a tough tone, \"You are a lawyer, you should know the nature of obstructing official duties.\"","Zhao Tianyi: \"You...\"","Liu Yutong: \"Tianyi, follow Chief Lin's arrangements. We will go and cooperate with the investigation.\"","Zhao Tianyi: \"Yes, Miss!\"","It was just that he still felt very stifled. This was obvious favoritism. But after all, this wasn't their turf, so for now, they could only endure it temporarily.","Immediately after, Liu Yutong made a move that everyone found hard to understand. She actually walked up to Chief Lin on her own initiative and held out her hands: \"Chief Lin, do I need to be handcuffed?\"","Chief Lin originally wanted to say no, but catching a glimpse of his nephew beaten to such a state in his own jurisdiction, if he, as an uncle, didn't show even a bit of a tough stance, it would be really hard to explain when he got back. Handcuffing Liu Yutong and taking her back would at least superficially vent some anger for his nephew, and procedurally it was barely justifiable.","Then he actually took out a pair of handcuffs and, with a click, cuffed Liu Yutong's wrists.","Little did he know, this would be the decision he regretted the most.","Zhao Tianyi's face instantly turned extremely ugly. He was just about to voice a warning when another hurried voice came from outside the private room door.","\"President Liu? Is Ms. Liu Yutong here?\"","As soon as the voice fell, a man wearing an executive jacket and glasses hurried into the private room.","The newcomer was none other than Secretary Chen from the General Office of the Demon City Government.","When he saw Liu Yutong surrounded by several police officers, with a pair of handcuffs on her wrists, the expression on his face instantly shifted from astonishment to anger.","\"What are you doing?!\"","Then he snapped his head to look at Chief Lin.","\"Chief Lin, please explain this to me clearly right now. What is going on here? Do you know who she is?!\"","Upon hearing Secretary Chen's words, Chief Lin's heart instantly skipped a beat.","Not good! Things were about to go south!","Secretary Chen was the closest secretary to the top leader of the municipal government. His attitude often represented the attitude of the top leader. For him to personally come looking for Liu Yutong at this moment, he must be acting on the leader's orders.","Sure enough, Secretary Chen's next words made Chief Lin's heart sink straight down.","\"Then let me tell you, President Liu, Ms. Liu Yutong, is a VIP personally invited by the leadership to inspect Demon City!\"","\"You all sure have some nerve! To think you actually handcuffed CEO Liu on his very first day inspecting Mo City! I'd love to see how you're going to explain this to the higher-ups!\"","........."]},{"number":633,"title":"Chapter 633: 633. Knowing When to Advance or Retreat: The Complete Downfall of Qin Zi'ang.","paragraphs":["\"Secretary... Secretary Chen... this is all a misunderstanding!\" Chief Lin's previously strictly business demeanor vanished without a trace in an instant.","If he had obtained any substantial evidence of crimes committed by Liu Yutong and her people, he might still have been able to defend himself. But the reality was that he had nothing in his hands. Instead, the other party possessed evidence of his nephew's group fighting with the thugs, as well as the criminal facts of that Qin Ziang.","Under such circumstances, he had actually put handcuffs on her, especially when she was an esteemed guest specifically requested by the top leader. Now, he definitely wouldn't be able to escape a harsh punishment.","However, he wasn't a complete fool. He hurriedly pulled the keys from his pocket. Perhaps due to nervousness, it took him several tries before he finally unlocked the handcuffs on Liu Yutong's wrists.","\"President Liu, it's a misunderstanding! I was just following procedure...\"","As soon as the handcuffs were off, Liu Yutong gently rolled her wrists. Before she could even speak, Secretary Chen angrily rebuked him.","\"Following procedure? Chief Lin, your officers responded to a dispute and handcuffed a distinguished guest invited by the leader without distinguishing right from wrong. Is this what you call procedure? The leader is still waiting to meet President Liu. How do you expect me to report this now? Should I say that the person has already been detained by you and put in restraints?\"","\"I wouldn't dare! Secretary Chen, I absolutely wouldn't dare!\" A patch of the police uniform on Chief Lin's back was already soaked with cold sweat.","\"My working methods were too simple and crude, and my investigation was not thorough enough. I will reflect on my mistakes! I offer my sincere apologies to President Liu!\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Chief Lin, there is no need for this. Cooperating with police investigations is the duty of every citizen.\"","\"My personal grievance is but a trivial matter. I also believe that once Chief Lin gains a deeper understanding of the situation, you will naturally return justice to me.\"","As soon as she said this, not only was Chief Lin stunned, but even Secretary Chen beside them felt slightly surprised.","This President Liu, despite her young age, handled matters with a great sense of propriety.","Not bad at all!","In fact, even if she had made some slightly excessive demands at this moment, Secretary Chen probably wouldn't have refused, but that would have made people feel she was being unforgiving despite being in the right. To put it bluntly, some matters could only be handled internally. If an outsider made too many demands, it would instead provoke dissatisfaction from higher-ups.","She didn't dwell on it, which was very good.","Hearing her words, Chief Lin breathed a sigh of relief. Although he would still inevitably face punishment, having the victim's forgiveness was a good thing for him; at the very least, he would receive a lighter penalty.","Just as he was about to express his stance and say something more.","\"However...\"","Liu Yutong's tone took a turn. \"Secretary Chen, I came to the Magic City this time at the gracious invitation of the leader, originally harboring great sincerity to inspect the investment environment and cooperation prospects here. Yet, right after arriving in the Magic City, I encountered a planned and organized violent interception and threat on the road...\"","She truly did not intend to continue pursuing Chief Lin; giving him a little warning earlier was enough. She believed a formal self-criticism was unavoidable for him. Although a self-criticism might seem harmless, anyone with ambition knew that a single blemish could cause their political career to suffer setbacks, or even stagnate until retirement.","That was why she decisively gave up pursuing the matter and appeared magnanimous. This would not only win the leader's favor but also give Chief Lin a way out. Although it might not have much practical use, it was still better than making an enemy who hated her.","Chief Lin's matter was considered over, but the other matters were not.","Qin Ziang and Cross-eye along with that group of thugs wouldn't be able to escape. Since they dared to do it, they had to be prepared to pay the price. The criminal law would tell them what price they had to pay.","After listening to Liu Yutong's account and reviewing the evidence and witness statements she provided, Secretary Chen's recently softened expression darkened once again, even darker than when he saw the previous scene.","Because the nature of this incident was much more severe.","Chief Lin's issue, at its absolute worst, was a procedural violation, but this was an actual crime. On a larger scale, with such a security environment, who would dare come to the Magic City to invest in the future?","\"Lawless! Simply lawless!\"","\"Chief Lin, how do you do your jobs? The evidence is sufficient, and the facts are clear. Detain all the individuals involved immediately, especially the primary suspects! Furthermore, you must interrogate them overnight and deal with them strictly and swiftly according to the law! I will report this matter directly to the leader to give President Liu, as well as society, a clear and transparent explanation!\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","Chief Lin did not dare to say more or refuse. He turned around and directed his subordinate officers to formally arrest Qin Ziang and the others, including his own nephew.","Although his nephew had not participated in the incident of hiring thugs to block Liu Yutong's path, he had been involved in the group brawl and still needed to be taken back and locked up for a few days. Of course, there was a high probability he would be bailed out the same day, but at least it showed the proper attitude.","As for Qin Ziang and Cross-eye's group of thugs, it was a different story. They were going to spend actual years in prison.","Qin Ziang, the rich second-generation heir nicknamed the Emperor of the Magic City, was now completely ruined. After Secretary Chen walked in, he had a premonition that this time, even if his father stepped in, he probably wouldn't be able to save him.","In the end, he was practically crying and begging for mercy, but no one paid him any attention. He was handcuffed and taken away directly.","Once everything was handled, Secretary Chen asked, \"President Liu, are you satisfied with this resolution?\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"Secretary Chen, you flatter me. I acknowledge and appreciate the determination and efficiency of the Magic City authorities in handling this matter.\"","A heavy stone finally dropped from Secretary Chen's heart, and his appraisal of Liu Yutong rose to an even higher level.","This young female CEO not only had a deep background and acted decisively, but more importantly, she knew when to advance and retreat, and understood the bounds of propriety. If such a person entered politics, her achievements would certainly not be low.","\"President Liu, you are too polite. This is what we ought to do,\" Secretary Chen said. \"The leader has set aside time. Shall we head over to the municipal government building now?\"","\"Alright, then I will have to trouble Secretary Chen,\" Liu Yutong said.","She turned to Zhao Tianyi and gave a few instructions in a low voice. Zhao Tianyi immediately understood and began arranging the subsequent legal follow-ups and evidence preservation matters.","The group left the clubhouse.","Liu Yutong rode in the official car driven by Secretary Chen, while Zhao Tianyi and Lan Die took other cars.","After arriving at the destination, Secretary Chen led her to the leader's small conference room.","Not long after Liu Yutong sat down, the leader arrived.","The two sides exchanged pleasantries for a moment, took their respective seats, and a secretary served clear tea.","This meeting leaned more towards a private nature, mostly for mutual understanding. The leader would not discuss specific conditions; the specific cooperation details would be followed up by the investment promotion office later, which would be the formal negotiation.","The meeting lasted for about thirty minutes, and both parties happily concluded their conversation."]},{"number":634,"title":"Chapter 634: 634. Anxious Uncle Li.","paragraphs":["Over the next few days, Liu Yutong and her team members, including top lawyer Zhao Tianyi and Qiu Ciyun, officially began investment negotiations with Magic City.","Although she personally leaned toward investing and building the factory in Lucheng, if Magic City offered excellent terms, she wouldn't rule out reconsidering.","After all, the microchip industry required long-term investment. It would be highly unwise for her to rely solely on her own cash flow. If she could secure low-interest bank loans, she would definitely prioritize them. Government subsidies, tax exemptions, and tax reductions—as long as they were legal and compliant, she would try to get as much as possible.","It would be foolish to turn down free benefits.","The Dragon Chip project held immense appeal for any region. Beyond the GDP generated by the project itself, the GDP created by driving the upstream and downstream integrated circuit industry scale was immeasurable.","For instance, in her previous life, after Zhongxin survived those few difficult years, the subsequent industrial scale GDP it drove exceeded 200 billion, and that wasn't even counting the increased employment opportunities.","After several rounds of negotiations over a few days.","Ultimately, the terms offered by Magic City included ten years of rent-free land and a tax policy of three years exempt, five years halved—meaning corporate income tax would be exempted for the first three years and halved for the following five. In addition, there were corresponding local rewards and rebates for value-added tax and personal income tax, along with a comprehensive welfare package that included quotas for talent introduction, employee housing guarantees, and children's schooling.","Beyond this, Magic City proactively offered an additional 1.2 billion in financial support through local state-owned capital investment for equity. This was genuine financial backing, signifying a deep tie-up between the two parties.","Overall, these terms exceeded Liu Yutong's initial expectations. The efficiency, boldness, and mobilizable resources Magic City demonstrated were truly beyond compare for an ordinary city. The cash equity investment also effectively shared a portion of her investment risk and financial pressure.","However, compared to the super gift packages Huahong and Zhongxin received when they established themselves back in the day, there was still a gap.","This was perfectly normal. At the end of the day, in the eyes of Magic City's leaders, Liu Yutong was merely an outsider crossing over into the semiconductor field. Even though she had poached a technical heavyweight like Qiu Ciyun, her standing still fell short compared to those industry titans who had been deeply rooted in the semiconductor sector for years, making her project riskier.","If this project failed, it could end up as a complete mess.","Moreover, Magic City already possessed two leading chip enterprises; adding another was merely icing on the cake.","Of course, this didn't mean Magic City didn't want the Dragon Chip investment project. Without comparing it to those two companies, the terms Magic City offered were already excellent by outside standards.","Liu Yutong figured that even the maximum terms Uncle Li could offer would roughly equal this. Factoring in the talent pool, the completeness of industrial facilities, and local financial strength, Magic City undoubtedly held an overwhelming advantage.","Having reached a preliminary agreement with Magic City, Liu Yutong had just returned to her hotel when she noticed a massive pile of text messages on her phone.","She hadn't noticed them because her phone had been on mute during the negotiations.","When she opened them, she found they were all from that girl, Li Xiaohui.","Sister Yutong! Sister Yutong! Are you there?","Call me back when you see this, Sister Yutong!","Urgent! Emergency!","Something huge happened, my dad is going crazy!","My dad, my biological father, the Old Man Li who came during the school anniversary, do you remember?","He's got blisters all over his mouth these past few days. Really, I'm not lying. I saw it with my own eyes when I went home last night. It's too horrible to look at, like he's got two little sausages hanging there.","And the reason is you, Sister Yutong!","Didn't you tell my dad you were going to invest in some project in Lucheng? How come you turned around and hooked up with Magic City?","The news has already leaked. Magic City is planning to heavily introduce a third ten-billion-level chip project. When my dad and his colleagues saw the news during their meeting, they completely lost it.","They haven't been able to reach you, and combined with that gossip news, my dad said you're clearly about to get your marriage certificate and host a wedding banquet with a third party.","My dad instantly turned into Sister Xianglin, sighing at everyone he meets: Alas, we did so much prep work, prepared the materials so thoroughly, and offered policies with the utmost sincerity. But before we even got into the specifics, how could she just change her mind? Didn't we agree she would talk to us first? How did Sweetie turn into Madam Niu in the blink of an eye?...","Pfft! Sorry, I shouldn't laugh, but my dad's resentful tone... I really couldn't hold it in, hahahaha!","But seriously, Sister Yutong, if you don't give a clear answer soon, my dad and his team will probably buy standing tickets and rush over overnight to corner you at your Magic City hotel!","The way he looks at me now isn't even right anymore. During dinner yesterday, he asked me faintly: Xiaohui, aren't you and Liu Yutong good sisters? You even shared a dorm in college. How come you can't even pass a message to her now? Did your feelings fade? Or did Liu Yutong fire you from the Wanlong Association?","I'm so wronged! More wronged than Dou E! It's you who isn't answering my calls, my dear sister!","Call me back ASAP when you see this. Even a hint is fine, I'll reject my dad for you. Otherwise, my dad is really going to charge over. I heard he was slamming the table during his meeting today, saying that even if they have to tie Chairwoman Liu up, they must bring her back to listen to our terms first!","Roar roar roar! Urgent urgent urgent! Emergency!",".........","Looking at this seemingly endless stream of texts, Liu Yutong was utterly speechless. Was this girl treating text messages like future WeChat voice notes?","However, she could also sense from Li Xiaohui's messages just how anxious Uncle Li's side was.","Lucheng and Magic City were simply not on the same level in terms of scale. Magic City's GDP was worth at least eight or nine Luchengs, nearly double that of the entire province.","Under normal circumstances, they definitely couldn't compete with Magic City.","But a microchip project was far too tempting. Once such a high-tech project was established, it would bring in so much more than just investment numbers on paper.","An advanced wafer fab acted like a powerful magnet, naturally attracting upstream and downstream enterprises to gather around it. From semiconductor materials and key equipment to chip design, packaging, testing, and even the final application terminal enterprises, it would ultimately spawn an integrated circuit industry ecosystem in the surrounding area.","The associated investment it would drive, the indirect employment it would create, and the GDP growth would be several times, even over ten times, the investment of the project itself—just like what Zhongxin achieved later in her memory.","Therefore, it was completely normal for Uncle Li to be burning with anxiety upon hearing the bad news of her negotiating with Magic City.","Watching a major industrial project that was originally likely to land in his city—a project capable of altering the city's industrial landscape—about to be snatched away by a wealthier mistress, no one could bear it!","Of course, Uncle Li himself definitely couldn't swallow his pride to contact her constantly, but he could certainly have Li Xiaohui relay the message and harass her!","Liu Yutong thought about how the usually serious Uncle Li might actually have blisters on his lips from anxiety, and she couldn't help but laugh. She then dialed Li Xiaohui's number.","It barely rang once before it was answered in a second, and Li Xiaohui's loud and dramatic voice came through.","Hello! Sister Yutong, my dearest sister, you finally returned my call! If you didn't show up soon, I might have been kicked out of the house by my dad. The charge: diplomatic failure and losing contact with my best friend!","Aren't you exaggerating a bit? I've been a little busy with negotiations here, but I called you back as soon as I had a free moment.","I don't care, let's get down to business, serious business! My dad asked me to solemnly and anxiously convey the deep calling and sincere greetings of the people of HS Province and Lucheng to the great Chairwoman Liu Yutong. He also has some soul-searching questions for Chairwoman Liu: What happened to your hometown sentiment? What happened to giving us priority? How did you get blinded by the winds of the Pujiang River? The water of our Lake C isn't bad either, and isn't Lucheng's old goose soup delicious?","Liu Yutong was amused by her words and laughed, Xiaohui, I'm sure those weren't your dad's exact words.","Oh, as long as you get the gist of it!","But seriously, Sister Yutong, my dad and his team are for real this time. They are going crazy with anxiety. After he found out you went to the Magic City, they held overnight meetings. I heard they almost wore out the policy documents flipping through them, trying to figure out what they can and cannot offer, and pondering how to give you the best deal. They're just waiting for you to come back and negotiate.","Speaking of this, Li Xiaohui sighed with emotion on the other end of the line, My dad is still working so hard at his age, I need to take him as a role model. I've decided, I'm going to open my gaming club over by my dad's place in the future to help boost his GDP!","Liu Yutong asked with a smile, Do you mean you're going to play video games right in front of your dad?","As soon as she said this, the other end of the line went quiet for a few seconds.","Then... then never mind, I think Pearl City is much better!","Liu Yutong stopped joking and said seriously, Here's the plan. Tell Uncle Li that we have finished our preliminary talks here in the Magic City. Tomorrow, I will personally lead my team back to Lucheng for official inspections and negotiations.","Li Xiaohui shouted excitedly, Great, great, great! I'll go tell my dad right now! Hahaha! This should finally clear up the blisters on Old Man Li's lips!","........."]},{"number":635,"title":"Chapter 635: 635, A Home Prepared for Loongson.","paragraphs":["The next day at noon.","Liu Yutong's motorcade, carrying the Longxin team, drove into the territory of Lucheng, the provincial capital of HS Province.","Compared to an international metropolis like the Magic City, this city's atmosphere seemed much more modest. Qiu Ciyun sat beside Liu Yutong, flipping through the industrial infrastructure materials sent in advance by Lucheng, and frowned slightly.","\"Director Liu, from the perspective of pure technical support and the existing industrial chain, the gap between Lucheng and the Magic City is not just a little bit. The traditional advantageous industries here are auto parts, building materials, and some agricultural product processing. There are very few high-tech enterprises, semiconductor-related industries are almost zero, and talent reserves must be built from scratch. Are we really going to consider building a factory here?\"","For Liu Yutong to advance the Longxin project, she naturally couldn't bypass this newly recruited capable general. Qiu Ciyun's opinion was still very important to her, as he possessed rich experience in setting up factories.","Since Qiu Ciyun said Lucheng was unsuitable, any other boss might have just politely declined and stopped considering this place.","But Liu Yutong was different. HS Province was the base camp of the Wanlong Society, and in her heart, she still hoped the project could be established in her hometown.","She thought for a moment and said, \"Let's see the situation first. After all, the leaders have kindly invited us, so it's hard to refuse. Let's hear what conditions they offer.\"","Hearing her say this, Qiu Ciyun could only nod. \"Alright, let's take a look first. However, I personally hold reservations about this. The number of cities in the country that can meet our requirements for talent, industrial chains, and capital intensity can be counted on one hand. I'm afraid it will be difficult for Lucheng to come up with a truly competitive proposal.\"","In his heart, he had pretty much decided the nature of this trip to Lucheng: it was just a formality of social etiquette, and in the end, they would still return to the Magic City to continue negotiations.","The motorcade had just arrived at the highway toll station.","Su Mansu, the executive assistant sitting in the passenger seat, immediately reported, \"Director Liu, look ahead. Those seem to be provincial vehicles.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong and Qiu Ciyun both looked forward.","They saw a neat motorcade parked imposingly by the side of the road outside the Lucheng toll station exit.","The grand display made even the Longxin team members, who were used to seeing big scenes, feel a jolt in their hearts.","Leading the way were three police motorcycles with flashing lights, followed by another three, making a total of six motorcycles responsible for escorting the front and rear. In addition, there were two police cars and two Coaster minibuses.","Among this motorcade was a black Audi with a white-background, black-letter license plate reading \"XX0001.\" This was the exclusive vehicle of the top leader of HS Province, symbolizing the highest authority in the entire province.","At this time, about a dozen people in dark suits or administrative jackets were standing and waiting next to the motorcade. Obviously, they were leaders and relevant staff.","HS Province was using the highest standard of etiquette to welcome the arrival of Liu Yutong and the Longxin team.","Liu Yutong had thought that Uncle Li would take this meeting seriously, but she didn't expect him to take it to this extent. Not only did he personally come to the highway exit to greet them, but this standard far exceeded the usual reception for attracting investment.","Qiu Ciyun was also stunned. He obviously hadn't expected the display to be so grand and solemn. Even when Zhongxin was established in the Magic City back then, they had never enjoyed such a high-level treatment.","For a moment, he felt an indescribable emotion in his heart.","Liu Yutong took a soft breath and said, \"Get ready to get out of the car.\"","Their motorcade had just driven out of the toll station and, guided by the duty officers, stopped next to the other motorcade.","Just as Liu Yutong pushed the car door open, before her feet even touched the ground, she saw the door of the \"XX0001\" Audi open at the same time.","A middle-aged man wearing an administrative jacket and exuding an elegant aura stepped out of the car. It was Li Xiaohui's father.","With an enthusiastic smile on his face, he strode toward Liu Yutong and reached out both hands.","\"Yutong, you've had a hard journey!\"","\"We've finally been able to welcome you and the Longxin experts!\"","Liu Yutong was also a bit overwhelmed. \"Uncle Li, why did you come personally? This is too grand. How can we be worthy of this!\"","\"You are worthy, absolutely worthy!\" Uncle Li let go of her hands, his smile undiminished, and looked at Zhao Tianyi, Qiu Ciyun, and the others who were getting out of the cars behind Liu Yutong.","\"The Longxin project concerns the national strategy, the future of the industry, and also the transformation and development of our HS Province. On behalf of the HS Provincial Party Committee, the Provincial Government, and the people of the whole province, I welcome Chairman Liu Yutong and all the experts of the Longxin team to visit Lucheng for inspection and guidance!\"","His words were powerful and equally very sincere!","Qiu Ciyun stood behind and to the side of Liu Yutong, looking at this high-ranking provincial official in front of him, and his heart also wavered a bit. If the conditions were right, it seemed it wasn't impossible to consider Lucheng.","Just for this sincerity, it was worth considering.","Liu Yutong then introduced Qiu Ciyun to Uncle Li. \"Uncle Li, this is the head of our Longxin project, Qiu Ciyun, President Qiu.\"","Uncle Li had obviously done his homework and knew this person's weight in the semiconductor industry. He gave him another enthusiastic handshake. \"Welcome, welcome! I've admired you for a long time! With President Qiu joining Longxin, it is truly like adding wings to a tiger.\"","If he previously had a trace of worry in his heart about whether Liu Yutong, a young junior, could really pull off a high-difficulty project like Longxin, then after seeing with his own eyes that Liu Yutong could actually recruit an industry-recognized practical master like Qiu Ciyun under her command, that last trace of worry vanished into thin air in an instant.","This girl not only had courage, but her vision and methods were even more impressive! This greatly increased his confidence in the future of the Longxin project.","Qiu Ciyun quickly replied modestly, \"You flatter me, sir.\"","Uncle Li then shook hands and exchanged pleasantries with the other members of the Wanlong Society one by one, and then invited Liu Yutong, \"Yutong, get in my car. I'll take you to see something.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Alright!\"","After getting into the car with the 001 license plate.","Uncle Li joked, \"Yutong, I'm afraid this car isn't as comfortable to sit in as yours. I'm sorry to wrong you.\"","Liu Yutong: \"Uncle Li, I actually feel that sitting in your car is steadier and more reassuring.\"","Uncle Li: \"Hahaha... You girl, you really know how to talk!\"","After the motorcade left in an orderly manner.","Liu Yutong looked at the formation of the police motorcycle escort outside the window and said again, \"Uncle Li, your welcoming display today really startled me. It's a bit too much of a fuss.\"","Uncle Li smiled. \"I don't think this is making a fuss. I just want to show my greatest sincerity.\"","\"Little Yutong, right now it's just the two of us, both family. I won't beat around the bush with you. I am determined to get the Longxin project! I know you just came from the Magic City. The conditions there are good, the foundation is thick, and every aspect is very strong. It's completely incomparable to our Lucheng. I still have this self-awareness.\"","\"However, we have one thing that the Magic City might not be able to give, and that is the unreserved, do-or-die determination, and the sincerity to exhaust the strength of the entire province to escort and protect this project for you!\"","\"If our hardware is lacking, we will make up for it with our utmost sincerity and the best policies. If there is no supply chain, we will build one from scratch around Longxin. If we are short on talent, we will search the entire province, the whole country, and even the globe to help you find it. Our city of Lucheng has good universities too, such as Longke University and the University of Technology. I will personally coordinate with these schools to train more professionals in the relevant fields.\"","\"Of course, everything I just said—what is that phrase you young people use nowadays... right, 'making empty promises'! It is all still a bit abstract.\"","\"But today, I don't intend to just feed you empty words. I am going to take you somewhere right now.\"","Liu Yutong asked curiously, \"Where to?\"","Uncle Li chuckled. \"To the home we have prepared for Longxin!\""]},{"number":636,"title":"Chapter 636: 636. Happy Cooperation","paragraphs":["The convoy did not drive directly into the city center; instead, it followed a somewhat dilapidated concrete road toward a newly emerging development zone in the east of the city.","After about twenty minutes of a bumpy ride, the convoy came to a halt at the edge of an incredibly vast and empty expanse of land.","The land before them appeared to be at least two to three thousand mu in size. It had clearly been pre-treated, as the ground was perfectly level.","Uncle Li was the first to step out of the car, followed closely by Liu Yutong and the rest of the Longxin team.","\"Yutong, President Qiu, and all the experts,\"","Uncle Li stood at the edge of the field, looking like a general directing his troops. He swept his arm across the vast expanse of land before them. \"This is the core starting area for the planned Lucheng Future Sci-Tech City, and it is also the first welcoming gift we have prepared for the Longxin project!\"","A few officials, who appeared to be heads of the land planning department, immediately directed their staff to unroll a massive regional planning map.","Pointing at the blueprint, Uncle Li said, \"This area covers a total of 3,200 mu. The original plan was to divide it into three phases over five to eight years, gradually bringing in a batch of high-tech enterprises and R&D institutions to build Lucheng's innovation park.\"","\"Upon learning that the Longxin project was about to launch, our Provincial Party Committee, Provincial Government, and Lucheng Municipal Government held an emergency joint meeting overnight. We made a major decision to suspend all previous planning and investment attraction for this area. These 3,200 mu of land will be comprehensively planned, reserved, and packaged together, to be provided entirely, free of charge, and permanently to the Longxin project as the construction site for your headquarters, R&D center, and first wafer fabrication plant!\"","\"Free of charge? And permanent?\" Qiu Ciyun couldn't help but exclaim, finding it somewhat unbelievable.","As an industry insider, he knew all too well the value of industrial land of this scale and location. Even the conditions offered by Modu were merely ten years of rent-free use. Yet here, it was being offered permanently and for free. This was simply too generous—or rather, so overwhelmingly generous that it felt unreal.","\"Yes, free of charge, and permanent.\" Uncle Li looked at Qiu Ciyun and nodded affirmatively.","\"Not only that, but all the costs for the preliminary infrastructure connections and land leveling, as well as the ultra-high-specification foundation treatment tailored to the special requirements of a semiconductor factory, will be entirely borne by the provincial and municipal finances. Longxin won't have to pay a single cent. We are not giving you a raw plot of land to struggle with yourselves; we are giving you a fully prepared plot finished to the highest standards. You can take it and immediately start construction according to your design blueprints.\"","\"Beneath this land, we have already buried the dual-circuit high-voltage cable channels, ultra-pure water supply mains, reserved interfaces for special gas pipelines, and an independent industrial wastewater pipe network needed for a future wafer plant... All infrastructure has been planned and constructed in advance according to the standards of world-class wafer plants. What we want is for Longxin to be able to build the factory at the fastest speed and with the lowest initial cost as soon as you arrive.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong was completely shocked. She had absolutely no idea that Uncle Li had quietly pulled off such a massive undertaking.","This place definitely hadn't been modified just in the last few days; construction must have started a long time ago. Uncle Li had just kept it a secret from her, presumably to give her a surprise.","After the school anniversary, she had indeed had a deep conversation with Uncle Li about Longxin's plans. Uncle Li had probably started taking it to heart right then. He might not have anticipated that Modu would suddenly swoop in halfway to hijack the deal, which prompted him to reveal this trump card early.","Having figured this out, Liu Yutong felt somewhat moved, and with a hint of shame, she said, \"Uncle Li, why didn't you tell me earlier? What if we...\"","\"There are no 'what ifs'!\" Li Weimin interrupted her.","\"Yutong, I understand what you mean, but for our HS Province and our Lucheng to achieve technological iteration and industrial upgrading, we must have the courage to burn our boats, dare to take a gamble, and dare to go all in!\"","\"Bringing in Longxin and developing the integrated circuit industry is our strategy to overtake on a different track and win the initiative for development in the coming decades. This is a battle we must fight, and we must win!\"","\"I believe that in the future, this place will absolutely not just be a single Longxin factory. It will become a complete industrial ecosystem centered around Longxin, attracting countless upstream and downstream enterprises in chip design, semiconductor materials, precision equipment, packaging and testing, and terminal applications. It will become the heart of our HS Province's new generation of information technology industry!\"","Shocking! It was nothing short of deeply shocking!","Qiu Ciyun's original mindset of just going through the motions and humoring them was completely shattered by this high-ranking official's thunderous determination and massive generosity.","He had to admit that this was his first time seeing a leader with such audacity, such decisiveness, and such a willingness to invest almost regardless of the cost.","Just as the man had said, this was no longer a negotiation; it was a strategic, all-in gamble!","Although it was a bit crazy, it worked very well on him.","\"Let's go, get in the cars! We're off to see the second grand gift!\"","With a wave of his large hand, Uncle Li didn't give everyone much time to digest the information before leading the way to the next stop.","As before, Liu Yutong rode in Uncle Li's Audi, while Qiu Ciyun and another municipal leader got into Liu Yutong's Maybach.","Not long after getting into the car,","Liu Yutong received a text message from Qiu Ciyun.","\"Director Liu, are the leaders over here all this crazy?\"","Looking at the screen, Liu Yutong couldn't help but smile. She thought for a moment and typed out a reply.","\"Do you know how Longke University ended up settling in Lucheng back then? I suppose it's an old tradition.\"","As one of the country's top science and engineering universities, Longke University had been invited over by the leaders of HS Province with the same level of passion and determination.","To what extent did this passion go?","To give a simple example, during the winter, the entire HS Province had no centralized heating, not even the offices of the provincial leaders. However, Longke University did.","And it was one of the very few places in the relatively southern regions to have centralized heating.","Hence, it was an old tradition.","Uncle Li's actions today could be said to be a continuation of the audacity and sincerity shown back then to bring in Longke University.","They might be a bit poorer compared to others, but when it came to sincerity, who could match them?","About ten minutes after this text was sent, just as they were nearing their destination, Qiu Ciyun finally replied.","\"What a great place!\"","Although he hadn't made any formal declaration, Liu Yutong could already tell from these few words that Qiu Ciyun was truly swayed.","For their second stop, they arrived at Longke University. The main purpose was to introduce a new talent cultivation and experimental platform spearheaded by the province, in collaboration with top provincial universities like Longke University and the Institute of Technology.","The third stop was a freight railway hub in the suburbs and a planned bonded logistics park.","The fourth stop involved viewing the architectural sand models for an international school and a high-end talent apartment community, for which the land acquisition had already been completed and construction was about to begin.","After seeing all of this along the way, the scales in the hearts of the Longxin team—especially Qiu Ciyun, who had initially harbored doubts—had begun to tilt irreversibly.","How was this merely a local government trying to attract investment?","They were practically treating them like royalty!","From land, infrastructure, research and development, talent, and logistics to the support system for living facilities, everything far exceeded their expectations.","After running around all day, their tight schedule meant everyone had to settle for boxed lunches at noon.","When evening came, Uncle Li played the host, inviting everyone to dine at Yuyuefang. This surprised Liu Yutong once again; she had not expected Uncle Li to choose the newly opened restaurant under her company's umbrella.","Inside the private dining room.","Once everyone was seated, Uncle Li did not waste time on pleasantries. He simply had his secretary place a document, bearing the red letterheads of the Provincial Party Committee and the Provincial Government, right in front of Liu Yutong.","\"This is the support package our HS Provincial Party Committee and Government have finalized for Longxin after multiple research meetings. This is not a draft; it is an official document that has already been approved. Every clause inside bears the official seal of the provincial authorities, representing the collective will and commitment of the province's highest decision-making body.\"","Liu Yutong carefully read through the terms before passing the document over to Qiu Ciyun.","After reading it, Qiu Ciyun was profoundly moved, even a little visibly excited. Upon finishing the final point, he looked up and nodded at Liu Yutong, having completely tossed the conditions offered by the Magic City out of his mind.","Seeing this, Liu Yutong felt a wave of reassurance settle in her heart. She stood up and extended her hand: \"Here is to a successful partnership, Uncle Li!\"","Uncle Li burst into hearty laughter: \"To a successful partnership!!!\"","After the dinner concluded, Liu Yutong could not help but pull Uncle Li aside to ask him a private question.","\"Uncle Li, did you offer such incredible terms as a special favor to me because of my relationship with Little Hui? After all, you might not even see Longxin rise to prominence during your term in office, which means you might not get to claim this as your political achievement.\"","Hearing this, Uncle Li merely chuckled and replied with a simple phrase: \"Success does not have to be mine.\""]},{"number":637,"title":"Chapter 637: 637, The Third Annual Meeting, [Thanks to Shadow Fragment Mosaic for the Great God Certification]","paragraphs":["Just how generous were the terms Liu Yutong negotiated with Lucheng?","Three thousand two hundred mu of prime industrial land was provided for permanent use, completely free of charge. In contrast, Mocheng's offer was ten years rent-free, after which huge land use fees would still have to be paid. In the long run, this single condition saved Longxin an astronomical amount of money.","In terms of taxation, Lucheng offered an eight-year full exemption followed by an eight-year half reduction. This meant that Longxin would enjoy an extremely low actual tax burden for a full sixteen years. Compared to Mocheng's policy of three years free and five years halved, the support period was nearly doubled.","Regarding financial support, Lucheng's local state-owned assets committed to a direct investment of two billion, whereas Mocheng only promised 1.2 billion. The difference was obvious.","Longxin was given the autonomy to certify the talents it brought in. For the local retention portion of their personal income tax, they would receive a full exemption for the first five years and a half reduction for the next five years as a reward. Additionally, a provincial special fund for breakthroughs in the integrated circuit industry was established. The provincial finance department would directly allocate two hundred million every year for ten consecutive years to specifically support Longxin's key technology research, development, and industrialization.","It should be noted that Lucheng's total fiscal revenue in 2008 was only thirty billion, which was hardly enough to go around. Education, healthcare, infrastructure, and public welfare all required funding. Being able to squeeze out this money from such a limited budget showed immense sincerity.","No wonder Qiu Ciyun, who had previously been pessimistic about Lucheng, was tempted. To a certain extent, these benefits could compensate for the lack of talent in the local industry chain.","On the third day after the inspection ended, the Longxin project swiftly signed an agreement with Lucheng. It even made it onto the local satellite TV news, and the evening Imperial Capital News dedicated nearly a minute to reporting on it.","The total investment of the project reached a staggering twelve billion.","The lineup of investors was luxurious. Pearl Capital led the investment with 3 billion, followed by Yunshan Capital with 1 billion, Wanlong Capital with 1 billion, HS Province State-owned Assets with 2 billion, Qixing Capital with 1.5 billion, AEG with 1.5 billion, Deutsche Bank with 500 million, AEG Overseas with 500 million, Goldman Sachs with 600 million, and Morgan with 400 million.","Ji Zhe and Chu Hai really had some tricks up their sleeves. They quietly secured four foreign investors.","In addition, Internet companies such as Ali, Baidu, NetEase, and Xinliang each invested 100 million. In reality, this money was invested by the bosses of these companies in their personal names, but it was publicly announced under their companies' names.","However, the specific investment amounts and other details were deliberately concealed. The outside world only temporarily knew that several top Internet companies had appeared among Longxin's investors, and the initial investment scale exceeded 12 billion.","In short, from the moment Longxin officially signed with the local government, its momentum was massive.","For the next period of time, Liu Yutong was incredibly busy coordinating various affairs for Longxin, such as the introduction of second-hand equipment and using headhunters to poach talent.","The salaries offered for talent were generally very high, about double the market rate. After all, many people instinctively felt some resistance upon hearing that the workplace was in Lucheng, as most people nowadays still yearned for big cities.","Nevertheless, lured by the high salaries and excellent benefits, they still managed to poach quite a few capable talents.","Qiu Ciyun also recommended a few names to her, especially asking her to focus on Liang Mengsong from Taiji Electronics.","Qiu Ciyun had also worked at Taiji Electronics in his early years and had some interactions with Liang Mengsong. Liang Mengsong currently seemed dissatisfied with his promotion prospects and intended to leave Taiji Electronics, making it very possible to poach him. However, he was bound by a non-compete agreement, which would make the operation rather troublesome.","But Liu Yutong said it didn't matter. If they wanted to file a lawsuit, they could come and do it. If they lost, the person stays; if they won, the person still stays.","These words left Qiu Ciyun dumbfounded, completely failing to understand what she meant.","In mid-January, construction on the Longxin base officially began, and the founding team had basically all arrived.","Aside from the talent poached by headhunters, a portion was brought over by Qiu Ciyun. Given his current status in the industry, there were quite a few engineers willing to follow him.","This was also why Liu Yutong had set her sights on him in the first place. Once this kind of person was poached, they could not only carry the banner but also pull together their own small team, saving a lot of worry.","Liu Yutong distributed one million in cash bonuses to the founding team on the spot. It was a purely personal reward regardless of rank, averaging about thirty thousand per person.","After pretty much settling the matters here, Liu Yutong returned to Pearl City, as the annual company meeting was about to begin.","This time, the annual meeting was not held in a hotel because there were simply too many employees. The total number of employees in the Wanlonghui Group exceeded fifty thousand.","That's right, over fifty thousand people.","This included full-time delivery riders. If the riders were excluded, there were about ten thousand people. Even after excluding employees from out of town who couldn't easily make it, the local employees in Pearl City alone still exceeded five thousand.","Currently, no hotel banquet hall in Pearl City could accommodate so many people. Therefore, they simply chose to hold it outdoors on a vacant lot at the Wanlonghui headquarters construction site. They purchased the ingredients themselves and hired several hotel chefs to cook on-site.","On the day of the Preliminary Eve, the weather was clear.","On a flattened piece of land at the Wanlonghui headquarters under construction, a temporary open-air venue was set up. The venue was surrounded by a massive steel framework forming a complete windbreak tent, with thousands of chairs arranged neatly in the center.","Several eye-catching banners hung on both sides of the venue, including the two that core members knew by heart.","Whoever betrays Wanlonghui shall suffer three knife wounds and six holes.","Be cautious, meticulous, bold, and law-abiding; unite knowledge and action.","As the new CEO of Longxin, Qiu Ciyun also attended the Wanlonghui annual meeting. Actually, he didn't have to come. Strictly speaking, Longxin did not belong to the Wanlonghui system. He came this time mainly because he was invited by the boss and had to show some respect.","As the only project injected with state-owned assets, Longxin was naturally unsuitable to be placed under the Wanlonghui Group. Moreover, Longxin was not a company controlled by the Wanlonghui Group, although Liu Yutong's personal authority in Longxin was unquestionable.","When Qiu Ciyun arrived at the Wanlonghui headquarters construction site, even though he was mentally prepared, he was still shocked by the sight before him.","There were so many people, seemingly even more than at the company he had previously worked for.","There must be at least several thousand, right?","The crowd was clearly divided into two categories. More than half were employees wearing various uniforms, while the smaller half was somewhat intimidating. They were dressed entirely in black, with silver dragon-shaped badges embroidered on their chests. It was very striking and made them look very much like underworld gangsters.","This couldn't help but remind him of the gang members he had seen in Taiwan Province back in the day. Gangs in Taiwan were numerous and famous, but those people at most looked like a bunch of street thugs. In contrast, the men in black before him looked like genuine underworld figures. Whether in momentum or aura, they completely outclassed those gang members from Taiwan.","Although this group of people did look a bit special, very much like mobsters, Qiu Ciyun didn't take it to heart. The mainland was different from Taiwan; there were very few gangs here. Besides, the company was named Wanlonghui, so what was wrong with employees wearing suits with dragon logos? There was no rule saying that people with dyed hair couldn't wear suits as uniforms, right?","However, when his gaze inadvertently swept across the giant promotional banners hanging from the scaffolding on both sides of the venue, he froze instantly.","The large characters on the massive red banner were glaringly conspicuous.","[Anyone who betrays the Myriad Dragon Society shall suffer the punishment of three knives and six holes.]","Qiu Ciyun: \"???\"","Wait, what on earth just got mixed in here?"]},{"number":638,"title":"Chapter 638: 638、Why Does It Feel Like I've Been Tricked [Thanks to Chī Mèi Wǎng Liǎng for the God-Level Certification]","paragraphs":["Those who betray the Wanlong Society shall suffer three knives and six holes.","Isn't this a cruel punishment used against traitors in old-era gangs?","Why would it appear at the annual meeting of a modern enterprise? Did the staff print it wrong?","But when Qiu Ciyun saw that the surrounding employees all had a look of being accustomed to it, he felt it wasn't a mistake. Otherwise, such an obvious error would have been discovered and replaced long ago.","Then he looked at another slogan.","Cautious, meticulous, bold, law-abiding, and integrating knowledge with action.","This one was very positive and professional. One could even say it captured the essence of management and execution requirements, full of positive energy.","But putting it next to the other slogan made it seem incredibly weird.","Could it be that they were supposed to learn how to hack people while escaping legal sanctions?","Qiu Ciyun truly felt his cognition splitting.","On one side was a gang rule reeking of a fierce underworld vibe, and on the other was a principle full of modern corporate management wisdom.","Wasn't this contrast a bit too jarring?","Just what kind of background did Chairman Liu's company have?","A man in black guiding the way nearby seemed to notice his strange expression. Following his gaze, the man gave an understanding smile. Everyone had a similar reaction the first time they saw the Wanlong Society's slogans. He would get used to it later.","\"President Qiu, the eldest miss and the others have arranged a seat for you in the front row. Please.\"","Qiu Ciyun followed the man in black forward in a daze, the words \"three knives and six holes\" still echoing in his mind.","He even started to involuntarily recall whether there were any special hidden clauses in the employment contract he signed with Dragon Chip. There shouldn't be, right?","Chairman Liu seemed quite normal; she wouldn't write \"three knives and six holes for job-hopping\" into it, would she?","Wait, a boss who could say something like \"if you lose the lawsuit, you stay; if you win, you also stay\" probably couldn't be described as completely normal either.","While his mind was running wild, he had already arrived at the front row area near the stage.","It was relatively spacious here. In particular, the three main tables were mostly occupied by the management of various business divisions and special guests.","At the first main table, which was also where Liu Yutong would sit later, there was currently only one person seated, a man around forty years old.","The employees of Wanlong Society, even the senior executives, were generally quite young, mostly young men and women in their twenties. At around fifty years old, Qiu Ciyun was at the father level here, in a league of his own.","The second oldest was obviously this middle-aged man who had arrived first and was sitting at the same table.","\"You must be President Qiu. I've heard a lot about you, and I didn't expect to meet you here today. It's a pleasure to meet you!\" The man speaking was Zhang Dalong, the head of Weibo and the newly initiated Shanxin project.","Everyone knew how difficult it was to make chips in the current environment. His compliments were indeed from the bottom of his heart.","\"My name is Zhang Dalong, and I'm currently in charge of Weibo.\"","Qiu Ciyun shook hands with him. \"You are too polite, President Zhang. I also use Weibo; it's quite interesting.\"","The two took their seats. After exchanging a few pleasantries, they discovered that they were the only two elderly people over forty among the thousands of people present, suddenly giving rise to a subtle sense of camaraderie.","Although one was in software and the other in semiconductor chips, they still found a lot of resonance when discussing technology trends and team management.","Qiu Ciyun gradually forgot about the slogans until he noticed the logo on Zhang Dalong's suit. He was surprised to find that this guy actually wore the same style of black suit, just that Zhang Dalong's seemed to be made of a higher-quality material.","\"President Zhang, is there any story behind your outfit? Why do I feel like these clothes look like something gangsters wear?\"","Zhang Dalong looked down at his clothes and smiled. \"President Qiu, when you get older, isn't it normal to mix with the underworld a bit?\"","Qiu Ciyun was speechless.","\"Mix... mix with the underworld? And it's normal?\"","Zhang Dalong replied, \"Didn't you know, President Qiu? Generally, some core executives have a high probability of becoming core members of the Wanlong Society. This black suit is the symbol. I heard that the eldest miss started out in the underworld back in the day. Word is she was incredibly fierce and took out a bunch of underworld bosses to build the Wanlong Society.\"","Qiu Ciyun was shocked.","Good heavens! He actually guessed right!","This Wanlong Group actually had a triad background!","Zhang Dalong added, \"Not to mention, the quality of these clothes is quite good. Do you want to get one too, President Qiu? I see you're still going strong.\"","Qiu Ciyun quickly waved his hands. \"No need, no need. My old bones can't handle the tossing and turning.\"","Zhang Dalong said, \"Well, if you don't want it, you can prepare one for your children. The quality of these clothes really is excellent. Boys look energetic in them, and girls look heroic. They aren't out of style at all! Rest assured, we have all sizes, from S to XXXL. If it really doesn't fit, it can be altered by hand.\"","Qiu Ciyun was left speechless again.","What was all this! Was he asking his whole family to join the underworld?","Prepare a gangster battle robe for his son? His son, who was currently studying for a Ph.D. at a prestigious overseas university, coming back and putting on this kind of clothing... the picture was too beautiful; he dared not imagine it.","\"There's really no need. The kids are all abroad, they won't need it, really won't need it!\"","Zhang Dalong smacked his lips in regret. \"That's a pity, but it doesn't matter. The days ahead are long. Maybe one day you'll figure it out.\"","Just as Qiu Ciyun was getting flustered by Zhang Dalong's words.","The originally bustling and noisy venue suddenly became dead silent within just two or three seconds.","A big shot was coming.","Sensing something, Qiu Ciyun looked up and involuntarily followed everyone's gaze toward the entrance.","At the entrance, a group of people walked into the venue one after another. Leading them was the chairman of the Wanlong Group, Liu Yutong.","Today, Liu Yutong was not wearing the warm-toned clothes Qiu Ciyun was familiar with. Instead, she wore a black tailored suit of the same style as the group of men in black. However, her suit was distinctly different from the others. The two sleeves were embroidered with patterns of a dragon on the left and a phoenix on the right, and the dragon-shaped emblem on her chest was a unique gold color. She wore little makeup, yet between her brows lay an undeniable, sharp aura that forbade anyone from looking directly at her. Her entire presence became incredibly powerful.","About half a step behind her followed five or six people, all core members of the Wanlong Group: Yun Cheng, Ma Da, Yu Xin, Zhao Tianyi, Li Xiaohui, and others.","As soon as Liu Yutong appeared, the thousands of employees in the audience stood up in unison.","Everyone's eyes closely followed the beautiful black silhouette walking toward the center of the stage.","This scene did not look like the entrance of a big corporate boss at all. Instead, it looked more like an underworld queen wielding absolute power and patrolling her territory, descending upon her domain with her core, sharpest right-hand men.","Just as Liu Yutong stepped onto the stage...","It was unclear who started it, but a loud, booming voice suddenly rang out.","\"Greetings, Miss!\"","Immediately after, the thousands of employees and core members in the audience followed suit, shouting in perfect unison.","\"Greetings, Miss!\""]},{"number":639,"title":"Chapter 639: 639, Issuing Another Hundred Million in Cash","paragraphs":["\"Good day, Eldest Miss!\"","The tsunami-like chorus of greetings pounded against Qiu Ciyun's eardrums. The fanatical expressions on the faces of the thousands of employees below the stage further shattered his understanding of this company.","It was his first time seeing such a divided company.","Yet, it was precisely such a company, which exuded an underworld vibe in every aspect, whose boss was working so hard to develop microchips.","Was this the patriotic sentiment held by a boss with an underworld background?","Qiu Ciyun now knew that the title Eldest Miss was a unique culture within the Wanlong Syndicate. Liu Yutong herself wasn't actually the eldest daughter of some prestigious family; it was just what everyone was accustomed to calling her.","Of course, one could also hear some subtle differences in these titles.","Normally, only the men in black suits would call her that, even viewing it as an honor to address their boss this way. Meanwhile, the other ordinary employees used more standard titles, similar to how he addressed her.","Liu Yutong merely raised her hand slightly, and the crowd below instantly fell silent. You could hear a pin drop.","Then, she took the microphone handed to her by Yun Cheng and spoke.","\"Brothers and sisters, thank you for your hard work!\"","There were no long-winded opening remarks, no superficial words of gratitude. It was incredibly direct and straightforward. Yet, this simple sentence unconsciously made everyone in the audience straighten their backs a little more.","\"It is a new year again. The place we are standing on right now is the Wanlong Syndicate Group headquarters that we are currently building. I feel deeply honored and incredibly lucky that the Wanlong Syndicate Group has grown from nothing to something, gathering so many brothers and sisters together on this land.\"","\"In 2007, I had just graduated from high school. At that time, Yun Cheng, Ma Da, and I founded the Wanlong Syndicate and opened our first restaurant, Yuyuefang. Now, Yuyuefang insists on a boutique route, with over twenty branches including those in Pearl City, and an annual revenue exceeding one hundred million. Later, we opened our first supermarket, Wanlong Supermarket, defeated all competitors in Pearl City, and swallowed up Mingcheng Supermarket, which had been competing against us. By the end of 2007, the valuation of the industries under the Wanlong Syndicate was nearly three billion.\"","\"In 2008, our first Wanlong Shopping Plaza officially opened, and we are accelerating our expansion in multiple cities. It is estimated that by the second half of this year, at least five Wanlong Plazas will open one after another. Huangquan Internet Cafe has opened dozens of branches, and Longyin milk tea shops have spread all over the streets and alleys of Pearl City. Our internet project, Wanhui Select, has completed multiple rounds of financing, and its current valuation exceeds seven billion. Weibo, from its inception to now, in just a few months, has surpassed 45 million users. At the same time, we have also invested in key high-tech projects like Longxin...\"","\"A year and a half feels like a very long time to me. Because back then, I never expected us to develop to the scale we are at today. Now, I can tell all the brothers and sisters of the Wanlong Syndicate, as well as every friend present today, that according to the latest round of professional evaluation, the overall valuation of the Wanlong Syndicate Group has broken through the twenty billion mark!\"","Boom!","The crowd instantly exploded into an uproar, gasps of amazement erupting all around!","Twenty billion!","From zero to twenty billion, the Wanlong Syndicate only took a short year and a half!","What did this mean?","It meant that all of them were part of this rapidly expanding business empire. It meant that the restricted shares in their hands and the platform they were on were rising in value.","Especially for the earliest batch of core members of the Wanlong Syndicate.","The 100,000 restricted shares they had bought for 100,000 yuan back then were now worth over a million. Simply because they had followed the right Eldest Miss, in just over a year, these street thugs who used to hustle in society, sometimes so poor they had to pick up cigarette butts while driving beat-up vans, had become millionaires in the blink of an eye.","In this day and age, being a millionaire carried a lot of weight. Even a decade later, it would still hold high value, because their restricted shares could be cashed out with the company at any time.","There was an even more shocking figure: the number of people in the entire Wanlong Syndicate Group with a net worth of over a million had already exceeded four digits.","As the company grew larger and wealthier, they too became wealthier. This was the early wealthy leading the later wealthy—no, it should be said that they truly achieved sharing blessings together.","It was also Qiu Ciyun's first time hearing Liu Yutong's entrepreneurial journey so completely, and he was deeply shaken.","He had seen many successful business owners, but he had never seen a boss who built a multi-billion empire from scratch at such a young age.","At first, he also thought Liu Yutong was the eldest daughter of some wealthy family, supported by her family's money to start a business. He didn't expect her to have started entirely from scratch. Of course, the process of building this empire might have been a little shady.","But it was undeniable that for her to lead the Wanlong Syndicate to its current scale at such a young age, her abilities were truly outstanding. The most crucial point was that the industries under her umbrella were blossoming everywhere, each with its own unique characteristics.","He had eaten at Yuyuefang, and the dishes there made it absolutely one of the most amazing restaurants he had ever visited. The small fish potstickers, in particular, left a deep impression on him.","The Weibo team led by President Zhang, who sat next to him, had created a miracle of surpassing 45 million users just a few months after going online, with a valuation of at least several billion.","There were also supermarkets, shopping plazas, milk tea shops... The Wanlong Syndicate Group seemed to succeed in whatever it did, and its momentum was incredibly fierce!","And the creator of all this, including the boss behind the Longxin project he was currently responsible for, was actually the same person: a young college sophomore who had just turned twenty.","Qiu Ciyun couldn't help but wonder what he was doing at the age of twenty. He was probably still studying desperately for a scholarship, or doing odd jobs for his advisor in the lab...","And even then, he was already considered a genius.","Then look at Liu Yutong.","Sigh, comparing oneself to others really just brings pure frustration...","On stage, Liu Yutong was still speaking.","\"Many people say that the annual meeting is a time to summarize the achievements of the year, but I think it should be more of a time for sharing. The Wanlong Syndicate Group will never mistreat its own people!\"","She turned her head and nodded to Ma Da.","Ma Da understood, picked up his walkie-talkie, and whispered a few words.","The next moment, there was a commotion at the entrance of the venue, and everyone looked over curiously.","They saw over a dozen young men in black suits, in groups of two, pushing heavy carts covered with red cloth into the venue.","There were a full ten of these carts in total.","The carts were neatly lined up in the open space in front of the stage. Beneath the red cloths were bulging outlines that made people's hearts race.","Liu Yutong walked to the edge of the stage, looked at the thousands of pairs of eyes below, and said, \"Everyone has worked hard over the past year. With the Spring Festival approaching, I won't spout any empty words...\"","She waved her arm, pointing to the carts covered in red cloth. \"Here is one hundred million in cash, and today, it belongs to every official employee of the Wanlong Syndicate!\"","\"One hundred million! In cash!\"","\"Holy crap!\"","\"Is this for real?!\"","\".........\"","The crowd below the stage went absolutely wild!","Many people stood on their tiptoes and craned their necks, desperate to catch a glimpse of what lay hidden beneath the red cloth.","Ma Da stepped forward alongside a few core members. They grabbed a corner of the red cloth draped over the first cart and yanked it off with a forceful pull!","Swoosh!","A dazzling sea of red, still carrying the fresh scent of printing ink, instantly filled everyone's vision.","It was neatly stacked hundred-yuan bills, arranged like bricks, pile after pile, layer upon layer, completely filling the entire cart.","The visual impact was simply unparalleled!","Immediately after, the second, the third... the rest of the red cloths were pulled away one by one.","Ten carts, all loaded with mountains of cash.","At this very moment, the sheer concept of one hundred million was completely brought to life!"]},{"number":640,"title":"Chapter 640: 640, Boss with Great Magnanimity","paragraphs":["One hundred million in cash!","Even though this wasn't the first time the Young Lady had distributed such a massive amount of cash, seeing it again was still an incredibly shocking sight!","Zhang Dalong and Qiu Ciyun felt equally astounded; it was indeed their first time seeing a hundred million in cash with their own eyes.","They had never even heard of any company being so extravagant as to take out a hundred million to give away as red envelopes at an annual meeting.","Today was a real eye-opener for them.","\"Line up! Get your money! Celebrate the New Year!\" Liu Yutong said simply.","The finance personnel and administrative staff quickly took their places. Following the pre-assigned zones and name lists, they began systematically organizing the distribution of the red envelopes.","Everyone wore a radiant smile after receiving their red envelope, and some were already planning what to buy with the money for the New Year.","Zhang Dalong nudged the dazed Qiu Ciyun and said with a smile, \"Mr. Qiu, don't just stand there, everyone gets a share. Although you're not officially part of the Wanlong Syndicate system, the Young Lady has definitely prepared a big red envelope for you too. The Young Lady always says that no one who works for her ever works for nothing.\"","He was also feeling a bit excited himself. Of this hundred million in cash, half was used for year-end red envelopes, averaging about ten thousand per person. The remaining fifty million was set aside specifically to reward outstanding individuals and teams.","Their Weibo team alone scooped up 15 million, of which he personally received 2 million. After all, the success Weibo had achieved was obvious to everyone.","Eventually, Qiu Ciyun also received a red envelope. Even though this amount of money was nothing to someone whose net worth had long surpassed ten million, a warm feeling still welled up in his heart.","He couldn't help but recall a previous conversation he had with Liu Yutong.","\"Mr. Qiu, I'm entrusting Dragon Chip to you, and you'll have full authority from now on. Whatever you do, don't waste your energy on external socializing. You have only one goal: to increase production capacity and strive to catch up with the world's best.\"","\"Then what about you, Chairwoman Liu?\"","\"Me? I'll be responsible for fending off all those social obligations for you, and then giving you money—giving it until none of your pockets can hold any more.\"","\"In short, just remember that my rules are very simple. You sweat, I pay. You conquer a hill, I pay. If you ever get bullied, I will bring my Wanlong Syndicate to back you up and demand justice!\"","At the time, Qiu Ciyun just took it as a casual joke from the boss. After all, how many bosses would actually do that? Especially the latter part about bringing the Wanlong Syndicate to back him up—he hadn't taken that seriously at all.","What kind of society did they live in now, anyway?","But looking at it now, it seemed she had never been joking.","Was she generous? She was ridiculously generous.","At the very least, he had never seen a boss give out such large year-end red envelopes to ordinary employees. If it were for top-tier talents or company management, he could understand.","But ninety percent of the people here were grassroots employees in easily replaceable positions, like supermarket clerks and delivery riders. Yet, everyone got a share, and the minimum payout averaged around ten thousand per person. In many places, that was equivalent to a full year's income.","Those with longer tenure already had net worths exceeding a million. Going from zero to a million had only taken them a year and a half.","And to think, as a master in the semiconductor industry, his own net worth was only in the tens of millions, not counting the options given by Dragon Chip.","She was truly too generous!","As for helping to settle scores if someone was bullied, he now had a visceral understanding of that too. Just looking at that dense crowd of men in black, who wouldn't be intimidated?","Speaking of the men in black.","After the red envelopes were distributed, there was another important segment: the promotion ceremony for the core members, namely the men in black.","The number of people being promoted this time exceeded five hundred, with over three hundred coming from out-of-town branches. Under the guidance and example of some veteran core members, these newly promoted individuals were all determined to become modern youths who knew and understood the law, uniting knowledge and action!","It was their first time attending the head office's annual meeting, their first time witnessing such an extravagant way of handing out money, and their first time personally experiencing this blood-pumping promotion ceremony.","When they received the black uniform symbolizing their status and the sacred red-covered book from Liu Yutong's hands, everyone was so thrilled they almost wanted to go through fire and water for the Young Lady.","Because putting on the black clothes meant they possessed even more benefits. For example, a double-salary system, holiday care packages for relatives, and medical reimbursement benefits for immediate family members.","If your parents, wife, or children fell ill, regardless of whether it was a minor or major illness, all expenses not covered by medical insurance could be reimbursed by the company.","There was an actual case of this on the company's intranet. The protagonist was a senior executive in charge of the company's internet cafe business, named Zhang Tao.","Zhang Tao had initially maliciously concealed his immediate family member's severe illness. As a result, the Young Lady made an example of him and harshly criticized him. Feeling extremely guilty, he wrote a self-criticism letter, which was still pinned to the front page of the intranet.","In short, becoming a core member practically meant having no more worries about the future.","As long as someone wasn't stupid, it was safe to say no one would choose to betray the company or resign.","After this round of promotions, the total number of core members in the Wanlong Syndicate had reached two thousand six hundred, which was already a massive number. Moreover, these people, regardless of gender, almost all studied and understood the law, and consistently exercised their bodies—except for Ma Da.","Ma Da's weight was visibly hurtling straight toward two hundred jin, making him a special case. Liu Yutong was even starting to feel a bit disgusted with the guy. She was even considering banishing him to Africa, confident that he would definitely slim down by the time he returned.","After the promotion ceremony concluded, Liu Yutong didn't waste any words and directly announced that it was time to eat.","Liu Yutong brought Yun Cheng and the others to the main table, table number one. After greeting Qiu Ciyun and the rest, they began to toast and drink.","After a sumptuous lunch, there was naturally the indispensable claw machine segment.","Liu Yutong had people prepare a large number of claw machines and ring-toss stalls for everyone to play with. Every doll or ring-toss blind box could potentially hide a voucher for a physical prize.","Most of the gifts were home appliances, along with some shopping cards. The grandest prize, naturally, was a seven-day overseas trip for two, which included airfare, hotel expenses, and a spending allowance of fifty thousand.","Zhang Tao and his fiancée, Zhou Juan'er, had their sights set on that seven-day overseas trip for two.","Their progress from confirming their relationship to getting married had been quite fast, making him the first among the most core members to start a family.","However, Zhang Tao himself was already twenty-five. In truth, getting married at his age was considered late marriage nowadays. The average age of marriage now and a dozen years later were truly worlds apart.","The date for their wedding was set for the twenty-sixth day of the twelfth lunar month.","Because Zhou Juan'er wasn't a local—she was from the neighboring city, quite a distance from Pearl City—they planned to host two wedding banquets: one on the bride's side, and one in Pearl City after the New Year.","The one on the bride's side would be slightly simpler, basically just the bride's relatives and friends along with Zhang Tao's relatives and friends.","In reality, Zhang Tao didn't have many relatives left. Ever since his father fell seriously ill, those relatives ended up avoiding his family and rarely interacted with them.","\"Got another one!\"","\"Hahaha, this duck is mine.\"","\"Let me try this machine, this one looks easy to win!\"","\"Actually, they are all the same. These claws grip tighter than a pair of pliers, it is basically a guaranteed catch every time.\"","\"Yeah, catching them like this is so satisfying.\"","\"........\"","After Zhang Tao and his fiancee, Zhou Juan'er, caught a few plushies without winning any lottery prizes, they decided to head over to the ring toss.","The ring toss was just as ridiculous.","Zhou Juan'er threw a ring and missed. Before she even had time to feel disappointed, the man in black in charge of retrieving the rings quickly snatched it up, casually placed it over a mystery box, and shouted.","\"Oh! A hit, a hit! Great aim, sister-in-law! Here, one premium mystery box!\"","\"Thank you!\" Zhou Juan'er smiled as she accepted the reward.","This left Zhang Tao completely speechless, but when he looked around at the others, he realized it was the same for everyone.","Missed your throw?","No problem. The staff would help your ring land on a prize, ensuring everyone got a share. Absolutely fair.","However, when Zhou Juan'er opened the mystery box on the spot and pulled out the prize ticket inside, she instantly let out a cry of surprise.","\"A'Tao, I won! I got the grand prize!\"","The surroundings fell silent for a moment before erupting into exclamations.","\"Holy crap, she really won it!\"","\"The grand prize, is that the major travel package?\"","\"Sister-in-law's luck is unbelievable!\"","\"Way to go, Brother Tao!\"","\"........\"","The young guy who had helped place the ring was also stunned. Staring at his own hands, he said with a hint of regret, \"I just randomly picked a mystery box and put the ring on it, and it turned out to be the grand prize? Doesn't that mean my luck is completely drained? When I play for myself later, am I going to end up with absolutely nothing?\"","Another brother in black beside him slapped him hard on the back and teased him with a wink, \"Look at you, what a matchmaker. You just sorted out Brother Tao's honeymoon for him! You should have Brother Tao give you a big red envelope later.\"","Zhang Tao replied generously, \"That is definitely not a problem. Xiao Liu, I will get a big red envelope ready for you later.\"","The young man quickly waved his hands. \"Forget the red envelope, I just want to drink some of your wedding wine to wet my whistle. Being force-fed all this romantic sweetness is making me choke.\"","\"Hahaha.........\""]},{"number":641,"title":"Chapter 641: 641, Zhang Tao's Grand Wedding","paragraphs":["Zhou Juan'er's hometown was located in a place called Zhoujia Village in the neighboring city.","On the twenty-sixth day of the twelfth lunar month, Zhang Tao borrowed eight Mercedes-Benz cars from his company. Along with the eldest young lady's exclusive Maybach and nine core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society acting as temporary drivers, he brought his parents and some relatives they still kept in touch with, setting off for the neighboring city before dawn.","The Zhou family was a prominent surname in the local area. Zhou Juan'er's father served as the captain of Team 5 in their village and was quite popular.","The wedding banquet this time was set up in the bride's courtyard and the open space in front of the house. Tents were erected, rural chefs were hired, and about fifteen tables were set up in total.","Around nine in the morning, the wedding convoy picked up the bride from a makeup studio in the city.","At about ten o'clock, the convoy, consisting of eight Mercedes-Benz cars and a Maybach, arrived at the entrance of Zhoujia Village, where the bride's family lived.","Many people got married at the end of the year, and they had encountered quite a few wedding convoys along the way. However, Zhang Tao's fleet of identical Mercedes-Benz cars, led by a Maybach worth ten million, was the most eye-catching.","This wedding convoy was truly extravagant. In this day and age, such a grand display was absolutely considered massive.","As soon as the convoy reached the village entrance, the bride's family, who had been waiting early, lit firecrackers. The crackling sounds went on endlessly, making the scene extremely lively.","Zhou Juan'er's parents waited at the door, their faces beaming with smiles. Their son-in-law's grand display had truly earned them a lot of face.","Have you ever seen a convoy entirely made of Mercedes-Benz cars?","Let alone them, even the other villagers had never seen such a grand display. Under normal circumstances, having a single Mercedes-Benz leading the way would already bring a lot of prestige, not to mention the Maybach acting as the lead car.","\"They're here, they're here! Juan'er's wedding convoy is here!\"","\"Holy smokes! Are these all Mercedes-Benz?\"","\"One, two, three... eight cars, all identical Mercedes-Benz!\"","\"Look at the lead car, what kind of car is that? I've never seen that logo before!\"","The villagers watching the commotion all started trying to identify the car. A Maybach was truly a rare sight in this place, and many people simply didn't recognize it. It was a young man who had worked in an auto repair shop in the city who recognized it first.","\"Damn, it's actually a Maybach! That's a Maybach!\"","\"What's a Maybach?\"","\"A Maybach is even more awesome than a Mercedes-Benz. I heard this car costs at least ten million on the road!\"","\"Ten million? Just to buy one car!\" The people around were shocked.","\"What kind of family is Juan'er marrying into? They're so wealthy!\"","\"I heard they run an internet cafe in the neighboring Pearl City, and their business is quite big.\"","\"Can running an internet cafe make that much money?\"","\"Absolutely. Young people nowadays all love surfing the internet. Opening an internet cafe is super profitable!\"","At this time, a young man with a cigarette dangling from his mouth couldn't help but curl his lips and say sourly, \"Just showing off. This is a rented convoy. If they were really that rich, would they take a fancy to a girl from our Zhoujia Village?\"","An auntie next to him rolled her eyes at him. \"Qiangzi, you're just jealous. Juan'er is such a good girl. She's pretty and even went to college in the city. What's wrong with her matching with a boss?\"","Zhou Qiang took a drag of his cigarette and said, \"Do you guys know what kind of car Zhou Laosan's cousin, Brother Biao, drives?\"","\"A BMW, what about it?\"","\"Brother Biao's BMW 5 Series reportedly costs around six or seven hundred thousand. This Maybach is worth twenty of Brother Biao's BMWs. Think about it, in our small place, whose car can overshadow Brother Biao's? Who dares to overshadow Brother Biao?\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the surroundings went quiet for a few seconds.","Zhou Laosan was the village chief's nephew and could be considered Zhou Juan'er's distant cousin. He had a cousin named Zhao Biao, who was a very formidable figure in this area and held a high status even in the city.","This guy ran a sand yard, lent money, and had a bunch of underlings. His BMW was the first of its kind in their town.","Now a wedding convoy suddenly popped up with a lineup so much bigger than Zhao Biao's. Given Zhao Biao's personality...","\"Juan'er's groom might be showing off a bit too much,\" a villager couldn't help but say.","\"What's wrong? Is it a crime to have money?\" a young wife said unconvincingly.","\"It's not a crime, Lao Jiu's wife, you just don't understand. That guy Zhao Biao cares about his face the most. Last time when Old Li's son from the West Village got married, they rented a Porsche as the lead car. Brother Biao happened to pass by, and his face instantly darkened. Later, their whole family went out to work and hasn't dared to return to the village since...\"","\"Isn't that too overbearing? So people just aren't allowed to be more high-profile than him?\"","\"Shh, keep your voice down. Zhao Biao might even come over today.\"","\"...\"","While the crowd was chatting, the firecrackers crackled loudly once again, and the bridal car arrived at the courtyard gate.","Zhang Tao got out of the car wearing a suit. Although he was young, after his experience in the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, his temperament had noticeably become much more composed, faintly exuding the aura of an elite executive.","Zhou Juan'er's parents couldn't stop grinning when they saw their son-in-law. When they went up to greet him, their backs were a bit straighter than usual.","In the crowd, Zhou Qiang quietly backed away, took out his phone, and dialed a number.","\"Brother Biao, it's me, Qiangzi... Ah, yes, in the village.\"","\"I need to tell you something. Juan'er's groom is here, and the display is huge. Eight Mercedes-Benz cars, with a Maybach as the lead car, said to be worth tens of millions... Okay, I got it. Don't worry, I'll keep an eye on things for you.\"","After hanging up the phone, Zhou Laowu slipped back into the crowd and squeezed to the front again to join the excitement.","Just then, someone next to him nudged him.","\"Qiangzi, who were you just calling?\"","\"No one. I just feel... today's wedding banquet probably won't be a peaceful one.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Nothing, nothing at all,\" Zhou Qiang casually brushed it off.","Actually, he regretted it a bit right after making the call. No matter what, they were relatives with the same surname. He had only made that call out of pure jealousy, dialing the number in a moment of impulse.","But it was too late for regrets now.","He knew Zhao Biao would soon come over to join the commotion, and he just hoped nothing serious would actually happen.","After Zhang Tao carried the bride out of the car, according to local customs, he had to hand out red envelopes to enter the door. He was well-prepared, having his brothers toss a few rounds of red envelopes. The relatives blocking the door were just about to let him carry the bride inside.","But right at this moment, a BMW 5 Series and a minivan drove over, and a group of hooligan-like youths got out.","Among them, a guy with dyed blond hair saw the groom about to enter the door and ran straight over to block him again.","\"Groom, you want to enter just like that? According to our rules here, besides giving out red envelopes, you also have to put on a performance!\"","Fortunately, Zhang Tao worked out regularly. After carrying his wife for so long, his arms were only slightly sore, and he could still hold on. Even though he didn't know the other party, he still smiled and asked, \"Brother, tell me, what kind of performance?\"","The blond guy looked him up and down, grinning widely. \"Simple. Crawl like a dog from here to the door of the bride's room, and bark while you crawl!\"","The villagers watching the commotion immediately burst into laughter.","Zhang Tao's expression changed, but he still suppressed his anger. \"Brother, that's not very appropriate, is it? It's a bit insulting. How about changing it to something else? I'll give you guys a red envelope, okay?\"","\"Trying to brush me off with a red envelope? That won't do.\"","The blond guy raised his chin and said, \"Hey, I heard you're doing pretty well for yourself in Mingzhu City. Opened an internet cafe and became a boss, huh? What, are you looking down on us country folks now?\"","A man in his thirties wearing a leather jacket strolled over slowly and patted the blond guy on the shoulder. \"Xiaowu, that's enough. Don't delay the auspicious hour.\"","The blond guy immediately changed his tune, bowing and scraping. \"Brother Biao is right, Brother Biao is right. We shouldn't hold up the newlyweds' auspicious hour.\"","Zhang Tao looked at the man. He had a thick gold chain around his neck and a large gold ring on his finger. His eyes carried a ruthless glint—he definitely looked like someone you didn't want to mess with!","Zhao Biao also sized Zhang Tao up and smiled. \"Brother, I heard you're doing business in Mingzhu City? What kind of business?\"","\"Running an internet cafe,\" Zhang Tao replied. \"Just a small business.\"","\"Internet cafes are great. People love going online nowadays. I have two internet cafes in the city myself. We should swap notes sometime,\" Zhao Biao said.","\"Sure!\" Zhang Tao replied perfunctorily."]},{"number":642,"title":"Chapter 642: 642, Wedding Nuisance","paragraphs":["As Zhang Tao carried the bride into the house, Zhao Biao stood at the doorway, taking another look at the fleet of black wedding cars. The smile that had been hanging on his face gradually darkened.","Seeing his expression change, the surrounding villagers felt a bit afraid and detoured around him. They could not help but recall the arrogant slogan Zhao Biao used to shout.","\"In Qingniu Town, no one is allowed to be more badass than me, Zhao Biao!\"","For a town with very average development, he had actually managed to achieve this.","When others got married, they did not dare to use a lead car worth more than half a million. Of course, these days, there were indeed few families here who would use very expensive cars as lead cars. Most just threw together a random fleet, and some even used tractors to pull the dowry.","Now that such a luxurious wedding fleet had suddenly appeared, given Zhao Biao's nature, the Zhou family's son-in-law was probably going to suffer a bit.","The noon banquet began, and the atmosphere was ostensibly lively.","Zhang Tao went from table to table toasting. When he reached Zhou Qiang's table, Zhao Biao was also there.","\"Groom, come, let me toast you!\" Zhao Biao stood up with his wine glass. \"I have some ties with your father-in-law, so sister Juan'er is also like a sister to me. In the future, if anything happens around here, just drop my name, Zhao Biao!\"","\"Thank you, Brother Biao.\" Zhang Tao raised his glass and downed it in one gulp.","Just as he finished, Zhao Biao reached out and held down Zhang Tao's glass. \"Brother-in-law, drinking like this is no fun. The rule here is that to toast this table, you have to drink one glass per person, ten glasses in a row!\"","Zhang Tao looked at the ten people at the table and frowned. \"Brother Biao, my alcohol tolerance isn't great, and I still have to toast the other tables...\"","\"Not giving me face, huh?\" Zhao Biao's expression sank.","A brother from the Wanlong Society acting as a driver next to him couldn't hold back. \"Brother Tao still has to toast the other tables. The gesture is enough, right? Don't go too far!\"","\"Who the hell are you!\"","Zhao Biao glared at the Wanlong Society member. \"I'm talking to my brother-in-law. Is it your turn as an outsider to interrupt? Are you looking for death!\"","\"You...\"","Seeing that a conflict was about to break out, Zhang Tao quickly intervened. \"Alright, I'll drink.\"","After downing ten small glasses of white liquor, Zhang Tao's stomach churned, feeling incredibly uncomfortable. His usual alcohol tolerance was decent, but chugging like this, even with the smallest glasses, was a bit too much to bear.","After toasting this table, Zhang Tao was already a little unsteady on his feet.","Juan'er supported him, her heart aching for him. \"Drink less.\"","\"It's fine, I'm happy.\" Zhang Tao forced a smile.","Around two in the afternoon, the first banquet ended. According to local customs, there would be wedding hazing in the bridal chamber that night.","Zhang Tao originally wanted to skip these activities, but his father-in-law said it was an old tradition and hard to change. Moreover, wedding hazing usually just involved the bride and groom playing little games, like biting an apple together, which was harmless. He thought about it and did not insist.","The bridal chamber was Juan'er's original bedroom. Their house was just a normal rural layout with two bedrooms and a living room.","In the afternoon, Zhang Tao took a nap in the bridal chamber.","At seven in the evening, after the second meal, the people coming to haze the bridal chamber arrived.","The leader was Zhao Biao, followed by seven or eight ruffian-looking youths, all drunk.","When Zhao Biao reached the door, he didn't hold back and kicked the room door open.","\"Brother-in-law, sober up, we're going to haze the bridal chamber!\"","Zhang Tao had just sat up when he was propped up by two people.","\"The first program, the groom is blindfolded and touches the bride. But let's change the rules a bit. Out of the women in the room, whoever you touch is the one you consummate the marriage with tonight!\"","The bride, Juan'er, changed her expression. \"Brother Biao, this won't do, it's too much!\"","\"Too much what? It's just for fun! Sister, don't worry, it won't go overboard. Your husband can definitely control himself,\" Zhao Biao said with a cheeky smile.","Besides Juan'er, there were three bridesmaids in the room. One was Juan'er's cousin, and two were her classmates, all around twenty years old. They had already heard of Zhao Biao's notorious reputation, and at this moment, they were a bit scared.","Zhang Tao was mostly sober now, and his face darkened. \"Brother Biao, jokes are jokes, but don't scare the little girls.\"","\"Oh, feeling protective now?\"","Zhao Biao walked over and patted Zhang Tao's face. \"Brother-in-law, do as the Romans do, understand? This is how we play here!\"","Saying that, he cast a glance behind him.","The group of men, who had long been impatient, threw themselves directly at the three bridesmaids, laughing loudly while intentionally groping and grabbing at them.","No matter how the three girls cried, shouted, and pushed, they could not break free. Some hands were even dishonestly reaching toward the bridesmaids' private parts.","Some relatives and villagers at the door who were originally just watching the fun also could not help but speak up to persuade them to stop.","They did indeed have a custom of wedding hazing here, but it usually wasn't this excessive. It was just harmless little games involving the bride and groom, not the bridesmaids.","This was also the reason why the three bridesmaids hadn't left in the afternoon. If they had known they would be hazed at night, they would probably have found an excuse to slip away long ago.","But Zhao Biao and his gang were really doing it, and it was obviously crossing the line.","Those relatives and villagers had only offered a few words of advice before they were silenced by a vicious glare from Zhao Biao.","This showed how terrifying Zhao Biao's reputation was in the local area.","Juan'er was extremely anxious. No matter how she shouted, these men showed no sign of stopping and instead became increasingly outrageous.","Zhang Tao was not going to indulge them. He reached out directly and violently yanked away the guys who were pouncing on the bridesmaids one by one. He worked out regularly, so pulling these people away was not a big problem.","\"Stop!\"","\"I told you to fucking stop! Is this how you haze a bridal chamber?!\"","The group of guys, who were in the heat of their lustful actions, were suddenly yanked away by Zhang Tao and instantly became annoyed.","Especially the leader, Zhao Biao. He had almost touched a bridesmaid's chest but was grabbed by Zhang Tao and pushed to the ground, landing on his butt and crying out in pain.","\"Zhang Tao, giving you face isn't enough, right? I'm just hazing the bridal chamber. I didn't mess with your wife. Why the fuck are you blindly interfering? Do you want to die!\"","\"Brother Biao, playing around is fine, but you can't go too far. Groping these young girls like that, according to criminal law, your actions already count as forced indecency and could even constitute attempted rape.\" Zhang Tao gave them a quick lesson in law.","Zhao Biao: \"Hahaha, rape? Do you think I don't know the law? Since when does wedding hazing count as rape? Stop spouting bullshit!\"","\"Also, absolutely do not talk to me about the law in this place, because here, I, Zhao Biao, am the law!\"","\"I am very angry right now, and the consequences will be severe. I can temporarily overlook you pushing me just now. But next, your big brother is going to play a game. As long as I have fun, I will let bygones be bygones.\"","\"As for what game? It's simple, just an exchange game. In a moment, you, the groom, will go out, leaving the bride and bridesmaids behind. We'll play a few little games with them. Once we're satisfied, tonight will end here. Otherwise...\"","When he reached this point, his true nature was completely exposed, and his tone became fierce. \"Otherwise, I can't guarantee whether you'll be able to leave Zhou Family Village in one piece!\"","This was a naked threat.","Zhang Tao's eyes also gradually darkened, his mind constantly pondering how to solve this trouble.","Seven of the nine brothers who came from the Ten Thousand Dragons Society had already left because they had to return the cars, leaving only two behind to drive back with him tomorrow.","Now, including him, there were only three of them at most, while the other side had eight people.","The most crucial point was that they were still at his wife's family home. If this wasn't handled properly, it could lead to a lot of trouble.","Zhou Juan'er grabbed Zhang Tao's hand and whispered, \"Ah Tao, what do we do now?\"","She was also worried that if they really provoked Zhao Biao and he went crazy, both she and Zhang Tao would end up in a terrible situation.","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society was formidable, but their people were mostly back in Pearl City. Furthermore, even if they managed to chase Zhao Biao away for the time being, what would happen to her family? They would inevitably suffer Zhao Biao's revenge.","It was better to just endure it.","Zhang Tao was similarly afraid of dragging his father-in-law's family into a mess, and combined with the fact that today was his big wedding day, he had been holding back all this time.","Otherwise, he wouldn't have given a damn about the consequences and would have already taught this guy a harsh lesson on how to behave.","\"Brother Biao, how about this? I'll toast to you to apologize, and I'll drink however you want me to. Just let these little girls go; they're still young, and it's not good to scare them.\"","Zhao Biao lit a cigarette. \"Do you think I'm negotiating with you?\"","He stood up, walked right up to Zhang Tao, and blew a puff of smoke directly into his face. \"I've been running things around here for over a decade, and no one has ever dared to bargain with me. Today, you're playing this game whether you want to or not!\"","\"Someone, escort our groom out!\"","Four or five young men rushed forward, reaching out to grab Zhang Tao.","\"Fuck you!\" Zhang Tao finally stopped holding back and smashed his fist right into Zhao Biao's face.","........"]},{"number":643,"title":"Chapter 643: 643, Something happened.","paragraphs":["Zhang Tao's punch, fueled by a chest full of rage, smashed ruthlessly into Zhao Biao's face.","Bang!","Zhao Biao staggered backward several steps, his back slamming hard against the table behind him. The liquor bottles and dishes on the table crashed to the floor in a shattering cascade. He covered his face, glaring at Zhang Tao in disbelief as a nosebleed trickled through his fingers.","The room fell silent in an instant.","Everyone was stunned, including the group of thugs Zhao Biao had brought, Zhou Juan'er and her bridesmaids, as well as the relatives, friends, and villagers watching from the doorway.","In Qingniu Town, someone actually dared to lay a hand on Zhao Biao?","\"Biao... Brother Biao, are you okay?\" one of his lackeys finally reacted, rushing over in a panic to help him up.","Zhao Biao wiped his nose, looked at the blood on his hand, and his eyes instantly turned red. \"You motherf...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, hurried footsteps suddenly echoed from outside the door.","The two members of the Wanlong Society, who had gone to the restroom together, had returned. Hearing the commotion in the bridal chamber, they rushed right in.","When they saw Zhao Biao covering his nose with a face full of blood, and then looked at Zhang Tao, they seemed to instantly understand what had happened. Their eyes immediately turned cold.","\"Brother Tao, are you alright?\" As the two asked, their hands discreetly reached toward the small of their backs, where their telescopic batons were tucked away.","\"I'm fine.\"","Zhang Tao shook out his hand and looked at Zhao Biao, his tone icy. \"Brother Biao, today is my wedding day. I don't want to see blood. Take your men and get the hell out of here, right now!\"","\"You hit me and now you're telling me to get the hell out?\"","Zhao Biao acted as if he had just heard the biggest joke in the world. He licked the blood from the corner of his mouth, his gaze turning incredibly ferocious. \"Zhang Tao, do you have any idea what happens to people who touch me, Zhao Biao, in Qingniu Town?\"","He waved his hand violently and roared, \"Beat him! Beat him to death! I'll take responsibility if anything happens!\"","The seven or eight thugs howled and charged forward.","But in the next second, they realized they were wrong.","Dead wrong!","Zhang Tao and his two companions moved almost simultaneously.","Zhang Tao delivered a side kick, landing squarely on the chest of the thug leading the charge. The man flew backward, knocking down two others behind him. The other two Wanlong Society members dodged the incoming punches from the thugs and seamlessly drew their batons, delivering a ruthless and resounding beating!","The scene instantly descended into utter chaos.","Perhaps because the space was too cramped for the thugs to maneuver properly, even though Zhang Tao's side only had three people, they completely overpowered the eight or nine thugs.","Zhang Tao seized an opening and closed in on Zhao Biao.","Relying on his superior numbers, Zhao Biao grabbed an empty liquor bottle and swung it at him. Zhang Tao didn't dodge or evade; he raised his left hand to block and drove his right fist straight into Zhao Biao's abdomen, putting all his strength into the punch.","\"Ugh!\" Zhao Biao doubled over from the blow, curling up like a cooked shrimp as the bottle slipped from his grasp.","Zhang Tao fluidly caught the bottle, grabbed Zhao Biao's hair with one hand to force him down, and raised the bottle with the other, bringing it crashing down hard onto his head.","Smash!!!","Zhao Biao's head split open instantly. Blood poured out even heavier, smearing all over his face and making him look even more pathetic and miserable.","Meanwhile, the other two core members of the Wanlong Society showcased the results of their daily martial arts training. These local street punks were no match for them at all; they were on the receiving end the entire time, beaten until they were crying out for their parents.","In less than two minutes, most of the thugs were lying on the floor groaning in pain. The remaining two, hiding in the very back, were too terrified to step forward, trembling at the doorway.","Zhao Biao was slumped on the floor, his face covered in blood, his consciousness fading.","Zhang Tao took a breath, straightened his slightly disheveled suit, walked over to Zhao Biao, and crouched down.","\"Brother Biao, can we talk properly now?\"","Zhao Biao opened his swollen eyes and glared fiercely at Zhang Tao, mumbling threats and curses, \"You... you're dead. I'm telling you... you're dead!\"","\"Still acting tough, motherfucker!\" one of the men in black walked over and stomped on Zhao Biao's hand.","\"Ah!\" Zhao Biao let out a miserable shriek.","\"Ah Liang.\" Zhang Tao shook his head, signaling him to let go.","Zhang Tao looked at Zhao Biao and repeated, \"I'll say it one more time. Today is my wedding. I don't want to cause trouble. Take your men and leave, alright?\"","Supported by his lackeys, Zhao Biao stood up. He shot a venomous glare at Zhang Tao, then looked at the two men in black, and finally turned his gaze to the terrified villagers at the door and Zhou Juan'er's family.","\"Good... good... very good!\"","Zhao Biao grinned, his smile even more grotesque. The blood on his face made him look like an evil spirit. \"Zhang Tao, you're certainly tough, but your father-in-law is still here in Qingniu Town!\"","\"Your wife's family is here too.\"","\"And these little bridesmaid chicks, their homes are nearby too, right?\"","Zhang Tao's eyes grew colder. \"Are you threatening me?\"","But Zhao Biao laughed, laughing brazenly despite his blood-soaked face. \"You're a badass, you can fight. You can protect them for a moment, but can you protect them for a lifetime? Once you go back to Pearl City, let's see who protects them then!\"","\"I've been running things in Qingniu Town for over ten years, and I've never taken a loss like this. Let me tell you, this isn't over!\"","He shoved away the lackey supporting him, staggered to the door, and looked back at Zhang Tao one last time, his eyes full of provocation and malice.","\"Just you wait. By tomorrow at the latest, I'll have you on your knees begging me!\" With that, he led his group of battered lackeys and stumbled away.","Watching the direction they left, Zhang Tao knew in his heart that there was no peaceful resolution to this matter anymore.","Originally, he had planned to call the police, but considering this was the enemy's turf, they would probably be bailed out the very same day they were arrested. When that happened, Zhao Biao would definitely retaliate even more ruthlessly.","That was why he had clung to a tiny sliver of hope that beating the man severely would scare him off, making him too afraid to ever provoke him, his father-in-law, or the Zhou family again.","But looking at it now, it seemed to have been completely useless.","That guy would definitely seek revenge, if not tonight, then tomorrow.","Zhou Juan'er rushed over, nervously grabbing Zhang Tao's hand. \"A-Tao, what do we do? Zhao Biao definitely won't let my parents off the hook.\"","She wasn't afraid of Zhao Biao coming after her and Zhang Tao, because they would be settling down in Pearl City, which was the headquarters of the Wanlong Society.","Unless Zhao Biao had a death wish, the guy would absolutely never dare go to Pearl City for revenge.","But her parents and family were different; they were still here.","Zhang Tao's father-in-law and mother-in-law were also badly frightened.","\"Little Tao, you... you were too impulsive. A man like Zhao Biao, our family can't afford to provoke him.\"","Some of the villagers and relatives at the door also gathered around to offer advice.","\"Juan'er's husband, you need to take Juan'er and leave quickly. Leave right now and go back to Pearl City. Zhao Biao is an incredibly petty man; he will definitely retaliate.\"","\"Yes, you two need to leave immediately. Zhao Biao has people in town and in the city, and he even has connections in the police department. You'll suffer a huge loss if you stay here.\"","\"Hurry up and go! Don't delay here any longer!\"","Zhou Juan'er cried, \"But what about my parents?\"","Her father-in-law gritted his teeth. \"You guys go. As for us... the worst that can happen is we move away!\"","Her mother-in-law grew anxious. \"Move away? Move where? Our house and land are all here. If we move, what will we eat and drink? We're old; we can't handle being uprooted like this.\"","For their generation, leaving the hometown where they had spent their entire lives was easier said than done.","Zhang Tao looked at his parents-in-law and his wife, taking a deep breath.","\"Dad, Mom, don't worry. I'll handle this. You don't have to move.\"","\"How are you going to handle it?\"","His father-in-law grew anxious. \"Even if you're good in a fight, there are only three of you. Zhao Biao can call up dozens of men, and he actually dares to use a knife!\"","Zhang Tao didn't say a word. He pulled out his phone and walked into the courtyard.","The other two men in black followed him out and asked, \"Brother Tao, should we call the boys over? We can just take them out.\"","That was exactly what Zhang Tao had in mind. Otherwise, he could have easily taken his wife's family to live in Pearl City; it wasn't like he couldn't afford to support them.","However, running away wasn't a real solution. What if Zhao Biao took his revenge out on their other relatives?","He decisively dialed Ma Da's number.","The call connected quickly.","\"Taozi, you actually have time to call me on your wedding night?\" Ma Da's laughter rang out from the other end of the line, mixed with the clatter of mahjong tiles.","Zhang Tao didn't beat around the bush. \"Brother Ma, I'm at Zhoujia Village. Something happened.\""]},{"number":644,"title":"Chapter 644: 644. Reply from the Disaster Area","paragraphs":["Mingzhu City, Qiongyue Bay Villa District.","At eight o'clock in the evening, Liu Yutong's home was brightly lit.","Yun Cheng, Ma Da, Li Xiaohui, Yu Xin, and Yang Xin were all here as guests. The group of people chatted while playing mahjong.","Since everyone was usually busy with their own lives, it had been a long time since they had a proper gathering like this, especially with Yun Cheng, whom they hadn't seen in months.","Liu Yutong invited them over not only to relax and play mahjong but also to hear about everyone's recent work updates, particularly from Yun Cheng, who had been stationed in BS Province.","Pong!","Li Xiaohui triumphantly pushed down the mahjong tiles in front of her. A flush, concealed hand, and self-drawn! Pay up, pay up!","Yu Xin groaned, Xiaohui, your luck is way too good today! This is the third time already!","Ma Da rubbed his round belly and reluctantly pulled out his money with a bitter face. If I had known, I wouldn't have played with you. I've already lost five hundred. Brother Yun, Brother Yun, why don't you take my place?","Liu Yutong sat on the sofa, holding a cup of black tea, watching them play mahjong. She wore an off-white turtleneck sweater, her long hair draped casually over her shoulders. Compared to her usual outdoor demeanor, she looked noticeably more intellectual and gentle.","Yun Cheng sat next to her, also holding a teacup.","His few months working in BS Province had noticeably changed his aura, giving him an indescribable touch of elegance.","Brother Yun Cheng, don't just watch. Come play a few rounds? Yu Xin turned her head to invite him.","Yun Cheng shook his head. You guys play. I'm fine just watching for a bit.","Alright then.","Liu Yutong put down her teacup and looked at Yun Cheng. Is everything going smoothly over in BS Province?","Yun Cheng sat up a bit straighter and reported, Overall, it's been pretty smooth. Our first Wanlong Plaza in the provincial capital was topped out last month and is expected to open in April. In addition, more than half of the Wanlong Plazas in the dozen or so counties and cities in the earthquake zone have started construction, and the remaining few are in the final approval process.","The progress is good. Have you run into any trouble?","Yun Cheng paused slightly. Trouble... yes, we did.","What is it? Is someone looking for trouble?","Yes.","Yun Cheng nodded. Mainly in Chuanxiang City. The plot of land we acquired in the city center was targeted by a local thug nicknamed Hei Gui. He gathered a gang and came to the construction site every day to cause trouble.","They claimed our construction was disturbing the residents and demanded high compensation, asking for five million right off the bat. It was obvious extortion. I looked into it, and this Hei Pi relies on these underhanded tactics to ruin other people's construction progress, forcing them to eventually sell the project or land to him at a low price.","And then?","I had someone dig into his background. This guy had several assault cases tied to him, but he always got off scot-free due to a lack of evidence or having someone else take the fall. Later, when he brought his men to cause trouble at the site again, I led our brothers to take them down, and then we packed them up and sent them straight to the provincial authorities. Since then, the site has been completely peaceful.","None of our brothers got hurt, right?","No, they are all elites we brought from Mingzhu City. The brothers we recruited locally in BS Province had also been training for a while. Dealing with that disorganized mob was more than enough.","That's good.","Liu Yutong still instructed, When our brothers are out and about, safety comes first. If you encounter this kind of thing again, be tough when you need to be, but you must try your best to ensure our people don't get hurt.","Yun Cheng nodded. Understood!","Over on Li Xiaohui's side, they started chattering and shuffling the tiles again, preparing for a new round.","Liu Yutong suddenly remembered something. By the way, how are Xiao Bao and the other children doing now?","Yun Cheng replied, They're all doing well. After confirming their identities, they were sent back to reunite with their families and are now attending school normally in their local areas. We will continue to fund their tuition fees all the way through college.","After more than a year of effort, most of the children they had taken in from Hua Muying had found their relatives. Now, only Yun Cheng's personal disciple, Xiao Hu, remained here; the rest had been sent home.","Liu Yutong nodded and asked, And what about the two billion allocated for the construction of primary and middle schools?","Yun Cheng had clearly done his homework. Miss, the two billion in special funds we donated have helped build a total of one hundred and twenty-seven primary and middle schools, covering eight heavily disaster-stricken counties and cities in BS Province. Among them, eighty-nine were completely newly built, and thirty-eight were expanded and renovated. Moreover, all these schools were constructed and modified according to the highest earthquake resistance standards. Most of them were put into use last month, and there are currently over fifty thousand students enrolled.","Fifty thousand students. That progress is very good. Liu Yutong was very satisfied with this progress.","Yun Cheng continued, Actually, many schools are built in remote mountainous areas, so transporting materials was a major issue. To catch up on the schedule, some of our brothers who were in charge of supervising the work also joined the reconstruction efforts, carrying cement and steel bars on their shoulders and backs. During the hardest times, dozens of people lived in tents for two straight months.","But we all felt it was worth it. I remember a place called Hongye Township. The original primary school completely collapsed during the earthquake, and the children had to take classes in temporary prefab houses. In the winter, it was so cold they couldn't even hold their pens. On the day our newly built school was completed, young and old from the whole township came out, and many elderly people knelt down and kowtowed to us.","At that moment, I thought to myself that this trip to BS Province was truly not in vain.","Yun Cheng took out a thick folder from his bag and opened it. These are the materials sent by the various schools one after another last month. There are thank-you letters and drawings from the children. Take a look, Miss.","Liu Yutong took it, casually pulled out a letter, and began to read.","The handwriting on the letterhead was still a bit childish and slightly crooked, but every stroke was written very neatly.","Dear big brothers and sisters of the Wanlong Society:","My name is Yang Xiaohua. I am ten years old and in the fourth grade at Hongye Township Wanlong Hope Primary School. In the past, our school was a mud house that leaked wind in the winter and rain in the summer. After the earthquake, the building collapsed, and we had classes in tents, our hands freezing until they looked like carrots.","This November, we moved into our new school. The classrooms are red brick buildings with really big windows, and the sunlight can shine on every classmate's desk. We have new desks, the chairs don't wobble anymore, and the food made by the cafeteria aunts is so delicious. Every Wednesday, we even get chicken legs.","Our teacher said that these were built with money donated by the big brothers and sisters of the Wanlong Society in Mingzhu City. I can't imagine how far away Mingzhu City is, but my mom says it's a place that takes two days by train to reach.","When I grow up, I want to be a teacher too and come back to teach in Hongye Township. I want to tell future students that there was once a group of good people dressed in black who built a red school for us.","Thank you. I will study hard.","Sincerely,","With best regards!","Yang Xiaohua","December 5, 2009.","Liu Yutong read very slowly. There were a few erasure marks on the letterhead, showing that the child had written it very earnestly.","There are many more letters like this. Almost every school sent them, along with these drawings.","Yun Cheng took out a few crayon drawings and handed them to Liu Yutong.","One drawing depicted a red school building under a blue sky with white clouds, and children jumping rope on the playground. Another showed a group of figures dressed in black helping to move building materials; although the people were drawn a bit crookedly, it was clear that the children had put a lot of effort and heart into it.","\"What touched me the most is this.\" Yun Cheng flipped to the back of the folder and took out a photograph.","In the photo, a girl missing a leg sat in a wheelchair, holding up a piece of embroidery. The six characters for Wanlong Hope Elementary School were stitched onto it, clearly showing a great deal of painstaking work.","\"Her name is Lin Xiuxiu, twelve years old. Her leg was crushed in the earthquake. She used to attend the village elementary school as a regular student, but because of her mobility issues, her father had to carry her to school on his back every day. Later, through some coordination, she was specially arranged a dorm room on the first floor.\"","\"She and the school teachers spent three months on this embroidery. She said she didn't know how else to thank us, and this was the only thing she knew how to do.\"","Liu Yutong looked at the girl's shy smile in the photo and remained silent for a long time.","Over at the mahjong table, the game had stopped at some point.","Li Xiaohui, Yu Xin, and Ma Da all gathered around, chattering as they looked at the letters and drawings.","\"These kids are so sensible and mature.\"","\"Everything we did was worth it.\"","\"This drawing is really pretty!\"","\"........\"","Just then, Ma Da stroked his chin and suddenly blurted out, \"You can tell these kids are very loyal. In the future, we should recruit them all into the Wanlong Society to learn boxing, study the law, join the underw... ahem... become courageous youths who stand up for justice!\"","Liu Yutong: \".......\"","Just as she opened her mouth to criticize Ma Da, Ma Da's phone suddenly rang.","After answering it, his expression instantly changed.","\"Send me the address, I'll bring people over right away!\""]},{"number":645,"title":"Chapter 645: 645. I'll Give You Two Choices","paragraphs":["\"Ma Da, what's wrong?\"","\"Zhang Tao is being targeted by a local gang boss in Zhoujia Village. Looks like a fight is going to break out.\" Ma Da briefly explained the situation to the crowd.","After hearing the whole story, everyone's temper immediately flared up.","\"Fuck them! What era is this, still playing such disgusting wedding hazing games!\"","\"How is Taozi doing now?\"","\"Miss, please give the order!\"","Yun Cheng raised his hand, and the living room instantly fell silent.","\"Don't rush, let the Miss speak.\"","Hearing this, everyone turned their eyes to Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong then slowly stood up and said, \"My rules are very simple. Those who dare to touch the people of the Wanlong Society, especially our family members, will meet only one end.\"","\"And that is to make sure they never see the sun again!\"","Ma Da immediately raised his hand, \"I'll go! Let me take the men this time!\"","Liu Yutong nodded, \"Know your limits!\"","There was no need for her to handle such a trivial matter personally. It was just a local street thug; having Ma Da lead a group there was more than enough.","Ma Da said, \"Miss, you can rest assured!\"","After saying that, he hurriedly left.","As soon as he reached the main gate, he took out his phone and made a call.","\"Call up... hmm... two hundred brothers. Get dressed, bring the gear, and assemble at the group's entrance in ten minutes.\"","\"Yes, Brother Ma!\"","Just as Ma Da got into a Mercedes-Benz, the underling in the passenger seat couldn't help but ask, a hint of excitement in his voice.","\"Brother Ma, did something happen?\"","In Mingzhu City, absolutely no one dared to provoke the Wanlong Society. The brothers hadn't been mobilized so urgently in a long time, and many were getting a bit rusty.","Now that men were suddenly being rallied, they were genuinely a little thrilled.","Ma Da replied, \"Zhang Tao got surrounded back in his hometown. The other side is trying to lay hands on him, his wife, and her family.\"","\"And what did the Miss say?\" the underling asked again.","\"The Miss... hmm... I think she said to make sure they never see tomorrow's sun?\" After Ma Da said this, he muttered in his heart: was that what she said?","Hearing this, the underling became even more excited. \"The Miss is the Miss, as fierce and decisive as ever!\"","Didn't that basically mean they were allowed to beat them half to death?","Ma Da said, \"Tell the brothers, it's fine to fight for the kills today, but don't go too far.\"","\"Yes, Brother Ma!\"","Soon, over forty black sedans were assembled. Counting the drivers, there were roughly over two hundred people.","Honestly, it wasn't that Ma Da insisted on making such a huge scene.","The main reason was that the Wanlong Society didn't have much business in the neighboring city. Aside from a few Wanhui Select stations and a couple of internet cafes, they had no other operations there.","The employees over there were just ordinary staff. They had no idea how much power Zhao Biao actually wielded. What if the other side called in a massive crowd?","Bringing more people was just a way to be prepared for anything.","Of course, precisely because it was unfamiliar territory, Liu Yutong also sent Zhao Tianyi along. In case they needed to deal with the local police, having a top lawyer like him step in would save a lot of trouble.","Once fully assembled, the long convoy drove straight onto the highway, speeding toward the neighboring city.","Seeing this spectacle, the toll booth worker who had been dozing off instantly woke up.","\"One, two, three... forty-four cars. Isn't this convoy a bit too long?\"","\"Who are these people?\"","\"They're from the Wanlong Society Group. In all of Mingzhu City, you won't find a second organization with this kind of pageantry.\"","\"Hiss... I have a feeling something huge is about to happen!\"","\"...\"","...","Zhoujia Village.","It was past eleven at night, and Zhao Biao was already growing impatient.","Zhang Tao and the other two Wanlong Society members hadn't been able to withstand the siege. They were all beaten black and blue, covered in injuries.","Zhou Juan'er and her parents had been locked inside the house by Zhang Tao, leaving them with nothing to do but worry helplessly.","Zhang Tao and the others had known all along that Zhao Biao would come for revenge. They just hadn't expected him to arrive so quickly, let alone bring over a hundred men. No matter how good the three of them were at fighting, they couldn't hold off an attack of this scale.","To prevent his wife and parents-in-law from getting hurt, Zhang Tao locked them in the house ahead of time, leaving only the three of them outside to face Zhao Biao and his mob.","Naturally, the result was that all three were taken down and restrained by the enemy.","Originally, Zhao Biao had been ready to cripple Zhang Tao. But when he heard that Zhang Tao's group had called for backup, he decided to stick around. He wanted to see exactly who these guys could summon on his turf.","If they dared to come, he would catch them all in one fell swoop.","It wasn't arrogance; it was the confidence he had built from running the streets of Qingniu Town and Huai City for over a decade.","If he ran away just because some out-of-towner threw a couple of threats his way, how could he still call himself a gangster?","He might as well just wash up and sell his body!","\"Brother Biao, it's been over an hour and their backup still isn't here. You don't think they were just bluffing, do you?\" one of the lackeys asked.","Zhao Biao frowned. He also felt something was off.","Logically, if they had really called people, they should have arrived by now.","\"Let's wait a little longer. If they don't dare to show up, we'll just cripple these three!\" Zhao Biao said viciously.","Just as he finished speaking, the roar of car engines suddenly echoed from the village entrance.","And it wasn't just one car.","Zhao Biao stood up abruptly and walked to the courtyard gate to look outside.","On the village road, dozens of cars were speeding toward them with their high beams on. It was a uniform fleet of black sedans, lined up like a long dragon. Their headlights illuminated the entire village road as brightly as day.","The convoy came to a halt outside the Zhou family courtyard.","The door of the first car opened, and a chubby young man wearing a custom black suit stepped out first.","Immediately after, the doors of the other cars opened almost simultaneously.","Slam! Slam! Slam!","One, two, ten, twenty... A dense crowd poured out, seemingly endless under the dark night sky.","Dressed entirely in matching black suits, they exuded an overwhelmingly dark and powerful aura that made the street thugs in the courtyard and on the road subconsciously take a step back.","\"Is this all of them?\"","Ma Da swept his gaze over the crowd. The other side had about a hundred people, fewer than the men he brought. Wasn't this just serving themselves up on a silver platter?","\"Which one of you is Zhao Biao?\"","Zhao Biao's expression finally changed. He had guessed that Zhang Tao might call in some people from the underworld, but he hadn't expected them to be this professional. The sheer oppressive presence was even stronger than the gangster movies he had watched.","\"Damn it, didn't you hear me? Who is Zhao Biao? Step forward!\" Ma Da demanded again.","Zhao Biao forced himself to stay calm and took a step forward. \"That's me. You all must be brothers from Mingzhu City, right? This whole thing is actually a misunderstanding. Zhang Tao threw the first punch. Just look at this wound on my head...\"","He chickened out! He was yielding!","He couldn't help it. Anyone would feel a chill down their spine seeing such a massive horde of men in black. Not to mention the endless convoy of Mercedes-Benz cars stretching out of sight, which clearly showed just how powerful the force behind this group truly was.","\"Did I ask you? Why are you spouting so much nonsense?!\" Ma Da interrupted him.","Zhao Biao choked on his words.","Seeing Zhang Tao and the other two being held by the enemy, Ma Da's tone grew even colder. \"I'll give you two choices. First, hand over everyone who laid a hand on them, break one of your own legs, and pay a million in medical fees. Then, this matter ends here.\"","\"Second, I'll choose for you!\""]},{"number":646,"title":"Chapter 646: 646, Taking Hostages","paragraphs":["Zhao Biao's face instantly turned incredibly gloomy.","Pay a million in compensation, and everyone has to break a leg? Could the doctors in town even handle that many patients?","Just tell me, could they?","Forget about the lackeys, why did he have to be included?","This was too much!","\"Brother, aren't you leaving absolutely no room for mercy? We have over a hundred brothers on our side too. If a real fight breaks out, you might not gain the upper hand.\"","Ma Da laughed, the flesh on his face trembling with the movement.","\"You're comparing numbers with me?\"","\"Clap, clap, clap!\" He clapped his hands.","Over two hundred men in black suits took a synchronized step forward, making the ground tremble slightly. That murderous aura made Zhao Biao's hundred-plus thugs involuntarily take a few steps back again.","Zhao Biao's heart completely sank to the bottom.","He could tell now, these people were definitely not ordinary gangsters. These guys were fucking professionals!","But the arrow was already on the bowstring; he had no choice but to shoot.","If he completely chickened out today and broke his own leg, he, Zhao Biao, would never be able to hold his head high in Qingniu Town again.","Zhao Biao abruptly turned around and roared at his thugs, \"Brothers, did you hear that? A bunch of outsiders want us to break our legs and pay them money. Tell me, can we agree to this?!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Huh???\"","\"Ah, no, I misspoke, it's no!\"","\"Right, no way!\"","\"Screw them!\"","\"What the hell are we afraid of? We have a lot of people too!\"","The thugs' ferocity was provoked, and they raised their clubs and machetes one after another.","They also noticed that although this group of men in black looked intimidating, they didn't carry any regulated weapons. Meanwhile, they had weapons in their own hands. Even if the other side had more people and looked professional, so what?","As soon as blood was drawn, this bunch of suit-wearing guys would probably wet their pants in fear!","In short, they wouldn't back down!","Zhao Biao looked at Ma Da again, \"Hear that? My brothers don't agree!\"","Ma Da sighed and shook his head, \"Then you've chosen the second path.\"","He took a step back, his tone instantly turning ice-cold, \"Clear the area!\"","As soon as his voice fell, the men in black moved.","The first row of men in black drew telescopic batons from their waists and flicked them open in unison, producing a sharp whistling sound that pierced the air.","The second row took riot shields from the cars and quickly formed a shield wall.","The third row, the fourth row... each row had a clear division of labor, and they even had personnel recording videos.","Zhao Biao's thugs were dumbfounded.","When they fought, they always just swarmed up and swung their weapons wildly. When had they ever seen a formation like this?","Were these guys even gangsters?","Anyone who didn't know better would think they were riot police wearing gangster skins.","\"Fuck, get them!\" Zhao Biao roared, bracing himself.","The thugs immediately howled and charged forward.","And then they learned what professional meant!","The shield wall blocked the first wave of impact. The batons struck out accurately from the gaps, specifically targeting joints and soft ribs. Screams rose one after another, and soon the thugs fell in droves like wheat being harvested.","The men in black covered each other in groups of a few, advancing at an extremely fast pace. In less than five minutes, more than half of the hundred-plus thugs inside and outside the courtyard had fallen.","Seeing this scene, Zhao Biao's face turned deathly pale, and cold sweat poured down.","He finally realized the severity of the problem. This group of men in black had real skills and came fully prepared!","He had to run!","As long as he could escape today, he would go into the city, call up all those big bosses he usually called brothers, and tell them that a group of outsider dragons had come to clear the area. After dealing with him, Zhao Biao, they would be next. He wanted to see if those bosses could still sit still.","When the time came, with several forces united, he didn't believe they wouldn't be able to deal with this group of men in black.","Thinking of this, a fierce light flashed in Zhao Biao's eyes. He abruptly turned around and lunged at Zhang Tao, who was being restrained by a few lackeys.","\"Everyone fucking stop!\"","Zhao Biao pulled a dagger from his waist and pressed it against Zhang Tao's neck, \"Move one more time, and I'll kill him!\"","Ma Da raised his hand, and the men in black stopped immediately.","Zhao Biao pressed the dagger slightly harder against Zhang Tao's neck, drawing a bloody line, \"Get back! Everyone get back! Make a path for me!\"","Ma Da narrowed his eyes, \"Zhao Biao, do you know what you're doing?\"","\"I know!\"","Zhao Biao roared hoarsely, \"I'm risking it all today! Step aside! Let us go! Otherwise, do not blame me for offing your brother!\"","Just as he finished speaking, a loud bang suddenly came from inside the house.","Bang!","The door was smashed open.","It turned out that during the chaos just now, two of Zhao Biao's lackeys saw things were going south, sneaked around to the back of the house, smashed the window, and climbed inside.","\"Brother Biao!\" A Baldy dragged Zhou Juan'er out from the house, also holding a knife in his hand. \"We have hostages!\"","Zhang Tao's father-in-law and mother-in-law were also dragged out, restrained by two other thugs.","Zhao Biao's eyes lit up. \"Good! Well done!\"","He looked at Ma Da and grinned hideously, \"How about now? I have four... no, six bargaining chips in my hands. Are you going to back off or not?!\"","Ma Da's face darkened.","He truly hadn't expected Zhao Biao's men to pull such a stunt, actually taking defenseless family members hostage.","Or rather, it was his first time seeing such shameless gangsters resorting to kidnapping.","In the past, those gang bosses they had taken down, which one of them didn't go to jail in a blaze of glory, or die in a blaze of glory?","Using the old, weak, women, and children as meat shields when driven into a corner like this was truly a first for him.","It seemed that in future operations, before ensuring the absolute safety of the hostages, they really shouldn't be too hasty to make a move.","Today served as a lesson for them.","\"Brother Ma, what do we do?\" a lackey in black behind him asked in a low voice.","\"Sigh, we were careless!\"","Ma Da looked at Zhao Biao. \"Let them go, and I'll let you leave.\"","\"Should have said that earlier, shouldn't you? You just had to force me to use a knife!\"","Zhao Biao said to his lackey, Baldy, \"Get the cars ready, we're pulling out!\"","Baldy nodded and signaled to the remaining thugs who could still move.","Soon, a few beat-up vans and Zhao Biao's BMW were driven over by them.","Ma Da could only watch helplessly as Zhao Biao and his men held Zhang Tao, Zhou Juan'er, and her family hostage, slowly inching toward the vehicles. At the same time, he was calculating their next moves in his mind. What if they still refused to let the hostages go after getting in the cars?","For a moment, he was completely caught in a dilemma.","If they forced an attack, the hostages might be in danger.","If they backed down, there might also be danger.","Right at this moment of stalemate.","The hostage, Zhang Tao, stared fixedly at the dagger Zhao Biao had pressed against his neck.","Then he looked at his wife Zhou Juan'er's terrified, tearful eyes, and the pale, frightened expressions of his father-in-law and mother-in-law.","No!","He couldn't just sit and wait for death!","Given Zhao Biao's vengeful and completely bottomless nature, once he got in the car and still didn't release them, their end would definitely be miserable.","He had only heard later that this guy was extremely petty and held deep grudges, so he couldn't gamble on the chance that the other party would show mercy out of fear of his brothers in the Wanlong Society.","Zhang Tao took a deep breath, forcing himself to calm down, his brain working rapidly.","He recalled the counter-attack techniques he had learned during the Wanlong Society's training. When held at knifepoint from behind, the key lay in the timing of the strike.","Right now, Zhao Biao's attention was entirely on Brother Ma. This was the perfect opportunity.","As one of the original brothers who had followed the eldest miss, Liu Yutong, Zhang Tao just had to twitch a muscle... well, no, Ma Da could guess exactly what he was about to do just from the look in his eyes.","Just as Zhao Biao edged toward the car door, Ma Da suddenly let out a loud shout.","\"Look! A spaceship!\"","Zhao Biao's nerves were already stretched completely taut. Startled by the sudden roar, he instinctively looked up.","At that very moment, Zhang Tao made his move.","He violently slammed his head backward, scoring a direct hit on Zhao Biao's face.","\"Ah!\" A sharp pain shot through Zhao Biao's nose as tears and blood gushed out simultaneously. His knife-wielding hand instinctively loosened.","In that split second, Zhang Tao grabbed Zhao Biao's knife-holding wrist with his right hand and gave it a vicious twist!","Crack!","The crisp sound of snapping wrist bones rang out!","The dagger slipped from his grasp.","Using the momentum, Zhang Tao spun around, slamming his left elbow fiercely into Zhao Biao's chest, while his right hand snatched the falling dagger out of midair.","All of this happened in the blink of an eye.","By the time the crowd reacted, Zhang Tao had already subdued Zhao Biao, the dagger pressed tightly against his throat.","\"Let them go!\"","Zhang Tao's voice was terrifyingly cold. \"Otherwise, I'll slit his throat right now!\"","The lackeys froze in place.","Zhao Biao's face twisted in agony, but what terrified him even more than the pain was the cold, piercing sensation at his throat.","Oh crap! I'm gonna die! I'm gonna die!","\"Hubby!\" Zhou Juan'er cried out in tears.","\"Release them! Don't make me say it twice!\" Zhang Tao applied pressure. The blade pierced the skin, and beads of blood immediately seeped out.","Zhao Biao was scared out of his wits. \"Let them go! Let them go! Hurry up and let them go!\"","The lackeys holding the hostages hesitated.","Zhao Biao grew desperate. \"Screw your ancestors! If you don't let them go, and I manage to survive today, I'll definitely kill your entire families when I get back! Hurry up and release them!\"","Zhao Biao's intimidation factor in the local area was still quite strong. Everyone knew he was extremely petty and would seek revenge for the slightest grievance.","Although this group of men in black was formidable, they probably wouldn't actually kill anyone. Most likely, Zhao Biao would just get a severe beating from them and spend a few months in the hospital. Once he was discharged, he would definitely deal with anyone who hadn't listened to his orders.","Thinking of this, the lackeys released the hostages one after another.","Ma Da seized the opportunity and waved his hand. \"Get them!\"","The men in black pounced forward like fierce beasts!"]},{"number":647,"title":"Chapter 647: 647, It's really getting real.","paragraphs":["Just as the men from the Wanlong Syndicate rushed forward.","To everyone's surprise, the bald thug holding Zhou Juan'er hostage did not let go. Instead, he was provoked into a desperado-like ferocity, a look of near-crazed ruthlessness flashing in his eyes.","\"Don't fucking move! Whoever takes another step, I'll chop her up first!\"","\"Boss! We can't just surrender without a fight. I know who these people are, we'll die!\"","With that, he suddenly raised the machete in his hand, making as if to slash the arm of the woman in front of him. He was clearly trying to use this extreme method to force the crowd back and buy himself a chance to escape.","His actions seemed utterly foolish to the onlookers, completely disregarding his own boss's life.","But only he himself knew that he absolutely could not fall into the hands of these men in black.","Because he had spent time in Mingzhu City and knew that these men in black were in cahoots with the cops over there. Once caught by them, he would truly be finished.","He was one of the fugitives on the run from the Mingzhu City arson case early last year, and he even had a murder charge on his back. To evade the police, he didn't hesitate to shave his head bald and get a tattoo on his face, managing to escape capture through this disguise.","Later, because he was a fierce fighter, he started running with Zhao Biao in this small town.","This was why, while the other thugs chose to obediently release their hostages, only he chose to resist to the bitter end.","Of course, no one present knew about this past except him, including Ma Da and his men.","\"Wife!\" Zhang Tao's eyes nearly popped out of his head when he saw this.","He shoved Zhao Biao aside and threw himself forward without a second thought.","Zhao Biao was pushed to the ground. Struggling to his feet, perhaps because his underling's words had sparked his own violent nature, he suddenly scrambled up and rammed into Zhang Tao from the side.","\"You want to kill me? I'll fucking kill you first!\"","Zhang Tao's entire attention was focused on the bald man and Zhou Juan'er, completely unaware of the attack from the side.","Bang!","Zhao Biao crashed heavily into Zhang Tao's ribs.","The massive impact threw Zhang Tao off balance, making him stumble and fall forward to the right, his right hand still gripping the dagger he had snatched from Zhao Biao.","In the moment of his fall, Zhang Tao instinctively held the dagger across his chest. After knocking Zhang Tao down, Zhao Biao continued lunging forward due to momentum, diving right toward where Zhang Tao was falling.","Thwack!","The sound of a blade piercing flesh!","Zhao Biao's eyes suddenly widened. He lowered his head in disbelief, looking at the dagger buried in his own chest, before his body went limp, pinning Zhang Tao underneath him.","On the other side.","Just as the bald man's machete was about to fall on Zhou Juan'er, a massive fist carrying a fierce gust of wind struck toward him.","Clang!!!","The fist smashed against the flat of the blade, emitting a harsh screech of deforming metal. The machete's blade actually caved in abruptly, and the sheer force sent the bald man flying backward.","Crash!!!","The bald thug slammed heavily into the brick wall behind him, instantly passing out. The machete clattered to the side, its blade completely bent and mangled.","Ji Yu pulled back his fist and looked at Ma Da: \"It's handled!\"","\"Badass!\" Ma Da gave Ji Yu a thumbs-up.","\"Quick! Save them!\"","Several men in black quickly stepped forward, shielding Zhou Juan'er and her parents, and swiftly escorted them away from the scene.","After completely securing the scene, Ma Da finally walked over toward Zhang Tao.","When he saw that Zhang Tao was still lying on the ground, he laughed and scolded, \"Taozi, why are you playing dead? Hurry up and get up, your wife is fine now.\"","\"Stop lying there.\" He gave Zhang Tao a light kick.","But when Ma Da saw Zhang Tao's increasingly pale face, his smile gradually faded.","He shoved Zhao Biao off of Zhang Tao. A dagger was starkly embedded in Zhao Biao's chest, blood gushing out, staining Zhang Tao's clothes red and pooling onto the ground.","\"Fuck!\" Ma Da's expression changed, and he crouched down for a closer look.","Zhao Biao's eyes were half-open, his pupils already beginning to dilate. He opened his mouth as if trying to say something, but only bloody froth spilled from his lips.","A few seconds later, the last rise and fall of his chest stopped.","He was dead!","Ma Da sharply looked up at Zhang Tao: \"What happened?\"","Zhang Tao propped himself up, caught his breath, and explained what had occurred: \"He just rammed into me from the side. I fell down, and then the knife just went in...\"","Ma Da took a deep breath, stood up, and looked at the people around them.","The men in black had already restrained all the thugs, but whether it was their own people or the gang members, many had witnessed the scene.","\"Listen up, everyone. From now on, nobody says a word out of turn!\"","\"Call Lawyer Zhao over here.\"","\"Yes, Brother Ma!\"","After Zhang Tao regained his senses, he asked with lingering fear, \"Brother Ma... am I going to be thrown in the slammer?\"","In the outside world, there were always rumors that the Wanlong Syndicate was ruthless and had even killed many people, but the true core members knew clearly that they had never done such things.","Those were all slanders and rumors from outsiders.","This time, Zhang Tao had genuinely killed someone for the first time, even though it was an accident.","Ma Da patted his shoulder: \"Don't overthink it. Zhao Biao kidnapped and attacked you first. This is self-defense. When Lawyer Zhao gets here, he'll handle it.\"","Despite saying this, he knew in his heart that once someone died, things became complicated.","To his knowledge, there seemed to be no precedent in the country for self-defense resulting in death without bearing any responsibility. Zhang Tao would likely have to go to prison for a while.","Thinking of this, he felt somewhat irritated. What a mess this was!","A joyous day had turned into this.","This was absolutely his most failed operation as a team leader. How was he supposed to explain this to the young miss later!","Soon, Zhao Tianyi arrived in a hurry.","After taking a look at the scene, he asked nothing and directly started making arrangements.","\"First, preserve the scene exactly as it is. Do not move anything.\"","\"Second, everyone hand over your phones, including our own people.\"","\"Third, immediately go and screen the observing villagers to stop them from calling the police. If anyone reports this, it must be us.\"","He had a reason for this third arrangement; it was to prevent the villagers, who might not have seen the full context, from spouting nonsense to the cops. For instance, if they claimed two gangs got into a brawl that resulted in a death, that would be troublesome.","Instead, if they called the police themselves, they could report the situation more accurately—that they had acted courageously to save people, rather than simply engaging in an illegal gang fight. Setting the narrative early would save a lot of trouble.","After making the arrangements, Zhao Tianyi finally looked at the groom sitting on the ground, covered in blood.","To be honest, he really felt that Zhang Tao was too unlucky, running into such a disaster on his wedding day.","\"Zhang Tao, tell me the detailed sequence of events again.\"","Zhang Tao recounted the whole incident once more, including the detail of how Zhao Biao collided with the dagger.","After listening to Zhang Tao's statement, Zhao Tianyi's face showed not a ripple of emotion. He pushed up his gold-rimmed glasses and began to meticulously inspect the scene like a detective."]},{"number":648,"title":"Chapter 648: 648, The Details of a Great Lawyer","paragraphs":["\"Camera crew, take comprehensive photos. Start from the doorway and move clockwise, establishing a shooting angle every two meters.\"","\"Pay special attention to the blood spatter patterns, the distribution of footprints, and the locations of dropped items. Take close-up shots of every single drop of blood on the ground; do not miss anything.\"","Several men in black immediately took out professional cameras and began photographing methodically according to the instructions. Not only did they show no fear, but they were actually faintly excited.","This was all valuable experience!","Zhao Tianyi himself walked over to Zhao Biao's corpse and crouched down. He took a pair of gloves from the investigation kit he carried with him and put them on with practiced ease. His posture made him look less like a lawyer and more like an experienced forensic doctor.","Seeing that he even had this kind of professional equipment, Ma Da was absolutely stunned.","\"Lawyer Zhao, when did you get your hands on this stuff?\"","Zhao Tianyi: \"I've been watching a lot of homicide TV shows lately. I thought it was pretty interesting, so I prepared a set. I didn't expect to actually use it today.\"","Ma Da: \"...\"","\"Professional!\"","Zhao Tianyi looked up at Ma Da. \"Brother Ma, please have someone turn on all the lights in the courtyard. The brighter, the better. Also, find two clean white cloths and lay them out on the side; I need them to place the physical evidence.\"","Ma Da immediately gave the orders.","He even brought in two cars and turned on their high beams, shining them directly into the courtyard. In an instant, the entire yard was as bright as day.","The white cloths were also quickly found and laid out.","Zhao Tianyi first examined the fracture on Zhao Biao's wrist. He used a tape measure to carefully measure the distance from the fracture to the end of the palm, and then measured the wrist circumference.","\"The width of the purlicue is 3.9 centimeters. Take a close-up.\"","One of the men in black responsible for photography immediately stepped forward and took a localized close-up.","\"Zhang Tao, when you grabbed the knife, how did you hold it?\" Zhao Tianyi turned his head and asked Zhang Tao.","Zhang Tao recalled, \"At that time, I headbutted him in the bridge of his nose with the back of my head, took the opportunity to grab his wrist and twist it outward, and then used my other hand to grab the knife...\"","He roughly described the process.","\"When you grabbed the knife, how did your hand grip the handle?\" Zhao Tianyi asked again.","\"Just... gripped it directly like this.\" Zhang Tao gestured.","Zhao Tianyi shook his head. \"No, if you gripped it directly, your fingerprints would cover Zhao Biao's fingerprints. But look here.\"","He shone a strong flashlight on the dagger's handle. At a certain angle, faint ridges could be seen. \"There are at least two sets of overlapping fingerprints on the handle. One set is complete, and the other is incomplete.\"","Then he took out fingerprint powder and transparent tape from the kit, carefully processing the dagger's handle.","A few minutes later, he used the tape to lift the two sets of fingerprints and stuck them onto transparent cards.","\"The first set of fingerprints is complete and covers the entire handle. This is characteristic of holding it for a long time.\"","Zhao Tianyi held up the card for Zhang Tao to see. \"These are Zhao Biao's. The second set of fingerprints is only at the end of the handle, and there are sliding marks. These were left by your brief contact when you snatched the knife.\"","\"Now, perform the action of snatching the knife again, exactly as I tell you.\"","Zhang Tao was a bit bewildered, but he did as told.","Zhao Tianyi carefully observed the details of his movements.","\"Note that when you grab the knife, your thumb is here, and your index finger is here... Yes, exactly like that.\"","\"This grip perfectly explains why your fingerprints are only at the end. Because you pulled the knife out of Zhao Biao's hand, rather than gripping it.\"","\"What's the use of saying this?\" Ma Da asked curiously.","\"Details determine success or failure. A simple difference in movement can deduce whether the action was an active attack or passive defense. We have to be fully prepared. This way, when we go to court in the future, I will have a stronger basis for my defense,\" Zhao Tianyi explained.","Ma Da nodded, half-understanding. \"Oh, so that's how it is!\"","Zhao Tianyi could tell he was pretending to understand, but there was no time to explain in detail now. It was more important to hurry up and collect favorable evidence. Even if they had video evidence that could basically prove Zhang Tao acted in self-defense, once someone died, things were no longer that simple.","Even if it was ruled as self-defense, there was still a high probability that Zhang Tao would be convicted of excessive defense.","After all, someone had died, and there had never been a precedent where someone was completely exempted from criminal responsibility for causing death through self-defense.","Therefore, it was highly likely that Zhang Tao would still go to prison.","Of course, he was confident he could fight for probation, but he didn't want that result.","Self-defense was self-defense; the defender shouldn't be held responsible just because the aggressor died.","He wanted to use this opportunity to break history! He wanted to be a trailblazer!","He wanted to show the Eldest Miss the results of his long training. He wanted to achieve fame in a single battle and shake the entire legal world!","Now the opportunity was here!","Before the police arrived, he had to race against time, grasp all the details of the incident, and prepare for this unprecedented defense.","\"The insertion angle of the dagger is about 25 degrees, slanting upward from below. The edges of the wound are neat, with no drag or cut marks.\"","\"Zhang Tao, when you fell, the dagger was held horizontally across your chest, with the tip pointing outward, right?\"","\"When Zhao Biao crashed into you, if you had actively stabbed him, the wound should be horizontal or slightly downward. But this 25-degree upward angle could only mean that Zhao Biao pounced down from above and impaled himself on the blade.\"","\"...\"","After Zhao Tianyi had pretty much sorted things out, he ran to an empty space away from the crime scene, drew a few lines on the ground with chalk, and began to reconstruct the scene while muttering to himself.","\"This is Zhang Tao's falling trajectory.\"","\"This is Zhao Biao's impact trajectory. The two lines intersect here, which is exactly where Zhao Biao fell to the ground.\"","Then he casually had someone find two wine boxes and used them as character models.","\"Let's assume this is Boss Zhang, and this is Zhao Biao.\"","When the two models collided, the prop dagger accurately inserted into Zhao Biao's chest, and the angle was exactly 25 degrees upward.","\"See that?\"","Zhao Tianyi said to Ma Da, \"This angle, this position, is a one hundred percent match for the characteristics of an impact injury. If it were an active stab, the angle of the wound would be completely different.\"","Everyone at the scene was dumbfounded. Did he really need to be this detailed?!","Also, how the hell was this guy a lawyer? He was practically a criminal investigation expert!","Subsequently, Zhao Tianyi looked at the thugs who had been restrained and began his questioning.","\"Now, I'm going to start asking questions.\"","\"Separate these people so they can't hear each other. When I ask questions, you guys record audio and video on the side.\"","A group of thugs were taken to different corners. These were the true eyewitnesses selected by Zhao Tianyi, and he interrogated them one by one.","\"Name?\"","\"Wang... Wang Ba.\"","\"??? Are you messing with me?\"","\"I... My name really is Wang Ba! 'Ba' as in honest and simple! I'm not lying!\" the questioned thug hurriedly explained.","\"...\"","\"Nice name.\"","\"Why did you come to the Zhou family's house tonight?\"","\"Brother Biao told us to come.\"","\"To do what?\"","\"To... to crash the wedding night... No, to teach the bride and groom's family a lesson.\"","\"...\"","\"How did Zhao Biao die?\"","\"He was... stabbed to death by him.\"","\"The specific process?\"","\"Brother Biao ran into... no, Brother Biao tried to attack him, and then... then he died.\"","\"Are you sure?\"","\"I'm sure.\"","\"...\"","After Zhao Tianyi finished questioning everyone one by one, he had someone turn off the recording.","\"Good, now we just wait for the police to arrive. My preliminary work here is basically done.\"","He had questioned more than twenty people in total, and every single response had been captured on video and audio.","Moreover, the testimonies of these thugs were largely consistent: Zhao Biao attacked Zhang Tao, tripped, and accidentally impaled himself on the dagger.","\"Aren't you worried they'll change their statements later?\" Ma Da asked curiously.","\"Human memory has a way of correcting itself. When they saw Zhao Biao die, their instinct was to blame it on his own mistakes. It is a psychological defense mechanism. I used a specific technique during the questioning just now to subconsciously solidify this version of events in their minds. Even if a few of these guys try to change their stories later, the vast majority definitely won't do so easily. When the time comes, the testimonies of those dissenting few will be rendered invalid...\"","Zhao Tianyi pushed up his glasses. \"In short, I'm on the case, so you can all rest easy!\""]},{"number":649,"title":"Chapter 649: 649, Caught a Big Fish","paragraphs":["While Zhao Tianyi was making his preparations, the men in black from the Wanlong Society were also going door-to-door conducting their so-called inspections.","Thump, thump, thump.","Open up, folks! We're from the Wanlong Society, here to spread some warmth and care.","We're really the good guys!","...","Zhou Juan'er's family and the surrounding villagers almost all received this warmth. In reality, it was just a hundred bucks handed to each household as a token of apology for the disturbance.","It wasn't exactly bribery; it was mainly an excuse to check if anyone had secretly called the police.","After confirming that no one had called the cops, they pretty much packed up and withdrew.","Once they were gone, the villagers, who had just been scared out of their wits, finally dared to whisper among themselves.","Are... are they gone?","They're gone. They all headed back toward Zhou Juan'er's place.","Oh my god, I was scared to death. That massive crowd of men in black looked like the mafia descending on our village. When they knocked on my door, my legs turned to jelly. I thought they were here to raid my house.","Exactly! And they even claimed to be a law-abiding business. Do you believe that? What kind of law-abiding business goes out with hundreds of thugs in black suits?","It was terrifying!","They just gave out money. Did you guys get any?","Yeah, a hundred bucks.","What is this about? Is it hush money?","It's definitely hush money. By taking this money, whatever we saw or heard tonight has to rot in our stomachs. Otherwise... heh. The villager speaking made a throat-slitting gesture.","Oh man, hearing you say that makes me even more scared!","Then can we even spend this money?","Spend it, why wouldn't we? If we don't spend it, they definitely won't feel at ease. Anyway, we have to take tonight's incident to our graves. Just pretend we never saw Zhao Biao come here.","Zhao Biao? Who is Zhao Biao? Never heard of him.","Damn, you guys catch on fast! It makes me feel a bit out of place.","Hey, what do you think will happen to Zhao Biao and his gang?","I don't know, and we wouldn't dare go over to look. They'll probably get a severe beating. That group of men in black looks way more formidable than Zhao Biao.","It's good to teach him a lesson. Let Zhao Biao know that there's always someone tougher out there, so he won't be so arrogant in the future.","...","While the villagers were still guessing how badly Zhao Biao would be beaten, little did they know that Zhao Biao's corpse was already turning stiff.","Because the village was in a somewhat remote location, and it was late at night, it would take at least half an hour for the police from the town and city to arrive.","Ma Da also took advantage of this gap to have someone deliver a flurry of punches to that bald lackey—the guy who had almost chopped off one of Zhou Juan'er's arms.","After being beaten up, not only did this guy not yield, but he actually burst into loud laughter.","What the hell are you laughing at!","Ma Da unleashed a wild flurry of punches onto the special vest worn by the guy. Wataa!","You got me chewed out by the Young Lady, and you're still laughing!","Wataa! Wataa!","...","Finally tired from beating him, Ma Da stopped. Are you still going to laugh?","The bald lackey instinctively prepared to keep laughing.","Furious, Ma Da looked behind him. Ji Yu, get over here!","The bald lackey's face instantly changed, and he hurriedly begged for mercy. I was wrong! I was wrong! I was wrong! I won't laugh anymore!","He had already taken a punch from that giant earlier. To be honest, if he hadn't blocked it with the machete in his hand, he probably would have gone to see his great-grandmother by now.","He had never seen such a terrifying person.","But it was too late to beg for mercy now.","Watching that fist, which was about the size of his own head, swing toward him, he felt as if he could see his great-grandmother waving at him from heaven, smiling and saying:","Come here, my sweet grandson. Great-grandma will take you to a good place.","Snapping back to reality, he immediately shouted, I have information! I have information! Don't hit me!","Hearing this, Ma Da immediately called for a halt. Ji Yu, stop!","Ji Yu's reaction was half a beat slow, and he couldn't quite brake his fist in time. However, he ultimately managed to forcefully change its direction, smashing it into the wall right next to the bald lackey.","Bang!","A hole was instantly smashed into the wall.","Cold sweat instantly poured down the forehead of the bald lackey, who was still wearing the strike-resistant vest.","Just a little bit more, and he would have been done for.","Ma Da said, Speak. What information?","He didn't actually think this guy could spit out anything valuable; it was most likely just nonsense spouted out of the fear of death.","But with the mindset of not wanting to miss out on anything, he still gave the other party a chance.","The bald lackey said, If I tell you, you have to let me go. I promise to keep my mouth shut about everything tonight.","Ma Da replied, You have no right to bargain with me. If you don't speak, my brother's next punch won't miss.","The bald lackey steeled his heart and stiffened his neck. Then just beat me to death. I'll die even if I tell you anyway.","Ma Da stared at him for a few seconds, carefully observing the expression on his face. Seeing that he didn't seem to be lying, he relented slightly. I'll give you one chance. As long as what you say is valuable, I can let you go.","The bald thug closed his eyes and took a deep breath. When he opened them again, he said, Early last year, the mastermind behind that massive fire in Pearl City was Zhao Weixiang. I was just the muscle, took a little money...","Ma Da: ???","Good heavens!","They had caught a big fish!","No wonder the other thugs had obediently released their hostages while this guy tried to resist. It turned out he had a major crime hanging over his head.","The bald thug explained the general situation, including which country Zhao Weixiang was currently living it up in. Zhao Weixiang hadn't hidden this fact, as the place he was staying had no extradition treaty.","As for how he knew Zhao Weixiang was there, it was because the man had recently contacted him via instant messaging, wanting to orchestrate another attack on Liu Yutong. Whether it succeeded or not, Zhao promised to arrange a way to smuggle him out of the country.","Now, he had spilled everything.","Of course, he didn't breathe a single word about the fact that he had blood on his own hands.","After finishing his confession, the bald thug looked at Ma Da. Is what I said valuable enough? You just said you would let me go, right? I promise I will never appear in Pearl City again, nor in Huai City. I will hide far, far away and never cross you again.","Ma Da suddenly laughed. When I, Ma Da, speak, my word is my bond. I said I would let you go, so I will let you go.","The bald thug's eyes lit up, instantly overcome with excitement. He could finally leave. If he didn't leave now, once the cops arrived on the scene, he would truly be finished.","Suddenly, Ma Da changed his tune. However, I am not letting you go right now. I will release you after we take you to a safe place.","The bald thug panicked. You are going back on your word!","Ma Da couldn't be bothered to waste breath on him. Take him away!","Immediately, two subordinates restrained him, shoved him directly into a car, and left the convoy ahead of time, driving toward Pearl City.","Ma Da indeed hadn't broken his promise to let him go. He was just going to release him into the hands of a certain eldest young lady.","A few minutes later, the sound of police sirens echoed from the village entrance.","Zhao Tianyi gave the collar of his suit one last adjustment and ordered his men to gather all the compiled videos and other evidence. Watching the approaching police cars, he uttered a single sentence:","They are here. My turn begins!"]},{"number":650,"title":"Chapter 650: 650, The Locust City Has Grown Dark","paragraphs":["Past midnight, Zhoujia Village was still brightly lit.","The officers and the leading sergeant from the Qingniu Town precinct first carefully inspected the crime scene, then looked at the dense crowd of men dressed in black standing before them.","Even as law enforcers, the sight sent a chill down their spines.","Just what was the background of these men in black?","They had never heard of such a dark underworld syndicate in Huai City. Anyone who didn't know better would think they had stumbled onto the set of the movie Kung Fu Hustle, as if the notorious Axe Gang had risen from the ashes.","After waiting a little longer, the sergeant finally breathed a sigh of relief when an officer reported that the police from the city precinct had arrived.","A case of this magnitude was definitely beyond the jurisdiction of their town-level precinct. With the city police here, he could hand it over and be free of this immense pressure.","Five police cars arrived from the city, dropping off about twenty officers. Leading them was a detective from the criminal division, Inspector Li. He was around forty, with a buzz cut and eagle-like eyes, exuding a resolute and no-nonsense aura.","\"Is the scene secured?\" Inspector Li asked, his voice icy.","\"We've locked it down according to protocol, and all involved parties are still here. However, Inspector Li, the deceased, Zhao Biao, is a well-known local entrepreneur,\" the Qingniu Town sergeant replied.","\"I don't need to know who the deceased is right now. I just want to know who offed him, and how.\"","Inspector Li glanced at the crowd of men in black, frowning slightly.","He thought to himself: These people are too arrogant. They actually killed someone, didn't flee, and even dared to call the police themselves.","After getting a rough understanding of the situation, he looked at Zhang Tao, who was covered in blood.","\"Cuff him!\" Inspector Li ordered.","Two officers immediately stepped forward to do so.","Just then, Zhao Tianyi took a step forward, blocking their way. \"Hold on a moment, Inspector.\"","As he spoke, he pulled out his ID. \"I am Zhang Tao's lawyer, Zhao Tianyi. Before you take any coercive measures against my client, I have a few questions regarding legal procedures that need to be confirmed.\"","Inspector Li narrowed his eyes. \"Speak!\"","Completely unfazed by his sharp gaze, Zhao Tianyi pushed up his gold-rimmed glasses and said, \"First, I want to confirm if my client has shown any obvious signs of fleeing, committing suicide, or destroying evidence?\"","\"Not at the moment.\"","\"Second, has the preliminary investigation of this case been completed, and is there sufficient evidence to prove that my client is suspected of a crime?\"","\"There's a knife stuck in his chest and the man is dead. Is that not enough?\"","\"No, it's not. There needs to be a complete chain of causality to link the resulting death with criminal responsibility.\"","\"Third, and most importantly, according to the Criminal Procedure Law, if you believe an arrested person needs to be formally charged, you must submit a request to the prosecutor's office for review and approval within three days of detention. Under special circumstances, this can be extended by one to four days.\"","\"I am now formally stating that if you intend to detain my client, I demand a meeting arranged within twenty-four hours, and I expect to see the complete evidentiary materials for the arrest request within three days. Otherwise, I will file an application for case supervision with the investigative oversight department of the Supervisory Bureau.\"","Inspector Li's face darkened.","This lawyer didn't seem like he was here to follow standard procedures; rather, it felt like he was here to flip the table.","On the surface, not only did the lawyer not plead for leniency, he even gave the illusion that he was more eager to have his client arrested than the police were.","In reality, this was a preemptive strike. It was a disguised way of telling him that this matter had to be handled strictly by the book, not by their usual policing habits.","In particular, the lawyer's demands for a meeting within 24 hours and access to evidence within 3 days were all within legal bounds, designed to buy time and gather information for the subsequent defense.","This way, the opposing side would immediately know exactly what charges the police intended to use to send Zhang Tao to the prosecutor's office, allowing them to prepare a counter-strategy in advance.","Inspector Li became even more certain that this group of men in black was no ordinary bunch. The lawyer they hired was highly skilled.","However, did they really think they could escape the sanctions of the law just like this?","\"Lawyer Zhao, are you threatening me?\"","\"I am merely upholding the legal rights granted to my client by the law.\"","Zhao Tianyi said, \"You can go ahead with your evidence collection and investigation for now. We can talk after you're done. Oh, by the way, we also have some video evidence on hand that we can provide to you.\"","There were no security cameras installed in the village. Unlike in later years when surveillance was everywhere, the video evidence they provided was particularly crucial.","Of course, the video was a copy.","At the same time, Zhao Tianyi gave a brief recount of what had happened.","To Inspector Li's ears, it could only be described in one word: professional!","\"Lawyer Zhao, have you worked in criminal investigation before?\"","\"Self-taught.\"","Zhao Tianyi replied, \"Inspector Li, I know you rely on evidence when handling cases. You've roughly seen the evidence by now. Furthermore, there are two to three hundred people at the scene who can testify that Zhao Biao's gang broke in with weapons first, took hostages first, and attacked first.\"","\"This evidence is sufficient to support a preliminary judgment of self-defense. If you now criminally detain Zhang Tao under the pretext of intentional injury leading to death or any other charge, you would be making a presumption of guilt against a defender under circumstances where the evidence is clearly questionable. I suggest you think this through carefully.\"","His words carried heavy weight.","So heavy that the entire courtyard fell silent.","A young officer behind Inspector Li couldn't help but speak up. \"Lawyer Zhao, what do you mean by that? It's not up to you to decide what charges we use!\"","\"Xiao Chen.\"","Inspector Li stopped him and took a deep look at Zhao Tianyi. \"Fine, we'll do this by the book. Zhang Tao, you are now verbally summoned to the police station to cooperate with the investigation. This is not a detention. Your lawyer may accompany you, but everyone else will be taken back for statements. Anyone suspected of a crime will be detained accordingly.\"","Zhao Tianyi: \"I also demand that the entire process be audio and video recorded, and that I be allowed to supervise and document the interrogation.\"","Inspector Li: \"Approved.\"","The two men, originally standing in opposition, unexpectedly shook hands in tacit understanding. To an outsider, it would look as though they had some sort of special relationship.","Only they knew that they had met their match and needed to take each other seriously.","If the other party were just some petty lawyer, Inspector Li wouldn't have bothered with him. But given the current posture, he didn't dare show the slightest negligence.","Likewise, from just this one encounter, Zhao Tianyi realized that Inspector Li was an experienced veteran detective who would not be easy to deal with.","What they didn't know was that this handshake was witnessed by a neighbor peeking from the second floor across the courtyard.","The neighbor even saw the men in black actively helping the cops escort away the lackeys Zhao Biao had brought, leaving them utterly shocked.","Once the convoy had completely departed and the entrance to Zhou Juan'er's house fell completely silent, the nearby villagers, unable to sleep, gathered around and began chattering all at once.","\"I don't know if you guys saw it, but I sure did. The lead cop just shook hands with that man in black wearing glasses.\"","\"Holy crap! Are you serious?\"","\"They really did, and they shook hands several times too.\"","\"What does this mean? Are the cops in cahoots with these guys?\"","\"Don't you get it yet? Zhao Biao was tough enough around here, right? But he was wiped out just like that. When the cops showed up, not only did they not arrest those men in black, but they even shook hands with them politely. What does that tell you?\"","\"It tells us that these guys in black have a much bigger background than Zhao Biao.\"","\"Zhao Biao was just a local thug, only good for bullying us. Look at these guys, look at their lineup and their composure. They killed a man and didn't even run. Even the cops had to play by their rules when they arrived. Could they be just your average gangsters?\"","\"No wonder they gave us a hundred bucks. That wasn't just hush money; that was money to buy our lives. It means take the cash, keep your mouths shut tight, and pretend we saw nothing tonight. Zhao Biao died on his own.\"","\"Zhao Biao really hit a brick wall this time. Not only did it cost him his life, but does this mean everything in our village is about to change? With these guys backing Juan'er's family from now on, who would dare cross them?\"","\"We'd better be polite when we see Juan'er's man in the future, or we'll be in deep trouble! Just think about what happened to Zhao Biao.\"","\"Say no more. Tomorrow I'm using this hundred bucks to buy some gifts and taking them over to Juan'er's place.\"","\"I'm going too. I wouldn't feel right spending this money on myself.\"","\".........\"","The group practically came to a unanimous agreement, just waiting for the Zhou family to return tomorrow so they could show up at their door with gifts in hand.","Excuses were easy enough to find. As neighbors, after such a huge incident, it was only natural to show some concern, wasn't it?","As the saying goes, a close neighbor is better than a distant relative! Round it up, and they were practically family!","Seeing so many people eager to curry favor with the Zhou family, someone couldn't help but sigh, \"Things in Qingniu Town, no, probably all of Huai City, are about to change. And from the looks of it, it's going to be much darker than Zhao Biao's reign!\""]},{"number":651,"title":"Chapter 651: 651、Then just cut the Gordian knot","paragraphs":["Mingzhu City, Duan Village.","As the New Year approached, she had specially prepared a holiday gift for the elderly villagers over the age of sixty. In addition to rice, flour, and cooking oil, each senior also received an extra New Year red envelope containing one thousand yuan.","“Yutong is such a good child, she always keeps her hometown in her heart!”","“Isn't that the truth? She's made a name for herself out there, yet she still remembers us old bones. She's much better than my own children, who I don't even see once a year.”","“This girl has been kind-hearted since she was little. She's beautiful, and her heart is even more impeccable.”","“The Liu family's granddaughter is truly successful! And so righteous! Our entire Duan Village shares in her glory!”","“Accountant Liu is so blessed!”","“...”","The small square in the village was packed with people, everyone talking at once as they praised Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong's grandparents also had glowing, red faces. Having such a successful granddaughter made them walk with their backs completely straight wherever they went.","Now, let alone the town leaders, even the city leaders who came down to the countryside would make a special trip to sit in their home, politely chatting with Old Mr. Liu, their words full of admiration for Liu Yutong.","Liu Chengjiang truly felt that his old bones had somehow become younger and more energetic.","Just as Liu Yutong was handing out red envelopes to the villagers one by one, her phone rang. It was Zhao Tianyi calling.","“Miss, I have already intervened on this end. Procedurally speaking, there are no problems for now. Zhang Tao is currently cooperating with the investigation and has not been criminally detained. This is one of the best scenarios we anticipated.”","“However, the wind in Huaicheng seems a bit off lately. Someone has put pressure on the police department there, leaning towards classifying the case as intentional injury causing death, or even intentional homicide. The pressure is significant; it doesn't look like something an ordinary person could pull off.”","“So, Zhao Biao's connections are very strong?”","“From the information we've gathered so far, Zhao Biao seems to be the son-in-law of a certain representative in Huaicheng. The other party has been operating locally for many years and has strong influence.”","“Then what support do you need?”","“Just in case, I hope to borrow your Weibo platform to mobilize public opinion and gain more initiative for us.”","“Actually, besides Zhang Tao's case, our law firm has received two other cases where people were found guilty despite deaths resulting from justifiable self-defense. It's just that those two cases happened a while ago. The families refused to accept the verdicts and always wanted to appeal, but they hit a wall with many law firms. I want to use Zhang Tao's case to thoroughly bring the standards for determining justifiable self-defense to the table for public discussion.”","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and said, “That's fine, but I will have someone moderately guide and control the direction of public opinion. We cannot let it spiral out of control and turn into pure incitement.”","Zhao Tianyi quickly replied, “I understand!”","Just as she hung up the phone, a panting voice rang out behind Liu Yutong.","“M-Miss! I... I have a situation to report!”","Liu Yutong turned around and saw Ma Da, covered in sweat, holding his knees and gasping for air. She couldn't help but be taken aback. “Ma Da? Why did you run all the way here?”","“I... I ran here.” Ma Da said, out of breath.","“You ran here?” Liu Yutong was surprised.","Ma Da took several more deep breaths before he barely managed to catch his breath. “M-Miss! I have deeply realized my mistake. I ran... ran all the way from Mingzhu City. Along the way, I even did thirty-six good deeds and helped eighty old grandmas cross the street. Of course, some of the streets were the same one, and the old grandma was the same one too. She insisted I looked like her grandson and forced me to help her cross again...”","Liu Yutong: “...”","Are you just picking a fight with an old lady?","Liu Yutong could also roughly guess why Ma Da was doing this.","Because he had failed in his duties, Liu Yutong had punished him by ordering him to lose ten pounds within half a month.","This guy actually ran straight from Mingzhu City. As for whether he truly ran the whole way or just got out of a car near the destination and started running, only he himself knew.","“Alright, stop spouting this nonsense. Just tell me, have you lost your ten pounds of flesh?” Liu Yutong asked.","“Definitely! More than ten pounds!”","After bragging, Ma Da quickly got down to business. “Miss, although I was careless over in Huaicheng before, I promise to keep a close eye on things from now on. If those local snakes want to stir up trouble, they'll have to ask me, Ma Da, if I agree first.”","Liu Yutong: “Did you hear any rumors?”","Ma Da: “I received news on my end that several local gangs in Huaicheng seem to have been brought together recently. It looks like they want to test our depths and give us a show of strength. I'm guessing it's because we suddenly appeared in Huaicheng and took out Zhao Biao, which touched some people's nerves. No, wait, we acted in justifiable self-defense.”","Liu Yutong was silent for a moment, looking at the smiling faces of the villagers not far away. “It seems someone thinks we are paper tigers and wants to poke us. Or rather, the waters in Huaicheng are inherently deeper than we thought.”","Ma Da nodded. “We analyzed that Zhao Biao is very likely just a white glove pushed to the front by some behind-the-scenes figure. We touched his people, especially knowing that we also sent one guy to Mingzhu City, so the other side is getting a bit desperate. On one hand, they want to use pressure to make Zhang Tao's case an ironclad conviction, and on the other, they want to show us some color.”","After that underling of Zhao Biao was handed over to Gao Min, knowing he was definitely going to trigger a reincarnation mode, he simply spilled everything he could. Zhao Biao ran sandpits and other businesses in Huaicheng, and did quite a few bad things. Baldy also knew some things, and it very likely involved the people behind Zhao Biao.","If that was really the case, the other party's fierce reaction would make sense.","“Miss, I think we need to make preparations in advance. We are unfamiliar with the people and the place in Huaicheng; let's not fall into a trap again,” Ma Da said.","Of course, the probability of that was very low.","With the Wanlong Syndicate's current scale and network of connections, it would be quite difficult for anyone who truly wanted to make them suffer a major setback.","But it was always right to be cautious in everything.","At this moment, an elderly man who had just received his New Year goods walked by happily carrying his things, greeting Liu Yutong: “Yutong girl, come to my house for a meal when you're done! Your grandma stewed an old hen, it's incredibly fragrant!”","Liu Yutong's face instantly broke into a smile. “Thank you, Sixth Grandpa, I appreciate the thought, but I have to rush back soon; there are still matters to handle. You and Auntie eat more and nourish your bodies.”","The elderly man was a bit regretful. “I see, then you must come next time. You may be busy, but you must take care of your health.”","“Aye, thank you for your concern, Sixth Grandpa,” Liu Yutong said with a smile.","Once the old man had walked far enough away, she turned her attention back to Ma Da. \"Then we will take a two-pronged approach. Zhao Tianyi's side will coordinate the public opinion offensive, with the goal of getting Zhang Tao acquitted and released. On your end, deploy some manpower into Huaicheng. The focus will be on gathering evidence of illegal activities by anyone associated with Zhao Biao, as well as dirt on those local gangs. If they cannot hold back, we will send them to a safe place behind bars. Meanwhile, I will see if I can have a word with Uncle Li and push an investigation team down from the provincial level. Anyone who can gather so many local thugs together certainly deserves this kind of special treatment.\"","She was doing this, firstly, to hand her sister an achievement. With Baldy in her custody, her sister would have a legitimate reason to intervene.","Secondly, she felt there was no need to investigate exactly how many local connections the person behind Zhao Biao had. It was better to just cut the Gordian knot. In the face of a provincial investigation team, any local connections would be rendered useless.","Ma Da's spirits lifted as he listened. He nodded, \"Yes, I will get on it right away! I guarantee that anyone who dares to stick their neck out will be pushed right back down, one by one!\"","He turned around and was just about to leave when Liu Yutong called out to stop him.","\"Wait.\"","Ma Da looked back. \"What is it, Miss? Is there anything else you need me to do?\"","Liu Yutong pointed to the rice, flour, grain, and cooking oil on a large truck not far away. \"Since you are already here, do not let the trip go to waste. The village is short on hands to distribute the supplies. Go help carry the rice and oil; you can consider it a weight-loss exercise.\"","Ma Da was speechless.","\"Miss, can I say no...\"","\"Hmm?\" Liu Yutong raised an eyebrow slightly.","Ma Da immediately patted his chest. \"No problem! Serving the people! It is my absolute duty!\""]},{"number":652,"title":"Chapter 652: 652, Remove the Lawyer by Cutting Off the Source","paragraphs":["Huaicheng, a certain police station.","Zhao Tianyi was invited into the office by Inspector Li, who was in charge of the case.","\"Lawyer Zhao, take a seat,\" Inspector Li greeted politely.","Zhao Tianyi adjusted his glasses and said earnestly, \"Call me Senior Counsel.\"","Inspector Li: \"...\"","Did this guy have some sort of obsession with being called Senior Counsel?","Inspector Li poured a cup of tea and handed it to Zhao Tianyi. \"Let's get straight to the point. How do you plan to handle this case?\"","Zhao Tianyi took the teacup. \"According to the law, of course. Open a case if it warrants one, or drop it if it doesn't.\"","\"It's not that simple.\"","Inspector Li shook his head. \"Someone died, and the deceased was a prominent local figure. The family has already called us, demanding severe punishment for the killer.\"","Zhao Tianyi naturally knew who the family was, but he didn't point it out. \"So? Should the law give way to personal connections?\"","\"The law won't, but sometimes the procedure does.\"","Inspector Li lit a cigarette, took a deep drag, and said, \"The prosecutors are already preparing to arrest Zhang Tao for intentional injury leading to death. Their reasoning is that after Zhang Tao snatched the knife, Zhao Biao no longer had a weapon in his hand. At that point, the defense clearly exceeded the necessary limits.\"","Zhao Tianyi smiled, a very cold smile.","\"Inspector Li, let me ask you a question. If your wife had a knife held to her neck, and another thug charged at you, would you first check if he had a knife in his hand, or would you use every means possible to stop him?\"","Hearing this, Inspector Li immediately fell silent.","Zhao Tianyi continued, \"The law cannot demand the impossible. If you don't drop this case, I will fight it to the bitter end. This isn't just for Zhang Tao, but for all the ordinary people who might face violence but are too afraid to fight back.\"","\"Inspector Li, you've handled so many cases. You must have seen too many victims who were beaten to death or crippled because they were afraid of exceeding the limits of self-defense and didn't dare to fight back, right?\"","Inspector Li fell silent again. He indeed had.","Zhao Tianyi simply brought up two cases he had taken on as examples.","After more than a year of development, Tianyi Law Firm had a very high success rate and was already considered a top law firm in Pearl City. Naturally, many people came because of its reputation.","Two of those cases left a deep impression on Zhao Tianyi. Even he found them very tricky to handle, mainly because so much time had passed.","The current situation presented a perfect opportunity for him to breathe life into the justifiable defense clause.","\"In 2005, a small female supermarket owner in our area caught three thugs stealing. When she confronted them, she was beaten. She finally grabbed a knife from a shelf and stabbed one of the thugs to death. As a result, she was convicted of intentional injury and served three years in prison. After she was released, her supermarket was gone, her husband divorced her, and now she can only sweep trash at a wet market.\"","\"In 2007, a taxi driver was robbed at knifepoint by a passenger. He found an opportunity to run the robber over with his car, killing him. He was convicted of excessive self-defense and sentenced to two years.\"","\"Inspector Li, were these verdicts wrong? From the perspective of legal provisions, perhaps not. But from the perspective of human conscience and justice, they were dead wrong! The law is supposed to be a shield for the weak, but now it has become an accomplice to thugs. Because it always demands that victims respond perfectly in life-and-death moments!\"","Inspector Li sighed and said, \"I know everything you're saying, but someone died after all, and I'm in a tough spot. The prosecutors are also in a tough spot because there has never been a precedent like this.\"","Zhao Tianyi replied, \"Then why can't we start with this case? Be a righteous pioneer and prove that the law can protect those who are brave enough to fight back.\"","\"Also, I suggest you search for the discussions about this case on Weibo right now.\"","Hearing this, Inspector Li suddenly grew alert. He turned on his computer and started checking the related topics on Weibo.","When he saw that the topic had already blown up on Weibo, his face instantly darkened.","The comment section was almost unanimously in support of Zhang Tao.","\"If this is true, the groom's actions were completely justifiable defense.\"","\"I hope he's found innocent, otherwise who would dare to fight back in the future?\"","\"........\"","Inspector Li frowned and looked at Zhao Tianyi. \"You're manipulating public opinion.\"","\"I am presenting the truth.\"","Zhao Tianyi corrected him. \"Public opinion isn't some terrifying monster; it can also be a mirror. If judicial decisions run contrary to the general perception of justice, it is the judicial system that should reflect on itself, not the public.\"","\"According to our statistical data, eighty percent of people support justifiable defense, fifteen percent are discussing the application of the law, and only five percent believe it might constitute excessive defense.\"","Looking at that data, Inspector Li felt a chill run down his spine.","This lawyer's methods were a bit too formidable.","Pushing forward simultaneously on the three fronts of criminal investigation, law, and public opinion—he could already imagine the immense pressure they were about to face.","In comparison, the pressure from those so-called family members was not even worth mentioning in the face of this tidal wave of public opinion.","\"The prosecutors won't like you doing things this way,\" Inspector Li reminded him.","Zhao Tianyi said dismissively, \"I don't need them to like me. I just need them to act according to the law.\"","\"Inspector Li, my goals for this case are very clear. First, Zhang Tao is released without charge. Second, Zhao Biao and his gang members are all prosecuted according to the law, without a single one slipping through the cracks. Third, use this case to push for the clear application of the justifiable defense clause so it is no longer so ambiguous, turning it into a true shield in the hands of good people rather than a constraint.\"","\"Actually, if you think about it carefully, if this case can become a textbook example of a case being dropped due to justifiable defense, then all that public opinion online will transform into praise for you and for legal progress!\"","\"Alright, I'm off to the prosecutor's office to submit the hearing materials.\"","\"Wish me luck—oh no, wish certain people luck!\"","The door closed.","Inspector Li sat in his chair, unmoving for a long time as he pondered an incomprehensible question.","\"Wait, is this lawyer really in cahoots with those men in black? Why does he feel so righteous?\"","\"Or is he so dark that he's come out the other side as righteous?\"","............","On the road diagonally opposite the police station, a dilapidated minivan was parked.","Inside sat seven or eight hoodlum-looking youths, puffing clouds of cigarette smoke. If passersby hadn't been sure there were people inside, they would have thought the minivan was on fire.","\"Keep a close eye out! The boss said that once that bespectacled lawyer comes out, we find a spot to intercept him and loosen his bones up a bit!\"","\"Damn it, a lawyer spouting nonsense online, trying to get that murderer off the hook? We have to teach him a lesson!\"","\"Don't worry, Blondie. You think we can't handle a four-eyed lawyer? I guarantee we'll scare the crap out of him and make him run out of Huaicheng!\"","\".........\"","They were clearly hired by the person behind Zhao Biao.","The mastermind behind the scenes probably hadn't expected the other party to disregard the unspoken rules and directly expose the case online, making it known to everyone.","So they came up with this drastic measure to strike at the root of the problem and get rid of that troublesome lawyer once and for all.","A few minutes later, a Mercedes-Benz drove out.","The blond thug leading the group slapped the driver on the back of the head and shouted.","\"That's the Mercedes! Hurry! Follow it! Don't lose them!\"","\"Don't worry, boss. On the way to the prosecutor's office, there's a section of the road where they're fixing the pipes. Half the street is blocked off, so there's hardly any traffic or pedestrians. It's the perfect spot to make our move.\"","........."]},{"number":653,"title":"Chapter 653: 653, The Great Lawyer Is Not to Be Trifled With, Framing.","paragraphs":["About seven or eight minutes later, the car drove into a somewhat dilapidated street.","The right side of the street was blocked off by fencing due to pipeline construction, leaving only a single lane on the left for traffic, and there were very few pedestrians.","\"This is the place!\"","The van tailing closely behind suddenly accelerated. Its engine roared like a tractor as it aggressively overtook them from the left drainage ditch, then slammed on the brakes, stopping sideways right in front of the Mercedes-Benz.","Fortunately, Zhao Tianyi had quick reflexes and stepped on the brakes just in time to avoid a collision.","Clang!","The van's doors were violently shoved open.","Seven or eight thugs wielding steel pipes and baseball bats jumped out and surrounded the Mercedes.","Yellow Hair Man swung his steel pipe, banging it against the driver's side window. With a crooked smirk and a face full of hostility, he roared, \"Get out of the car! Did you hear me? Get the hell out!\"","Zhao Tianyi sighed, opened the door, and stepped out.","He first checked the car window for any cracks before looking at Yellow Hair Man and his gang, saying, \"Gentlemen, cutting off a car is illegal. Do you know that?\"","\"The law? Today, I'll let you know who makes the rules around here!\"","Yellow Hair Man pointed his steel pipe at Zhao Tianyi's nose and said arrogantly, \"You're that lawyer surnamed Zhao? If you know what's good for you, get on your knees and kowtow a few times. I might consider going easy on you.\"","Zhao Tianyi slowly buttoned the cuffs of his suit jacket and replied, \"Let me correct you. First, I am a senior lawyer. Second, I will give you three seconds to drop your weapons, put your hands on your heads, and kneel down.\"","\"What the fuck? A lawyer acting this tough? You actually dare to tell us to kneel?\" Yellow Hair Man and the others were momentarily stunned upon hearing this.","\"Brothers, beat him up! Smash his car first, then break one of his arms. Let's see if he still acts tough after that!\"","Hearing this, the thugs immediately raised their weapons, ready to strike.","Zhao Tianyi shook his head and pointed behind them. \"You had better look behind you.\"","Yellow Hair Man and the others instinctively turned around to look.","Without them noticing, a group of young men, at least three times their number, was walking toward them with unfriendly expressions, forming an even larger encirclement.","These men were all dressed uniformly in black suits, looking like true underworld professionals, completely different from Yellow Hair Man and his ragtag group.","Yellow Hair Man and his subordinates were dumbfounded. Even though they still held their weapons, their bodies began to tremble instinctively.","Unhurriedly, Zhao Tianyi took a pack of cigarettes from his suit's inner pocket, tapped one out, and lowered his head to light it.","He walked up to the pale-faced Yellow Hair Man and blew a puff of smoke into his face.","\"You want to hit me? And smash my car? Do you know that you shouldn't casually mess with a senior lawyer?\"","Then he pointed at the group of men in black. \"See these guys? They are all my students.\"","Yellow Hair Man and his gang: \"???\"","Their brains couldn't quite process it. Shouldn't a lawyer's students be lawyers? Why were they all gangsters? Could it be that lawyers were also part of the underworld?","Zhao Tianyi nodded at the leader of the men in black. \"I didn't see anything. Oh, and handle this quickly, I'm in a hurry.\"","The leader in black nodded and waved his hand.","The men in black immediately sprang into action. With clean and efficient movements, they disarmed the thugs in no time and completely subdued them.","With his back to the crowd, Zhao Tianyi leaned against the hood of the Mercedes, continuing to smoke leisurely as if pondering something.","Two minutes later, he turned around and stomped out his cigarette.","\"I'll leave this to you. Clean it up nicely and send them wherever they need to go. I'm heading to the prosecutor's office.\"","\"Yes, Senior Lawyer Zhao,\" the leader in black said respectfully.","Zhao Tianyi got back into the driver's seat of the Mercedes, restarted the car, maneuvered around the van blocking the road and the subdued thugs, and drove away.","..............","Eastern District of Huaicheng.","Smoke filled a private dining room in a restaurant, where six people were seated.","In the seat of honor sat a sinister-looking young man around thirty years old named Liu Shui. On the surface, he was the boss of several logistics companies, but in reality, he was an agent representing someone named Jiang Gui in the gray areas of the city.","The other five were the leaders of the five most powerful local syndicates in Huaicheng.","\"Bosses, the tea is getting cold,\" Liu Shui said.","Sitting first on his left was a man with a face full of fierce flesh, nicknamed Big Lei. He controlled more than half of the nightclubs and underground casinos in Huaicheng.","\"Boss Liu, whether the tea is cold or not doesn't matter. What matters is what the fuck is going on with our businesses? Last night, in just one fucking night! Several of our key turfs were all trashed. You did this, didn't you?\"","Just last night, the territories of all five leaders had been attacked one after another without any warning.","First, Big Lei's most profitable underground casino was raided, with most of the cash stolen. Many of his brothers were still lying in clinics right now.","The tea shop of a fat man sitting next to him was also set on fire. The loan sharking ledgers hidden in the shop were burned, which contained records of many shady transactions and client information.","The situations for the other three were basically the same; they had all been attacked to varying degrees and suffered heavy losses.","Considering that Liu Shui had repeatedly invited them over and wanted them to submit to him, they suspected he was the one behind it, trying to force them to bow their heads.","\"Do you all really think I did it?\" Liu Shui said with an innocent face. \"I don't have that kind of time. Besides, the matter with Zhao Biao on my end hasn't been resolved yet, so how would I have the time to target you bosses?\"","\"Also, I just came from Elder Jiang's place. Actually, when Elder Jiang found out, he was also very shocked and furious!\"","\"I invited everyone here today to tell you the information we found out.\"","Then, he told a story he had fabricated to sound very real. It was roughly about a group of uninvited guests from Mingzhu City who wanted to replace them and had massive ambitions.","This was naturally a frame-up.","In fact, he had simply ordered his subordinates to temporarily get some black suits and impersonate the group from Mingzhu City to trash the territories of these bosses.","The purpose of doing this was to make these bosses make up their minds sooner and take action against those outsiders.","\"I was originally planning to take over Zhao Biao's sandpit business, and you all know the relationship between Zhao Biao and Elder Jiang. But what happened? These guys actually relied on their superior numbers to forcibly occupy the sandpit, and they even beat up my men!\" He was making this up as well, mainly to emphasize that he had also been attacked, just like them.","\"Think about it carefully, everyone. As soon as these outsiders from the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang arrived, they killed Zhao Biao, and now they are making moves on all of our territories. Do they have any respect for us at all?\"","After Liu Shui finished his highly inflammatory speech, the bosses were mostly convinced.","Their subordinates had indeed seen quite a few unfamiliar men in black operating in Huaicheng. During the day, they had even dealt with a few thugs in a certain area, truly showing no regard for them as the local heavyweights.","Big Lei slammed his hand on the table. \"Motherfucker! These outsiders are too arrogant! Do they really think they can swallow us all up?\"","\"Boss Liu, what exactly does Elder Jiang mean to do? He can't just watch us get bullied by outsiders, right? Zhao Biao was at least considered Elder Jiang's son-in-law. This revenge must be taken!\""]},{"number":654,"title":"Chapter 654: 654, Alliance, Battle Appointment","paragraphs":["A fleeting, barely noticeable glint of coldness flashed through Liu Jinshui's eyes.","That idiot Zhao Biao was nothing more than a pawn under Elder Jiang. If he was dead, he was dead. However, the methods of the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate were indeed a bit excessive, truly striking a nerve with Elder Jiang. If they got dragged into this, it would be a huge problem.","Especially that underling of Zhao Biao who was taken away; he was a massive hidden danger.","They didn't yet know that Zhao Biao's underling had already been sent to the Pearl City police station. Currently, they only knew that the people from the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate had detained him, and they assumed the other party wanted to use this insider underling to threaten them.","It was understandable for them to think this way. After all, no one in the underworld liked dealing with the police, let alone cooperating with them.","Usually, they couldn't hide from them fast enough.","A syndicate like the Ten Thousand Dragons, which looked extremely shady, couldn't possibly cooperate with the police either. Most likely, they just wanted to hold onto a bargaining chip.","Liu Jinshui lit a cigar, took a deep drag, and then slowly spoke: Revenge, of course, must be taken.","But how we take it requires everyone's effort. Don't forget, they sent over a hundred men to strut around our territory. If we just sit back and do nothing, what happened last night will keep repeating. By then, we'll just be eaten away bit by bit until we become homeless dogs.","Big Lei suddenly stood up and cursed angrily again: Damn it, these outsiders! Killing Zhao Biao wasn't enough, now they want to wipe us all out. Do they think just because Zhao Biao is dead, there's no one left in Huai City?","That chubby Boss Du also couldn't help but speak up: By doing this, they've offended all of us. What good does that do for them?","Liu Jinshui sighed, a worried look appearing on his face: This is also what Elder Jiang and I couldn't figure out at first. But when I sent people to Pearl City to investigate the background of the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate, we finally understood why they dared to do this.","Pearl City used to have several gangs, but they were all wiped out by this Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate. I also heard their methods are extremely ruthless. Not only do they steal territories, but they also exterminate their rivals completely. For example, there was once a faction called the East Sea Alliance in Pearl City. Back then, it was one of the top syndicates there. In the end, the boss's son was forced to jump off a building and became a vegetable, and the boss himself was shot dead.","From all indications, this Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate seems to love monopolizing everything. Wherever they go, they tolerate no other gangs. Now, they've clearly set their sights on our territory in Huai City. As for why they struck so suddenly, it's simple: for the coal mines.","Elder Jiang had just secured the coal mine in the west of the city when Zhao Biao had his accident. How could there be such a coincidence?","They just wanted to use Zhao Biao to test our reaction, while simultaneously showing off their strength and methods. For instance, getting the subordinate who killed Zhao Biao out scot-free, and then telling everyone: look, they can kill someone and get away with it, even the law can't punish them. If we don't obediently submit, we're next.","This highly logical analysis made cold sweat break out on the backs of the several bosses present.","Not gonna lie, this way of establishing dominance is really damn unique, and their methods are top-notch!","Looking at it this way, that self-defense claim was just a smokescreen. When I read the news online, I actually thought it was genuine self-defense.","Damn, I've learned something new today. After surviving in the underworld for so many years, this is the first time I've seen dominance established like this!","Did these guys study law or something? They're playing this so professionally.","I don't know, but it's no wonder those men in black had such an imposing aura. They can kill someone and find a legitimate excuse to get away with it. Aren't they just pure outlaws?","I'm actually a little scared now. I'm afraid I might get knocked off under some fabricated self-defense excuse too.",".........","Finally, it was Big Lei, the one with the most violent temper, who stepped forward to state his position.","Screw their ancestors! They want to mess with me? In their dreams!","Boss Liu, what do you say we do?","Liu Jinshui: My intention is to make the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate the public enemy of all factions in Huai City. Make it impossible for them to move a single inch in our territory, and they will naturally scram.","Boss Liu, aren't you taking things a bit too for granted? Lin Hong asked, raising an eyebrow.","As the only boss among them who had risen to power from the status of a mobster's wife, even in her thirties, she maintained her figure and looks perfectly, appearing much like a girl in her early twenties.","Even though the men harbored some lust for this woman, none dared to show it. After all, to become the biggest local smuggler meant her background connections and methods were both formidable.","Then there is only one way left: wipe them all out!","Liu Jinshui continued: The Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate brought just under two hundred men to Huai City this time. These should be all their capable fighters. As long as we get people together to annihilate this group in one fell swoop, they will naturally run away with their tails between their legs and never dare to lay a finger on Huai City again.","This was the most viable plan he could think of at the moment.","Why was the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate so arrogant? Wasn't it simply because they had enough manpower?","Setting aside everything else, if those one or two hundred men gathered together, none of their individual families could possibly be a match for them.","In this day and age, who would casually keep one to two hundred professional thugs like the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate did?","Dozens of thugs were already considered a lot—enough to dominate an entire area. If worse came to worst, they could spend some money and easily gather another hundred or so broke street punks.","It was just that the combat effectiveness of those hired street punks was ultimately inferior to professional thugs.","That was why he needed to unite the people present, pool everyone's strength, and take out the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate's men in one vigorous effort. That way, everything would be smoothly resolved.","The private room fell silent for a few seconds.","The fat pig, Boss Du, couldn't help but speak up first: Boss Liu, isn't this playing a bit too big? And what if they refuse to go to war with us?","Rest assured on that point, everyone. I have already issued a formal challenge to them, and they have agreed to fight. We've arranged to meet at the construction site in the suburban development zone. The site is currently on holiday, so there's absolutely no one around. All you need to do is provide the men. My suggestion is that our numbers cannot be less than five hundred. The thugs from the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate are quite capable fighters, but if we can assemble five hundred men, it'll be two against one. We can crush them with sheer numbers!","Five hundred men? Everyone gasped in shock.","Over the years, the largest gang fight in Huai City had involved just over a hundred people. That record had been held for many years, only recently broken by the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate.","On the day Zhao Biao was killed, the total number of participants from both sides exceeded three hundred. The most outrageous part was that none of those men in black were arrested, except for the one who actually committed the murder.","If they really gathered five hundred men this time, plus the opponent's two hundred, wouldn't that exceed seven hundred people?","This would be a massive, unprecedented scene!","Boss Du frowned and said: That's a bit too many people. If our families pool our resources, the capable elites we can gather will total around three hundred at most. The rest would just be low-level punks making up the numbers; they'd be useless in a real fight.","\"Also, what if they don't play by the rules and secretly call the cops?\"","\"If they call the cops during a gang war, how could they ever show their faces in the underworld again?\"","Liu Jinshui said with certainty, \"Don't worry. Elder Jiang will pull some strings and make sure we have enough time to react.\"","\"All you need to do is provide the manpower. If you can't gather enough men, then it's time to use your connections. It's best to let everyone in the Huaicheng underworld know that we are standing together against outsiders to protect everyone's interests. Otherwise, we'll just be picked off one by one!\"","\"Besides that, Elder Jiang also said that once it's done, he will compensate everyone based on how much effort they put in and the losses they suffered. He guarantees everyone will be satisfied!\"","The private room fell silent again, leaving only the sound of burning cigars and cigarettes.","Everyone was weighing the pros and cons. After all, if this battle really broke out, it would be absolutely unprecedented.","Even those gangster movies probably didn't have scenes this massive.","At the same time, the risks were incredibly high.","But soon, they made their decision.","\"Damn it, I'm in! I've been sick of those guys in black for a long time! Acting all high and mighty. As long as the compensation is right, I'm absolutely down to fight!\"","\"Count me in. I'll bring a hundred men. If we don't beat the crap out of those black-clad bastards, I'll take their last name!\"","\"I'll bring eighty men, and pull in at least another fifty just to hold the line!\"","\"........\"","\"I don't care if they're mighty dragons crossing the river, we'll turn them all into dead worms!\"","..........."]},{"number":655,"title":"Chapter 655: 655, The Story of a Nobody.","paragraphs":["\"New Year's Eve, a night for family reunions. They certainly know how to pick a date.\" Hearing Ma Da report the agreed time, Liu Yutong sneered.","\"It seems they figured we'd be on holiday and short-handed, so they deliberately chose this time.\"","Ma Da said, \"Miss, I don't think we need to pay them any attention. Why should we dance to their tune?\"","Liu Yutong suddenly asked, \"Is the information confirmed? Will all those people from Huaicheng be there?\"","Ma Da nodded. \"Basically, yes.\"","According to the intelligence they had gathered, the other party had issued a challenge this time, seemingly uniting all the local underworld factions in Huaicheng. They looked like they were ready to settle everything in this one battle.","Liu Yutong said, \"Then accept it. What era is this, still playing gangsters? This is the perfect chance to wipe out these social cancers in one fell swoop. That way, Zhang Tao can also be released earlier through earning merit to reduce his sentence.\"","If it were just one of their factions, she might not even bother, but if they were all going to be there, it was worth her time. Catching them all in one net would save a lot of trouble.","Ma Da asked, \"Miss, how many men should we call up?\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"The more, the better.\"","Ma Da instantly understood; she meant going all out.","He wondered what expressions those ignorant hicks from Huaicheng would have when they saw thousands of people.","That bunch of country bumpkins would probably wet their pants in fear, right?","However, being able to make the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang mobilize its entire force meant they would die a worthy death.","Liu Yutong added, \"This isn't mandatory. Those who find it convenient can come, and those who don't can stay home for the New Year. Anyway, we are cooperating with the police for this operation, so it doesn't matter if we have a few less people.\"","Those mob bosses in Huaicheng could probably never imagine in their wildest dreams that a syndicate they considered incredibly dark not only had numbers beyond their imagination but was actually going to call the cops. No, they were fundamentally on the same side as the police.","\"Cooperating with the police?\"","Ma Da realized what she meant. \"Miss, do you mean the investigation team has already arrived?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Times have changed, Ma Da. Those guys still thinking about fighting and killing to seize territory for illegal businesses are on a dead-end road sooner or later. The Ten Thousand Dragons Gang has made it to where we are today not because we are so tough or good at fighting, but because we know how to go with the flow and understand what it means to be legal and compliant. If you want long-term peace and stability, you just can't cross the bottom line.\"","\"Go gather the men. Oh, and don't forget to book a large restaurant in Huaicheng. After we resolve the matter there, we'll all celebrate the New Year together.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\"","After Ma Da returned to Pearl City, he chatted with Yun Cheng and the others, bringing up this special New Year's Eve and the scheduled fight with the Huaicheng gang.","\"Brother Yun, how many people do you guess will come back? After all, everyone is home for the New Year. With such a sudden summons, I'm afraid many won't be able to get away, right?\"","Yun Cheng didn't even have to think about it; he said decisively, \"All of them!\"","\"As long as the Miss gives the order, not a single one of our brothers and sisters will be missing!\"","\"That is the cohesion of our Ten Thousand Dragons Gang!\"","...............","Seventy kilometers outside Pearl City, in a remote village.","It had started snowing before midnight, and by early morning, the entire village was covered in a moderate layer of white.","Cheng Gang, carrying a large black suitcase and wearing a backpack, stepped off the only rural minibus. His shoes crunched on the snow as he walked.","The old locust tree at the village entrance was still there, its branches hanging low under the weight of the snow. A figure stood beneath the tree, wearing a bulky, old padded jacket and a faded red scarf, stomping his feet to keep warm.","Cheng Gang paused for a moment, then quickened his pace and walked over.","Hearing the noise, the person under the tree looked up.","It was the face of a twelve or thirteen-year-old boy, red from the cold. His nose was especially red, but his eyes were very bright.","The boy was Cheng Gang's younger brother, Cheng Lei.","\"Brother, you're back!\" Cheng Lei called out in pleasant surprise.","\"How long have you been waiting?\" Cheng Gang looked at his brother's bright red ears and reached out to brush the snow off his shoulders.","\"Not long, just a little while.\"","Cheng Lei looked at the black suit his brother was wearing, and his eyes instantly lit up. \"Brother, you look so handsome in this outfit!\"","Cheng Gang had specifically worn the black suit issued by the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang today, with a dark gray down jacket over it. He dressed like this to show his brother that he had finally made something of himself.","\"It's cold and you don't even know to wear a hat.\" Cheng Gang pulled a brand new wool hat out of his bag and pulled it down over his brother's head.","The hat was dark blue, soft and thick, with the tags still attached.","Cheng Lei touched the hat and asked out of habit, \"Brother, how much was this? It must be expensive, right?\"","\"Don't ask how much it cost. As long as it keeps you warm.\"","Cheng Gang put his arm around his brother's shoulders and walked toward the village. \"Is the stove lit at home?\"","\"Yes, I lit it when I got up this morning. The house is really warm.\"","As Cheng Lei spoke, he suddenly remembered something and pulled a boiled egg out from inside his coat.","\"Brother, did you eat breakfast? I boiled this for you.\"","Cheng Gang took the egg. Surprisingly, it was still warm. He looked at his brother's five fingers, red from the cold, and his throat suddenly felt a bit tight.","A year ago, when he had just returned from prison, his brother Cheng Lei had been standing under that same old locust tree, a size smaller than he was now. At that time, his brother was also wearing an old padded jacket handed down from a neighbor's child, his little hands and face purple from the cold. When he saw him get off the bus, he had also pulled a very precious egg out from his coat.","Back then, he had no luggage and absolutely nothing to his name.","His brother had just held his hand and whispered, \"Brother, let's go home after you eat the egg. I lit the stove, the house is warm.\"","That old house was the only property their parents had left them.","Their father died in a car accident when Cheng Gang was fifteen. Their mother held on for three years, but when she fell ill, there was no money for treatment. She dragged on for a year before passing away as well. Cheng Gang was seventeen at the time. He dropped out of school to work in the city, entrusting the eleven-year-old Cheng Lei to the care of neighbors, and sent money back every month.","Later, his brother suddenly contracted a severe illness and urgently needed a large sum of money. Driven into a corner, someone told him that the copper inside a transformer could be sold for one or two thousand. He couldn't resist the temptation and went through with it, teaming up with others to steal seven or eight transformers. In the end, he was caught, and because he was a minor, he was sentenced to two years.","He still remembered the day he was arrested. The police officers asked him if he knew this was against the law. He lowered his head and said he knew, but his brother would die without the surgery.","The police officers fell silent for a moment but still took him away according to the law.","During his two years behind bars, he received a letter from his brother every month. The letters said he had received donations from kind-hearted people, his illness was cured, and the school had even waived his tuition fees so he could study. At that time, he cried, crying his heart out.","On the day of his release, the sky was overcast and gray. He stood at the prison gates holding his release papers, with only one hundred yuan for travel expenses that the prison guard had stuffed into his pocket.","After returning home, he saw his brother, who had grown even thinner. Only then did he realize that his brother had basically survived the past two years by eating whatever food the neighbors could spare. No one had ever told him this, nor had his brother.","Later, in order to give his brother a better life, he came to the city once again.","As someone with a criminal record, it was very difficult to find a decent job.","Construction sites didn't want him, saying he had a criminal record and fearing he would cause trouble. Restaurants also found it bad luck to hire an ex-convict to wash dishes. He made do living under a bridge for almost a month, occasionally picking up odd jobs to earn a few dozen bucks, often eating only one meal every two days... These cruel experiences made him want to return to his old ways, but the thought of his younger brother forced him to hold back.","One afternoon, just as he was about to completely break down, he saw a recruitment notice posted by the most popular supermarket in town.","Normally, his instinct would have been to ignore it. He had hit a wall so many times due to his time in prison that he felt these job postings had nothing to do with him. But the cold and hunger forced him to grasp at this straw and give it a try.","However, when he read the contents, he froze, thinking his hunger had blurred his vision.","[Wanlong Supermarket is hiring warehouse clerks, delivery drivers, security guards, and other positions. This is a restricted recruitment; ex-convicts are preferred. Interested parties please go to the Human Resources Department at No. XX, Shunchang Building, XX Road for an interview.]","Cheng Gang stood in front of the utility pole for ten minutes before finally tearing down the flyer.","Desperate times call for desperate measures, he thought.","The interview location was a very grand-looking office building. The receptionist was a girl with a beautiful smile. When he stuttered that he had a criminal record, she didn't even blink, simply handing him a form.","\"Just fill in your basic information. Compared to your past, our Wanlonghui Group cares more about your present and future performance.\"","His interviewer was a young man in his twenties wearing a black suit, who introduced himself as the supermarket's HR supervisor.","After reviewing his resume, the young man asked him a question: \"If you had a legitimate job right in front of you, and right next to it was your old way of making quick money, which would you choose?\"","Cheng Gang was silent for a long time before replying, \"I just want to set a good example for my little brother.\"","The HR supervisor nodded and didn't ask anything else, simply saying, \"Come to work tomorrow. You'll be a warehouse clerk at the Lingshan District branch. There is a one-month probation period. Your take-home pay will be two thousand a month, rising to two thousand five hundred once you become a regular employee, with social security and a housing provident fund included. Any questions?\"","Cheng Gang was stunned. All the pleading words he had prepared were stuck in his throat, and he finally squeezed out, \"You... you really want me?\"","The HR supervisor in the black suit smiled. \"If you don't show up, how would I know if I want you or not?\"","\"Oh, by the way, the company provides a housing subsidy and covers one meal a day. Regular employees also have access to an internal medical fund, where staff and their immediate family members can apply for subsidies for major illnesses, though it doesn't cover a hundred percent.\"","The man in black pointed to his left chest. \"If you want a hundred percent medical reimbursement, you have to wear clothes with this logo, just like me.\"","Cheng Gang looked at the incredibly striking dragon-shaped logo. It was the first time since his release from prison that he felt like crying.","For his first month, he worked in the warehouse of the Wanlong Supermarket branch. He worked six hours a day on three rotating shifts, mainly organizing goods and checking inventory lists. The work wasn't heavy, but it required meticulousness and diligence.","There were seven or eight others working with him. During idle chats, he discovered that a few of them also had unique pasts—some had assaulted people, while others had just gotten out of pyramid schemes.","But here, no one brought up those things.","The store manager would do a walkthrough once a day. He didn't talk much, but if someone caught a cold, a box of medicine would appear on their desk; if someone had a family emergency, they could swap shifts just by asking. At the end of the month, he received his salary. Not a single day's pay was withheld; the entire month's salary was paid three days in advance, and the pay stub clearly listed the base salary, performance bonus, perfect attendance bonus, as well as the deducted social security and provident fund.","Upon receiving his first month's salary, he immediately remitted a portion to his neighbor, Auntie, back in his village, asking her to withdraw it and give it to his brother for living expenses.","His brother called him using the village phone, telling him not to work too hard.","He really didn't feel it was hard work.","Six hours a day—he actually felt the time was too short and the work too easy. He was even a bit afraid of getting fired out of the blue.","Yet, every time he volunteered for overtime, his requests were invariably rejected by his supervisor or the manager.","The store manager told him that unless there was an emergency, there was no such thing as overtime here.","The manager also said that this was a rule set by the mysterious big boss he had never met. The big boss said that employees of the Wanlonghui Group shouldn't just work; they needed to learn how to live.","These words left Cheng Gang dumbfounded. What kind of fairy-tale boss was this?","In his second month, he became a regular employee. His salary rose to two thousand five hundred, and he received an additional five hundred yuan as a housing subsidy.","This amount was perfectly sufficient for a single person renting in Pearl City. If he chose a slightly remote area, he could even rent a two-bedroom apartment, though the commute would take a bit longer.","In his third month, he inexplicably received a massive red envelope of three thousand yuan. After asking around, he found out that the big boss was in a good mood and had given bonuses to all the employees.","This habit of casually throwing money around left him shocked, but more than that, he was confused.","Unable to hold back, he asked a black-clad supervisor at the store, \"Why is the company so good to people like me?\"","The supervisor lit a cigarette and said slowly, \"Cheng Gang, do you know what makes a person?\"","\"A person isn't defined by the mistakes they've made, but by what they want to become. The company giving you a chance, the Eldest Miss giving you a chance—it's not charity, it's an investment. The Eldest Miss told us that we must believe that someone who has been abandoned by society will cherish the right to stand tall more than anyone else once they get back on their feet.\"","Cheng Gang's heart was deeply moved. He then asked the question he had always been curious about: \"Then why does everyone try so hard to become a core member?\"","The black-clad supervisor smiled. \"Because being a core member means receiving the Eldest Miss's personal recognition. That is the greatest honor!\"","\"Of course, on a more practical note, the benefits are better: double pay, the ability to buy company-developed real estate at cost price in the future, and full medical reimbursement for relatives. But the requirements are also higher. At all times, you must be loyal to the company, united with your colleagues, and strict with yourself—especially when it comes to absolute loyalty to the Eldest Miss! You must be willing to go through fire and water without hesitation. Can you do that?\"","That night, Cheng Gang lay in bed with his eyes wide open until dawn.","He made a decision: he was going to become one of the best employees in the company, and he, too, was going to wear that black suit.","Because he had plenty of personal time, he would run to a law firm to study law as soon as he got off work. At home, he would bury his head in books, studying with extreme dedication.","Six months later, due to his meticulous and error-free work, he was transferred to the delivery dispatch center, and his salary increased to four thousand.","Before the annual meeting, he passed three extremely strict internal assessments to become a prospective core member.","This meant that he only had to wait a little longer before he could join the other prospective core members in the promotion ceremony hosted by the Eldest Miss.","After receiving the news, he was so excited that he barely slept for days.","On the day of the annual meeting, he truly felt the sheer power of the Wanlonghui Group for the first time. There were countless employees packed tightly together, and the men in black were just as dense, radiating an unparalleled aura.","He finally met the incredibly young big boss—or rather, he should be calling her the Young Lady now.","The Young Lady was truly stunning, more beautiful than anyone he had ever laid eyes on. Even the celebrities on television were like scattered stars paling in comparison to her radiant moon.","From her hands, he received a custom-tailored black suit and a book with a red cover. With a heart full of solemnity and excitement, he took his oath.","After returning home, he stood in front of the full-length mirror, looking at the man standing perfectly straight in the reflection.","The suit fit him like a glove, accentuating his broad shoulders and straight back, making him look rather handsome.","Then, he smiled at the mirror. He smiled with genuine joy.","Even though he was just a nobody, he felt that he was finally living the way a person was meant to live!"]},{"number":656,"title":"Chapter 656: 656, We Are Together","paragraphs":["\"What are you thinking about, bro?\" Cheng Lei's voice pulled Cheng Gang back to reality.","\"Nothing.\"","Cheng Gang snapped out of it, shook his head, peeled an egg, and stuffed it into his mouth in one bite.","\"Delicious!\"","\"By the way, Xiaolei, I looked at your final report card. A 98 in math and a 92 in language, both are pretty good. But how come your foreign language score is only 63?\"","Cheng Lei's face instantly turned red. \"I... I'm just patriotic.\"","\"That's a solid excuse!\" Cheng Gang smiled and nodded, then pushed open the wooden door that was as familiar to him as could be.","The room was indeed warm. The fire in the stove was roaring, and the kettle on it was bubbling and puffing out white steam. The furnishings were simple, but his younger brother had kept everything neat and tidy. The walls were covered with the certificates of merit his brother had won over the years.","Cheng Gang put down his suitcase, took off his coat, and hung it up.","Cheng Lei had already poured a cup of hot water and brought it over. \"Bro, take a rest first. I'll go heat up the food. I stewed some ribs. The village slaughtered the New Year pig yesterday, and I bought them with the money you gave me.\"","\"No rush.\"","Cheng Gang pulled his brother down to sit and started taking things out of his suitcase. \"I bought these for you. See if you like them.\"","A down jacket, a pair of sneakers—both were famous brands Cheng Lei had seen in TV commercials—along with a few study guides and a cell phone.","Cheng Lei said, \"Bro, aren't these too expensive? You don't have to buy me such expensive things. I have enough clothes to wear, and a phone too.\"","\"You have to wear new clothes for the New Year. I bought them for you, so just wear them.\"","Cheng Gang then shoved the phone into his brother's hands. \"It'll be inconvenient without a phone when you go to school in the city later on. I've already set up the SIM card and saved my number. Call me anytime if you need anything, but you can't play on your phone during class!\"","\"Go to school in the city?\" Cheng Lei was stunned.","\"Yeah.\"","Cheng Gang looked into his brother's eyes. For the first time in three years, he had the confidence to say what came next.","\"After the New Year, you'll come with me to Mingzhu City. I've already found a school. It's a pretty good public middle school, and it's close to where I live—just a five-minute bike ride away. The company is helping to transfer your student records, so don't worry.\"","Cheng Lei opened his mouth but couldn't speak. His eyes just slowly grew red.","\"What are you crying for.\"","Cheng Gang rubbed his brother's hair. \"Your brother finally has the ability to give you a good life. You should be happy.\"","Right at that moment, his phone dinged with a text message.","Someone was reminding him to check the internal group chat.","As soon as he saw the message in the internal group, he stood up almost instantly.","His brother, Cheng Lei, noticed his unusual reaction. \"Bro, what's wrong?\"","Cheng Gang turned off his phone and shook his head. \"It's nothing. It's just that you might have to spend this New Year alone, Xiaolei. I have to go back to the company and work overtime.\"","Hearing this, Cheng Lei felt very disappointed, but he also knew it wasn't easy for his brother to find such a good job. Ultimately, he nodded sensibly. \"Go ahead, bro. I'll be fine at home by myself.\"","Seeing his brother's expression, Cheng Gang felt a bit guilty. \"Spend New Year's Eve next door at Auntie's house. I'll let them know later. Also, if you miss me, just give me a call.\"","He had bought quite a few gifts this time around and was planning to give them to the neighbor Auntie as a thank you for helping take care of his brother these past few years.","Cheng Lei nodded. \"Yeah, I know, bro. Go do your work, but make sure you remember to eat on time.\"","Cheng Gang gave him one last word of comfort. \"When I get back from working overtime, I'll take you to the city. That way, we two brothers can always be together from now on.\"","Cheng Lei finally smiled happily. \"Okay!\"","Cheng Gang picked up his luggage again, turned, and left. Cheng Lei watched him gradually disappear at the edge of the village. The smile on his face slowly faded as he silently said, \"Have a safe trip!\"","Cheng Gang got in the car. As soon as he unlocked his phone, messages in the core members' internal group chat were flooding the screen.","\"Arrived.\"","\"On the way, arriving in half an hour.\"","\"Rushing back from my hometown, save a spot for me.\"","\".........\"","After seeing the messages in the group, the slight disappointment in Cheng Gang's heart was instantly thrown to the back of his mind. He decisively replied with three words: \"I am returning!\"","There was no unnecessary nonsense; those three words expressed his determination.","Cheng Gang was just a small microcosm of the core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. There were many, many other core members just like him.","With the issuance of the mobilization order, the entire Ten Thousand Dragons Society was like a massive machine starting up, with every part automatically returning to its proper place.","At two o'clock in the afternoon, Cheng Gang dragged his suitcase out of the Mingzhu City bus station. A core member was already waiting at the entrance in a car.","\"Gangzi, over here,\" someone called out to him.","It was his former supervisor at the Ten Thousand Dragons Supermarket branch, though now the title had changed from supervisor to brother.","\"Gangzi, you're right on time. With you, my car is exactly full. We're heading to the headquarters to assemble now.\"","Cheng Gang nodded and then asked, \"Brother Li, did the higher-ups say what they want us to do for this mobilization?\"","Supervisor Li replied, \"I'm not too sure about the specifics. It should be related to the situation over in Huaicheng. But it doesn't matter. You know the principles of our Ten Thousand Dragons Society: we don't cause trouble, but we don't fear it either; we don't bully others, and we won't be bullied. Anyway, the higher-ups gave the order, so we just get it done!\"","Cheng Gang roughly understood. This probably meant they were going to make a move. However, he wasn't afraid; he was even faintly excited.","He finally had a chance to repay The Young Lady and repay the company.","Cheng Gang got out of the car and took a deep breath. The air still carried a faint smell of rust and dust. When he walked into the headquarters square, which was currently under construction, the scene before him made his breath catch slightly.","The massive open space was already packed densely with people.","Everyone was wearing a black suit. Under the gloomy weather, they looked like a silent black forest.","Everyone was smiling and chatting. Even though it was their first time seeing the company put on such a grand display, none of them let it weigh heavily on their minds.","Since the establishment of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, they had never suffered a loss and had never been defeated. No matter how strong the enemy was, they would always meet only one end when facing them: being brought to justice!","Snowflakes had begun to fall sparsely at some unknown point, landing on everyone's shoulders, yet no one brushed them away.","It was obviously very cold, but it felt as if a silent fire was burning wildly in everyone's hearts within this black sea of people.","Cheng Gang gradually straightened his chest.","He was no longer just Cheng Gang; he was a drop in this black tide, even if insignificant. But when thousands upon thousands of drops gathered together, they formed an ocean.","A black, surging, vast ocean!","Right at that moment, the roar of a car engine came from outside.","Almost everyone quieted down at the same time and looked toward the main gate.","They knew who was coming.","In their hearts, a few words echoed as well.","The Young Lady!","We stand with you!"]},{"number":657,"title":"Chapter 657: 657. Gathering of All Parties.","paragraphs":["Cheng Gang's heart began to beat a little faster. Even though this wasn't his first time seeing the Young Lady, a surge of instinctive excitement still welled up in his heart.","Footsteps echoed through the area.","Everyone's gaze simultaneously turned toward the gate of the construction site.","Immediately after, a beautiful silhouette dressed in a long black trench coat entered their sight. A dark-gold dragon-shaped badge was pinned to her left chest, and golden pendants dangled from her earlobes.","Behind her, a cold and stern young man held up a black umbrella, shielding her from the falling snow.","As she walked to the front of the stage.","Standing in the first row, Ma Da suddenly raised his right hand, making a fist and pressing it against his left chest over his heart. This was the highest salute among the core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society.","Almost at the exact same moment, Cheng Gang quickly performed the same gesture.","The nearly two thousand other people at the scene also simultaneously raised their hands, made fists, and pressed them to their chests, producing a deep, resonant thump.","These were all the core members currently in Pearl City, 1,998 of them in total. Members from other cities had not received this summons.","Greetings, the Young Lady!","Following Ma Da's lead, the very next second.","Greetings, the Young Lady!","Thousands of voices exploded across the scene, their imposing aura soaring straight into the clouds.","Cheng Gang felt the hairs on his arms stand up. The sheer shock of the sound waves slamming into his chest made his blood boil with adrenaline.","Liu Yutong swept her gaze across the crowd and slowly spoke.","Everyone!","Today was supposed to be a night of reunion, a day for all of you to gather with your families.","But there are some things we cannot wait for.","Someone in Huai City has issued a challenge to us, choosing New Year's Eve as the time. They think this will distract us and scatter our strength.","They are wrong!","The Ten Thousand Dragons Society has made it to where it is today by relying on our cohesion and our unstoppable momentum!","I do not like violence, but I dislike it even more when people think they can solve problems with violence, or that they can be arrogant and disregard the law just because they have numbers on their side!","So today, we are going to Huai City to tell them that times have changed!","We will use our own methods to return a clear, sunny sky to Huai City!","And similarly, this is so that our family member, Zhang Tao, can come home early!","Perhaps some might wonder if it is worth mobilizing such a massive force for just one member. My answer is this: if anything happens to any single one of you, I, along with everyone seated here, will go all out!","Never abandon, never give up. This is the Ten Thousand Dragons Society!","Hearing the Young Lady's words, some of the men in the crowd couldn't help but wipe away tears.","The Young Lady had treated everyone incredibly well ever since the beginning of her business ventures. Even now, with a net worth in the billions and being the youngest tycoon in the country, she still treated them all as family, truly sharing in both their joys and their hardships.","If possible, they were willing to follow her for the rest of their lives.","No, it would be for the rest of their lives!","Ten Thousand Dragons Society! someone shouted.","Soon after, the crowd chanted in unison once again.","Ten Thousand Dragons Society!","Ten Thousand Dragons Society!","...","One second, two seconds, ten seconds passed.","Only when the cheering gradually subsided did Liu Yutong speak again, uttering just a few words.","Then, let's move out!","She turned around and walked toward the Maybach parked at the very front.","Yun Cheng stepped forward briskly and opened the car door for her.","After she got into the car.","The next second, Ma Da grabbed his battlefield megaphone and yelled out a command.","Everyone, board the vehicles!","The sea of people in black began to line up and board the vehicles in an orderly fashion.","Cheng Gang sat in a bus. The reason they didn't use all sedans was mainly out of concern for traffic jams during the New Year period. Even so, the entire convoy still consisted of dozens of vehicles.","When the convoy merged onto the main road of Pearl City, it immediately drew sidelong glances and exclamations from pedestrians.","Holy crap! Holy crap! Look!","This convoy is insane!","They saw one, two, three... fifteen black Mercedes-Benz vehicles driving by, led by a Maybach worth tens of millions, forming an ultra-luxurious motorcade.","But that was only the beginning.","Behind the Mercedes fleet followed an even larger fleet of buses, nearly thirty of them. All the vehicles maintained almost the exact same speed, looking like a giant, black steel dragon.","What's going on?","Those are the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's cars. Look at the logo. Who in Pearl City doesn't recognize it by now?","Where are so many of them going?","I don't know, but I seriously doubt they're going on a field trip on New Year's Eve.","A pedestrian absentmindedly counted the passing vehicles.","If each bus held fifty people, that was one thousand five hundred people, plus the people in the Mercedes up front... When he reached this calculation, he couldn't help but gasp.","Something huge must have happened!","On the highway, other drivers were also stunned by the massive convoy.","A child saw the convoy, pressed his face against the car window, and shouted excitedly, Daddy, look! So many black cars! It's so long and cool!","Honey, what kind of cars are those?","They belong to the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, the biggest corporate faction in our Pearl City. Either way, they're not to be messed with.","Then we'd better stay far away from them.","...","Along the way, many other cars and passengers heading in the same direction toward Huai City couldn't help but discuss it when they saw the convoy.","Those are the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's cars, right? I recognize that logo.","What happened? Why such a massive display?","The convoy's destination seems to be Huai City. I'm shivering just thinking about it.","Did someone in Huai City pick a fight with the Ten Thousand Dragons Society? Isn't that just a death wish?","How many people are there? A thousand? Two thousand?","More than that, just look at the length of this convoy.","I have a feeling someone is about to get really unlucky.","...","...","Huai City, East District Development Zone, inside a warehouse that had just had its steel-framed roof put up.","This was a newly built logistics warehouse under Liu Shui's name in the new development zone. Spanning over three thousand square meters, it had now become their gathering spot.","In the open space in the middle of the warehouse sat a long table, pieced together from several desks brought over from the office.","Liu Shui sat at the head of the table. On either side of him were Big Lei, Xiucai, Lin Hong, Fatty Du, and two other local bosses, Brother Qiang and Nine Fingers.","The surrounding area of the warehouse was densely packed with people.","At a rough estimate, there were at least six to seven hundred of them.","The makeup of this crowd was rather complex. There were thugs working under various bosses, street toughs temporarily hired with cash, petty hooligans who showed up to support the scene out of so-called loyalty, and troublemakers who had heard about a big event and wanted to join the fun.","In the corner of the warehouse lay a pile of weapons, such as steel pipes, baseball bats, and machetes.","Looking at the sea of heads moving around them, the bosses all showed smug expressions on their faces.","How about it, Boss Liu? I brought one hundred and twenty men, plus eighty more just to pad the numbers. That's two hundred in total. Pretty awesome, right?","I have fewer people on my end, eighty, but every single one is a skilled fighter.","I pulled sixty enforcers from my venues.","...","The final count came out: Big Lei with 200 men, Xiucai with 80, Lin Hong with 60, Fatty Du with 100, Brother Qiang with 100, Nine Fingers with 90, plus the 100 enforcers Liu Shui had prepared himself.","A total of 730 people.","He originally only hoped to gather 500, but unexpectedly exceeded the goal.","It seems the Wanlong Gang's actions from the past few days really sparked public outrage!","\"Good!\"","Liu Shui slammed the table and stood up, saying excitedly, \"We've gathered over seven hundred brothers. How many did the Wanlong Gang bring? Two hundred at most. Three against one, we can crush them with sheer numbers!\"","\"Victory!\"","Excited cheers echoed through the warehouse as everyone chanted the slogan for victory together.","A subordinate walked over carrying a tray with several poured glasses of red wine.","Liu Shui picked up a glass and raised it high. \"Bosses, brothers, tonight's battle is for the pride of us Huaicheng people! After this is over, I, Liu Shui, guarantee that Elder Jiang will double the compensation for all your losses, and from now on, all the business in Huaicheng will be divided equally among us!\"","\"Cheers!\" Big Lei was the first to raise his glass.","\"Cheers!\" The crowd raised their glasses one after another, downing the blood-red wine in one gulp.","After drinking, Liu Shui secretly whispered to the gang bosses, \"I had someone hide two shotguns in advance, just in case.\"","Big Lei was taken aback. \"Homemade shotguns? Is that really necessary? Our lineup is already big enough.\"","\"Better to have them and not need them.\"","A hint of ruthlessness flashed in Liu Shui's eyes. \"If those Wanlong Gang guys are really good at fighting, we can't just sit and wait to die. Don't worry, if something really happens, Elder Jiang will arrange a few fall guys.\"","Hearing this, the crowd finally nodded, feeling a bit more at ease.","Everyone knew that in the Dragon Kingdom, anyone who dared to use a gun, even a homemade one with average power, would face severe consequences.","Since Elder Jiang had already made arrangements, they had nothing more to say.","However, Lin Hong felt a vague sense of unease. As a woman, she believed her sixth sense was much stronger than that of the big men present.","Could something really go wrong?"]},{"number":658,"title":"Chapter 658: 658. Seeking Death","paragraphs":["\"By the way, the scouts I sent to Pearl City just sent word. The Wanlong Syndicate is making a move; their convoy has left the city,\" Liu Shui suddenly said.","\"How many people?\"","\"I'm not exactly sure, but it seems like a lot.\"","\"But no matter how many there are, they couldn't possibly outnumber us, right?\"","\"Exactly. We've got over seven hundred men here. Looking at the whole world, who could possibly match us!\"","Big Lei slammed his hand on the table, threw his wine glass to the ground, and shouted to all his brothers, \"Everyone, the advantage is on our side!\"","\"Let them come! The more, the better! We'll beat them into submission in one battle and let them know who truly rules the skies of Huai City!\"","A frenzy of cheers immediately erupted inside the warehouse.","The underlings began distributing red strips of cloth, tying them to their right arms as a friendly identifier to prevent friendly fire in the melee.","In reality, this was somewhat unnecessary. The Wanlong Syndicate all dressed entirely in black; they couldn't be easier to identify.","Aside from that, they also handed out boxes of energy drinks, bread, and cigarettes, allowing everyone to replenish their physical and mental energy in advance.","In a corner.","A group of young thugs in their early twenties were excitedly taking selfies with their crappy, pixelated phones.","\"Brothers, after tonight, we can finally say we've seen the big leagues!\"","\"I posted it to my social media. My friends are so jealous seeing this huge scene. They keep calling me 'bro' in the comments, saying it's too badass, hahaha!\"","\"How much do you guys think we'll get paid after this fight? Boss Liu said at least two hundred each.\"","\"Two hundred is a lot. I can afford to pull all-nighters at the internet cafe for a whole week.\"","\"Hey, I heard the guys from the Wanlong Syndicate are pretty good fighters. We aren't going to screw this up, are we?\"","\"What nonsense are you spouting? With so many of us, we could drown them if we each just spit once. You're worried about screwing up? Unless what's coming isn't a wave, but a tsunami!\"","\"Relax, relax!\"","\"........\"","On the other side, a few men who had previously dealt with the Wanlong Syndicate were also whispering among themselves. Their expressions were clearly not as pumped up as the others; instead, they looked deeply worried.","\"Can we really pull this off? If you ask me, when the fighting starts, we should hide in the back so it's easier to run away.\"","\"Lao Dao, is that really necessary?\"","\"It is.\"","\"You guys have never fought the Wanlong Syndicate. I clashed with them back when I was following Zhao Biao, and those guys are truly different.\"","\"How are they different?\"","\"I can't quite put it into words. Just, everyone be careful.\"","\"Yeah.\"","Just then, someone let out a surprised gasp.","\"Huh? It looks like the sky just got dark?\"","\"The days are short and the nights are long right now, isn't that normal? Besides, it's snowing lightly outside, so there's no sun.\"","\"No, I just feel like this darkness isn't normal.\"","Before anyone else could tell him he was being too sensitive, someone outside suddenly yelled.","\"They're here!\"","Everyone in the warehouse stood up in a rush, grabbing their weapons.","\"Brothers, now we're going to let those out-of-towners know whose turf Huai City is!\"","\"Oh!!!\"","The crowd roared in unison, all getting hyped up. After all, they had the advantage of numbers this time; who wouldn't be intimidated seeing this?","On the road in the development zone, a long, black steel dragon was driving toward them.","In every vehicle, someone was repeating the orders handed down from above.","\"We're almost there.\"","\"Once we arrive, nobody break formation. Remember, we are not here to fight. As long as they don't make a move, we absolutely do not strike.\"","\"And if they do make a move?\" someone in the back row asked.","\"Then incapacitate them as quickly as possible.\"","The buses began to slow down.","Through the front windshield, Cheng Gang saw their destination: a massive construction site.","At the entrance of what looked like a tin warehouse, a chaotic mess of vehicles was already parked, and a dense, dark crowd of people stood outside.","At a rough estimate, the opposing side had at least five or six hundred men.","On the Wanlong Syndicate's side, the doors of over a dozen Mercedes-Benzes and thirty buses opened almost simultaneously.","Black silhouettes filed out one after another.","In just a few minutes, they formed a sea of black that seemed almost endless.","The opposing crowd, looking at this dense, boundless swarm of men in black, clearly began to grow restless and uneasy.","How the hell was this one or two hundred people?","Multiply that by ten and it'd be closer, right?!","Standing within his own ranks and looking across, Cheng Gang could clearly see the shifting expressions on the faces of those thugs.","From arrogance, to surprise, to disbelief, and finally, to sheer terror.","Their so-called illusion of a numerical advantage shattered completely in this instant!","The few gang bosses, led by Liu Shui, stood at the very front of their crowd, their faces growing increasingly ugly and shocked.","In their expectations, a syndicate mobilizing two hundred men would be the absolute limit. This wasn't a lack of imagination on their part; in reality, whether in the Dragon Kingdom, Harbor City, or even the whole world, that number would definitely qualify as a major syndicate.","But there were at least two thousand people across from them. Could this even be called a syndicate anymore? More like a military legion, right?","In ancient times, this would be considered raising a private army!","How the hell were they supposed to play this!","\"Liu... Boss Liu... fuck, something's wrong!\"","\"Didn't you say they had two hundred men at most? You forgot to multiply it by ten!\"","\"Damn it, I knew something was off when I saw all those vehicles earlier. Dozens of cars and so many buses, I knew there was no way they were just packing seven little dwarfs per car.\"","\"What do we do now?\"","\"We just have to fight it out!\"","The previously excited underlings now stood frozen in shock.","Idioms they had long forgotten since their school days suddenly surfaced in their minds.","Black clouds crushing the city, a dark moon and high winds, total darkness... In short, it was just so fucking black!","Just as they were panicking, the sea of black across from them suddenly parted to the sides, clearing a path.","Everyone's eyes were involuntarily drawn toward it.","At the end of the path was an incredibly imposing luxury Maybach.","The passenger door opened, and a cold, stern young man quickly stepped out. He walked briskly to the back, respectfully pulled open the rear door, and simultaneously opened a black umbrella, holding it over the doorway.","Immediately after, a girl wearing a long black trench coat stepped out of the car. The dark gold dragon-shaped badge on her left chest was exceptionally striking.","With the girl's appearance, the thousands of men in black bowed their heads in greeting almost simultaneously.","\"Eldest Miss!\" x 2,000.","This collective shout of \"Eldest Miss\" made the hundreds of thugs jolt in terror.","At the same time, they were deeply shocked. The leader of this horde of men in black was actually such a young girl? Could she be the heiress of some hidden, elite family?","Liu Yutong walked through the human corridor and arrived in front of these gang bosses.","Her gaze wasn't fierce, but it carried the scrutiny of an absolute superior, as if she were looking at a bunch of monkeys.","\"Putting on such a grand display on New Year's Eve... Did you invite us here to watch the snow, or to watch you dig your own graves?\""]},{"number":659,"title":"Chapter 659: 659, Moving the Gun.","paragraphs":["Liu Shui and the others had expressions so gloomy they looked as if water could drip from them.","The more critical the situation, the less they could afford to panic. If they showed any cowardice in front of their subordinates, it would all be over.","\"Are you the boss of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society?\"","\"Don't be too arrogant! Do you think having more people makes you so great? This is Huaicheng, and even a mighty dragon cannot suppress the local snakes!\"","\"Why is it this same rhetoric again? There's no novelty at all. I think I've already encountered four or five gang bosses who said the exact same thing.\"","\"And the result? They were nothing but a mob.\"","Liu Yutong tilted her head slightly and looked at Yun Cheng.","Yun Cheng understood perfectly, moving the umbrella slightly away to let more light fall on her flawless profile.","\"Times have changed, bosses. I'll give you one minute to put down your weapons, clasp your heads in your hands, and squat down.\"","\"Impossible!\"","Big Lei roared, \"You're just a woman, and you expect us to surrender? What kind of pipe dream are you having?\"","\"Brothers, don't be afraid! They just have numbers, they're all for show! Grab your weapons and fight them! If we win, you'll be heavily rewarded!\"","His roar actually roused the courage of some of the thugs. A few hot-headed youths immediately started howling in agreement.","Liu Yutong shook her head, not wanting to waste any more words on them, and waved her hand.","\"Then let's begin acting courageously for a just cause!\"","As soon as she spoke, Yun Cheng and Lan Die immediately protected her and retreated backward.","At the same time, Ma Da, who was standing at the very front of the formation, suddenly raised an oversized megaphone and began to deploy their tactics.","\"Point one: we are acting in self-defense! Everyone, carve the words 'forced to counterattack' onto your foreheads!\"","\"Point two: attacking vital areas such as the head, neck, chest, and abdomen is strictly prohibited! Focus on the fleshy parts of the limbs, like the arms, legs, and butt cheeks!\"","\"Point three: if you encounter the enemy using regulated knives, clubs, or other weapons, your counterattack can be appropriately escalated, but still avoid vital spots. Our goal is to disarm the enemy's combat effectiveness, not to create disabled people.\"","\"Point five: if the opponent loses the ability to resist or voluntarily surrenders, stop attacking immediately. Anyone who squats with their head in their hands is to be left alone!\"","\"Point six... look alive, everyone! After this fight, the Eldest Miss is treating everyone to a luxurious New Year's Eve dinner with unlimited meat and booze!\"","\"Oh!!!\"","The originally solemn men in black instantly erupted into earth-shattering cheers, their morale skyrocketing once again!","This operation completely dumbfounded Liu Shui, Big Lei, and the others on the opposite side.","What the hell kind of operation was this?","Giving a legal lecture before a battle?","\"Brothers! We have rewards too, unlimited meat and booze! Kill them!\"","\"Charge!\"","Big Lei rushed out first, carrying a steel pipe.","The hundreds of thugs behind him also charged forward. In an instant, the black-clad men and the motley crew collided, and the scene became incredibly chaotic.","Ma Da continued to shoulder the megaphone, constantly directing them.","\"Spread out! Form free groups! Those with riot shields, step up first, pay attention to teamwork!\"","\"Pay attention to the force of your strikes! Although we are acting righteously, in self-defense, and eliminating evil, don't go too far.\"","Because the men in black had a battlefield commander constantly reminding them, everyone's actions remained quite rational.","Facing incoming machetes, someone would first block with a specially made riot shield, while someone behind them would knock the machete away, followed by a sweeping kick to knock the opponent down. A nearby teammate would immediately follow up by stepping on the opponent's calf muscle, it was fleshy and painful, but not prone to severe injury.","\"Ah! My leg!\"","\"Don't hit the face! Damn it! You said no hitting the face! Ouch, my butt!\"","\"Let go! Why are you hugging my leg? Let go! If you don't let go, I'm going to tickle you!\"","\"Regulated weapons! Attention, escalate counterattacks!\"","The entire battlefield was filled with almost identical scenes.","The black-clad men of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society already had the numerical advantage. Coupled with their regular training and boxing, and with an average of several men fighting one, this motley crew was simply no match. They were quickly divided, surrounded, and taken down one by one by the men in black.","Screams, wails, and pleas for mercy were everywhere.","\"Hey, that blondie over there! Yes, you! You actually dare to use a watermelon knife, that's a regulated weapon. Brothers, give that blondie's butt some special attention!\"","\"Fatty! That fatty with the cleaver! That can be considered a deadly weapon, beat the crap out of him!\"","\"Good heroes in black, please go easy, my back is bad, I have hemorrhoids!\"","\"...\"","The battle was an almost one-sided crushing defeat.","The black tide advanced steadily. Wherever they passed, the opponent's men fell piece by piece like harvested wheat, losing their combat effectiveness, and were then signaled by the following men in black to kneel, clasp their heads, and squat to the side.","More and more people squatted down. Soon, a massive dark crowd was squatting by the warehouse wall, all with bruised and swollen faces, shivering.","Liu Shui, Big Lei, and a few other bosses were protected in the middle by their core subordinates, fighting as they retreated. They had already retreated to the warehouse door, their faces full of despair and disbelief.","They couldn't figure out why, when it was many against few, even though the situation was reversed now, they still had a considerable number of people, they would lose so miserably in a massive chaotic brawl.","\"Boss Liu, what do we do? We can't hold them off!\" Xiucai, who had taken a punch to the face that sent his glasses flying, shouted while covering his face.","\"Damn it! Let's fight them to the death!\"","The most hot-tempered Big Lei completely saw red. He turned and ran into the warehouse, found the homemade gun that Boss Liu had hidden, and fired directly out the door.","\"All of you, go to hell!\"","As soon as he came out of the warehouse, the sharp-eyed Cheng Gang spotted him.","A gun! They actually had a gun!","And looking at the guy's crazed appearance, he truly dared to shoot.","\"A gun! Someone has a gun!\" Cheng Gang roared to the back with all his might.","But the scene was too chaotic. The shouts of battle and screams completely drowned out his voice.","At this moment, Big Lei had already raised the homemade gun.","He seemed to know that this thing had poor accuracy, so he didn't even bother aiming. He simply pointed it at the densest area of the men in black, which was roughly in Liu Yutong's direction, and pulled the trigger!","Bang!","A flash of fire flickered at the muzzle!","\"Watch out!\"","The closest person, Cheng Gang, suddenly had his mind go blank. When he saw that the muzzle was raised in the general direction of the Eldest Miss, a rush of hot blood shot straight to his head.","He didn't know where he found the courage and reaction speed, but he lunged forward and forcefully shoved away a black-clad companion who was facing away from the muzzle and grappling with an enemy.","Pfft!","A searing force pierced his left shoulder. There wasn't the agonizing pain he had imagined. He let out a muffled groan and fell to the ground, blood instantly soaking his black suit.","As he fell, he saw a large number of riot shields rapidly converging, blocking the man with the homemade gun to prevent him from firing again and hurting anyone.","As for the Eldest Miss, she had monster-like experts like Ji Yu and Lan Die guarding her, so she should be safe, right? The bullets from that homemade gun probably couldn't even pierce Ji Yu's muscles...","After confirming that the Eldest Miss and the others were not injured, a faint smile appeared on Cheng Gang's face before his consciousness plunged into darkness.","\"Gangzi!\"","\"They are shooting! Bastards! You bastards!\" furious roars erupted from the crowd of men in black.","\"Attention, all units! The enemy is using illegal firearms. This is a severe escalation. They are to be treated as extremist terrorists!\"","\"Use the riot shields and take him out!!!\""]},{"number":660,"title":"Chapter 660: 660, Unbeatable Connections Thank You [Lan Zhu «Shang Shang Qian»] for the God Certification","paragraphs":["As the roar of the engines died down, the men in black quickly stacked their riot shields together and charged fiercely at Big Lei, hiding behind their defenses.","Having just fired a shot, Big Lei frantically fumbled to reload his gun, cursing loudly, \"Damn it, you still dare to come? One more shot and I'll blow your heads off!\"","When the riot shields pressed right up to his face, he barely managed to fire another shot, but the bullet was blocked by the surface of the shield. The firepower of his crude, homemade gun was ultimately no match for professional riot shields.","The men in black were secretly glad that the company had custom-ordered a batch of riot shields a long time ago. The original intention was to reduce accidental injuries among members, but they never expected them to be of such great use today.","If it weren't for these shields, more of their brothers would have probably fallen.","Seeing that this shot was also ineffective, Big Lei hastily reached into his pocket for more bullets, wanting to reload again, but this time, he had no chance.","Before he could even shove the bullet into the chamber, he was swallowed by a wave of black silhouettes.","Immediately after, a series of miserable screams rang out from within the encirclement.","\"Ah!!!\"","Right at this critical moment.","\"Woo-wah! Woo-wah! Woo-wah!\"","The piercing wail of police sirens suddenly erupted, and a massive fleet of police cars was seen speeding rapidly in their direction.","This time, it wasn't just ordinary police cruisers; even SWAT assault vehicles and riot control trucks had been deployed, quickly surrounding the entire area.","A loud megaphone immediately blasted in everyone's ears.","\"Listen up, people inside! You are completely surrounded! Drop your weapons immediately, cease all resistance, put your hands on your heads, and get down! I repeat, drop your weapons immediately and cease all resistance!\"","Everyone at the scene froze in shock.","Liu Shui, Xiucai, and the others were initially startled, but soon after, a wave of wild ecstasy surged in Liu Shui's heart.","Now that the cops were here, things would be easy.","The Wanlong Society had deliberately come to Huaicheng to gather a mob, fight, and commit armed assault. With the evidence so concrete, they were completely doomed!","He even noticed that the one leading the squad seemed to be a Deputy Chief he knew. This was in the bag!","It must be Elder Jiang pulling strings behind the scenes!","\"Officers! Officers! You're here just in time!\"","As if grabbing onto a lifesaver, Liu Shui stumbled and crawled as he rushed toward the police cars.","Once he reached them, he frantically pointed at the dense crowd of Wanlong Society members behind him:","\"They're the Wanlong Society, a mafia group from Mingzhu City! They brought thousands of people here to violently attack us! They're completely lawless! Arrest them quickly! We are all victims!\"","\"Just look at how badly we've been beaten.\"","At this time, Big Lei also dizzyingly climbed to his feet, his brain still not quite processing the situation.","However, the scene that unfolded next made Liu Shui, Big Lei, and all the Huaicheng thugs who were still standing feel a chill run down their spines.","They saw the stern-faced Deputy Chief take a step back, allowing a young female police officer to step forward.","She was the Deputy Team Leader of the investigation task force specially dispatched by the higher-ups.","\"Team Leader Gao, how do you think we should handle this?\"","Gao Min first swept her gaze across Liu Shui's face, her eyes filled with undisguised disgust. Then, she looked at the unconscious Cheng Gang, who was currently receiving first aid. When she noticed the gunshot wound on him, she immediately went on high alert.","\"A gunshot victim has been found at the scene. Have the ambulance take him away first. SWAT Team One and Team Two, subdue all armed and violently resisting personnel! Make sure to identify them carefully!\"","\"Yes, ma'am!\"","A large squad of SWAT officers charged into the scene like fierce tigers and wolves. Their targets were shockingly Liu Shui, Big Lei, and the Huaicheng thugs who were still holding steel pipes and machetes, or who had just participated in the brawl.","\"You've got it all wrong! It's them! The Wanlong Society! The Wanlong Society is the real mafia!\"","As Liu Shui had his arms twisted behind his back and was pinned to the ground by two SWAT officers, he continued to scream frantically, \"I'm Elder Jiang's man! I demand to make a phone call! You're arresting the wrong people!\"","Hearing his words, Gao Min walked up to him and read out his charges.","\"Liu Shui, you are suspected of organizing and leading a mafia-style syndicate, illegal possession of firearms, gathering a crowd to engage in a brawl, attempted murder, and various other crimes. You are now under arrest in accordance with the law. As for this Elder Jiang you mentioned, you will be seeing him very soon.\"","After saying that, she waved her hand at the escorting officers. \"Take him away!\"","\"Attempted murder?\"","Liu Shui was dumbfounded. \"I didn't! It's the Wanlong Society! They are the real mafia!\"","\"Your subordinates carried out an armed attack with firearms, causing severe injuries to the other party's personnel. Was that not instructed by you?\"","Gao Min pointed at Cheng Gang, who was being carried away on a stretcher by the paramedics. \"The evidence is irrefutable. Do you still want to deny it?!\"","Liu Shui felt as if he had been struck by lightning and abruptly looked over at Big Lei.","Big Lei was currently being heavily guarded by the SWAT officers. The red laser sights of several assault rifles were firmly locked onto his body, primarily because he was still gripping that crude, homemade gun in his hand.","\"Drop the gun! This is your final warning!\"","Big Lei looked at the gun barrels pointing at him from all around, then looked at the ashen-faced Liu Shui and the others being taken away. Finally, he looked at the men in black—although they were also being watched by the police on the side, they were merely asked to sit down together and were not being treated roughly.","It was unknown if his brain had been beaten silly just now, but a wave of extreme resentment and unwillingness pounded against his chest.","\"It's just a gun, isn't it? I have one too!\"","He was actually crazy enough to raise the gun in his hand before he even had time to load it.","This move was extremely dangerous.","Bang!","A sniper rifle spat fire. In the distance, the SWAT sniper had decisively chosen to pull the trigger.","Big Lei's body jerked, his motion of drawing the gun freezing in place. He looked down in disbelief at the spreading red stain on his chest, then fell stiffly backward, the homemade gun in his hand dropping onto the freezing snow.","Dead silence fell over the entire scene.","No one expected Big Lei to have the guts to stand his ground even when he was being targeted.","The Huaicheng thugs squatting in the corner witnessed the whole thing and were scared out of their wits.","They looked at Big Lei, who had been shot dead on the spot, then at Liu Shui and the other bosses being swiftly escorted away, and finally at the men in black who were just sitting there, even receiving special treatment from the police. Another wave of chills ran down their spines.","An absurd and terrifying thought began to grow uncontrollably in each of their minds.","\"Were they telling the truth earlier when they said they were acting in self-defense and for a just cause?\"","\"Why are the cops only arresting us and not them? They're even giving them water to drink!\"","\"What exactly does the Wanlong Society do? Are their connections really that deep?\"","\"I told you guys they were different.\"","\"Look at their clothes, look at their demeanor, look at the cops' attitude toward them. How the hell are they gangsters? They're clearly...\" A young thug didn't dare to finish his sentence.","\"Clearly what?\"","\"You all know exactly what!\"","\"This is so fucking corrupt!\"","A massive brawl of a thousand people had ended with them being almost entirely and unilaterally crushed.","Losing the fight was one thing, but on what grounds were the cops only arresting them and ignoring the other side?","Of course, they had no idea that Liu Yutong and her group were acting as bait to cooperate with the investigation team sent from above, aiming to uproot the local criminal syndicates entirely.","In short, far from being illegal, all of their actions were actually assisting law enforcement. Why would the police arrest their own people?","However, from the perspective of the thugs, things looked completely different.","The Wanlong Society's background was simply too deep. As an outside faction, they were somehow able to make the lawful authorities of Huaicheng cooperate with them to such an extent.","Just how high up did their connections go?"]},{"number":661,"title":"Chapter 661: 661、The Sky Over Huaicheng Has Truly Darkened Thanks to [Victoria Eric] for the God Certification","paragraphs":["The wrap-up work was proceeding in an orderly manner.","This operation had wiped out all the local criminal syndicates in one fell swoop, arresting hundreds of suspects. Such a massive achievement was more than enough to warrant a grand internal commendation ceremony.","Cheng Gang was quickly loaded onto an ambulance and sent to the best local hospital, with Liu Yutong personally accompanying him in the vehicle.","The rest of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members left in an orderly fashion in batches, after the police completed basic statements and identity registrations.","Before they left, the deputy chief specifically walked up to Ma Da, who was leading the team, and patted him on the shoulder. \"Thank you all for your hard work. Please cooperate with the follow-up investigation. Ensure the wounded are treated with the utmost care; we won't skimp a single cent on the medical expenses for our heroes.\"","Ma Da nodded. \"Thank you, officers, for upholding justice! Our Ten Thousand Dragons Society has always been a legally operating enterprise, and we firmly support the crackdown on all evil forces! We will fully cooperate with the investigation and reserve the right to file a civil lawsuit for compensation against Liu Shui and his associates!\"","Liu Shui, who had just been escorted into a police car, almost twisted his mouth in anger when he heard this. \"You beat us to a pulp, and you still want us to pay compensation? So what if you have a huge background!\"","The most infuriating part was that the other side's people had actually become heroes? Damn it, do they have no shame? We are the ones who got beaten up, okay?","He also roughly understood in his heart why Elder Jiang's connections were useless at this time; the other party was actually able to mobilize an investigation team from above. Was this still a damn gang? Their connections reached the heavens!","What they didn't know was that Liu Yutong was able to push for the establishment of the investigation team because she carried enough weight in the hearts of the higher-ups. Coupled with the evidence she provided of local gang involvement in Huaicheng, it wasn't difficult to go with the flow and send an investigation team down.","In any case, the conclusive evidence was an ironclad fact.","Gao Min had now been promoted to police captain, and her next goal was the position of district deputy chief. Arranging for her to serve as the deputy team leader this time was also to add a layer of gold to her resume.","The team leader was a superior sent from above, responsible for overall coordination, while Gao Min was in charge of uniting the local police station for specific execution.","Gao Min originally wanted to find her sister Liu Yutong for a quick chat, but seeing her leave so anxiously with the ambulance, she had to drop the idea for now.","............","After the dust settled on the results in the Development Zone, the news quickly spread out through various channels.","Many prominent local figures had actually sent people to secretly keep an eye on this massive battle. Elder Jiang's proxy had united almost all the local underworld bosses to engage in a turf war with an outside force called the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. With such a huge lineup, it was impossible for them to miss it.","They sent people to secretly monitor the outcome of this battle of the century. Of course, the vast majority of people favored Liu Shui's side.","After all, Liu Shui had united so many bosses and reportedly assembled six or seven hundred people. How could he possibly lose?","However, the results made everyone's jaws drop.","Soon, the informants sent back urgent reports one after another.","\"Boss! Something huge happened! Liu Shui went down! He's completely finished!\"","\"What happened? Did people die on the Ten Thousand Dragons Society's side? Did things blow up?\"","\"No, it's Liu Shui and his guys who went down! The Ten Thousand Dragons Society seems completely fine. Even when the cops arrived, they didn't do anything to them.\"","\"Bullshit, with so many of them, how could the other side be fine?\"","\"They really are fine, Boss. The cops only arrested Liu Shui's people. Boss Big Lei was even shot dead by the cops. Word is that those men in black deliberately orchestrated it to establish their dominance!\"","\"R-really?\"","\"As real as it gets. Those outsiders have connections that reach the sky; even the cops are in cahoots with them.\"","\"Got it.\"","The phone was hung up abruptly.","In a high-end private club in Huaicheng, several well-dressed individuals were leisurely drinking tea. After receiving the news, every single one of them was shocked.","\"President Zhang, Chairman Li, the news has been verified. Over at the Development Zone, Liu Shui is completely finished. His backer, Elder Jiang, will probably not be able to protect himself either.\"","\"The Ten Thousand Dragons Society, that faction from Pearl City, are they really that powerful?\"","\"More than powerful, it's simply absurd. We'll have to be careful from now on, too. After all, even Elder Jiang went down.\"","\"Elder Jiang has been entrenched in Huaicheng for so many years, with intricate and complex connections. Being uprooted this time, do you know how many people will be implicated? In the past, for the sake of our projects, we all had some involvement with him, more or less... Sigh!\"","\"Hurry up and do a self-inspection. Pay any outstanding taxes, and quickly cut off any ties that need to be cut. In the future, in Huaicheng, and even in the entire region, we can only befriend the Ten Thousand Dragons Society and absolutely must not offend them! No, we have to find a way to connect with them!\"","\"........\"","Not long after these big shots received the news, it also spread rapidly like wildfire among the common people.","Some petty thugs, taxi drivers, night market vendors, and so on, all heard various versions of the rumors, and these rumors grew increasingly outrageous.","\"Did you hear? Over at the East District warehouse, Liu Shui gathered over seven hundred people to take on the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. In the end, the other side showed up with thousands of people, and all of them were...\"","\"All of them were what? Spit it out, stop keeping us in suspense!\"","\"All of them were ruthless, black-hearted badasses! They are so much darker than these Huaicheng gangsters who only know how to bluster and constantly ask 'What are you looking at'!\"","\"Hiss~ Is that true?\"","\"Of course it's true! A buddy of mine who drives in that area saw it with his own eyes. There's a gang boss in the north of the city named Big Lei, you guys know him, right?\"","\"Yeah, yeah, the one with the fierce-looking face.\"","\"Right, that's him! He got his hands on a homemade shotgun from god knows where, wanting to blast the head of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. But guess what happened?\"","\"As soon as the gun went off, not only was the other guy fine, but Big Lei's head was slapped flying by a man in black using the Iron Sand Palm!\"","\"Slapped his head flying? Is he a damn superhero?!\"","\"Right? But how come I heard he was shot dead by the police?\"","\"That's a rumor! My buddy saw it with his own eyes, how could it be fake? Anyway, with just one strike, Big Lei's head was like a rotten watermelon—splat!—and it went flying! Red and white matter splattered all over the ground, it was so gruesome!\"","\"Mother of god, that's too brutal! Didn't the cops arrest them when they got there?\"","\"Brother, you're too naive. This is the scariest part. When those men in black saw the cops coming, they didn't panic at all. Instead...\"","\"Instead what? Can you just finish it in one breath, damn it? You're killing us with anxiety!\"","\"Instead, a few of the leading men in black, right in front of all those cops, pulled out several dark pieces from their coats—not homemade shotguns, but proper real guns! They aimed at the bosses on the ground who weren't completely dead yet and still wanted to resist, and went pew! pew! pew! A burst of fire, and they finished them all off!\"","\"Holy shit! Right in front of the cops?\"","\"Yeah! My buddy said those cops acted like they didn't even see it. They tacitly allowed them to do it, and both sides even exchanged friendly greetings.\"","\"It was only after those men in black had finished venting that the cops finally rounded up and arrested the rest of the people who hadn't been killed.\"","At this point in the conversation, the exact same movie line popped into everyone's mind at the same time.","\"Police, come out and clean up the mess!\"","Even though the rumors grew increasingly outrageous as they spread from person to person, they, along with those prominent bosses, all came to the exact same realization.","The skies over Huaicheng had truly gone pitch black!"]},{"number":662,"title":"Chapter 662: 662. Picking someone up.","paragraphs":["Huaicheng First People's Hospital, the corridor outside the operating room.","Whether it was the patients or their families, everyone's voices were much lower than usual at this moment.","Because a group of men in black stood neatly on both sides of the corridor, creating a truly intimidating atmosphere.","There was even a family that had originally planned to cause a medical disturbance. As soon as they reached the entrance of the corridor, they were so frightened by the scene that they turned around and fled, no longer daring to make trouble for the surgeon. That doctor seemed to be operating on a brother of these underworld bosses; making a scene now would be asking for death.","Seeing this group of men in black and recalling today's rumors, many people roughly guessed that these men were probably from that ruthless underworld...","In short, anyone who saw them instinctively showed a look of fear.","Liu Yutong stood motionless by the window in the corridor outside the operating room, gazing at the sparse snowflakes falling outside. A hint of worry lingered on her flawless side profile.","This was the worst situation they had encountered since the founding of the Wanlong Syndicate.","Yun Cheng and Lan Die stood quietly three paces behind her, like black shadows.","Ma Da rushed out of the elevator, holding two cups of coffee in his hands.","\"Miss, please go and rest for a while. We can keep watch over Cheng Gang here.\"","\"No.\"","Liu Yutong turned around, took one of the coffees, and asked, \"What did the hospital's consultation say?\"","\"Although the bullet didn't hit any vital organs, he lost a lot of blood. However, I heard the chief surgeon assigned by the hospital is highly skilled, the best surgeon in Huaicheng.\"","\"Then let's wait a bit longer.\"","\"Right, Miss, what about his younger brother? Should we notify him?\"","Liu Yutong had just reviewed Cheng Gang's detailed profile. After all, with nearly three thousand core members now, it was impossible for her to know everyone's background clearly.","Immediately after Cheng Gang's accident, she had someone retrieve his file, not expecting him to have had such a rough life.","Although he had gone astray in the past, fortunately, he eventually got back on the right path and worked very hard on a daily basis.","What was unexpected, however, was that not long after becoming a core member, he was severely injured taking a bullet for a comrade.","In any case, no matter what, she could not let anything happen to him.","\"Let's wait a while before notifying him, at least until we confirm Cheng Gang is out of danger.\"","Ma Da nodded. \"Understood!\"","Just then, the operating room doors suddenly opened.","A nurse hurried out and asked, \"Are the injured patient's family members here? We need a signature.\"","Liu Yutong immediately stepped forward. \"I am his boss. I will sign whatever is needed.\"","The nurse hesitated for a moment, glancing at the imposing men in black behind Liu Yutong, and then at the overly young but inherently authoritative girl in front of her. Finally, she nodded.","\"The surgery was very successful. The bullet has been removed, and no major blood vessels or nerves were damaged. But the patient lost a lot of blood and needs to be observed in the ICU for a period of time. These are the postoperative notice and the ICU admission consent form.\"","Liu Yutong took the pen and signed her name in the designated spot.","\"Thank you.\"","The nurse took the documents back, gave them another look, and asked, \"Are you... really his colleagues?\"","\"We are family,\" Liu Yutong corrected.","The nurse was slightly taken aback, nodded, and turned back into the operating room.","About twenty minutes later, the operating room doors opened again.","Cheng Gang was wheeled out. His face was pale, his body covered in various tubes, and he was still unconscious from the anesthesia.","\"The patient needs rest. ICU visits have time limits; only one person can enter at a time, and for no more than ten minutes.\"","The attending physician took off his mask and said to Liu Yutong and the others, \"You can leave one or two people here to keep watch. The rest of you should go back. It's not good to have too many people here.\"","Liu Yutong looked at Ma Da. \"You go back first. I'll wait here.\"","\"Miss, how can we do that?\" Ma Da became anxious.","\"I have the final say.\"","Liu Yutong's tone brokered no argument. \"Go check on the situation at the restaurant. Don't keep everyone waiting too long.\"","\"Oh, and you can arrange for someone to pick up his younger brother now.\"","\"Alright.\"","After Ma Da left hurriedly, Liu Yutong sat down on the bench outside the ICU.","A few hours later.","A black Mercedes-Benz drove away from Cheng Gang's hometown, arriving in a hurry and leaving in a hurry.","\"Little Lei, don't be afraid. We are your brother's brothers, taking you to the city for the New Year.\" Sitting in the back seat with Cheng Lei was Zhou Ming, a veteran member of the Wanlong Syndicate.","\"Is my brother... really okay?\" Cheng Lei asked, choking back sobs.","\"He really is fine. The surgery was very successful.\"","Zhou Ming comforted him, \"What's more, our Miss is personally keeping an eye on things at the hospital.\"","Cheng Lei bit his lip and said no more, but his mood had finally calmed down a bit.","By the time the car drove into the urban area of Huaicheng, it was already past ten o'clock at night.","The streets were decorated with lanterns and colorful banners, and the occasional sound of firecrackers could be heard. The festive New Year atmosphere was very strong, but they were in no mood to appreciate the scene.","The car stopped at the hospital, and Cheng Lei finally saw his dearly missed brother, Cheng Gang.","However, when he saw his brother lying in the ICU through the window, he couldn't hold back and started crying loudly again.","\"Little Lei?\"","Just then, a female voice came from behind him. The voice seemed to carry a kind of magic that instantly made him stop crying.","He turned around and saw a young woman wearing a black trench coat. She was incredibly beautiful; he had never seen anyone so pretty.","Pinned to her left chest was a dark gold dragon-shaped badge, making her status seem very high.","Behind her stood several men in black.","\"You... who are you?\"","\"I am your brother's boss. Your name is Cheng Lei, right?\"","Cheng Lei nodded blankly.","Liu Yutong earnestly apologized to him, \"Little Lei, I'm sorry.\"","Cheng Lei was stunned. \"Why... why are you apologizing to me?\"","\"I am responsible for your brother's injury. As their boss, if I take them out to work, I have the responsibility to bring them back safely, but I failed to do so.\"","\"So, I have to say sorry to you.\"","Cheng Lei opened his mouth but couldn't speak.","The elders in his village always said that city bosses were black-hearted, only caring about making money and ignoring the life or death of their workers. But the beautiful lady right in front of him was apologizing so sincerely because his brother got hurt. It was truly easy to feel a strong sense of goodwill toward her.","\"My brother... is my brother really going to be alright?\"","Liu Yutong comforted him, \"Don't worry, the doctor said he will probably be transferred to a regular ward tomorrow. I will also hire the best doctors and use the best medicine so he can be discharged early.\"","\"Also, I heard your brother's wish was to bring you to the city to study. I will help you take care of that. From today on, everything for you in the city, including your housing, schooling, and living expenses, will be covered by the company.\"","Tears welled up in Cheng Lei's eyes again. \"Thank you, thank you, miss.\"","Liu Yutong gently patted his shoulder. \"You must be hungry, right? I'll take you to get some food, and we can ring in the New Year together.\"","\"But my brother...\"","\"Your brother will be cared for by professional doctors and nurses, and besides, we aren't allowed into the ward anyway. Also, since your brother can't ring in the New Year with everyone, you are his representative, and you are our family too. Shouldn't you celebrate this New Year properly, for his sake as well as your own?\"","Cheng Lei nodded. Reluctantly, he walked toward the elevator with her, while Yun Cheng and the others followed behind.","They arrived at the entrance on the first floor.","Cheng Lei saw that the hospital lobby was still filled with many men in black, wearing the same clothes his brother had on when he came home, and several black sedans were parked outside the doors.","He had never seen a scene like this before; it felt even more shocking than the mobsters on TV.","Just what kind of company did his brother work for?","They treated him so well, so it couldn't possibly be the... mafia, could it?"]},{"number":663,"title":"Chapter 663: 663. Thanks to [Qiu Xiaoying, who likes the qin] for the expert certification.","paragraphs":["In less than ten minutes, the motorcade pulled up in front of a brightly lit grand hotel.","By this time, the parking lot at the entrance and the nearby roadsides were already packed with cars. They all belonged to the Wanlong Syndicate, as they had paid a premium to book the entire hotel.","Cheng Lei was led out of the car by Liu Yutong, and immediately after, he witnessed the most shocking scene of his life.","At the hotel entrance, two rows of men in black suits stood ramrod straight with their hands behind their backs. The lines stretched all the way from the doors into the interior of the hotel.","Seeing Liu Yutong arrive, they immediately bowed in unison and greeted her.","\"Eldest Miss!\"","This grand display gave Cheng Lei, a country boy who had barely ever been to the city, a violent start.","\"Don't be afraid, they're our people,\" Liu Yutong comforted him, then led him into the hotel.","If the spectacle outside had scared him, walking into the hotel made him feel as though his breathing had stopped entirely.","Inside the massive banquet hall, there were hundreds of tables, and every single one was packed with men in black.","And this was only the first-floor lobby. The second-floor banquet hall also held hundreds of tables, equally filled to the brim with men in black.","Nearly two thousand people were gathered together watching the Spring Festival Gala, though most were drinking, playing finger-guessing games, chatting, and boasting.","When they saw Liu Yutong appear, they stood up in unison at the very first moment and greeted her together once again.","\"Eldest Miss!\" multiplied by thousands.","The scene was incredibly awe-inspiring.","Cheng Lei could feel his own legs trembling.","There were simply too many of these men in black, too orderly, and too imposing.","It felt as if he had stumbled into a black ocean that could completely swallow his tiny figure at any moment.","His brother's company... was terrifying.","Fortunately, he had a sister with a powerful aura right beside him, which allowed him to barely suppress the nervousness in his heart.","Liu Yutong led him onto the stage, picked up a microphone, and made an introduction.","\"Everyone, this is Cheng Gang's younger brother, Cheng Lei.\"","\"Cheng Gang is a hero of our company. The family of a hero is our family. Let's give him a warm round of applause to welcome him!\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the crowd erupted into applause.","\"Brother Xiaolei, welcome!\"","Followed immediately by a second, a third, a tenth, a hundredth...","\"Welcome, Brother Xiaolei!\"","\"Gangzi is a good man, and his brother is our brother too!\"","\"Don't be afraid, Xiaolei. Your big brothers will look out for you from now on!\"","\"...\"","Nearly two thousand people expressed their welcome to Cheng Lei in their own ways. Some waved, some nodded and smiled, some raised their glasses, and some shouted at the top of their lungs that they would protect him.","Cheng Lei stood there blankly, feeling the tide of enthusiasm rushing toward him.","It was strange. He was clearly very afraid of these men in black, but for some reason, a very special sense of security welled up in his heart.","These people indeed looked very dark and intimidating, but the looks in their eyes when they gazed at him were very warm. He had only ever seen this kind of warm gaze in his brother's eyes before.","Finally, he held it in for a good while before stumbling out a few words: \"Thank you, thank you, older brothers and sisters!\"","Afterward, Liu Yutong led him to the main table to sit down.","\"Serve the dishes!\" Ma Da immediately shouted loudly behind him.","The hot dishes that had been prepared long ago began to be brought out one by one. Braised carp, Four Joy Meatballs, sliced boiled chicken... the spread was incredibly lavish.","This was specially reserved for the main table by Ma Da.","After the dishes were served, no one touched their chopsticks. Instead, they all looked toward Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong picked up her beverage glass and stood up. \"Brothers, sisters, everyone has worked hard this past year!\"","\"The New Year is here, and I don't have much else to say. I only hope that at this time next year, we can still sit together like we are now, sharing a New Year's Eve dinner, safe and sound, without a single person missing.\"","\"Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!\"","\"Cheers!!!\"","Cheng Lei also raised his glass.","After the meal, Liu Yutong arranged for someone to escort Cheng Lei to a hotel to rest. Ma Da accompanied him and even specially had someone buy him a few sets of new clothes.","Lying on the soft and comfortable large bed in the hotel, Cheng Lei just couldn't fall asleep.","Finally, he took out the phone his brother had given him and sent a text message to his brother's number.","\"Brother, Happy New Year! I met your colleagues. They are all really nice, and the boss lady is especially good to me too. She even told me to call her sister. Hurry up and get well, I'm waiting for you so we can go home together.\"","After it sent successfully, Cheng Lei stared blankly at the ceiling again.","It all felt like a dream.","On this New Year's Eve, even though his brother wasn't by his side, he felt as if he had found something even bigger than a home.","A family.","A super large family that was black on the surface, yet full of warmth.","..................","The next day.","After waking up, Liu Yutong took a car back to her hometown.","Most of the others also dispersed, heading to their respective homes to spend the first day of the Lunar New Year, leaving only a few people in Huaicheng to accompany Cheng Lei in taking care of his brother, Cheng Gang.","When she arrived at her hometown, she was just in time for her grandparents to finish making lunch.","Gao Min had also arrived early and was helping out in the kitchen.","Liu Yutong had just parked the car in the courtyard. As soon as she stepped out, a petite and adorable figure ran out from the main room and threw herself at her.","\"Sister!\"","Yaya, wearing a small red padded jacket, threw herself joyfully into Liu Yutong's arms. She had her hair tied up in two little buns, and her eyes were big and bright, making her look just like a porcelain doll.","Liu Yutong bent down to pick her up and planted a kiss on her soft cheek. \"Did Yaya miss her big sister?\"","The little girl had been sent back to their hometown as soon as her holidays started. It wasn't that there was no one to play with her in Pearl City; it was mainly because they couldn't withstand the grandparents' daily nagging to see her.","However, since coming back, Yaya had been playing even more wildly.","In the city, there were too many cars and people, so she couldn't run around freely, and there were fewer children her age. But in the village, this wasn't an issue. After getting familiar with the place over a few days, the little girl started running around wildly with the village kids, almost turning into a little tomboy.","There was no need to worry about safety in Duan Village, as many surveillance cameras had been installed. Plus, everyone knew that this little girl was adopted by Liu Yutong, so they all looked out for her.","As for outsiders entering the village, as long as they were unfamiliar faces, they would be immediately scrutinized by the villagers, unless they were explicitly there to visit relatives.","\"I did! I missed you so much!\"","Yaya hugged Liu Yutong's neck tightly and said in a crisp voice, \"Sister, Grandpa said he made Eight Treasure Rice today. There are lots of sweet red dates and lotus seeds inside. I really want to eat it.\"","\"Little glutton,\" Liu Yutong smiled and pinched her little nose.","Hearing the commotion, the grandparents also came out of the house to welcome her, smiling warmly as they called her inside to eat.","Once the whole family was seated around the table, Liu Yutong saw a familiar yet foreign figure wearing an apron, walking in from the kitchen carrying a pot of freshly cooked pork rib soup.","\"Pork rib soup is here!\"","He set the soup pot down, and upon seeing Liu Yutong already sitting at the table, he instantly tensed up.","Even though he was several years older than Liu Yutong and was her older brother, he still felt uneasy, and even afraid, every time he saw her.","This person was none other than Liu Yutong's stepbrother, Liu Yushan.","\"Sis, you're back. How was the journey?\"","Liu Yutong nodded, then cut straight to the chase, \"How have things been going with Debao lately?\"","\"Not... not bad. I've been getting up at six every morning to work in the greenhouse. During my lunch break, I occasionally play chess with Grandpa, and in the evening...\" Liu Yushan hurriedly explained his recent situation in detail.","\"It seems you've done some good soul-searching, but I hope you aren't just putting on an act for me. Do you understand?\"","\"I've really turned over a new leaf. I... I promise I will work hard. I...\"","\"Alright, sit down and let's eat.\"","........."]},{"number":664,"title":"Chapter 664: 664. Itinerary Arrangement.","paragraphs":["Grandpa and Grandma spent the entire morning preparing sixteen dishes, symbolizing that everything would go smoothly in the new year.","Yaya sat beside Liu Yutong, her little hands resting obediently on her knees. However, her eyes could not help but steal glances at the crystal-clear Eight Treasure Rice. She pursed her lips again and again, looking absolutely adorable.","Grandpa sat at the head of the table and, as the head of the family, spoke first.","Everyone, take a seat.","The adults who had finished their chores gradually took their seats. Yaya still maintained a very proper posture and did not touch her chopsticks.","Yaya, why aren't you eating? Grandma asked her.","Yaya replied in a milky, childish voice, If the elders haven't touched their chopsticks, children can't eat first. We have to wait for the elders to take the first bite.","At these words, all the adults at the table burst into laughter.","Grandpa was grinning from ear to ear. Good, good, our Yaya is so polite.","Saying that, he picked up his chopsticks and took a piece of fish. Grandpa has started, so you go ahead and eat.","Having received permission, Yaya finally picked up her little spoon, scooped up some Eight Treasure Rice, and started eating happily.","Compared to the heavy meat and fish dishes, she obviously preferred this sweeter food.","Liu Yutong could not help but remind her, Don't eat too many sweets. You need to protect your teeth, you know?","Yaya made a finger heart with her thumb and index finger. Sister, can I just eat a little bit more?","Before Liu Yutong could speak, Grandma chimed in, Let her eat a bit more. What's wrong with eating a little extra for the New Year?","Grandma, you are just spoiling her, Liu Yutong said helplessly, then turned to Yaya. Then remember to brush your teeth regularly.","Mhm! Yaya nodded her little head, then scooped up a few more large spoonfuls of the Eight Treasure Rice, eating with even more relish.","She looked at her grandparents again. Grandpa and Grandma, you eat too.","Alright, alright, we will all eat.","The atmosphere at the dining table gradually warmed up, and the family finished their lunch amidst talking and laughing.","After dinner, everyone gathered in the living room to drink tea and watch TV.","Yaya grew sleepy and lay on Liu Yutong's lap, yawning continuously. This was mostly a habit formed in kindergarten, where she always had to take a nap after lunch.","Sister, you smell so good, Yaya mumbled drowsily while resting on Liu Yutong's lap.","Really? What kind of smell is it?","Like... like a blanket that has been baked in the sun. Mmm... warm and fragrant.","Go to sleep now.","Liu Yutong took the small blanket Grandma handed her and covered the little girl, who quickly fell asleep.","The newly built house in their hometown had additional heating installed, so there was no need to worry about her catching a cold.","Gao Min finished washing the dishes and brought over two cups of tea, handing one to Liu Yutong.","Is Yaya asleep?","Yes.","Liu Yutong took the tea. Thank you, Sister.","Gao Min sat beside her with her tea, sipping it while watching the large TV, which was replaying last night's Spring Festival Gala.","A moment later.","Is something on your mind? Liu Yutong suddenly asked.","Gao Min turned to look at her. Is it that obvious?","Liu Yutong said, It's about Zhao Weixiang, right?","You are as scary as ever. Sometimes I really wonder if you can read minds.","Gao Min smiled bitterly. All the evidence points to him now, but if we can't bring him back, it is all for nothing.","The day my dad sacrificed his life... I still remember when he left the house that morning, he said, Girl, when Dad gets back, I'll take you out for your favorite hotpot, and then...","Gao Min turned her head away. After calming her emotions, she continued, I went to the police academy and worked desperately hard, all so that one day I could personally catch the person who killed him.","Now I have a pretty good idea of who it is, but the key suspect has hidden abroad. This feeling of powerlessness... Yutong, can you understand it?","The Dragon Kingdom and the Beautiful Country had no extradition treaty, which was indeed a huge problem.","Liu Yutong handed her the teacup and stroked Yaya's hair, saying, What if I told you I have a way to make him come back?","Gao Min froze for a moment, then shook her head. Don't comfort me. Without an extradition treaty, official channels won't work. As for other methods, don't tell me you would actually send your Wanlong Syndicate people to snatch him by force?","I admit your Wanlong Syndicate is very powerful domestically, but abroad, especially in the West, your people wouldn't be of much use. Plus, gun ownership isn't banned there, so the risk is extremely high.","What she said was the truth.","The Wanlong Syndicate was absolutely a formidable corporate group within the country, but in a foreign land where they were unfamiliar with the people and the environment, they would basically be useless. If the other side used guns, people could die.","I never said I was going to use Wanlong Syndicate's people, Liu Yutong said.","Hearing this, Gao Min looked at her in confusion.","Liu Yutong tucked the blanket around Yaya. The little girl smacked her lips in her sleep, hugging Liu Yutong's leg and rubbing against it, looking incredibly cute.","I know someone. His name is Jesse, of Italian descent.","What do you mean?","That man has some influence in the Beautiful Country. Assisting in catching someone shouldn't be a big problem for him.","After so much time had passed, Jesse had not been completely idle. Relying on the funds she provided and the support of his father's old subordinates, he had finally taken control of more than half the factions over there. Dealing with a guy who had fled from the Dragon Kingdom would be more than easy for him.","Gao Min seemed to have guessed Jesse's identity and did not ask any further.","She was just shocked by her younger sister's methods, quietly extending her reach abroad. Domestically, her sister was indeed very law-abiding. Even though the company looked like an underworld syndicate, they never did anything illegal. If it weren't for their long period of interaction, anyone else would find it hard to believe.","But it was different abroad. There were numerous gangs in the West, and they even had access to all kinds of weapons. Turf wars over there were truly terrifying.","With her sister's methods, would she actually turn into a real mobster over there?","Although Gao Min really wanted to follow her sister abroad to catch the man personally and keep an eye on her sister while she was at it, logic told her it wouldn't work, because her status as a police officer made it inappropriate.","Leave this matter to me. I happen to be going abroad after the New Year anyway, Liu Yutong said.","Gao Min nodded. Then you must be very careful.","Mhm!","After staying in her hometown for three days, Liu Yutong returned to Pearl City. Not long after she entered her office, Su Mansu knocked on the door and walked in.","Boss, all the preparations for the trip abroad are complete. Let me give you a report.","The members accompanying you on this business trip include Yun Cheng, Ji Yu, Chu Yang, Zhao Tianyi, Qiu Ciyun, three engineers, myself, and twenty bodyguards selected from our core members, forming a joint delegation.","She had not originally planned to let Yun Cheng go, but he was truly worried and insisted on tagging along. Perhaps in his mind, the danger level abroad was far higher than at home, so having one more person meant an extra layer of security. Unable to dissuade him, Liu Yutong had to agree.","As for Zhao Tianyi, his foreign language skills were quite good, and he was relatively knowledgeable about some foreign laws.","There was even less need to mention Qiu Ciyun and the others. They were among the main figures of this trip, and many of the itineraries revolved around them.","There was no need for extra arrangements regarding translation. As Liu Yutong's primary assistant, Su Mansu had studied abroad and was proficient in multiple languages, making her more than capable of handling the job.","Chu Yang was coming along because of his Special Forces background. He was the best marksman among them, and as for legally carrying firearms abroad, someone else would handle the paperwork for them.","The reason for bringing Ji Yu was even simpler: he was the chief bodyguard, tough as nails and a phenomenal fighter.","In short, the security for Liu Yutong's trip was practically maxed out.","\"According to the itinerary, we expect to stay abroad for about two months. Our first stop is Berlin, where our main agenda is to tour the production lines of three microchip companies. The equipment we need for Longxin is primarily imported from the second-hand machinery phased out by these manufacturers. President Qiu reported that the negotiations are basically finalized.\"","\"On March 3rd, we fly to Eindhoven. On the 4th, we will tour the ASML headquarters. We obtained an internal visitor permit through a company we secretly control, but our true identities must remain confidential, so we can't bring too many people. On the 5th, we have a technical exchange session with the Philips Research Institute.\"","\"On the 7th, we head to Leuven to visit the IMEC microelectronics research center, which is one of the top chip research and development institutions in the West...\"","\"On the 9th, we fly from Brussels to San Francisco, followed by our Silicon Valley itinerary...\"","\"Also, boss, Miss Bai called. She said she plans to travel with us since she happens to be attending a fashion show there anyway. Furthermore, her family's main businesses are located in the West, and her father, who lives in the United States year-round, is hoping to meet with you.\"","\"...\""]},{"number":665,"title":"Chapter 665: 665, You Are Free.","paragraphs":["After listening to the report, Liu Yutong nodded. Tell Suisui that I agree. Let's rent a larger private jet. It will be more convenient for such a large group.","Su Mansu replied, Understood, boss.","Liu Yutong asked again, By the way, Zhao Tianyi is coming with us. Can he finish handling his matters in Huaicheng?","Zhang Tao hadn't been released yet, and the lawsuit hadn't even started.","Su Mansu said, Lawyer Zhao said he will definitely get it done before we go abroad. He mentioned that the second communication meeting with the prosecutor's office will be held in two days. If nothing unexpected happens, the prosecution should drop the charges, so there won't be a need for a trial.","Liu Yutong said, That's good.","Also, communicate with the Yu Group. Our residential project should ideally be delivered by the end of this year. I promised to give Zhang Tao and the others houses, and we can't keep delaying it.","Su Mansu replied, Yes, boss!","She couldn't help but sigh inwardly at her boss's generosity. Working at Wanlonghui was truly a blessing.","Originally, she hadn't planned on buying a house in Pearl City, as purchasing property usually meant settling down long-term, but now she was tempted.","With so many industries under the Wanlonghui Group, plus the upstream and downstream supply chains it drove, the development potential here was absolutely stellar.","Most importantly, the company members were pleasant, interesting, and exceptionally driven.","Three days later.","Huaicheng Prosecutor's Office, Meeting Room 3.","The second hearing for the Zhao Biao case was being held here.","This wasn't a statutory procedure; it was more like a debate. If they could directly convince the prosecution, there would be no need to go to court, and Zhang Tao could be released immediately.","The attendees included personnel from the arrest approval division of the prosecutor's office, relevant police investigators, the defendant's defense attorney Zhao Tianyi, and three invited legal experts.","Sitting at the head of the table was the Deputy Chief Prosecutor of Huaicheng, a man around fifty years old surnamed Zhou.","Let's begin.","Deputy Chief Prosecutor Zhou tapped the table and looked at Zhao Tianyi, saying, Lawyer Zhao, please state your reasons against the arrest approval first.","He used to just call him Attorney Zhao, but this guy corrected him every single time to use his preferred title, leaving him quite speechless.","Zhao Tianyi stood up. He didn't hold any notes, as he had memorized the content by heart and didn't need them at all.","Prosecutor Zhou, fellow prosecutors, what I want to talk about today isn't legal clauses. Those are all clearly stated in the written opinions. Today, I want to tell a few stories first.","With that, he turned on the projector. The first photo showed a man covered in blood, lying in a hospital bed.","This man is Chen Ershan. In early 2006, he was robbed at his own convenience store. He grabbed a kitchen knife to defend himself and injured the attacker. As a result, he was convicted of intentional assault and sentenced to one year and three months in prison. During his incarceration, his father fell ill from anger and passed away, and his wife divorced him. After being released from prison, he went south to work. Last Spring Festival, he jumped off a building at a construction site. He wrote one sentence in his suicide note: 'The biggest regret of my life is fighting back that day.'","Then, he brought up a second photo. It was an eighteen-year-old boy who had just reached adulthood.","Wang Xiaojiu. Last year, outside of school, three high schoolers tried to extort protection money from him. He fought back, injuring one of their eyes with his backpack. As a result, he was detained for half a month for picking quarrels and provoking trouble, and was expelled from school. His classmates and teachers all thought he was a delinquent. He swallowed an entire bottle of sleeping pills. Although he was saved, his mind was damaged. Now he sits at his front door all day, staring blankly.","...","These are all real cases I've found. I won't judge the right or wrong of those verdicts. I just want to ask one question: When our judicial system repeatedly tells ordinary people that there are risks in fighting back, who exactly are we protecting? Are we protecting law-abiding citizens, or are we giving thugs a get-out-of-jail-free card?","The meeting room fell silent for a moment.","Only then did Deputy Chief Prosecutor Zhou speak slowly, Lawyer Zhao, isolated cases cannot represent the whole.","Then let's talk about the case in front of us.","Zhao Tianyi pulled up the files on Zhao Biao's case and said, Zhao Biao, a gang leader in Qingniu Town. According to police records, this man has been involved in illegal activities in Huaicheng and Qingniu Town for many years, including intentional assault, gathering crowds for brawls, extortion, illegal detention, and so on. Most of the time, he escaped punishment by spending money or threatening victims to obtain letters of forgiveness.","However, these are enough to prove that he is a man with a notorious track record. On the day of the incident, my client Zhang Tao was celebrating his wedding. Yet Zhao Biao deliberately showed up to provoke trouble, bringing over a hundred people armed with machetes and steel pipes. They broke into a private residence and took hostages at knifepoint. Let me ask, does this or does this not constitute a violent crime that seriously endangers personal safety?","It does.","Deputy Chief Prosecutor Zhou admitted, But after Zhang Tao snatched the knife, Zhao Biao no longer had a weapon in his hand. That is also a fact.","Prosecutor Zhou!","Zhao Tianyi raised his voice. Please put yourself in Zhang Tao's shoes and think about the situation at that time. His wife had a knife to her neck, and his parents-in-law were held hostage. In such a moment, you demand that Zhang Tao first determine whether Zhao Biao has a knife in his hand? You demand that he calculate the limits of self-defense within fractions of a second? You demand that he precisely control the angle and posture of a fall? Isn't that asking the impossible?","This is not law; this is a myth. If the law requires citizens to do things only gods can do in life-or-death situations, then such a law is tantamount to the murder of law-abiding people!","A young prosecutor couldn't help but speak up, But a death did occur.","A death occurred, so someone has to be held responsible? What kind of logic is that?","Zhao Tianyi countered, Then let me ask you, if Zhang Tao hadn't snatched the knife that day, what would the outcome have been? The outcome would be that he was killed by Zhao Biao.","He spoke very sharply today, mainly because this wasn't a courtroom; it wasn't a formal setting, so he could afford to be bolder.","Zhao Tianyi then took out a folder.","These are the written opinions of ten domestic authorities on criminal law regarding this case. Eight of them believe it constitutes justifiable self-defense, and two believe it might be excessive defense but the circumstances are remarkably minor and should not warrant an arrest approval.","Zhao Tianyi pushed the documents toward Deputy Chief Prosecutor Zhou.","Prosecutor Zhou, to approve the arrest or not is not a simple procedural decision. It sends a signal to the whole society: when violence comes, does the law stand behind you, or does it stand against you?","The law must not yield to lawlessness!","Deputy Chief Prosecutor Zhou carefully flipped through the opinions written by the criminal law professors page by page, passing each page to the next person after finishing it.","Everyone read through them seriously before finally looking at Zhao Tianyi.","Before they could speak, Zhao Tianyi said first, I've said my piece for today. No matter what decision you make next, I will respect it, and then I will overturn it in court using evidence and the law.","By the way, let me tell everyone: since I founded Tianyi Law Firm, I haven't lost a single case!","After Zhao Tianyi finished his boast, he executed a handsome turn and left the meeting room.","The meeting room instantly exploded into an uproar.","\"Damn, this guy is way too arrogant!\"","\"Is he threatening us?\"","\"Prosecutor Zhou, we can't let him intimidate us.\"","\"........\"","Zhou Wenbin raised his hand, signaling for everyone to quiet down.","\"Quiet, everyone! Lawyer Zhao's words might be hard to swallow, but was he wrong? I think he made an excellent point.\"","\"The law should never yield to lawlessness!\"","\"........\"","The next day, Huaicheng Detention Center.","Zhang Tao had been here for almost thirteen days. Thirteen days wasn't a long time, but it wasn't short either—it was more than enough time for a person to figure out a lot of things.","He sat by the window in his cell, looking out at the small patch of sky.","The sun was shining brightly today, and a few sparrows were hopping about in the courtyard.","\"Zhang Tao, come out!\" the voice of a correctional officer echoed down the corridor.","His cellmates all looked at him.","Having stayed here long enough, everyone was familiar with the meaning behind the different types of summons: a lawyer's visit, a prosecutor's interrogation, or a release.","Zhang Tao stood up calmly and smoothed out his clothes.","He had thought about so much over these thirteen days, but he had never once regretted his actions. Even if he had to do it all over again, he would still do the exact same thing.","Following the officer down the long corridor, he arrived at the meeting room.","Pushing the door open, he saw two people.","Zhao Tianyi and a young man wearing a prosecutor's uniform.","\"Lawyer Zhao.\" Zhang Tao smiled when he saw him, already guessing what was going on.","Zhao Tianyi also smiled and nodded at him. \"Good brother, you're free.\"","........"]},{"number":666,"title":"Chapter 666: 666, Arrival in the Beautiful Country.","paragraphs":["A few days later.","The private jet cruised smoothly above the clouds. Outside the window lay an endless expanse of white clouds and blue sky.","Su Mansu sat opposite Liu Yutong, a laptop open on her knees, reporting the results of their trip to Western Europe.","\"Boss, the production lines of the two chip companies in Berlin have been finalized. President Qiu's team has repeatedly verified the details of the transfer agreement for the second-hand equipment. The other party promised to ship on time next month, and we've already made arrangements for logistics and customs clearance.\"","\"In Eindhoven, President Qiu's visit to ASML headquarters went very smoothly. Although we couldn't access their core lithography technology, our engineers recorded a large number of peripheral process parameters and production line layout details. These are of great reference value for Mapper, the company we hold a controlling stake in, as they simultaneously advance their EUV lithography machine research and development.\"","\"IMEC's attitude was relatively cautious, but they eventually agreed to open up some joint laboratory resources to Mapper for collaborative R&D projects...\"","Liu Yutong nodded slightly. \"Let Mapper participate deeply in the R&D aspect. We won't intervene directly for now. Tell President Qiu to keep a close eye on the equipment testing phase; there must be absolutely no mistakes.\"","\"Also, Mapper needs to step up its efforts to recruit talent, especially engineers coming from companies like ASML. Compensation is not an issue; as long as they dare to come, we dare to pay. In addition, arrange for some special perks, such as regularly organizing free 'tours' to our Dragon Country for the engineers, with their families fully covered as well. You know what I mean, right?\"","Su Mansu understood implicitly. \"Understood! I will notify the person in charge over there immediately.\"","During this period, they had spent about a week traveling around various countries in Western Europe. Their primary goal was to secure the chip production lines. These phased-out, second-hand production lines usually didn't face technology blockades since they didn't involve the latest tech. Coupled with the fact that Longxin already had some international capital involvement, things had progressed quite smoothly.","Of course, the production lines were not the main focus.","The most critical aspect was the various technologies acquired by Mapper, which Liu Yutong controlled. With ample financial support, Mapper had developed very rapidly in the field of lithography machines. Under intentional promotion, they had even added EUV lithography machines to their R&D direction.","Mapper already possessed a solid foundation in electron-beam direct-write technology. The prototype they had just built could even reach a 28-nanometer process in terms of precision. This figure was among the best in the world, considering that the current mass production level of top global chip factories hovered around 32 to 40 nanometers, and the domestic company Zhongxin was still struggling with 65 nanometers.","Being able to process 28 nanometers was indeed impressive, but a look at its hourly processing speed revealed a dismal picture. The prototype could only process one 28-nanometer wafer per hour; its efficiency was pitifully low.","No matter how high the precision, it would be useless if the efficiency couldn't be improved; it could only be used as a niche product.","Therefore, after secretly taking control of Mapper, Liu Yutong decisively demanded the addition of a new R&D direction. By intensifying their efforts, they still had a chance to catch up.","If she remembered correctly, 2013 would be a massive watershed moment.","Because by then, ASML's EUV lithography machines would be nearing mass production. ASML would also become the only enterprise in the world capable of mass-producing EUV lithography machines, even supporting advanced processes of 5nm and below, completely breaking the limits of traditional lithography technology and monopolizing the global market.","As for the first EUV lithography prototype, it was expected to be delivered next year, which meant it was still in the R&D stage. Mapper still had an opportunity.","At worst, they just needed to poach more people, throw more money at it, and buy out more resources...","Once Mapper's own EUV prototype was born, she would execute a covert maneuver to transfer the technology. With this foundation, relying on Dragon Country's massive market and complete industrial system, it wasn't impossible for them to compete head-to-head with ASML in the future.","After Su Mansu finished her work report, she returned to her seat to handle emails.","Bai Shisui, who had been wearing headphones listening to music all along, finally took them off and ran over to sit beside Liu Yutong.","\"Sister Yutong, we're almost in San Francisco. If you're not busy, how about I take you around for a good tour first? For example, the seafood at Fisherman's Wharf is really famous, and the scenery at the Stanford University campus is nice too.\"","Liu Yutong smiled. \"Whatever you arrange is fine.\"","\"By the way, regarding your father, do we need to prepare anything in advance?\"","Bai Shisui waved her hand. \"No need to prepare anything special. My dad is like an old child; he's not particular about these things. Oh, right, he recently opened a cha chaan teng in Chinatown. This time, I can take you to taste his cooking. His barbecue pork buns are absolutely the best I've ever had.\"","Liu Yutong looked surprised. \"Wait, Uncle knows how to cook?\"","Bai Shisui giggled. \"Hard to imagine, right? My dad is indeed quite serious in business, but in private, he loves tinkering with this stuff. He said his family was poor when he was young, so he learned from a teahouse master in the south. Later, even though he went into business, he never lost the skill. He used to be too busy, but now, in his own words, he's earned enough money for retirement, so he needs to find something he actually enjoys doing.\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong couldn't help but nod. \"I have to say, Uncle has a really great mindset.\"","Bai Shisui continued, \"Right? But the cha chaan teng my dad opened isn't really open to the public; it's mainly used to host guests. My dad's business is mostly bilateral import and export, so he gets a lot of guests from back home, and they often chat until very late. You probably know what it's like here in the States. Unlike back home where you can find food in the middle of the night, there's basically nothing open here when it gets too late. That's why he opened a shop specifically for business hospitality—it's just convenient.\"","Liu Yutong smiled and said, \"In that case, I'm in for a real treat today, getting to taste Uncle's cooking.\"","Bai Shisui said, \"Of course. I've already told my dad, he has to set up everything perfectly for you!\"","After a long-haul flight of about ten hours, the private jet landed smoothly at San Francisco International Airport.","As soon as the boarding stairs were lowered, Liu Yutong spotted a very eye-catching motorcade on the tarmac. Over a dozen black Lincoln Navigators were lined up in a row, each with a silver eagle emblem embedded on the front. Beside the cars stood more than twenty bodyguards in black suits and sunglasses, looking incredibly imposing.","At the front of the motorcade, a tall, blonde, blue-eyed man of Italian descent walked over briskly. Seeing Liu Yutong walking down the stairs, an exaggerated smile appeared on his face, and he spoke with an unfamiliar accent.","\"Great-grandmother, you've finally arrived! I've been wishing upon the stars and the moon, and I've finally wished you here!\"","The person who came was none other than Jesse.","He was also dressed in a black suit today, with a bright red rose pinned to his left breast pocket. He looked quite the gentleman, though his overly fawning smile and posture made him look more like a lackey.","The motorcade behind him had been meticulously prepared. Perhaps subtly influenced by Liu Yutong, the men he brought along were all dressed in black suits, and the fleet of cars was entirely black as well. It was a highly extravagant lineup, consisting entirely of black Lincoln SUVs priced around 100,000 USD each—a model that would easily sell for over a million yuan back in China.","Hearing his choice of address, Liu Yutong's face darkened in sheer exasperation. \"Jesse, how many times have I told you? Don't call me Great-Grandma. Just call me Miss Liu.\"","\"Absolutely not!\"","Jesse replied with the utmost seriousness, \"You are my benefactor. Without your support, I would never have reached my current position. Besides, you actually are my Great-Grandma!\"","\"Great-Grandma, the cars are all ready. I've booked the entire top floor of the Four Seasons Hotel. Shall I take you there to rest now?\""]},{"number":667,"title":"Chapter 667: 667, Reception.","paragraphs":["Pfft!","Bai Shisui, who had just walked down the boarding stairs next to her, couldn't hold back and burst out laughing.","Great-grandmother?","Sister Yutong clearly looked young and aloof, so how did she become a great-grandmother?","And being called that by a foreigner who was obviously much older than her—the more she thought about the scene, the funnier it got.","Sister Yutong, great... great-grandmother? Hahaha... your seniority is doing pretty well overseas! Hahaha...","It wasn't just her; Yun Cheng and the others also twitched their faces, secretly cursing in their hearts. This guy Jesse was too shameless, forcefully trying to claim ties with the eldest miss.","Liu Yutong rolled her eyes at Bai Shisui in annoyance. Careful, or you'll laugh your teeth right out.","Then she turned to Jesse and introduced him, Let me introduce you. This is Bai Shisui, my friend.","The two shook hands, officially making each other's acquaintance.","Great-grandmother, Miss Bai, everyone, the cars are ready. Please get in!","The convoy, consisting of over a dozen black Lincoln Navigators, was indeed very imposing. The advantage of SUVs also became apparent at this moment—even tall people could sit comfortably, like Ji Yu.","The bodyguards Jesse brought couldn't help but freeze for a moment when they saw the clearly better-trained Wanlong Syndicate members led by Yun Cheng.","These were probably the people their boss had told them to learn from and imitate. Especially that big guy, whose physique was even taller and more burly than them Westerners.","Jesse personally opened the door of the middle car for Liu Yutong, carefully shielding the top of the door frame with his hand.","Liu Yutong and Bai Shisui rode in the same car. Soon, Liu Yutong began to regret it; she really should have stuffed this girl into the car behind them.","As soon as they got in, Bai Shisui started gossiping again.","Sister Yutong, confess. What's the deal with this great-grandmother thing? What did you do to him?","Looking at him, he treats you like a godmother... no, like an ancient ancestor. How on earth did you tame him?","Liu Yutong replied, It's nothing. I just provided a little help when he needed it.","But Bai Shisui felt that things couldn't possibly be that simple.","To make someone like Jesse, who looked exactly like a local gang member, act so respectfully, Liu Yutong's help was probably no small matter.","Alright, mysterious great-grandmother. With this big grandson of yours around, doesn't that mean we can walk sideways and do whatever we want around here?","Walk sideways? Are you a crab?","Besides, with Uncle Bai here, do you even need to borrow someone else's influence?","Come on, my dad is just a normal businessman. He's not as imposing as Jesse. Look at his convoy, it's so cool. I feel like it really has the vibe of your Wanlong Syndicate.","Her words were overheard by Jesse, who had just gotten into the passenger seat. This guy truly lived up to his hard work studying the Dragon Country's language; he could actually understand most of their conversation.","I learned all of that from Great-grandmother.","I think Great-grandmother's philosophy is excellent. What's that saying in your Dragon Country again... The underworld is not about fighting and killing, it's about romance, money, and... oh right, the law! You have to know how to talk about the law with others!","Liu Yutong was speechless.","Bai Shisui was speechless.","What kind of nonsense was this!","Jesse said, After I came back, I pretty much integrated my father's old subordinates. I also got the brothers to do some legitimate business. We opened a few security companies and casinos. Now we are legally operating entrepreneurs, hehe!","Bai Shisui had guessed right. Jesse was indeed influenced by the Wanlong Syndicate, and it seemed the influence was quite deep.","Since when did casinos become legitimate and legal businesses?","Oh, right, they were not in the mainland of the Dragon Country.","How is your investigation into Zhao Weixiang going? Liu Yutong changed the subject.","Jesse's expression turned serious as he replied, Don't worry, Great-grandmother. I've basically figured out this guy's whereabouts. He's been spending all his time lately at the San Manuel Casino in Los Angeles.","The casinos in the United States were not limited to the famous Las Vegas. Many other cities also had casinos. For example, the San Manuel Casino Jesse mentioned was a casino on a Native American reservation, which was legal. Even the casinos under Jesse's name were legal.","There was nothing to be done about it; everything was free here. Guns were free, gambling was free... drugs were free, and even the air was free... well, it just had a bit of a smell to it.","Liu Yutong analyzed, Going to gamble so often, it seems this guy has transferred a lot of dirty money over.","Jesse nodded. This guy is indeed quite rich. He wins or loses millions of dollars every time, and he's long become a VIP guest at the casino. Moreover, he hired seven or eight bodyguards. They either follow him around the casino or patrol the perimeter of his villa. I've never seen a guy so afraid of dying.","Hey, Great-grandmother, could it be that this guy is afraid you'll come looking for him?","When he said this, the expression on his face seemed to say: You're still the scarier one, Great-grandmother. The guy ran all the way to a place like this and is still living in constant fear.","Liu Yutong was silent.","She really wanted to ask, am I really that scary?","Little did she know, the feeling she gave Jesse was no longer just simple fear. If the Wanlong Syndicate were in the West, he felt that Liu Yutong would at least be the godmother of a top-tier gang.","Great-grandmother, when do we make our move?","There's no rush for now. Take us to Chinatown first.","You got it!","About twenty minutes later, the convoy entered Chinatown.","Liu Yutong's first impression upon seeing Chinatown was that the place looked very much like a small county town back home. There were street stalls everywhere, full of a bustling, grassroots vibe.","Soon, they arrived in front of a rather grand-looking restaurant.","Dad, we're here!","Following Bai Shisui's shout, Bai Jingchen, wearing an apron, came out from the back kitchen to welcome them. His hands were still covered in flour. He didn't look like a billionaire at all, but rather like a friendly old master chef at a tea restaurant.","President Liu, Suisui, you're here! Perfect timing, the last steamer of shrimp dumplings is about to come out, the BBQ pork buns are keeping warm in the pot, and the soup is perfectly stewed.","Then he said to Yun Cheng and the others, You guys have worked hard. The private room next door is ready. It's just a simple home-cooked meal, so please don't be polite.","Thank you, President Bai, everyone expressed their thanks and went to sit down and eat in the next room.","Liu Yutong also thanked him. Uncle, you're too kind, cooking personally for us. We feel a bit bad for troubling you.","Ah, what are you talking about? Here, I'm just a cook, and you are the guests.","Sit down first, have a cup of tea, I'll be right with you, Bai Jingchen said warmly.","A moment later, the dishes were served one after another.","Everyone exchanged pleasantries once more and then started eating.","Honey BBQ pork buns, shrimp dumplings, stewed soup, steamed seafood... The dishes were extremely rich and varied. The heat control and seasoning of every dish were just right, proving his culinary skills were indeed excellent.","Dad, your cooking skills have improved again. Bai Shisui took a bite of a BBQ pork bun and narrowed her eyes in satisfaction.","Bai Jingchen took off his apron, sat down, and poured himself a cup of Pu'er tea. He smiled and said, \"Practice makes perfect. What do you think of the food, President Liu? Is it to your liking?\"","\"It is truly delicious. I never expected you to be such an amazing chef, Uncle,\" Liu Yutong praised after taking a bite.","She was telling the truth. This was the best Chinese food she had eaten since going abroad. She had tried a few Chinese restaurants back in Xizhou, but their taste left much to be desired. Only the hotpot there was decent, mainly because the soup base was imported directly from the Dragon Kingdom.","\"Uncle, please don't keep calling me President Liu. I am your junior and Suisui's good friend. Just call me Yutong.\"","Bai Jingchen readily obliged, his smile growing even warmer. \"Hahaha, alright then, I won't stand on ceremony, Yutong.\"","As he spoke, he placed a shrimp dumpling into both Liu Yutong's and Bai Shisui's bowls. \"Try this. The fresh shrimp just arrived this morning.\"","\"Delicious!\"","\"So good!\"","Both girls chimed in with their praises after taking a taste.","\"Yutong, aside from your business affairs, has everything else been going smoothly on this trip? Have you run into any trouble? I know quite a few people around here, so if you ever need any help, please don't hesitate to ask.\"","\"Thank you, Uncle!\""]},{"number":668,"title":"Chapter 668: 668, I Choose to Bet on Someone","paragraphs":["Although it was Bai Jingchen's first time meeting his junior, Liu Yutong, a mere half-hour of conversation was enough to make him look at this girl in a completely new light.","Earlier, when he heard about her various deeds from his daughter, his first reaction was disbelief. After all, it sounded too exaggerated!","An eighteen-year-old girl who started a business from scratch and, within two years, held tens or even hundreds of billions in assets—this was more astonishing than the wealth the Bai family had accumulated over decades.","Now, after this conversation, he was thoroughly convinced.","Liu Yutong's mannerisms and speech could not be faked. Especially when discussing the trade landscape and future trends between Dragon Country and the Beautiful Country, she could always hit the nail on the head, shocking even someone like him who had lived in the Beautiful Country for years.","He was able to see these trends because he had the inherent advantage of dealing with both sides for a long time. However, she had no overseas business at all, yet she could see the exact same issues he did. It was evident how sharp her foresight was.","\"Starting a business at 18 and developing the Wanlong Association to such a scale... Yutong, your resume truly puts me to shame!\"","Chewing on a shrimp dumpling, Bai Shisui nodded repeatedly. \"Of course! Dad, do you finally understand what it means for the new generation to surpass the old? Sister Yutong is much more capable than you are.\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"Shisui, don't put me on a pedestal. Uncle has always been a role model for us younger generations. I was just lucky to achieve what I have today. I remember someone once said that even a pig can fly if it stands in the right updraft, and I just happened to be standing in that updraft.\"","Although there was some modesty in her words, it was also an indisputable fact.","For example, during the global financial crisis last year, she accurately seized the opportunity to make a fortune, which not only solved her funding gap but also left her with a considerable surplus.","Bai Shisui joked, \"Sister Yutong, if you put it that way, doesn't that make me worse than a pig?\"","Hearing this, Bai Jingchen scolded her, \"Girl, what are you saying? She was just making an analogy!\"","Knowing she had misspoken, Bai Shisui quickly apologized to Liu Yutong, \"Sister Yutong, I didn't mean it.\"","Liu Yutong smiled, \"It's fine.\"","Bai Jingchen added, \"But although your words sound a bit rough, they are very interesting. Thinking carefully about it, didn't I also stand in the updraft of the reform and opening-up policy to get to where I am today step by step?\"","\"By the way, Yutong, who said that quote? I'd really like to meet him. Is he a domestic entrepreneur?\"","Liu Yutong spoke somewhat vaguely, \"I just happened to see it online. I'm not too sure exactly who it was.\"","Naturally, she couldn't say outright that the source of this quote was Lei Jobs from the future, and that in a few years, this phrase would become a widely circulated famous saying because of him.","This famous quote sounded like a modest remark, but if anyone naively believed that success relied solely on finding the right updraft, they would be dead wrong.","If she remembered correctly, Dami, a company that would have a market value exceeding a trillion in the future, would be born next year. Although Lei Jobs was not short of money and held billions in cold, hard cash, she, Liu Yutong, also held tens of billions in cold, hard cash.","With such a massive volume of capital to invest in him, surely he wouldn't refuse, right?","Thinking of this, she recalled the mobile phone subsidiary she had asked Yu Xin to register recently.","She had to hurry up and put it on the agenda now; otherwise, wouldn't the design patent for the Fruit 4 they registered in advance be for nothing?","Liu Yutong planned to first scout out a moderately sized mobile phone manufacturer with potential for acquisition, such as Meizu.","In its early days, Meizu indeed had the strength to compete with Dami, and in some aspects of product design and system experience, it was even better than the early Dami.","Unfortunately, there was a gap between founders.","Whether in overall strategy, ecological layout, or capital operation, Meizu was completely crushed by Lei Jobs. In the end, it failed to seize the era's dividend of the smartphone explosion and gradually fell out of the first-tier camp. Although it wasn't to the point of bankruptcy, compared to Dami, it could only look up to it.","However, if Meizu were acquired by her, with the blessing of her resources and strategy, perhaps it could change the awkward situation of her past life.","In short, she definitely had to invest in Dami, but she wouldn't interfere with its operations. With Lei Jobs's abilities, he didn't need her dictating things to build the company up just the same.","As for her own mobile phone business, she definitely had to do it too. The Dragon Country market was so big, and the global market was so big, it wouldn't be unable to accommodate even two mobile phone brands.","Hearing Liu Yutong say she just saw it online, Bai Jingchen nodded and didn't ask further. Instead, he changed the subject and revealed the true purpose of inviting Liu Yutong over this time.","\"Yutong, actually, besides wanting to see the legendary girl Shisui talks about every day with my own eyes, Uncle has another important matter to discuss with you.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"Please go ahead, Uncle.\"","Bai Jingchen personally poured another cup of hot tea for Liu Yutong. \"Our Bai family has been in the import and export business for decades. From channels, logistics, and customs relations, to the top three supermarket chain channels here in the Beautiful Country, we have basically opened them all up. Relying on domestic industrial clusters and cost advantages for supply, we have indeed made a lot of money over the years.\"","Speaking of this, his tone changed. \"But the smoother things go, the more uneasy I feel in my heart. When a big tree grows too tall, it is always the first to feel the changes in the wind.\"","\"The speed of our Dragon Country's rise is obvious to the whole world. Accordingly, containment and friction will only increase, not decrease. I judge that in about five years at the latest, our current trade model will inevitably face tremendous challenges. By then, no matter how big my fleet is or how many channels I have, they may all be impacted.\"","\"Therefore, the Bai family needs to find a partner who can be relied upon at critical moments, someone who can even pull us up in the wind and waves. During the time Shisui has spent with you, I can clearly feel that she has grown a lot; her horizons and conversation are different now. This makes me even more convinced that your success is absolutely not just because you stepped into the right updraft. You have real skills and strength.\"","\"Just now when we talked about trade and the economic landscape, I could feel that you see things even more clearly and further ahead than an old guy like me. I have no reason not to choose a partner who combines ability, strength, luck, and advanced foresight.\"","\"Moreover, I also believe that your future business map will never be limited to the domestic market. Your products and your company will sooner or later go global, and the North American channel network that my Bai family has operated for more than twenty years can help you avoid many detours and open up the market faster.\"","At this point, Bai Jingchen made a decision. \"Therefore, I have decided to take our Bai family's fleet dedicated to North American routes, along with the warehousing and channel companies we have operated here for over twenty years, and transfer thirty percent of the dry shares to your name.\"","His words were astonishing.","As soon as this last sentence fell, the private room instantly quieted down. Even Bai Shisui widened her eyes, dumbfounded.","Thirty percent of dry shares, given away for free?","Did I hear that right?","It was worth noting that the Bai family's total assets amounted to at least ten billion US dollars. Thirty percent was no small sum.","Liu Yutong also hadn't expected Uncle Bai to be so bold, presenting her with such a massive gift upon their very first meeting.","If she wanted to achieve globalization in the future, entering the North American market was an absolute must, even if it meant facing potential sanctions.","With this offer, the Bai family's distribution channels could indeed help her rapidly expand into North America.","For example, Wanlong Group's mobile phone business could launch in North America first before pivoting back to the domestic market—a strategy commonly known as export-to-domestic sales.","However, her version of this strategy was different from the norm. It wasn't just about shipping goods abroad, slapping a foreign label on them, and importing them back to sell.","She could host the global launch event for her flagship smartphone in North America, going head-to-head with the currently dominant Fruit Company.","Then, she could get the media to drum up some hype.","Look, they would say, this is the first Dragon Country smartphone brand to hold a global launch in North America. Its products are already stocked in mainstream North American supermarkets, foreigners are using them, and even the Fruit Company copied their aesthetic design!","By then, the brand's prestige and image would instantly separate itself from the chaotic mix of domestic knock-off phones, establishing it as an emerging high-end brand.","Of course, the prerequisite for all this was that the new brand actually had an audience and real sales abroad. If you faked your numbers too aggressively, rival companies would easily expose the lie.","This was where the Bai family's channels became crucial. At the very least, they could move a solid batch of phones through these networks, right? Couple that with the hype of going toe-to-toe with the Fruit Company, and sales might just explode.","Bai Shisui finally snapped out of her daze and was the first to speak. Dad... you are not joking, are you?","Bai Jingchen looked at his most beloved daughter and said, I have made all kinds of bets in the business world throughout my life, and I have gotten most of them right. Over twenty years ago, I bet on the reform and opening up; over ten years ago, I bet on... Every time, people said I was crazy, but I was the only one who believed my judgment would not be wrong.","But for the next five or ten years, the world is changing too fast. Even I cannot clearly see the exact trends of the future.","At this point, he looked at Liu Yutong again, his gaze gradually sharpening. So, this time, I choose to bet on a person!"]},{"number":669,"title":"Chapter 669: 669, Mutual Aid Society.","paragraphs":["Looking at her father's profile, Bai Shisui suddenly realized that this was the first time in her twenty-three years of life that she had seen him trust an outsider so unreservedly.","This wasn't an ordinary business collaboration, nor was it a test. It was a desperate, all-in gamble, almost like entrusting his legacy to someone else.","Admittedly, doing this was incredibly cool!","Liu Yutong said, \"Uncle Bai, this gift is far too valuable. I truly don't deserve it.\"","Bai Jingchen waved his hand dismissively. \"Yutong, please don't misunderstand. I'm not bestowing a favor upon you; I'm buying a boarding pass for the Bai family in advance. I can somewhat foresee the future of traditional trade. With the rise of the Dragon Kingdom, that path will only grow narrower. But you... you, I cannot see through.\"","\"I'm getting old. The fact that Suisui is close to you is a blessing for the Bai family. Whether you consider these shares a welcoming gift from an elder or a boarding pass, as long as you are willing to accept them, that is enough.\"","Bai Shisui stared blankly at her father, then turned to look at Liu Yutong, who was as calm as still water beside her.","She suddenly recalled something her father had told her when teaching her how to read nautical charts as a child.","A true captain isn't someone who fears no storms, but someone who dares to hand over the mast to the person who best understands the wind before the tempest arrives.","At this moment, her father seemed to be doing exactly that.","He had clearly decided that Liu Yutong was the helmsman who understood the wind better.","After pondering for a moment, Liu Yutong picked up her teacup, using tea as a substitute for wine, and said, \"In that case, from this day forward, I will stand together with the Bai family through thick and thin!\"","\"Excellent! Through thick and thin!\"","Bai Jingchen laughed heartily, raised his own cup, and downed it in one gulp.","..............","Ten minutes later, just as everyone was enjoying the conversation to the fullest.","Bang!","The door to the private room was violently thrown open, and a man from the Dragon Kingdom wearing a jacket burst in frantically.","\"President Bai, this is bad! The Snakehead Gang is causing trouble again! They've recaptured the people we rescued last time!\"","Bai Jingchen frowned. \"Are you sure?\"","The young man nodded vigorously. \"I'm sure!\"","It was only then that he seemed to notice the other guests in the room. However, the situation was urgent, so he didn't even bother to apologize. He hurried over to Bai Jingchen and whispered a few more words into his ear.","Bai Jingchen's expression changed. He stood up abruptly, turned to Liu Yutong and the others, and said apologetically, \"Yutong, everyone, I am truly sorry! An emergency has come up, and I must go deal with it immediately. Suisui, please host everyone on my behalf!\"","Bai Shisui nodded in response. \"Dad, go ahead. I'll take care of things here.\"","Bai Jingchen cupped his hands together again in a gesture of apology to Liu Yutong and the others. \"I'm sorry for being a poor host. I will host another banquet to make it up to you later.\"","With that, he turned and hurriedly left with the young man in the jacket.","Liu Yutong then looked at Bai Shisui and asked, \"Did I just hear that Uncle Bai is going to rescue someone?\"","Bai Shisui nodded. \"Yes, he's going out to rescue people.\"","Her expression was quite calm, clearly accustomed to her father's actions. She had long known that he did this sort of thing.","\"Besides running his business, my dad is also the president of the regional Dragon Kingdom Chamber of Commerce. The situation here can be quite complicated sometimes. Especially in recent years, a bunch of messy criminal gangs have popped up, specializing in scamming their own compatriots.\"","\"You know how it is. Many people back home have illusions about the Beautiful Country, thinking even the air here smells sweet. This gives those scumbags an opportunity. They deliberately hype this place up, saying the streets are paved with gold just waiting to be picked up.","\"Those shady agencies and criminal gangs exploit this information gap to trick people into coming over, or they just smuggle them in through their illegal channels.\"","\"As soon as they land, their passports and IDs are confiscated. Then they're forced to work illegally, with no pay, and are subjected to constant beatings and abuse. I've even heard of illegal organ trafficking. Many of them don't speak the language, are unfamiliar with the area, and are terrified of being caught by immigration. They don't dare call the police and can only leave themselves at the mercy of others.\"","Liu Yutong had seen this kind of news in her past life, but hearing Bai Shisui recount it personally, coupled with the fact that she was currently in the Beautiful Country herself, made it feel much more real.","\"So, one of the main tasks of Uncle Bai's Chamber of Commerce is to rescue these deceived compatriots?\"","\"Yes,\" Bai Shisui nodded.","\"My dad... despite being very shrewd and capable in the business world, he's actually quite old-school at heart. He always likes to talk about how compatriots abroad should watch out for and help each other. A group of people in the Chamber share his ideals, so they organized this mutual aid society.","\"If they receive a plea for help, or if they uncover any leads themselves, they'll figure out a way to rescue the people. They help them contact the embassy, find a safe place for them to stay temporarily, or buy plane tickets for the victims to return home. He's been doing this for many years now; I suppose it's his way of continuously doing good deeds.\"","As a military veteran, Chu Yang felt a sudden surge of anger in his chest upon hearing this. He couldn't stand such despicable acts of bullying compatriots. He couldn't help but ask, \"The Snakehead Gang that guy just mentioned—are they a syndicate that specializes in this kind of dirty work?\"","Bai Shisui nodded. \"Yes, they're the most rampant one in this area. Their members are a mixed bag—some are local Dragon-descended thugs who grew up here, while others are desperadoes who were smuggled in. It seems they also have the backing of other local factions.\"","\"They are incredibly ruthless. They've previously engaged in shootouts with other gangs over 'piglets'—that's what they call the people they scam. Because my dad's Chamber of Commerce frequently steps in to rescue people, they've deeply offended them, and the gang has even retaliated against Chamber members in the past.\"","\"Doesn't the local police care about this sort of thing?\"","\"They do, but how are they supposed to handle it? Many victims are simply too afraid to step forward and testify, and evidence is extremely difficult to gather.\"","\"These gangs are also very cunning. They constantly operate in legal gray areas or set up their bases in neighborhoods that are already chaotic. Those places are crawling with junkies and gangs; even the police don't dare go in casually. Some corrupt cops even have shady ties with these gangs. So, more often than not, we just have to rely on our own people to figure out a solution.\"","Liu Yutong had now truly witnessed the dark underbelly beneath this glamorous facade.","But this was normal. As a complex immigrant nation, many social issues couldn't be completely resolved simply by relying on law enforcement agencies.","For Bai Jingchen to choose to step forward and do this required not just a kind heart, but also extraordinary courage and shrewdness.","To put it bluntly, a billionaire CEO continuously involving himself in this kind of business was taking on an immense amount of risk.","This gave Liu Yutong a few more degrees of heartfelt admiration for this elder who had just decided to weather the storm alongside her.","\"Is it safe for Uncle Bai to rush out so recklessly?\" Liu Yutong asked with concern once again.","Bai Shisui replied, \"It should be safe. My dad always has bodyguards with him, and there are many brothers from the Chamber of Commerce as well. He is, after all, a prominent figure in the Dragon-descendant community. Anyone who wants to touch him openly would have to carefully weigh the consequences.\"","\"Anyway, over the years he has handled quite a few similar situations, and most of them were resolved safely.\"","Liu Yutong nodded and did not press the matter further.","The dinner ended hastily due to the unexpected incident, and everyone promptly returned to the hotel to rest.","Bai Shisui also parted ways with them for the time being, presumably to gather the latest updates regarding her father's situation.","Back in the luxurious penthouse suite of the Four Seasons Hotel.","Yun Cheng, Chu Yang, and a few others lingered in Liu Yutong's suite for a while.","\"Chairman Bai is truly admirable. Even with such a massive business empire, he is still willing to take risks to do such good deeds,\" Yun Cheng remarked with genuine respect.","Liu Yutong nodded. \"This also proves that our partnership with him is a reliable choice.\"","\"But Miss, from what Miss Bai said just now, that Snakehead Gang seems incredibly ruthless. Will this affect our future cooperation? Could it even threaten the safety of Chairman Bai and Miss Bai?\" Yun Cheng asked, a hint of worry in his voice.","Liu Yutong turned around, looking at Yun Cheng, Chu Yang, and her other capable right-hand men.","\"The tree desires stillness, but the wind will not cease. Since we have already decided to weather the storm together, we cannot just stand by and watch if something really happens to the Bai family.\"","She paused, a cold smirk tugging at the corner of her lips.","\"Besides, we are only dealing with a bunch of rats in the gutter. There are always more solutions than problems.\""]},{"number":670,"title":"Chapter 670: 670. Fisherman's Wharf.","paragraphs":["San Francisco, the morning light was just breaking through.","Liu Yutong woke up early. Since she didn't have anything pressing to do at the moment, she wanted to visit a few famous scenic spots in the city. After all, she was already here, and it wouldn't make sense not to look around.","Of course, she was the only one with free time; everyone else was very busy.","Jesse had taken a group to Los Angeles early in the morning to further monitor Zhao Weixiang's whereabouts. Zhao Tianyi also took two members of the Wanlong Gang out with him; he planned to open a law firm here, which was also Liu Yutong's request. After all, in the US, lawsuits would be inevitable in the future, so they needed to make preparations in advance.","Zhao Tianyi also knew a few highly capable lawyers and had invited them out for tea.","Bai Shisui also had matters to attend to, presumably helping her father deal with company affairs.","It seemed only Liu Yutong, the boss, had the most leisure time, planning to take a casual stroll and experience the local customs and culture.","\"Miss, the cars are ready.\" Yun Cheng was the first to step up to a black Lincoln parked by the door.","These were the cars left by Jesse, five in total.","Liu Yutong, however, shook her head. \"We won't take the cars today. I've been either on a plane or in a car these past few days and haven't moved around in a long time. Walking will be good.\"","\"Understood,\" Yun Cheng nodded in agreement.","He, Lan Die, Chu Yang, and Su Mansu followed behind Liu Yutong, while Ji Yu and the other core members followed them in the cars.","As Liu Yutong's personal bodyguard, Lan Die naturally came along as well.","Today, Liu Yutong wore a light gray casual tracksuit with a white baseball cap on her head and sunglasses hanging from her neckline. She looked fresh and laid-back, very much like a college student on vacation, completely hiding the fact that she was a powerful businesswoman controlling hundreds of billions in assets.","The group walked along the scenic coastal boulevard and soon arrived at the famous Fisherman's Wharf.","In the distance, the Golden Gate Bridge came into view, faintly discernible in the morning mist, accompanied by several seagulls circling and crying in the sky.","Liu Yutong stopped, faced the bay, slightly opened her arms, and took a deep breath of the fresh morning air.","\"The environment here is pretty nice.\"","Yun Cheng chimed in, \"If you like it, Miss, you can come here often in the future. I've read reviews online saying that San Francisco has the best climate in the whole US, like spring all year round.\"","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"Let's pass on that. It's fine to come here occasionally to play and relax, but if I were to actually settle down, I still prefer it back in our own country.\"","After strolling for over an hour, they arrived at Pier 39, which was noticeably much livelier.","This was a massive wooden boardwalk area lined with shops on both sides, including seafood restaurants, souvenir shops, candy stores, galleries, and an area for street performers.","Even though it was only a little past eight in the morning, quite a few tourists from all over the world had already gathered here.","The most bustling spot was undoubtedly the area at the end of the boardwalk, surrounded by layers of people, with bursts of laughter erupting from time to time.","\"Boss, that over there is the sea lion viewing deck.\"","Su Mansu, who had studied abroad for many years, acted as a guide at this moment. Pointing to the gathered crowd, she said, \"It's said that in the late 1980s, a group of sea lions suddenly came here and made the pier their home, and it later became a permanent attraction.\"","\"Let's go take a look.\" Hearing this, Liu Yutong immediately became interested.","As they approached, they indeed saw many sea lions.","Dozens of chubby sea lions were lazily lying on their backs on dedicated wooden floating platforms, basking in the sun, looking delightfully endearing.","The spectating tourists were pointing and chatting about these marine residents.","\"They really know how to enjoy life, don't they?\"","\"Look at the one in the middle. Doesn't its expression seem to say, 'What are you looking at? Never seen a handsome guy before?'\"","\"I think it's saying, 'Foolish humans, still worrying about mortgages and car loans? Look at me, RV included, room and board all covered.'\"","\"That hits right in the feels, bro!\"","\"...\"","After leaving the sea lion viewing deck, Liu Yutong and her group continued to stroll along the boardwalk.","The shops on both sides gradually began to open for business, and the aroma of food started to fill the air.","\"Boss, do you want to try this?\"","Su Mansu stopped in front of a small stall. \"This is San Francisco's specialty sourdough clam chowder. It's very famous.\"","The stall owner was a smiling Black auntie. Seeing Liu Yutong and her group, she greeted them warmly, \"Hey, darlings! Come try Grandma Martha's signature chowder. I guarantee it's the most authentic in all of Fisherman's Wharf!\"","Liu Yutong looked at the bread bowl. The bowl was made from hollowed-out sourdough bread, filled with creamy white chowder packed with clam meat, potato chunks, and vegetables.","It looked pretty good and smelled quite fragrant, though she felt the calories might be a bit excessive.","\"I'll take twenty portions.\"","\"You got it!\"","Upon hearing the order for twenty portions, Grandma Martha became even more enthusiastic. As she quickly ladled the soup, she asked, \"Are you tourists from the Dragon Country? First time in San Francisco?\"","\"Yes,\" Liu Yutong nodded.","\"Then you've come to the right place.\"","Grandma Martha handed the bread bowls over. \"Fisherman's Wharf is the soul of San Francisco. I started my stall here thirty years ago. What haven't I seen? Hippies, gold diggers, Silicon Valley elites... They come and go, but only my soup has always been here.\"","\"Let me tell you a secret. Gatsby used to come here for soup when he was young, and that young man who acted in Titanic, what was his name... Oh, Leonardo, he's been here too!\"","Playing along, Liu Yutong put on a surprised expression. \"Really?\"","\"Of course!\"","\"Martha never lies! But I prefer my current customers, like you polite young people...\"","Grandma Martha was very enthusiastic, but once she started talking, it felt a little bit like she couldn't stop.","Once all twenty portions of chowder were ready, Su Mansu paid, and the group found a wooden long table facing the sea to sit down. The remaining packed ones were taken by Yun Cheng and Chu Yang to distribute to the Wanlong Gang members waiting in the cars nearby.","Liu Yutong tasted a spoonful of the chowder, then tore off a small piece of the bread bowl edge that had absorbed the broth and become soft, popping it into her mouth. She couldn't help but nod.","\"It's quite delicious.\"","\"It is indeed good, but I feel like you can't eat too much of it, or it will get heavy,\" Yun Cheng also nodded in evaluation.","As Su Mansu ate, she suggested, \"Boss, do you want to take a cruise later? We can tour the bay, see the Golden Gate Bridge, and Alcatraz Island.\"","\"Alcatraz? The prison?\" Liu Yutong asked.","Su Mansu nodded. \"Yes, it's long been converted into a tourist attraction. It's said that many heavy-hitter criminals were locked up there, even the Chicago mob godfather Al Capone.\"","Liu Yutong shook her head. \"Let's pass on that. Today, I just want to look at things under the sunlight.\"","She slowly drank her soup, watching the sailboats passing by on the sea.","The sunlight grew stronger, and the sea surface shimmered like scattered crushed diamonds. Seagulls circled overhead, occasionally diving down to snatch food scraps dropped by tourists.","At this moment, she suddenly felt that the world could actually be very beautiful.","Just as she was thinking this, a burst of noisy commotion suddenly came from the distance.","The voice was extremely loud, distinctly carrying some sort of southern dialect accent from the Dragon Kingdom, and it brimmed with absolute fervor.","\"We made it! We really made it! The land of freedom!\""]},{"number":671,"title":"Chapter 671: 671, Freedom","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong turned her head and saw seven or eight men and women pouring out of the alley. They all looked haggard, but their expressions were unusually excited.","These people varied in age, from their early twenties to their forties. Many of them were carrying backpacks. Their clothes looked as if they had been soaked in water and then dried out, wrinkled and looking very miserable.","One of them, a young man in his thirties, had just arrived at the pier when he dropped to his knees with a thud, raised his hands high, and roared at the sky, America! I am here! I am finally here!","A thin young man behind him also knelt down, weeping tears of excitement, Big brother, we did it! We made it to San Francisco and escaped the border patrol! It is worth it! It is all worth it!","Hahaha...","The group gathered together, weeping tears of joy, and excitedly discussed their beautiful future lives.","According to the information I read online, America's GDP per capita is ten times that of Dragon Country, and the minimum wage is twenty times higher! Even if we wash dishes here, we can earn in a month what takes a year back home!","More than that! My cousin came here five years ago, and now she works as a nail technician in Los Angeles. She earns three thousand dollars a month, which is over twenty thousand in our currency! When she worked in a factory back home, she only made eight hundred a month!","The group grew more and more excited as they spoke, completely ignoring the strange looks from the tourists around them.","Especially the looks from some white people, which clearly carried a hint of disgust. Yet, not only did they not find it strange, they even mistook those gazes for friendliness.","Let me tell you, I watched a lot of documentaries and bloggers' videos about America back home. In their supermarkets, a huge steak is only a few bucks, milk is cheaper than bottled water, and every family lives in a big house with a lawn and drives a car!","Yes, yes, yes! And the welfare is so good! If you lose your job, there are unemployment benefits; if you get sick, there is medical insurance; when you get old, there is a pension. This is the life meant for human beings!","More importantly, there is equal opportunity. As long as you are willing to work hard here, you can make a mark for yourself!","So true! This is the true land full of freedom, equality, and hope!","So we definitely made the right choice coming here!","One of the young men stood up, raised his arms, and shouted to the crowd, Starting today, we are going to begin our new lives on this land of freedom!","A new life!","A new life! the crowd chanted in unison, extremely thrilled.","Liu Yutong watched this scene quietly, her expression complex.","In this day and age, the grand illusion of the American Dream was still so tempting to some people.","Look, were not the people before her willing to give up everything they had and smuggle themselves over just to take a bite of that imaginary pie?","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang exchanged a glance, both seeing the disdain in each other's eyes.","Generally, the first ones to be slaughtered were exactly these kinds of idiots who knew nothing about reality yet thought they held the ultimate truth.","At this moment, a man in the crowd, about twenty-seven or twenty-eight years old with an exaggerated head of dyed blonde hair, began to give a speech. The guy was even wearing a T-shirt printed with the Stars and Stripes and the letters I NY.","Everyone! Everyone! Listen to me!","Congratulations on finally stepping onto this land of freedom! As a senior who arrived a month earlier than you, Brother Wei has already figured out the ropes. Do you want to hear about it?","Brother, you have been here for a month? What kind of work are you doing now? someone asked.","I was originally working at a Chinese restaurant in Chinatown for twelve hundred dollars a month, and then I quit.","You quit over twelve hundred? The crowd was stunned.","They instinctively did the math in their heads; this was roughly equivalent to an income of nearly ten thousand back home.","How could he just quit such a high-paying job?","Why would I not quit?","Ah Wei put on an expression of you guys do not understand at all and continued, Most Chinese restaurant owners are from Dragon Country. They are extremely stingy and specialize in scamming their own people. If you want to work, you have to find a shop run by locals. The hourly wage is high, the benefits are good, and they never delay paying your wages!","The crowd suddenly realized, So that is how it is!","Then what do we do if we do not speak the foreign language? another person asked.","Learn it!","In America, even the old ladies sweeping the streets can speak a few words of a foreign language. The educational resources here are the best in the world. The community has free foreign language courses, and you can walk right into public libraries. All of these are free! Free! Understand?","Ah Wei grew more and more agitated as he spoke, When I was back home, I had to apply for a card to go to the library, and they would not even let you borrow some books. But here? You can just walk in! Enjoy the air conditioning all you want! Read the books all you want! This is the difference! This is civilization!","The welfare here really is good. I was a foreign language teacher back home, and my monthly salary was only two thousand. Coming here, I heard that substitute teachers start at an hourly wage of thirty dollars, another person sighed with emotion.","It is not just teachers!","Let me tell you, what does America lack right now? They lack labor, especially hardworking labor like us. Construction sites, farms, and restaurants are hiring everywhere. Why? Because they are unwilling to do these jobs. They are too lazy, so they need us!","Ah Wei's words were highly inflammatory, making everyone's blood boil. They felt that this place was full of high-paying jobs just waiting to be taken, completely forgetting that they were illegal immigrants working under the table.","That is right, the American people need us!","We are here to fill the labor shortage!","This is a win-win! We make money, and America develops!","...","Just as they were getting more and more excited.","Woo! Woo!","Suddenly, the urgent wail of police sirens came from a distance.","Several white SUVs marked with ICE (Immigration and Customs Enforcement) sped over and stopped at the edge of the pier plaza.","As soon as the car doors opened, over a dozen uniformed immigration officers jumped out and charged toward them.","Nobody move! Immigration inspection!","Obviously, it was because they had been too high-profile and carried away just now, arousing the dissatisfaction of some tourists. Someone had called the police, and they had specifically called ICE, which handles illegal immigrants.","When Ah Wei and the others saw those heavily armed officers, they instantly panicked.","Fuck! It is immigration! Run!","Motherfucker, who told you to yell so loudly? You brought the cops here.","Split up and run! Split up!","...","As a game of cat and mouse unfolded, the pier instantly fell into chaos.","This group of stowaways put on quite a show of desperate escape. Some jumped straight into the sea trying to swim to the opposite shore, some hid in public restrooms, and some squeezed into the nearby shops... It was an incredibly pathetic sight.","These immigration officers were clearly very experienced and quickly caught most of them.","After being caught, those people squealed like pigs, screaming desperately.","America needs labor! You cannot deport us!","I am a skilled worker, I know how to fix cars, the auto industry needs me!","My cousin is already a citizen, and I am a citizen too, you cannot arrest me!","Freedom! Freedom! Give me back my freedom!","...","However, no matter how much they shouted, the result was the same. They were ruthlessly dragged away.","Those who resisted fiercely were even met with the merciless iron fists of ICE.","Liu Yutong witnessed the entire ordeal. Yun Cheng and Chu Yang stood guard at her sides, keeping a vigilant eye on their surroundings to ensure they wouldn't be caught up in the chaos.","Miss, should we leave? Yun Cheng asked.","Liu Yutong shook her head. There is no rush.","She looked toward a figure buried under a pile of fishing nets. Someone was hiding there, having managed to escape the notice of ICE.","Only after ICE had completely left did the person finally crawl out from the nets.","It was none other than the yellow-haired Ah Wei.","Still visibly shaken, he darted his eyes left and right. Once he confirmed that he was truly safe, he let out a long sigh of relief.","Then, he fished a half-empty bottle of mineral water out of his backpack and gulped down a few large mouthfuls. Next, he pulled out a small half of a donut that had long been squashed flat and wolfed it down.","Having eaten and drunk his fill, that inexplicable, arrogant energy of his seemed to return.","He yelled out into the distance.","Donuts are so damn delicious!","A hundred times better than the steamed buns back home!","Hearing this, Chu Yang clenched his fists, finding it hard to hold back. Miss, I want to beat him up!","Forget it, Liu Yutong said. There is no need to waste our time on someone like him. Let us go.","But just as she stood up, preparing to lead Yun Cheng and the others away, the man named Ah Wei, whose eyes had been darting around aimlessly, suddenly noticed their familiar fellow-countrymen faces. His eyes lit up, and to their surprise, he excitedly started walking toward them.","From his demeanor, it seemed he had mistakenly assumed Liu Yutong and her group were just like him."]},{"number":672,"title":"Chapter 672: 672, Ask a Question for Ten Dollars.","paragraphs":["With ICE gone, the square gradually returned to its original bustling state.","Tourists were still busy taking photos, feeding seagulls, and picking out seafood, as if the farce just now had never happened.","Ah Wei chewed on half a donut, which didn't fill his stomach at all. He patted his pockets, only to find them completely empty.","He swallowed hard, his eyes involuntarily drawn to a small stall nearby that wafted the aroma of roasted meat. The hot dogs sizzling on the iron griddle looked incredibly tempting.","The stall owner, a middle-aged Mexican man, noticed his gaze and stated the price expressionlessly.","\"Three dollars each.\"","\"I... I don't have any money right now,\" Ah Wei said brazenly. \"But I'll find a job soon, and I'll definitely pay you back then. I know people in America are all kind-hearted...\"","\"If you don't have money, get lost!\" The stall owner impatiently shooed him away.","Ah Wei walked away resentfully, his stomach growling in disappointment. He walked over to the seaside railing, looked out at the azure sea, and straightened his back again.","\"It doesn't matter. This is just a temporary hardship.\"","\"In America, as long as you're willing to work hard, you won't starve to death. If someone like me were back in my home country, I would have been begging on the streets long ago. But here, I have infinite possibilities!\"","The more he spoke, the more excited he became.","\"Why is America great? Because it gives everyone a chance. Even if you're penniless, as long as you're willing to strive, you can succeed! This is the American Dream!\"","A few passing white tourists heard his words and cast strange glances at him again.","Ah Wei, however, thought he had received their approval and grew even more thrilled.","\"Look at how friendly Americans are! They are encouraging me with their eyes. Back home, who would pay attention to a poor person? They would have stayed far away. This is the difference in character!\"","Not far away, Chu Yang heard this guy's muttering and couldn't hold back. He said to Liu Yutong, \"The Young Lady, I suddenly feel that it's really not worth it at all for Chairman Bai to spend so much money and take such great risks to rescue this kind of trash.\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"A gentleman is judged by his actions, not his thoughts.\"","\"Not everyone is a runaway. Some were indeed tricked into coming here; they just wanted a better life.\"","Yun Cheng nodded. \"The Young Lady is right.\"","Just then, after pumping himself up, Ah Wei also noticed Liu Yutong and her group sitting by a wooden table not far away. His eyes immediately lit up, especially when he saw Liu Yutong, who had an outstanding temperament and was being guarded in the middle by Yun Cheng, Chu Yang, and the others.","These must be compatriots who have already gained a firm foothold in America and made money, right?","Such people would definitely understand his pursuits and ideals!","\"Hello, beautiful. You used to be from the Dragon Kingdom too, right?\"","\"Look, this is destiny. In free America, us people of Dragon descent must help each other...\"","He tried to cozy up to her while approaching Liu Yutong, but Yun Cheng stepped forward and reached out to stop him.","Ah Wei wasn't annoyed at being stopped. Instead, he felt that the fact she had bodyguards only confirmed his judgment: this was definitely a lady who had achieved success after arriving in America.","\"Beautiful, I can see you have an extraordinary aura. You must be a successful person. Could you lend me twenty dollars? No, ten dollars is fine too. I promise, once I find a job, I'll pay you back double—no, triple!\"","Liu Yutong took off her sunglasses, revealing her clear eyes. \"Didn't you just say that the streets in America are paved with gold and anyone can easily get rich? Why do you need to borrow even ten dollars?\"","Ah Wei's face stiffened, but he immediately smiled again. \"Well, in the early stages of starting out, it's inevitable to face some difficulties. But I have hands and feet, and I'm willing to endure hardships. I'll turn things around very soon. Beautiful, just consider it an investment—an investment in a future American elite.\"","\"An elite?\"","Chu Yang mocked, \"How can an elite not even have a legal identity?\"","\"How did you know...\"","Ah Wei realized he had misspoken and quickly corrected himself. \"The identity issue will be resolved sooner or later. America is a country of immigrants, and they welcome people with a striving spirit like us the most. Did you know that the ancestors of many American billionaires were smuggled in? What does that show? It shows that sneaking in is the first step to becoming a billionaire!\"","This logic left Yun Cheng and the others completely speechless.","Liu Yutong, however, asked with interest, \"Then how do you plan to solve your identity issue?\"","\"Two ways!\"","Ah Wei held up two fingers, speaking logically. \"First, find an American citizen to marry. I look decent, and my foreign language skills are alright, so I have a good chance.\"","As he said this, he couldn't help but glance at Liu Yutong again.","So beautiful! She was even more beautiful than the TV stars he had seen!","Indeed, the land of America really nurtured people well.","He still assumed that Liu Yutong was of Dragon descent and not a citizen of the Dragon Kingdom.","\"Second, apply for asylum. Back when I was in the country, I often posted comments criticizing the Dragon Kingdom online... It will definitely get approved!\"","He said it so matter-of-factly, as if betraying his motherland for profit was perfectly justified and something to show off. He didn't notice at all that a cold glint had already surfaced in the eyes of Chu Yang and Yun Cheng.","Liu Yutong asked another question. \"Your parents are still back in the country, right?\"","Ah Wei froze for a moment. \"Yes... they are.\"","\"If they knew you were over here, exchanging slander against your own motherland for a green card, what would they think?\"","Ah Wei's expression finally changed, but he still found an excuse, saying, \"They will understand me. If I live well over here, I can bring them over to enjoy a good life in the future. This is also for the good of the whole family.\"","\"Happiness exchanged for dignity?!\" Liu Yutong's gaze instantly sharpened.","Ah Wei's face immediately turned red, and he argued stubbornly, \"Is there dignity back home? Here, at least there is hope! The hope of changing my destiny!\"","\"Beautiful, I can see you're a sensible person too. To be doing so well here, you must have made the right choices as well. We are all smart people, and smart people should choose the path that is most beneficial to them, right?\"","Liu Yutong gave him a deep look, put her sunglasses back on, and stood up.","\"Let's go.\" She didn't want to waste any more breath on this kind of person.","\"Understood, The Young Lady!\"","\"Hey! Beautiful! Wait!\"","Ah Wei grew anxious and blocked their way. \"Just lend me ten dollars. Five dollars is fine too...\"","Yun Cheng directly stepped in to drive him away. \"If you keep pestering us, don't blame me for not being polite!\"","Ah Wei saw the murderous aura in the other party's eyes and immediately felt timid. He could only watch helplessly as the people he thought were like-minded walked away.","\"Sigh, going hungry again. But it's okay, I heard there are relief stations handing out free food around here. I will definitely survive this low point and reach the peak of my life.\"","After comforting himself, he turned around and prepared to leave, wanting to see if he could collect some bottles to exchange for spare change.","Just then, Chu Yang suddenly turned back alone.","\"Hey, brother, don't leave.\"","Ah Wei paused. \"What's wrong? Could it be that you guys figured it out and are willing to lend me money?\"","\"I knew it. We are all people of Dragon descent full of dreams. How could you really leave me in the lurch.\"","Fighting back his disgust, Chu Yang pulled a ten-dollar bill from his pocket. He pointed to a group of Black men with dreadlocks nearby, who looked like gang members, and said, \"I have a condition. Just go ask one of them a single question, and this money is yours.\"","Ah Wei stared at the green bill and swallowed hard. \"Really? Just one question?\"","Chu Yang: \"That's right, just one question.\"","Ah Wei: \"Then what do you want me to ask?\"","Chu Yang: \"It's very simple. Just pick anyone at random and ask, 'What is your father's name?' That's it.\"","Ah Wei: \"It's that simple?\"","Chu Yang: \"Yes, it's that simple.\"","Ah Wei snatched the ten-dollar bill Chu Yang held out, terrified the man might change his mind, and walked straight toward the group of young men.","This scene was witnessed by Yun Cheng, who had just gotten into the car.","\"The Young Lady, what is Chu Yang doing?\"","Liu Yutong seemed to have guessed what Chu Yang was up to and smiled. \"Just wait and enjoy the show.\"","Soon, Chu Yang ran over and got into the passenger seat.","Unable to hold back his curiosity, Yun Cheng asked, \"Chu Yang, what did you just say to him?\"","Chu Yang briefly explained what had happened.","Yun Cheng completely missed the point, his head full of question marks. \"It was really that simple? Didn't you let that bastard off too easily?\"","Chu Yang: \"I had just heard a dark joke about this place from Assistant Su before, and I wanted to test it out, that's all.\"","Right as he finished speaking, a sudden agonizing scream echoed from the distance.","\"Ah!!!\""]},{"number":673,"title":"Chapter 673: 673, President Bai Is in Trouble","paragraphs":["Ah Wei clutched the ten-dollar bill, feeling pretty pleased with himself.","\"Ten bucks just to ask a question? This is too easy. I always said that in America, opportunities are everywhere. It just depends on whether you have the guts to grab them.\"","Lost in his own narcissism, he walked toward a group of young Black men with dreadlocks and various tattoos.","To be honest, taking the initiative to talk to these tough-looking guys did make him a little nervous.","Fortunately, what he was best at was mental gymnastics.","\"What's there to be afraid of? This is a society ruled by law, everyone is equal. It's just a question, are they going to beat me up over it?\"","Then, he walked up to the youngest and smallest-looking guy in the group and said in broken English, \"Excuse me, sir! I have a question for you!\"","The young man turned his head, looking Ah Wei up and down with a face full of confusion.","Ah Wei kept smiling and said, \"It's just a simple question, nothing major.\"","The young man nodded. \"Ask away.\"","\"What's your father's name?\"","???","The young man thought he had misheard. \"What?\"","A few of his friends nearby heard it too. After a brief moment of shock, they immediately reacted.","\"Hey! This bastard is insulting you!\"","\"He's asking about your old man!\"","\"You looking for trouble, boy?!\"","Seeing their huge reaction, Ah Wei felt a bit uneasy. Wasn't this just a normal question? Why were they reacting so strongly?","Could it be that they didn't understand his question?","So, he repeated it, deliberately slowing down his speech to make it clearer. \"I said... what's... your father's... name?\"","Asking it so slowly, combined with his naturally punchable face, was no different from a direct, point-blank provocation.","\"Hey! What the fuck did you just say? Do you have a death wish?!\"","\"Surround him! Don't let him get away!\"","The group immediately formed a circle, trapping Ah Wei inside.","Ah Wei finally realized something was wrong and hurriedly waved his hands to explain, \"No, no, no! I'm just... just asking a question, I don't mean any harm! Don't tell me you don't even remember your dad's name?\"","There was a long-standing racist stereotype in this area that many Black people didn't know who their fathers were. Asking someone this question on purpose was a severe offense, insult, and provocation.","Obviously, Ah Wei was completely unaware of this dark joke.","The young man completely lost it. He grabbed Ah Wei by the collar and roared, \"You fucking dare to humiliate me?! I'm gonna shove you up a donkey's ass!\"","Terrified, Ah Wei begged for mercy. \"I... I was paid to ask! Someone gave me ten bucks...\"","The young man glared. \"Where is this guy you're talking about?\"","Ah Wei hurriedly pointed behind him, but he only pointed at thin air. Chu Yang had long since slipped away.","The group felt insulted all over again. \"He's playing you, Mike!\"","Ah Wei pleaded, \"NO! I'm not, I just...\"","Before he could finish, a massive fist smashed into his face.","Bang!","A nosebleed instantly gushed out!","\"Get him!\"","The group of young men swarmed him, raining punches and kicks down on him.","Ah Wei curled up on the ground, clutching his head, and cried out in pain, \"This is America! You can't do this! I have rights!\"","These words were like adding fuel to the fire; the group beat him even harder.","\"Rights? I'll show you what rights are! Our biker gang is the law!\"","\"Beat the shit out of him!\"","\"Teach this dumbass some respect!\"","\"Ah!!!\"","Yun Cheng, watching this scene unfold, finally snapped out of his daze and couldn't help but laugh.","\"Chu Yang, isn't that a bit too wicked of you?\"","Chu Yang shrugged. \"I gave him money, and he went willingly. Besides, I only told him to ask a question. I never said he wouldn't get beaten up.\"","He had long found this ungrateful, self-hating guy to be an eyesore. This would serve as a lesson for him.","Ah Wei's miserable screams continued.","\"This is a society ruled by law...\"","\"I'm calling the cops... The police will help me...\"","\"Ah!!! I was wrong, I was wrong!\"","\"Black daddies! Please let me go...\"","When the young men got tired of beating him, they delivered a few final kicks, and one of them even snatched the ten-dollar bill from his pocket.","\"Take this as a lesson, punk!\"","\"Next time, don't go poking your nose into other people's family business!\"","After dropping these harsh words, they hopped onto their motorcycles and sped off.","Ah Wei lay on the cold concrete ground, his face bruised and swollen, his clothes torn to shreds, and his entire body aching terribly.","He looked up at the azure sky, tears mixing with his nosebleed as they streamed down his face.","\"Why... why treat me like this? I just want to be successful, I want to achieve my dreams!\"","Just as he fell into despair, feeling like he was about to die, an ambulance arrived. A few paramedics swiftly lifted him onto a stretcher and loaded him into the back.","Lying on the stretcher, watching the medical staff of this foreign country care for him, the light gradually returned to his eyes.","\"Look! There are still good people! This is America! Even if I'm beaten up like this, someone will still call an ambulance for me in time!\"","\"What is this little setback today? The road to success is always paved with difficulties. When I become a millionaire, the people who beat me up today will all have to... work for me! Yes! I'll hire them as security guards to protect me. This is what you call... a counterattack!\"","\"America... is so great!\"","Two hours later.","With his head wrapped in gauze, bandages plastered on his face, and walking with a limp, Ah Wei stood outside the hospital gates. He stared at the medical bill in his hand for over fifty thousand dollars and fell into a dead silence.","It seemed he had achieved his dream of becoming a man of negative wealth ahead of schedule.","...........","Meanwhile, on the other side.","Liu Yutong was in a car heading to the shooting range. Since she had come to America, she had to experience firing various firearms—something that both men and women found highly interesting.","But before they even reached the range, her phone suddenly rang.","It was Bai Shisui calling.","Liu Yutong answered the phone, but before she could speak, Bai Shisui's crying came through the receiver.","\"Sister Yutong, my dad... something happened to my dad...\"","Liu Yutong's heart sank heavily. \"Take your time. What happened to Uncle Bai?\"","\"My dad was ambushed on the road. He was shot... He's in the operating room now... sob...\"","\"Which hospital?\"","\"General Hospital... the emergency building...\"","\"I'll be right there.\"","Liu Yutong hung up and told Chu Yang, who was driving, \"Turn around. Go to General Hospital, right now.\"","\"Yes, Miss!\" Yun Cheng's mood also grew heavy.","\"Miss, do we need to notify Jesse?\"","\"Let's go to the hospital and check the situation first. If something terrible really happens to Uncle Bai...\" Liu Yutong didn't finish her sentence, but her meaning was perfectly clear.","This matter had to be thoroughly investigated to the bitter end!","The Snakehead Gang has grown far too arrogant. Not only do they prey on their own people, but they actually dared to lay a hand on President Bai. No matter what it takes, we must make them pay!"]},{"number":674,"title":"Chapter 674: 674, The Eternal Bottom Line of the Dragon Alliance (Two-in-One)","paragraphs":["Outside the emergency room at San Francisco General Hospital.","Bai Shisui sat on a bench with red, tear-filled eyes. Seeing Liu Yutong and her group arrive, she immediately stood up.","\"Sister Yutong.\"","\"How is Uncle Bai?\" Liu Yutong held her hands and asked with concern.","\"He is still in emergency resuscitation. He was shot twice, and the most serious one hit his abdomen. He lost a lot of blood...\" As Bai Shisui spoke, she started crying again.","Beside them, Yun Cheng frowned and asked, \"How could this happen? Doesn't President Bai always have bodyguards with him?\"","\"It was a premeditated ambush,\" a deep voice came from the side.","Liu Yutong turned her head and saw the young man in a jacket who had come to deliver the message at the restaurant last night.","His arm was wrapped in bandages, evidently injured as well.","\"My name is Jiang Chen. I'm a veteran employee who has followed President Bai for eight years. Last night, we received an urgent tip that the Snakehead Gang had locked up a new batch of scam victims in an abandoned warehouse south of the dock district. President Bai immediately took us there to save them, but we were ambushed as soon as we arrived!\"","\"How many of them were there?\" Yun Cheng asked.","\"At least twenty, and they came prepared with heavy firepower. Including the president, we only had twelve people in total. Out of our eight bodyguards, six were injured, two of them critically. They had too many men and held advantageous positions. We couldn't hold them off at all.\"","\"If it weren't for the president's driver staying in the car—which was specially modified and bulletproof—and realizing something was wrong from the gunfire, he rammed the car right into those bastards, buying us time to retreat. Otherwise, none of us might have escaped!\" Jiang Chen said in agony.","Right at that moment, the door to the operating room was pushed open with a swish.","A doctor wearing a mask and green scrubs walked out.","Seeing this, everyone immediately gathered around.","\"The bullets have been extracted, but the patient lost a massive amount of blood, damaging vital organs and blood vessels. His condition remains extremely critical and could deteriorate at any moment. The family needs to be mentally prepared.\"","Bai Shisui's vision instantly went dark, and she nearly collapsed, but fortunately, Liu Yutong caught her.","Liu Yutong looked at the doctor and said earnestly, \"Doctor, please, no matter what, use the best medicine, the best equipment, and the best treatment plan. At all costs, you must save Uncle Bai. Money is not an issue!\"","The doctor nodded and returned to the operating room.","The hallway fell into a brief silence.","Then, several more members of the chamber of commerce, having received the news of the president's accident, rushed to the scene. Each of them wore an expression of sheer anger.","\"Those bastards! I want to skin them alive!\"","\"This is too arrogant!\"","\"We must catch the culprits!\"","Everyone present, whether it was these chamber members or Liu Yutong's group, was filled with deep respect for President Bai Jingchen.","A highly successful tycoon who had long achieved financial freedom and could have easily enjoyed the rest of his life in peace, yet for years he consistently risked his life, personally rushing about just to save compatriots he didn't even know.","Such a man did not deserve this kind of fate.","\"Have you called the police?\" Liu Yutong asked Jiang Chen.","Jiang Chen nodded. \"We did. The police came, took our statements, and said they would open an investigation. But those slum areas have no surveillance cameras and no witnesses. Even if there were, who would dare step forward to testify against a gang? The Snakehead Gang has connections in the local area.\"","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and suddenly asked, \"Do you know where the Snakehead Gang's lair is, or the address of their main base of operations?\"","As soon as she said this, everyone looked at her.","\"Miss, you couldn't be thinking of...\" Yun Cheng frowned.","The gangs here weren't like the ones back home; they all had guns. Even President Bai and his bodyguards had fallen victim. He didn't want to see Liu Yutong put herself in danger. If anyone had to go risk their lives, it should be subordinates like them. It was best for the Miss to stay behind the scenes.","\"Don't be so nervous. I'm just asking.\"","Liu Yutong said to Yun Cheng and the others, \"After all, Uncle Bai is my business partner now. If something happens to a partner, I should at least show some concern and understand the situation, right?\"","Jiang Chen glanced at Bai Shisui. He wasn't sure if the Miss's friend was reliable, but after hesitating for a moment, he gave an address. \"In the dock district, near the intersection of Seventh Avenue and Sea Wolf Alley, there is a three-story red brick building. It has a sign for Seven Seas Freight, but it rarely opens for business. That is one of their main hideouts, and there are usually a lot of people going in and out.\"","Liu Yutong nodded, committing it to memory. Then she turned to Bai Shisui and said, \"Shisui, you stay here and watch over Uncle Bai. If there is any news, call me immediately.\"","Bai Shisui subconsciously grabbed her sleeve and asked with teary eyes, \"Sister Yutong, where are you going?\"","Liu Yutong smiled faintly. \"To prepare a grand gift for Uncle Bai, of course.\"","..........","As soon as Liu Yutong walked out of the emergency building, she took out her phone and dialed Jesse's number.","The phone rang three times before it was answered.","Jesse also immediately reported the situation on his end.","\"Great-grandmother, I was just about to call you. The tail in Los Angeles reported that Zhao Weixiang's whereabouts have been completely locked down. When do you want to make a move?\"","\"No rush for now. I have an urgent matter that I need you to handle.\"","\"Uh, what is it?\"","\"Do you know the Snakehead Gang? I want to know their specific details, including information about their members.\"","Although the man named Jiang Chen had given them a fair amount of information, it wasn't comprehensive enough; otherwise, Uncle Bai wouldn't have been ambushed.","Having Jesse investigate it would serve as a backup plan.","On the other end of the phone, Jesse fell silent for two seconds upon hearing this.","\"Great-grandmother, are you planning to make a move against the Snakehead Gang? This... I might be powerless to help.\"","\"Why?\"","\"I've run into some trouble on my end too, and it's a massive problem that needs to be resolved immediately.\"","\"What kind of trouble? Tell me about it.\"","\"It's my uncle, Rossi Corraro. I don't know where he got the news, but he found out I'm working for you. He scolded me for bringing absolute disgrace to the family, saying that our Corraro family is a long-standing Italian-American family in the US and a great branch of the Mafia. He asked when we were ever reduced to being lackeys for a little girl from Dragon Country, saying I've completely thrown away the family's face.\"","\"Of course, I know these are all just excuses. I suspect he investigated and found out that my funding comes from you, and he wants to use this as an excuse to attack me. Now there is a division within the family again, and I must resolve it.\"","Liu Yutong had her phone on speaker, so Yun Cheng and Chu Yang, who were beside her, could hear it too.","Yun Cheng couldn't help but speak up. \"Didn't you say you basically had control of the family now? How can you not even solve this little internal issue? You can't even handle your uncle?\"","To be honest, Yun Cheng was a bit disappointed in this guy. He tried to imitate the Ten Thousand Dragons Society but only managed to copy the surface.","Within the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, orders were always strictly enforced. With a single word from the Miss, no one below would ever dare to utter a word of dissent.","Look at Jesse over here, completely tied up by a little family infighting. Besides, the laws in America aren't as strict as in Dragon Country. If he really wanted to solve internal family issues, there are plenty of ways. Just execute the disobedient ones on the spot and be done with it!","Hearing Yun Cheng's dissatisfaction, Jesse hastily explained, Boss Yun Cheng, you don't understand the situation. My uncle recently hooked up with a guy named Miles. His father is the second-in-command of the Hells Angels, the largest motorcycle gang in Northern California. With the Hells Angels backing him, he has regained the capital to oppose me... And he put the word out that...","Said what?","He said that if I don't resolve the issue according to family rules, he will unite with a few other uncles and kick me out. By then, let alone helping you, Great-Grandma, I won't even be able to protect myself.","What exactly is your uncle's goal? Does he want you to completely cut ties with us?","That's just one aspect, I suppose. The other is about money.","Since I took over the family, I've transitioned many illegal businesses into legal operations, which led to a decrease in gray income. My uncle and his people are used to making fast money. They can't stand my way of doing business; they think I've cut off the family's financial lifeline.","So, he doesn't really care who you work for, or about losing any family face. He just needed to find an excuse to incite the others, kick you out, and resume running those illegal businesses?","Exactly! Especially when they found out I was cooperating with you and that there were large financial transactions, they accused me of betraying the family and selling family resources to outsiders.","Moreover, I only recently heard a family secret from an elder. It seems that many years ago, the reason my father's branch was able to take control of the family was because of the help from your grandfather, Great-Grandma. My uncle's lineage, being the losers, have always harbored a grudge about this, and now they are using it to make an issue.","Now, seeing the conflict between my uncle and me getting more and more serious, the family elders agreed to my uncle's proposed solution.","What solution?","A duel.","Best two out of three. If I win, he will never interfere with my decisions again and will hand over all the remaining power in his hands. If I lose, I have to step down, and from then on, he will be the main authority in all major family affairs.","Hearing Jesse explain the cause and effect, Liu Yutong and the others really felt that the internal affairs of Jesse's family were quite complicated.","Of course, this didn't stop Yun Cheng and Chu Yang from inwardly despising this great-grandson once again.","Just look at you, the dignified current helmsman of a mafia family, who even received tens of millions of dollars in financial support from the Eldest Miss. How could you still run the gang into such a miserable state?","Then look at the Eldest Miss, starting from scratch at eighteen with nothing, yet she single-handedly forged the Ten Thousand Dragons Association into a behemoth.","This gap... What a piece of trash!","Naturally, Yun Cheng, Chu Yang, and this group of Ten Thousand Dragons Association members were, to some extent, lucky guys who got carried to victory by following the Eldest Miss.","After all, how many Liu Yutongs could there be in this world?","Compared to the monstrously talented Liu Yutong, ordinary people like Jesse, who didn't have cheat codes, were the normal ones.","Jesse, what are the events for this best two out of three?","The first round is a shooting contest, the second is a no-rules MMA fight, and the third is a slapping contest.","Yun Cheng and the others: ???","Slapping?","The first two events were understandable, but what the hell was this third one?","How does slapping count as a competition? Isn't that too childish? Yun Cheng couldn't help but complain.","Chu Yang also nodded in agreement, Exactly, it feels like kids fooling around.","Yun Cheng, do you guys really think it's just fooling around? Liu Yutong suddenly asked.","Yun Cheng: Isn't it?","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and gave an example, There really are these so-called slap competitions here in America, and they are very dangerous. Participants even need to sign a waiver of life and death. Yun Cheng, why don't you two imagine what the result would be if you played a slapping game with Ji Yu?","As soon as she said this, the two most capable fighters of the Ten Thousand Dragons Association couldn't help but freeze.","What would happen if they exchanged slaps with Ji Yu? This question was a bit profound.","The two gradually began to imagine it. Given Ji Yu's terrifying physique of over two meters, if he slapped them with a hand larger than their heads, it would probably send them straight to the afterlife to meet their ancestors on the spot, right?","Just picturing that scene made the two of them simultaneously shudder.","How the hell was this a competition? This was clearly a contest of who had a harder fate!","Ahem...","Yun Cheng coughed awkwardly and immediately changed his tune, Um... Eldest Miss, I just thought about it carefully, and this slap competition is actually quite good, really!","Chu Yang also nodded hastily, Yes, yes, yes! And it particularly tests a person's strike resistance and willpower, while also showing the purest contest between men!","Liu Yutong watched the two make a 180-degree turn in their attitude, the corners of her red lips turning up slightly, What, you don't think it's childish anymore?","Not childish! Not childish at all! The two shook their heads frantically.","This is a collision of strength and courage!","Exactly! It's much more practical than those flashy fighting techniques!","Liu Yutong stopped bantering with them and spoke into the phone again, Jesse, when is the competition scheduled? I'll go watch it in person.","Ah? You're coming, Great-Grandma? Jesse was a bit surprised.","Why, is that a problem?","No, no! Of course it's fine!","How could Jesse dare to refuse? He immediately gave the address and time.","It's at one of the family's boxing gyms. The time is tomorrow night at eight. Since you're coming, Great-Grandma, I'll send someone to pick you up.","No need, we'll head over ourselves. Liu Yutong said, then hung up the phone.","She put away her phone, looked at Yun Cheng and the others again, and said with a somewhat serious expression.","It seems we have to help Jesse resolve his family affairs first. Jesse is currently an important asset for us in this unfamiliar country. If his backyard catches fire and he can't even protect himself, many of our subsequent plans will be difficult to carry out. We need to help him settle his uncle first, so he can free up his hands and fully cooperate with us to deal with the Snake Head Gang and seek justice for Uncle Bai.","Eldest Miss, just tell us what to do! We'll listen to you! Yun Cheng immediately declared.","There are indeed many ways to deal with Jesse's uncle.","Liu Yutong's tone shifted, But here, we still have to choose legal methods. And let me emphasize again, no matter where you go in the future, you must engrave the words abide by the law in your hearts. This will always be the bottom line of our Ten Thousand Dragons Association!","Understood, Eldest Miss!","Call Zhao Tianyi back and see if he can first establish a legal law enforcement identity for us!","Yes! Yun Cheng and the others instantly grew excited.","The familiar rhythm was starting again!"]},{"number":675,"title":"Chapter 675: 675、Use Money to Smash","paragraphs":["Half an hour later.","Inside the hotel suite, all members of the Wanlong Syndicate were present.","Liu Yutong gave a brief and concise account of what had happened, repeatedly emphasizing that the prerequisite for dealing with those gangs was that it had to be completely legal.","Yun Cheng spoke first. Miss, Jesse's family is a notorious local gang, and the security here is far worse than back home. Take the police, for example, security in the wealthy neighborhoods is obviously much better, but in areas where gangs are active, it's absolutely atrocious. The methods we used back home probably won't work here.","Chu Yang nodded in agreement. And then there's the Snakehead Gang. They dared to shoot Chairman Bai in broad daylight. They are complete outlaws. Dealing with them is too dangerous.","It is precisely because their actions are illegal that we must stick to legal channels.","Liu Yutong looked at Zhao Tianyi. Tianyi, tell us what you think.","Zhao Tianyi nodded and said unhurriedly, The Miss has always emphasized the principle of obeying the law, and I think she is absolutely right. As the saying goes, when you are away from home, there are no parents to spoil you. The same applies to our Wanlong Syndicate. Back home, we are a massive conglomerate, and the local leaders, acting like parents, will look out for us to some extent. But abroad, no one will look out for us, and they might even work against us. That is why we must be even more law-abiding and leave no vulnerabilities.","Chu Yang said, Counselor, you're right about obeying the law, but it depends on the place! In this hellhole, we can hardly even guarantee our own safety. How are we supposed to solve problems legally?","Brother Yang, don't rush. Listen to me first.","Chairman Bai is a renowned expatriate entrepreneur with strong influence in both the San Francisco business circles and the expatriate community. Now that he has been shot and hospitalized, I've looked into it, and the incident has already alerted our embassy.","The first step is to have Bai Shisui contact the embassy to put pressure on the local police. After all, with such a heinous incident occurring in their country, the local police have to provide an explanation, right?","If the police discover during their investigation that this case not only involves the Snakehead Gang but might also implicate other local gang forces, and even internal struggles within the Corraro family... what do you think the police will do?","Chu Yang's eyes lit up. Counselor, you mean we link Jesse's uncle to the Snakehead Gang? Make him the scapegoat?","You're mistaken. It's not just simply linking them and making him a scapegoat.","After correcting his wording, Zhao Tianyi continued, We just need to make the police suspicious. Make them suspect that Jesse's uncle, Rossi Corraro, has been secretly supporting the Snakehead Gang in attacking foreign expatriates.","Yun Cheng was a bit confused. Is suspicion alone enough? Isn't that too simple?","Brother Yun, sometimes the more complex things are, the worse they turn out. Too much complexity easily leads to mistakes.","Hasn't Jesse's uncle always been dissatisfied with Jesse legitimizing the family business? Hasn't he always wanted to revive those gray-area operations? So, wouldn't it be perfectly logical for him to have ties to the Snakehead Gang?","What we need to do isn't forge evidence, but guide them. Guide the police to investigate whether Jesse's uncle and the Snakehead Gang have been in contact. Also, you've fallen into a misconception. Have you ever seen the US police wait for conclusive evidence before acting? As long as they suspect the other party is dangerous and involved in illegal activities, they will enforce justice directly! This is basic procedure for them!","Damn! You can do that? Yun Cheng and the others were shocked.","Sure enough, in a place overflowing with freedom, the way cases were handled was truly unique.","Zhao Tianyi looked at Liu Yutong. Miss, are you willing to spend some money?","Liu Yutong said without hesitation, Money is not an issue. As long as it works, I'm willing to spend however much it takes.","Zhao Tianyi nodded. Then there's no problem. To make the local police more proactive in thoroughly investigating the case, we can donate ten million dollars to the police in Miss Bai Shisui's name.","In the United States, donating to the police is not only legal but also very common.","Many businesses and individuals support police community projects through donations, and these donations can even qualify for tax deductions.","This is also why security in wealthy neighborhoods is often better, while security in poorer areas is so bad.","Chu Yang realized what he meant. Counselor Zhao, you mean we donate to the police in Miss Bai's name and use that as an entry point to obtain some sort of legal assisting status?","Zhao Tianyi nodded. Exactly! Ten million dollars is no small sum. It's enough to make the local police department take this seriously. Moreover, as donors, we have the right to request updates on the investigation's progress and even offer assistance under certain conditions.","Yun Cheng's eyes also lit up. Like the special consultants in those American crime shows?","Zhao Tianyi replied, Pretty much, but what we want is an official status. Not an informant, not an undercover agent, but a special investigative consultant officially hired by the police. This way, even if we take some extreme actions while assisting the investigation, there will be a legal explanation for them.","We might even become the first foreigners to receive a pennant for bravery and friendly police-civilian cooperation from the US police.","After hearing his words, Yun Cheng and Chu Yang couldn't help but praise him. Counselor Zhao, your move is truly brilliant. Even though it'll cost us some blood, it allows us to execute those bastards legally and legitimately!","Not to mention, I've never seen the US police award a pennant for bravery. We have to strive to be the trailblazers.","But I have one more question. Will the local police really agree to this? It's not common to hire foreigners as consultants, right? Even if we donate ten million dollars.","Zhao Tianyi said, Under normal circumstances, it is indeed uncommon. But if the donation amount is large enough, then anything is possible. After all, this is a capitalist society.","After listening to their conversation, Liu Yutong immediately made the final call. I've made my decision. If ten million isn't enough, then twenty million. If twenty million isn't enough, then fifty million. If fifty million isn't enough, then a hundred million!","Even if I have to throw money at them, I will keep throwing it until they agree!","Hearing the Miss's words, Yun Cheng and the others were shaken. The Miss's aura was truly too powerful!","It was just that giving away so much money to the US police for nothing still made their hearts ache a bit.","Ten million US dollars was equivalent to seventy or eighty million Dragon Coins, and a hundred million US dollars meant seven or eight hundred million!","Liu Yutong seemed to see through their thoughts and said, Don't fret over the money. No matter how much we spend, as long as we can avenge Uncle Bai, it's worth it!","She left one thing unsaid: the thirty percent dry shares Bai Jingchen had gifted her were alone worth over two billion dollars. What was a mere hundred million dollars compared to that?","Furthermore, doing this would not only achieve revenge but also demonstrate to all expatriates the Wanlong Syndicate's determination and stance in protecting its partners and defending the interests of expatriate merchants abroad.","\"Of course, donating money is one thing, but applying pressure is equally important. In addition to our efforts at the embassy, we need to ramp up the media coverage. We must quickly spread the news of Chairman Bai's attack, emphasizing his status as a renowned entrepreneur, philanthropist, and president of the chamber of commerce. At the same time, we need to highlight the sheer viciousness of the incident.\"","Liu Yutong looked over at Su Mansu. \"I want you to handle this.\"","Su Mansu nodded. \"Got it, boss!\"","Liu Yutong then looked back at the rest of the group. \"In short, we need to tackle this from multiple angles and make absolutely sure we are fully prepared.\"","\"Understood!\" the crowd nodded in unison.","Now, everyone was filled with confidence. Once all the legal procedures were neatly in place, it would finally be time to let those gangs witness the unrivaled, sky-reaching power of their Wanlong Society!"]},{"number":676,"title":"Chapter 676: 676, The First Game Is Going to Be Lost","paragraphs":["With their course of action finalized, Liu Yutong and the others each took up their respective roles and quickly sprang into action.","Relying on his personal connections, Zhao Tianyi swiftly partnered with a renowned law firm to assist him in handling any potential legal issues.","Su Mansu worked non-stop to contact the media, spending money to ramp up their promotional efforts.","Liu Yutong personally went to the hospital to find Bai Shisui and explained her planned course of action.","Simply put, she intended to donate ten million dollars to the local police department in the name of the Bai Group. If ten million wasn't enough, they would keep adding to it. At the same time, they would demand that the police establish a special task force to thoroughly investigate the attack on Father Bai, and temporarily hire Liu Yutong's team as special investigative consultants.","Additionally, she asked Bai Shisui to contact the embassy to request their close attention to the case and provide any necessary assistance.","The embassy certainly wouldn't refuse. After all, Bai Jingchen was a famous entrepreneur from the Dragon Kingdom who had cumulatively donated billions in charity back home. Even if they hadn't asked, the embassy would have followed up on the case anyway.","Truth be told, Liu Yutong really admired the sheer audacity of the Snakehead Gang for actually daring to lay a hand on an entrepreneur with as much influence as Uncle Bai.","However, when she remembered the social climate of this place, it made sense—after all, people here even dared to assassinate top leaders.","After hearing Liu Yutong's arrangements, Bai Shisui's eyes grew red again. Especially when she learned that Liu Yutong would be paying for all the expenses out of her own pocket, she absolutely refused to accept it, but she ultimately couldn't win the argument against Liu Yutong.","Sister Yutong, thank you... really, thank you!","Don't mention it, we are sisters, so let's not be strangers. Rest assured, I will definitely get justice for Uncle Bai.","Liu Yutong comforted Bai Shisui a bit more before leaving the hospital.","After walking out of the hospital, the expression on her face didn't lighten much.","After all, Uncle Bai was still not out of the woods. He was already getting on in years, and having suffered such a severe gunshot wound, whether he could pull through was still unknown.","If the worst were to happen, what would become of the Bai Group?","Counting on a girl like Bai Shisui was definitely out of the question. She had never participated in her family's corporate affairs, dedicating her heart and soul entirely to fashion design. If Uncle Bai really didn't make it, the Bai family would inevitably fall into internal chaos. Power struggles were highly likely to occur, and even the thirty percent shares Uncle Bai had previously promised might become uncertain.","It wasn't that Liu Yutong absolutely had to have that thirty percent stake, but if she could no longer cooperate with the Bai family because of this, the mobile phone business layout she had just planned out would definitely be affected.","I hope he gets better, Liu Yutong silently prayed in her heart.","............","Time flew by.","The next evening, the boxing gym owned by the Rossi family became extraordinarily lively.","At this moment, inside the octagonal steel cage, two burly men were engaged in the first round of a no-holds-barred MMA fight.","The fighter sent out by Jesse was a lean and tough Italian youth, but right now, this fighter was backed against the cage by his opponent, enduring a frantic barrage of attacks.","His opponent was a massive white man standing one point nine five meters tall, with broad shoulders, a thick back, and a ferocious fighting style!","Bang!","The burly white man landed a vicious hook on the Italian youth's cheek. The latter let out a muffled groan and stumbled into the chain-link fence of the cage, his consciousness nearly fading.","Hahaha! Is this the trash that Jesse picked?","In the VIP suite on the second floor of the gym, a middle-aged man with a full beard was laughing uproariously. He was Jesse's uncle, Rossi Corraro.","Sitting beside him were several family elders who supported him, as well as a fierce-looking man in a black leather jacket—the second-in-command of the Hells Angels gang.","Rossi raised his wine glass and cast a contemptuous glance at Jesse, who was sitting not far away looking tense. My good nephew, the fighter you chose doesn't seem to be up to much. He's already failing after only two rounds. Why don't you just obediently surrender? Stop making a fool of yourself.","Hearing this, Jesse only clenched his fists and said nothing. The bodyguards around him also lowered their heads one by one, their morale low.","No one expected the fighter Rossi brought in to be this strong, completely dominating their fighter the entire time. How could they possibly compete?","The gang members in the audience joined in the jeering, whistling, mocking, and screaming.","Jesse is definitely going to lose, right? Boss Rossi's guy is just too fierce.","Absolutely. I heard that white guy is a former UFC fighter, hired by Boss Rossi for a massive sum.","Jesse could never hold the family up anyway. Now he can't even win a match. He should just get lost!","Look at that bunch of people around him, all wearing black suits like waiters. What kind of combat power could they possibly have?","Yeah, where did they learn to put on such a useless show?","........","Just then, a bald white man intentionally began to loudly mock Jesse.","Just a lapdog for the yellow monkeys, and you want to fight with Boss Rossi? You really don't know your place!","Jesse jerked his head up, glaring fiercely at the bald man. Say that again, motherfucker?!","Seeing his nephew fly into a rage, Rossi laughed again. What? Jesse, you want to throw punches? Don't forget the family rules. Until the match is over, no one is allowed to cause trouble!","Jesse took a deep breath, calming himself down. Of course I remember, Uncle, but don't celebrate too early either!","Hahaha, I'll be waiting! Rossi didn't take his words seriously at all.","Jesse looked back at the octagon, his mind racing with thoughts of how he would face his great-grandmother if he really lost this time.","He truly regretted it in his heart. He regretted that he hadn't been ruthless enough to eliminate his uncle after seizing power, which gave his uncle the chance to make a comeback.","But it was too late to say anything now.","Jesse stared intently at the teetering figure in the octagon, desperately wishing for a miracle, but reason coldly told him that defeat was certain!","The Italian fighter he sent out used to fight in underground boxing matches and wasn't weak by any means. However, his opponent was a professional fighter who stood one point nine five meters tall, weighed over a hundred and twenty kilograms, had truly fought many official matches, and was as brutal as a wild beast.","The match reached the four-minute mark.","With his consciousness blurring, the Italian youth ultimately couldn't hold on. He was struck again by a heavy punch to the chin from his opponent, sending his whole body flying backward to crash heavily onto the ground.","His opponent, a guy nicknamed Bone Crusher, grinned widely and laughed. He turned to face the audience, raising his hands high to accept the cheers and screams of the crowd like a conqueror.","Immediately after, he turned back around, preparing to deliver the final blow to his opponent.","Just then, Jesse hurriedly shouted at the ring, Mike! Surrender!","In the end, he couldn't be cold-blooded enough to watch his fighter die in battle. This was also an important reason why his uncle had found an opportunity to turn the tables on him.","Compassion has no place in command, especially in the world of Western gangs, where being soft-hearted means you cannot be a leader.","However, the fighter named Mike didn't just refuse to surrender; he gritted his teeth and struggled to his feet. Even though he was swaying and on the verge of collapsing, he refused to concede. He assumed his fighting stance once more and threw a straight punch at the opponent before him.","But to his opponent, Bonecrusher, this punch was painfully slow and weak. He dodged it effortlessly.","\"Idiot! If you want to die so badly, I'll grant your wish!\"","Bonecrusher took two steps back, then suddenly sprinted forward and leaped into the air, driving his knee viciously into Mike's chest.","With a sickening crack, Mike was sent crashing heavily against the steel cage. His chest caved in visibly, and blood spewed from his mouth. He slowly slid to the ground, completely motionless.","Jesse's eyes went red. \"Mike!\"","The referee quickly stepped in to separate them and began the countdown.","\"Ten! Nine! Eight!...\"","The guy nicknamed Bonecrusher simply looked down at the unmoving Mike, his eyes full of contempt.","\"...Three! Two! One! The match is over!\"","\"The winner of the first round is our very own Bonecrusher!\"","The cage door swung open.","Bonecrusher dragged Mike out like a limp chicken and tossed him onto the floor like a piece of garbage.","The staff hurried over with a stretcher to carry him away, but anyone could see that he was likely beyond saving.","As the victor, Bonecrusher pounded his chest like a wild beast inside the octagon and roared, \"Who else?!\"","\"Which one of you cowards dares to step up next!\"","No one in the audience dared to answer.","According to the rules, Jesse had lost this round.","Rossi didn't forget to mock Jesse in Italian, \"Jesse, my dear nephew, is this all your men are capable of?\"","\"Don't say your uncle didn't give you a chance. If you can still find someone to step into the ring, I can tell the referee to hold off on announcing the result of this first round.\"","He had the confidence to say this because he had done his research. Jesse only had one semi-professional fighter under him. Finding someone who could defeat Bonecrusher on such short notice was virtually impossible.","Beside Rossi, the second-in-command of the Hells Angels, Miles, couldn't help but sneer as well. \"Jesse, as the new leader of the Corraro family, can't you even find a decent fighter? How about I lend you a few of my guys? For a fee, of course.\"","\"Hahaha...\"","Jesse's face turned livid. He even entertained the thought of ordering his men to draw their guns and fight them to the death. However, when he looked at the people around them, he abandoned the idea.","The Hells Angels were also here. If he dragged them into this, the result would inevitably be a devastating blow to the entire Corraro family.","As a branch of the Italian Mafia known for its unity, he certainly didn't want to see that happen.","Although he had lost the first round, he still had a chance.","Thinking of this, he took a deep breath and started to speak, \"I con...\"","Before he could get the word \"concede\" out of his mouth...","Creak!","The main doors of the boxing gym were suddenly pushed open from the outside.","A beautiful silhouette appeared against the light. The golden dragon emblem on the left lapel of her black suit was dazzling!","Immediately after, a cold, clear female voice reached the ears of everyone present.","\"I am so sorry, gentlemen! Jesse has not lost yet!\""]},{"number":677,"title":"Chapter 677: 677, Ancestor","paragraphs":["With a creak, the doors of the boxing gym were pushed open.","Everyone couldn't help but look toward the entrance.","Backlit by the light, a slender black silhouette stood in the center of the doorway. The dark gold dragon emblem on the left breast of her suit gleamed with a cold light, like a fierce beast lurking in the dark night suddenly opening its eyes.","Behind her stood about twenty young men in black suits. The dark aura emanating from these men felt stronger than that of any gang member in the gym.","Then, the beautiful figure walked unhurriedly into the gym.","Even though her figure appeared very slender and petite compared to the Westerners around her, for some reason, she gave off an insurmountable presence.","\"God... who are these people?\"","\"Look at their chests, that symbol, is it a dragon?\"","\"Those men in black are so cool, aren't they? Matching black suits and dragon tattoos, they look more like a mafia than the Collaro family!\"","\"Which gang are they from? A new one?\"","\"That woman leading them... God, she's so young, and incredibly gorgeous!\"","\"But her aura is so intimidating, so strong!\"","\"...\"","The discussions in the gym rose and fell, filled with surprise, speculation, confusion, shock, and awe at that exquisite Eastern face.","After Liu Yutong entered the arena, her beautiful eyes calmly swept across the room.","The men in black behind her followed in perfect formation, like loyal guards protecting their queen.","The gang members on both sides of the stands couldn't help but step back, making way for a path. Some even subconsciously reached for their waists, only to realize their guns had already been handed in.","Arriving at the center of the arena, Liu Yutong first glanced at the fierce-looking fighter in the octagon, then looked up at the gang bosses with varying expressions in the VIP boxes on the second floor.","\"Jesse hasn't lost yet, don't celebrate too early!\"","In the VIP box on the second floor of the gym, Rossi's initially mocking smile gradually faded. He narrowed his eyes, staring intently at Liu Yutong.","Was this woman the person behind his nephew, Jesse?","To think she was so young!","The moment Jesse saw Liu Yutong, a look of excitement immediately appeared on his face. He quickly stood up and ran downstairs to greet her. His posture was extremely respectful, even more humble than when he faced the elders of his family.","\"Great-grandmother, you really came.\"","His calling her Great-grandmother instantly caused the entire gym to erupt in an uproar.","\"What did Jesse just call this beautiful Eastern woman?\"","\"TaiNaiNai? What is that? Grandmother?\"","\"Impossible, she looks like she's only around twenty!\"","\"Is Jesse crazy? He actually called a little girl from Dragon Country Great-grandmother.\"","\"Was Jesse beaten silly?\"","\"Could it be some Eastern honorific? The kind that shows respect?\"","\"...\"","Next to Rossi, the Hells Angels' second-in-command, Miles, couldn't help but laugh out loud. \"Rossi, is your good nephew so desperate from losing? Finding a little Eastern girl to be his backer and calling her Great-grandmother, this is hilarious.\"","\"Doesn't that mean you have to call her Grandmother too?\"","Jesse's uncle, Rossi Collaro, instantly darkened his face. He stood up abruptly and slammed his hand heavily against the railing.","\"Eastern girl, do you want to interfere in the affairs of the Collaro family?!\"","Truth be told, this girl was indeed the most beautiful and elegant Eastern woman he had ever seen in real life.","Of course, he didn't underestimate this young Eastern girl in his heart. A few months ago, he had suffered a setback because of his nephew, and anyone who could make his nephew undergo such a huge transformation could not be an ordinary person.","By this time, Jesse had already arrived in front of Liu Yutong, bowing at almost ninety degrees. \"Great-grandmother, I am so touched that you could come. Please, take the seat of honor!\"","He stepped aside and respectfully made a gesture inviting her.","Liu Yutong didn't hold back either, striding toward the seat Jesse had just occupied on the second floor.","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang followed her on the left and right, their eyes vigilantly scanning the surroundings.","Lan Die, who had a relatively low presence, was like a shadow, quietly blending into the surrounding environment.","When Liu Yutong actually sat down in Jesse's main seat, the atmosphere in the entire room became incredibly eerie again.","An Eastern girl who looked no older than twenty was sitting in the seat of the current helmsman of the Collaro family, while Jesse himself stood respectfully by her side like an attendant, ready to be ordered around at any moment.","This contrast was simply too huge!","\"Jesse!\"","Seeing this scene, Rossi became furious and roared at him, \"You worthless trash who has disgraced the family! How dare you let this Dragon Country girl sit in the position of the head of the family? What the hell do you take our Collaro family for? Is that a seat just anyone can sit in?!\"","\"Could it be that you're sleeping with this young and beautiful Eastern girl? Or is she just that good in bed? To bewitch you to this extent, making you completely abandon the honor of the Collaro family!\"","\"If that's the case, then I'm very disappointed in you. I will make you watch with your own eyes as I take this woman down and have my men ruthlessly humiliate her!\"","These insulting words immediately made some gang members restless. Their gazes toward Liu Yutong gradually changed from initial awe to malicious intent.","If they could really catch this breathtakingly beautiful Dragon Country girl... it would definitely be thrilling!","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang were not good at foreign languages. Moreover, many of these gang members were speaking Italian rather than English. Without a translator, they didn't understand. Otherwise, hearing Rossi's words, they would have gone over to beat him up long ago.","However, they seemed to be able to tell from the expressions of these people that Rossi was probably saying something filthy.","Just as they were about to step forward to issue a warning, Liu Yutong stopped them.","\"Jesse.\"","\"Here, Great-grandmother!\" Jesse responded immediately.","Liu Yutong raised her slender finger and pointed in Rossi's direction. \"This person, is he your uncle?\"","\"Yes, Great-grandmother. He is my uncle, Rossi Collaro,\" Jesse nodded and said.","Liu Yutong looked Rossi up and down, then spoke in a foreign language, \"You ill-mannered thing!\"","Rossi's face instantly flushed the color of pig liver. \"What did you call me?!\"","Liu Yutong leaned forward slightly, resting her elbow on the armrest and propping her chin on one hand, adopting a lazy, arrogant posture.","\"Jesse calls me Great-grandmother. According to seniority, what should you call me?\"","She paused, her red lips parting slightly as she uttered a single word.","\"Ancestor!\""]},{"number":678,"title":"Chapter 678: 678, I'm Coming","paragraphs":["The moment the word \"ancestor\" left Liu Yutong's lips, the atmosphere in the entire boxing gym instantly froze.","Everyone's eyes widened, staring in disbelief at the Eastern woman sitting properly in the seat of honor on the second floor.","Resting her chin on one hand, she had a somewhat girlish, playful look that was undeniably beautiful, but also incredibly arrogant.","To dare humiliate Rossi like this on his own turf—she had serious guts!","\"Hahaha! Ancestor, she said she's Rossi's ancestor.\"","\"Good God, this woman is ruthless!\"","\"She's humiliating Rossi right in front of everyone!\"","\"But in terms of seniority, it seems she's actually right? Jesse calls her great-grandmother, and Rossi is Jesse's uncle... calling herself his ancestor kind of makes sense, right?\"","\"Shut up! Is that the fucking point?\"","\"Boss Rossi, this bitch is too arrogant! Teach her a lesson!\"","\"Let her know whose territory this is!\"","\"An Eastern monkey dares to run wild here?\"","\"She is pretty hot, though... heh heh...\"","\"What's the use of being pretty? Didn't you hear her humiliating Boss Rossi?\"","\"Exactly, an Eastern chick deserves to be called an ancestor by us from the Coraro family?\"","\"...\"","In this underground world filled with violence and male hormones, the sudden intrusion of a young, beautiful Eastern woman—who arrogantly sat in the patriarch's seat and mocked a core member of the Coraro family—was undoubtedly a naked provocation to many of the gang members.","However, a portion of the crowd remained silent.","Their gazes continuously swept over the young men in black standing behind Liu Yutong.","Most of these silent observers were seasoned veterans who had weathered many storms. Their intuition told them that this Eastern woman was not simple.","Those young men in black were far too quiet.","From the moment they entered until now, they hadn't made a single sound, not even whispering among themselves. Such discipline was definitely not something an ordinary leader could cultivate.","Little did they know, it was simply because the men couldn't understand foreign languages.","\"Everyone shut up!\"","Right then, Rossi let out a furious roar, and the entire venue instantly fell silent.","He then looked back at Liu Yutong, his face contorted with rage, and said, \"Eastern chick, do you have any idea who you're humiliating?\"","\"Look around you. These are all my brothers, the territory of our Coraro family. Did you think bringing a few Eastern boys over would let you act so arrogantly in front of me?\"","\"Piss me off, and I'll show you the consequences. I'll strip you naked and tie you to a pillar, letting all my brothers see exactly what that Eastern skin of yours looks like!\"","\"Once you're used up, I'll throw you into the dog cages in the basement with those disobedient whores. I'll feed you dog food every day and make you bark like a dog... until you thoroughly remember who the master is around here!\"","These words were extremely vicious, and they completely infuriated Liu Yutong.","She stood up. The laziness and casualness on her face gradually faded, her delicate features turning as cold as frost.","\"Rossi, do you know that in our Dragon Country, three things are very important? First is hierarchy, second is rules, and third is face.\"","\"Since Jesse calls me great-grandmother, according to seniority, I am your ancestor. Yet you speak so insolently to your ancestor. Do you know what that's called? Treasonous!\"","\"A wild dog like you, who understands neither hierarchy nor rules, and commits such treason—how dare you clamor in front of your ancestor!\"","\"You!\" Rossi instantly flew into a rage.","\"Shut up!\"","\"Grandson, did I give you permission to speak!\"","Firing on all cylinders, Liu Yutong instantly plunged the entire boxing gym back into dead silence. Those who had just been discussing or even insulting her all instinctively shut their mouths.","Even Rossi was intimidated by the invisible pressure radiating from her.","A few seconds later.","The other gang members in the gym snapped back to reality, all showing expressions of shock. They hadn't expected this little Eastern girl to be so terrifying when angry.","\"My God, what did I just see?\"","\"Rossi was actually scared by a little girl.\"","\"Forget Boss Rossi, even I was scared.\"","\"The aura this woman gives off when she's angry... is too terrifying!\"","\"...\"","Rossi took a deep breath, forcing himself to calm down.","\"Good! Very good! Little girl, you want to talk to me about your Dragon Country's rules, right?\"","\"Then let's play by the rules. Best two out of three, written in black and white, witnessed by the elders of the Coraro family.\"","\"You just said Jesse hasn't lost yet. I can give you a chance. According to the agreement, if you can find someone to take his place in the ring within three minutes, the first round won't be considered over.\"","Saying that, he raised his wrist to look at his watch.","\"The timer starts now. Which of these boys behind you, dressed like they're going to a funeral, dares to go up? Or do you want to try it yourself?\"","\"The fighter I have in that cage doesn't know the meaning of showing mercy to the fairer sex. What he loves most is taking a delicate, self-righteous, pretty face like yours and smashing it to pieces, punch by punch!\"","\"Just think about it. That beautiful Eastern skin of yours beaten beyond recognition, bones broken, blood flowing... that picture will surely be beautiful. When that time comes, let's see how you maintain this high-and-mighty attitude!\"","Rossi still wanted to use this kind of vicious language to regain his face and frighten Liu Yutong.","Even some of the gang members couldn't help but shiver. Rossi was famous for his cruelty; if he said it, he would definitely do it.","Liu Yutong, however, remained unmoved, her eyes freezing cold.","Jesse also hurriedly said to Liu Yutong, \"Great-grandmother, the fighter my uncle found is very formidable. He's a former UFC fighter, one meter ninety-five tall, weighing over a hundred and twenty kilograms, with extreme combat power. I think for this round... if we really can't do it, giving up is fine. After all, it's best two out of three.\"","As he said this, he couldn't help but look at Yuncheng behind Liu Yutong. He had some understanding of Yuncheng's skills, but not much. Most importantly, the physiques of Yuncheng and these men in black compared to the guy in the ring were definitely at a disadvantage.","In fact, in the stereotypes of many Westerners, Easterners were generally petite in stature and their combat prowess was far inferior to theirs. It was normal for Jesse to feel uncertain.","Before Liu Yutong could speak, Rossi started laughing again.","\"What? My dear nephew Jesse, you found outside help but don't dare to send them up? Afraid your yellow monkey backup will be killed by Bonecrusher in one punch? Makes sense, with their puny builds, they probably aren't even enough to fill the gaps in Bonecrusher's teeth.\"","Miles: \"Rossi, don't talk about them like that. Maybe these Easterners have some flashy martial arts moves? Let them go up, so we can broaden our horizons and see how yellow monkeys get beaten to the ground!\"","\"Little girl, since you brought people, let them go into the ring and try! Don't just stand there flapping your lips. If you've got the guts, let's see some real action! If you don't dare, then take your people and get the hell out of here before you embarrass yourself any further!\"","Everyone looked at Liu Yutong's stunningly beautiful face, which remained perfectly calm.","Would she be scared? Would she accept the challenge? Or would she run away with her tail between her legs?","Just then, Liu Yutong turned her head slightly and looked behind her.","\"Will you be okay?\"","She was actually quite worried. After all, the guy offstage had a genuinely terrifying build, although of course, he still fell a bit short compared to Ji Yu.","Just as she finished speaking.","In a flash!","Two figures stepped forward at the exact same time.","\"I'll go!\"","\"Let me do it!\""]},{"number":679,"title":"Chapter 679: 679, The True Tycoon","paragraphs":["I will go!","Let me do it!","Two voices rang out almost simultaneously. Yun Cheng and Chu Yang exchanged a glance, their eyes burning with the fierce will to fight.","Both of them were top-tier martial artists in the Ten Thousand Dragons Society. Now that they were faced with such a tough battle, naturally, they both wanted to be the first to step into the ring.","I will take care of that Bone Crusher, you can take the next match, Yun Cheng said.","No way, I am going first. Everyone knows the next match will not be a fighting competition, Chu Yang refused to yield.","The two were at a stalemate and simultaneously looked toward the Eldest Miss, waiting for her to make the final decision.","Miss...","Before Liu Yutong could speak, Miles beat them to the punch. How about the two of you go in together? We will also send out another man. Let us make it a two-on-two brawl, what do you say?","After briefly translating his words, Liu Yutong looked at Yun Cheng and Chu Yang with a questioning gaze.","Yun Cheng immediately patted his chest and promised, Miss, no problem! Let alone two-on-two, even if it is one against two, I can handle it!","Chu Yang showed no sign of weakness either. Rest assured, Miss. With the two of us joining forces, taking care of those two will be a piece of cake!","Liu Yutong gave a slight nod. Then you must be careful.","The two replied in unison, Understood!","Soon, the arena staff cleared out the octagon.","Bone Crusher was already standing inside the cage, arms crossed over his chest, his eyes sweeping contemptuously over Yun Cheng and Chu Yang outside.","The second-in-command of the Hells Angels, Miles, also sent out a tall, burly Black man nicknamed Iron Fist, whose combat prowess was in no way inferior to Bone Crusher's.","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang exchanged a glance and walked into the octagon one after the other, forming a standoff against Bone Crusher and Iron Fist.","Although their height and build were not as imposing as the two Western brutes opposite them, the fiery fighting spirit burning in their eyes made it clear they were not to be underestimated.","Inside the cage, Bone Crusher pounded his chest with his fists, letting out a beast-like roar. Come on! Let me crush your bones!","Iron Fist cracked his knuckles, producing a series of sharp pops, his face twisting into a ferocious sneer. Yellow monkeys, if you know what is good for you, surrender now, or you will get your teeth knocked out!","What kind of bird language are you babbling? Speak human! Yun Cheng said coldly.","Just then, the bookmaker began to shout loudly.","The odds are out! Team Rossi, odds are 1 to 1.2! Team Jesse, odds are 1 to 5! Any bets?","As soon as the words fell, almost everyone surged toward the bookmaker, frantically placing their bets on Team Rossi.","I bet five thousand on Team Rossi!","Ten thousand! Team Rossi is sure to win!","I bet those two Dragon Country brats will not even last three minutes.","Hahaha, this is basically giving away free money.","...","On one side were two experienced fighters and gang enforcers who held an absolute advantage in size.","On the other side were two relatively slender Eastern men.","No matter how you looked at it, this was going to be a completely one-sided massacre.","Only a sparse few placed bets on Team Jesse, mostly out of a gambler's mentality or simply because they were awed by Liu Yutong's aura and wanted to bet on an upset.","Jesse gritted his teeth and pulled out his checkbook. I bet one million dollars on us winning!","The entire crowd went into an uproar!","Hahaha! One million dollars? Jesse, do you think you are not going to lose ugly enough, so you want to give us money to spend?","Rossi slapped the railing of the VIP box, laughing so hard his thick beard trembled. With those two yellow monkey mercenaries of yours, forget about beating Bone Crusher and Iron Fist, whether they can even last a minute is a question. As for this million, I will just take it as a New Year's red envelope for me and my brother Miles.","Miles clamped down on his cigar and said, Jesse, if you want to give away money, just transfer it directly to my account. There is no need to go through all this trouble.","The surrounding gang members joined in the jeering, with whistles and roars of laughter rising and falling.","Is Jesse just giving up completely?","I think he has been bewitched by that Eastern woman and does not even treat money like money anymore!","Just wait and see. When his men get their bones broken, that million will be completely flushed down the drain!","Those two Dragon Country guys look scrawny as hell, how could they possibly beat Bone Crusher and Iron Fist? These 1 to 5 odds are already considered high; I bet even at 1 to 10 nobody would dare to bet on them.","Jesse's face flushed bright red. He clenched his fists, wanting to retort, but was stopped by Liu Yutong.","One million is indeed too little. Since it is a gamble, we should gamble properly.","She raised her hand, signaling Su Mansu behind her. Su Mansu immediately stepped forward, took out a checkbook and a fountain pen, and handed them to Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong took the pen and signed her name on the check.","I bet ten million dollars!","These few words exploded in the arena like a sudden artillery shell!","Everyone's eyes widened, looking at Liu Yutong in utter disbelief, thinking they had misheard.","Ten million dollars? She must be crazy!","You have to know, the lifetime income of an ordinary middle-class person in the beautiful country was only a few hundred thousand dollars. Ten million dollars was enough to buy several luxury mansions, or even equip a powerful mercenary force.","Even for established gangs like the Colaro family and the Hells Angels, coming up with so much cash all at once would be very difficult. The cash flow in their territories was indeed high, but that money did not go purely into their personal pockets.","If they were really asked to personally produce that much money, they absolutely could not do it, not even half of it.","Yet this Eastern girl casually bet ten million dollars. This could no longer be described as merely being rich; did her family own a money-printing machine? To dare throw cash around like this!","Jesse was also stunned. He only knew that his great-grandmother had formidable financial resources, but he never expected them to be this deep.","Ten million dollars! Just casually placed as a bet like that?","At the same time, he felt the pressure on his shoulders multiply; if they lost, the losses would be disastrous.","Great... Great-grandmother... Are we really going to play this big? Jesse wanted to advise her not to be impulsive.","Liu Yutong merely raised her hand slightly, signaling him to say no more. Then she looked at Rossi and Miles again. Ten million dollars, just a small bet for fun. Mr. Rossi, Mr. Miles, do not tell me you are scared? Or could it be that you cannot even scrape together this much cash?","Rossi's expression changed slightly. Stop bluffing here. Ten million dollars? Who knows if your check will bounce. Do not think you can intimidate people with a bad check!","He was indeed feeling a bit guilty, not out of a lack of confidence in his fighters, but out of fear of the what if.","What if they lost? They would have to pay out fifty million dollars. They could not possibly come up with that much money; even if they went bankrupt, they could not produce it.","Hearing this, Liu Yutong gave a look to Su Mansu beside her.","Su Mansu immediately took out a cell phone from her bag, quickly dialed a number, and spoke a few words in a fluent foreign language.","In less than a minute, she hung up the phone, nodded to Liu Yutong, and then addressed everyone in the arena. Gentlemen, my boss's bet has been confirmed by the Swiss Bank branch. The funds are instantly available for transfer, and the bookmaker can verify this at any time. If you are worried about the payout, we can also transfer the ten million dollars into a third-party escrow account right now.","Instant confirmation from a Swiss Bank, third-party escrow...","Now this is a true fucking tycoon!"]},{"number":680,"title":"Chapter 680: 680, Duo Cooperation","paragraphs":["After five seconds of dead silence, the entire venue completely erupted.","\"How much? Ten million dollars?\"","\"My God, is she crazy!\"","\"What's this woman's background, betting ten million dollars just like that?\"","\"Even the Corraro family couldn't scrape together that much cash on such short notice, right?\"","\"Where did Jesse find such a freak?\"","\"This Eastern woman is too daring! Is she that certain those two Dragon Country men can win?\"","\"...\"","Everyone looked at Liu Yutong, trying to find even the slightest hint of wavering on her calm face, but they found nothing.","It seemed she was truly confident.","Rossi and Miles were also shocked by this astonishing bet amount. After discussing in low voices, they immediately made a decision.","\"Ten million dollars, right? We'll take it!\"","\"Bone Crusher, Iron Fist, did you two hear that? That Dragon Country chick bet ten million dollars on you losing! Beat them to death! Shatter every single bone in those two yellow monkeys! I want to see them paralyzed in the cage like mud! If you win, you'll each get an extra five hundred thousand dollars!\"","Under the heavy reward, Bone Crusher and Iron Fist's eyes instantly turned red.","\"Don't worry, Boss Rossi, I'll smash their heads like watermelons!\"","\"I guarantee they'll leave here lying down!\"","As they spoke, they looked at Yun Cheng and Chu Yang, their eyes becoming even more brutal and greedy.","\"I'll tear you to pieces!\"","\"Dragon Country brats, get ready for the hospital—no, the morgue!\"","In the octagon cage, Yun Cheng and Chu Yang's expressions remained unchanged.","Chu Yang even grinned, revealing a mouthful of white teeth, and beckoned them with his finger: \"What are you jabbering about? Come on, let your grandpa teach you what real Dragon Country kung fu is!\"","With that, he began unbuttoning and took off his shirt, revealing an explosive, bronze-colored torso to the crowd. The muscles on his body weren't exaggeratedly bulky like those of Western musclemen; instead, they looked leaner and more fluid, as if forged through a thousand temperings.","After taking off his shirt, he casually tossed it out of the cage, where it was caught by a member of the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang.","Seeing Chu Yang strip, the corners of Yun Cheng's mouth twitched almost imperceptibly.","This guy still loves taking his clothes off every time he fights—just to show off his nice muscles, huh?","Complaints aside, he also silently raised his hands and began unbuttoning his suit shirt. Soon, an equally lean and strong upper body was revealed. His skin was much fairer than Chu Yang's, but his muscle lines were just as perfect, brimming with a sense of power.","After taking off his shirt, he neatly folded it before gently placing it by the edge of the cage.","The entire arena: \"...\"","Why did this synchronized stripping routine inexplicably give off an unspeakably weird vibe?","The two stood shirtless side by side in the cage, one dark and one pale, looking surprisingly harmonious.","Some of the female spectators in the audience subconsciously covered their mouths upon seeing this, their eyes growing brighter and brighter.","Eastern men are pretty great too!","\"Damn it, trying to look cool at death's door!\"","Bone Crusher roared wildly. Without waiting for the referee to announce the start, he charged fiercely toward the relatively smaller Yun Cheng, his massive fist carrying a howling wind as it smashed straight toward Chu Yang's face!","If this punch landed solid, a head would probably be deformed.","At the same time, Iron Fist also moved. His target was Chu Yang. These two clearly intended to handle one opponent each, with no thought of cooperating.","The battle erupted in an instant!","Facing Bone Crusher's incoming heavy punch, Yun Cheng didn't choose to take it head-on. Just as the fist was about to make contact, his body slid half a step backward and to the side at an incredible speed. Simultaneously, his left hand shot out, resting on Bone Crusher's thick wrist, and gave it a gentle pull downward to the side.","Deflecting a thousand pounds with four ounces of force!","Bone Crusher's punch, which had concentrated all his body's strength, was guided away by Yun Cheng. His center of gravity instantly shifted, and his punch hit nothing but air, making him feel so uncomfortable he wanted to vomit blood.","Before he could even react, Chu Yang decisively avoided engaging with Iron Fist. While Bone Crusher's center of gravity was off, Chu Yang rapidly closed in and viciously thrust his right elbow into the soft spot under Bone Crusher's ribs.","\"Crafty Dragon Country men! Despicable!\"","Bone Crusher hadn't expected this Dragon Country man to have no martial ethics, actually intentionally avoiding a fight to ambush him. It wasn't manly at all.","Bang!","Bone Crusher let out a muffled groan, feeling a burst of intense pain where he was struck; his bones felt as if they were about to split apart.","The explosive power of this Eastern kid was far more terrifying than he had imagined!","\"You're asking for death!\"","Bone Crusher roared in anger, directly abandoning his attack on Yun Cheng and lunging toward Chu Yang.","At the same time, Iron Fist was right in a flanking position and swung his fist toward Chu Yang as well.","\"Watch out!\"","Seeing this, Yun Cheng immediately rushed over, launching a flying kick at Bone Crusher's back.","Bone Crusher was forced to turn around and block. Chu Yang took the opportunity to roll away, dodging Iron Fist's attack, and arrived by Yun Cheng's side.","The two sides formed a standoff once again.","In this first exchange, Yun Cheng and Chu Yang held a slight upper hand, but they both knew it was only temporary. The opponents' ability to take hits was clearly stronger than theirs. If they fell into a drawn-out war of attrition, they would very likely be the ones to lose.","\"This can't go on; we have to end this quickly!\" Yun Cheng said to Chu Yang.","\"Killing someone in this place isn't illegal, right?\" Chu Yang suddenly asked.","\"It probably isn't.\" Yun Cheng was also a bit unsure.","\"Good! Then hold nothing back!\" Chu Yang nodded.","The two charged at their opponents again. This time, their coordination was noticeably more in sync.","Chu Yang struck first. His movements were elusive as he circled Bone Crusher. He didn't choose to clash head-on, but instead utilized the lethal killing techniques forged in the special forces to their utmost limit. Fists, elbows, knees, fingers—every move targeted Bone Crusher's vulnerable vitals: his throat, temples, the back of his neck, armpits, and joints!","His speed was incredibly fast, and his angles were tricky. Bone Crusher had nothing but brute strength and couldn't keep up with his speed. For a while, he could only awkwardly protect his vitals and defend passively, trying to drain Chu Yang's stamina.","Seeing this, a fierce glint flashed in Iron Fist's eyes.","Perhaps because he saw Bone Crusher successfully ambushed earlier, he wanted to repeat the trick. After trading a few hard punches with Yun Cheng, he suddenly feinted, spun around, and swung his fist toward the back of Chu Yang, who was currently tangled up with Bone Crusher!","Little did he know, this was exactly what Yun Cheng and Chu Yang wanted to see. Their earlier intentional ambush on Bone Crusher was just to give him a false impression.","In reality, their true target was never Bone Crusher at all.","\"Chu Yang!\"","Yun Cheng shouted loudly and suddenly accelerated. He didn't choose to split up from Chu Yang; instead, he quickly circled behind Bone Crusher and delivered a fierce knife-hand strike right to the weak spot on the back of his opponent's neck.","The unlucky Bone Crusher was already busy defending against Chu Yang's attacks. Upon glimpsing Iron Fist's sudden sneak attack on Chu Yang, before a look of joy could even appear on his face, he felt an intense burst of pain from the back of his neck. His vision went black, and he nearly collapsed.","Chu Yang was already prepared. Seeing Iron Fist attacking, he used his height advantage to lean back nearly ninety degrees, completely dodging the strike. He then lifted his foot and kicked Bone Crusher in the chest, sending him stumbling backward.","Yun Cheng followed up with a sweeping kick, bringing him down to the ground.","Then, the two of them continued to dodge Iron Fist's attacks while using their speed advantage to relentlessly assault Bone Crusher, who was lying on the floor!","Bastards! Fight me head-on if you have the guts!","Seeing his companion being ambushed and beaten by those two Dragon Kingdom brats, Iron Fist became even more certain that their plan was to team up and finish off Bone Crusher first before turning around to gang up on him.","Crafty Dragon Kingdom people indeed!","But he was not going to give these two Dragon Kingdom men the chance to surround him. With a furious roar, he charged at them madly once again!","Yun Cheng chose to intercept him directly from the side, and the two instantly became locked in a fierce close-quarters struggle.","Iron Fist's strength was truly astonishing. For a moment, Yun Cheng actually could not suppress him. He even took a heavy punch to the chest, forcing him to take two steps back as a trace of blood spilled from the corner of his mouth.","Brother Yun! Chu Yang roared. Feinting a move to shake off Bone Crusher on the ground, he turned and dashed toward Iron Fist.","Perhaps because the two of them had been exclusively targeting Bone Crusher, Iron Fist had slightly relaxed the guard behind his back.","Now was the time!","A cold light erupted in Chu Yang's eyes. He leaped up suddenly, clamped his legs around Iron Fist's neck, and exerted force backward. With a beautiful flying guillotine, he slammed Iron Fist to the ground.","Caught off guard, Iron Fist's massive body lost its balance from the sudden momentum. He crashed backward, his body hitting the ground heavily with a loud bang.","Yun Cheng did not even bother to rub his aching chest. Seizing this excellent opportunity, he also leaped into the air. Bending his right knee mid-flight, he smashed it down fiercely in a kneeling posture right onto Iron Fist's fragile neck.","Crack!","A blood-curdling scene unfolded.","Iron Fist's eyes instantly bulged out, completely bloodshot. A mouthful of blood spilled from the corner of his lips. His legs twitched and kicked a few times, and then... he gradually stopped moving entirely.","All the spectators, whether they were Rossi's or Miles's people, Jesse's subordinates, or even the neutral gang members, fell silent in an instant.","Iron Fist's miserable state, with his eyes nearly popping out of their sockets, was enough to give anyone nightmares just from a single glance!"]},{"number":681,"title":"Chapter 681: 681, Who Else","paragraphs":["When the audience finally snapped out of their daze, their mouths hung wide open in shock, as if they had just witnessed something utterly terrifying.","\"Holy... Holy shit!\"","\"Is he dead? Did Iron Fist's neck just get snapped? Oh... Jesus Christ!\"","\"God! What did I just watch? Did they really just off Iron Fist?\"","\"When that Dragon Country guy dropped his knee, I swear I heard a sound—the sound of a neck being crushed!\"","\"Seeing Iron Fist like that... I'm definitely going to have nightmares tonight.\"","\"I never expected these two Asian kids to be so ruthless and deadly!\"","\"Hey! This is what you call fucking professional! Did you guys catch that? These two Dragon Country guys are too smart. They set a trap for Iron Fist right from the start. They made it look like they were going after Bone Crusher, but they were actually catching Iron Fist off guard. And they hit so damn hard! Fucking incredible!\"","\"Where the hell did these two come from? Where did Jesse find such monstrous backup?\"","\"My money! It's all gone down the drain!\"","\"Boss Rossi is finished too. See that woman over by Jesse? She dropped ten million dollars without even blinking, and her subordinates kill without batting an eye. Boss Rossi really kicked a titanium steel plate this time. And Miles from the Hells Angels—look at him, his face has turned green!\"","\"I swear, I will never mess with anyone who looks like they're from a Dragon Country gang... especially the ones in black suits. They're terrifying. They look more like the Mafia than we do. No, even the Mafia isn't this brutal and cold-blooded.\"","\"..........\"","Jesse himself was so excited that he turned to Liu Yutong and said, \"Great-grandmother, Boss Yun Cheng and Boss Chu Yang are way too strong! This is amazing! I've heard the name Iron Fist before; he's the number one enforcer for the Hells Angels. I never thought he'd get taken out just like that...\"","\"From today on, I don't think anyone in the family will ever dare to question your strength again. The Colaro family will always be your most loyal partner!\"","With Iron Fist lying on the ground, his fate unknown, Bone Crusher was the only one left on the battlefield. There was no way he could defeat Yun Cheng and Chu Yang in a one-on-two fight. He had likely been scared out of his wits by his partner's tragic state. Couldn't they see that he was only holding a defensive stance, hesitating to launch an attack?","The trusted bodyguards standing behind Jesse, who had been a bit nervous earlier, now stood up straight, their faces showing a sense of shared pride.","When they looked again at the two shirtless Dragon Country men in the cage, who looked like gods of death, their eyes were filled with awe.","\"My God! Is this the true strength of the Dragon Country's Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate that Boss Jesse always talks about?\"","\"No wonder Boss Jesse is so respectful to the Great-grandmother. They are too strong!\"","\"...........\"","On the other side, Rossi and Miles both had faces as dark as the bottom of a pot.","Rossi, in particular, was filled with regret. He regretted agreeing to Miles's proposal. If this guy hadn't meddled and pushed for a two-on-two match, he definitely wouldn't have lost, nor would he have been caught off guard by those two hateful and despicable Dragon Country men in the ring.","But he still didn't want to give up because he couldn't afford to lose. Fifty million dollars! Of course, he wouldn't have to pay all of it himself, but even half of it was too much to bear!","No! He couldn't lose! He absolutely could not lose!","Thinking of this, Rossi suddenly roared at the ring below.","\"Bone Crusher, listen to me!\"","\"Look at your feet! Iron Fist is done for, but you are still standing! I order you to kill them right now! Kill these damn yellow monkeys! Now! Right now! Immediately!\"","\"If you win, I'll give you an extra million dollars! But if you lose, I guarantee that before the sun rises tomorrow, you, your sister in Oakland who lives on welfare, and her little bastard who just started elementary school, will all disappear from this world. They won't even find a single bone fragment!\"","\"Do you understand?! Get in there! Tear them apart! Otherwise, I'll tear you and your entire family apart!\"","Rossi was clearly seeing red at this moment, not even bothering to keep up appearances as he directly issued a death threat to his own fighter.","Roar!","Bone Crusher let out a roar that barely sounded human, his voice filled with anger and the madness of a man driven to a dead end.","\"Rossi, you're ruthless!\"","Although Bone Crusher was furious and desperately wanted to crush the scum Rossi for threatening his family, he had no choice now.","He snapped his head around, his bloodshot eyes locking onto Yun Cheng and Chu Yang.","\"It's all your fault! You forced my hand! I'm going to kill you!\"","Bone Crusher no longer held anything back. Ignoring his injuries, he charged wildly at the two Dragon Country men opposite him like a completely out-of-control war machine, adopting a suicidal stance.","This time, he completely abandoned his defense, opting only for desperate attacks, willing to trade blow for blow as long as he could beat these two guys.","\"Careful, he's going all out!\"","After Yun Cheng called out a warning, he immediately pulled back to create some distance. Chu Yang moved quickly as well, taking a few steps back. The two instantly formed a pincer formation.","As the two of them watched Bone Crusher charging at them like a mad bull, their expressions clearly grew solemn. If they weren't careful against this kind of suicidal fighting style, they could genuinely get hurt.","\"Come on! You piece of trash!\"","Yun Cheng roared as well, boosting his own momentum. The moment Bone Crusher's fist swung over, he once again used his skillful technique to deflect the force.","But this time, Bone Crusher was relying entirely on brute strength and body weight to ram into him. Yun Cheng's deflection was far less effective. He took a heavy hit to the shoulder, letting out a muffled groan as he was slammed into the iron cage.","Seeing this, Chu Yang instantly cut in from the flank, delivering a vicious thrust kick straight into the back of Bone Crusher's supporting knee.","Bone Crusher grunted in pain as his body tilted, but using the momentum of his fall, his massive left hand shot out like an iron pincer, grabbing fiercely at Chu Yang's calf.","Fortunately, Chu Yang reacted fast enough, but even so, his pant leg was ripped open with a loud tear.","The battle erupted fiercely once again!","Bone Crusher's attacks grew increasingly frantic and reckless.","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang kept dodging, looking for the perfect opportunity to land a decisive strike.","Watching this intense battle, the audience instinctively held their breath again, terrified of missing even a single second.","Rossi, his eyes equally red, roared once more, \"Kill them! Crush them to pieces!!!\"","Even Liu Yutong, who had remained exceptionally calm the entire time, felt a pang of worry upon seeing the situation in the cage. She prayed silently in her heart, \"You guys are the strongest! You'll definitely be fine!\"","Inside the octagon.","As time ticked by, this final showdown entered a white-hot phase.","Ultimately, Bone Crusher couldn't withstand the two-pronged assault. He took a flying kick to the chest from Yun Cheng and crashed to the ground.","This time, Chu Yang didn't give him a chance to get back up. He rushed over and stomped hard on his wrist. With a sickening crack, the bone snapped.","\"Ah! My hand!\" Bone Crusher was truly crushed this time.","He had just struggled to his feet when he saw the two men from the Dragon Kingdom raise their legs in almost perfect synchronization and deliver a vicious kick to his body.","Bang!!!","Bone Crusher was sent flying as if hit by a cannonball, smashing heavily against the iron fencing of the cage behind him and leaving a visible dent in the specially reinforced steel mesh.","Then, his massive frame slumped down and collapsed onto the floor.","The fight was over!","Inside the octagon, Bone Crusher and Iron Fist, who had been unbearably arrogant and seemingly invincible just moments ago, were now both down, their fates unknown.","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang had also taken some damage. Chu Yang had accidentally caught a swinging punch, leaving one of his eyes completely swollen. Yun Cheng seemed to be in better shape, but a trail of blood still hung from the corner of his mouth.","Though they looked a bit battered, in the eyes of the surrounding audience at this very moment, they stood like two gods of war who had just triumphed in a bloodbath!","Following that, Chu Yang took a deep breath, suddenly raised one fist high into the air, and roared at the entire arena.","\"Who! Else!!!\""]},{"number":682,"title":"Chapter 682: 682, The Black and White Pair","paragraphs":["Chu Yang's roar of \"Who else!\" exploded like thunder in everyone's ears!","In an instant, the entire venue plunged into a dead silence.","It was even quieter than when Liu Yutong had placed her ten-million-dollar bet!","All the gang members, whether from the Corraro family or the Hells Angels, seemed to have their necks gripped by an invisible hand, unable to utter a single sound.","Their wide eyes were filled with shock, horror, disbelief, and a trace of fear!","They won?","Those two Dragon Country men, who were at a clear physical disadvantage and looked down upon by almost everyone, had actually won?","And they did it in such a ruthless manner, finishing off the notoriously fierce Bone Crusher and Iron Fist!","Uproar!!!","After a brief moment of silence, the entire venue erupted!","\"My God! They actually did it!\"","\"That was brutal, and so freaking awesome!\"","\"Bone Crusher and Iron Fist were both ruthlessly taken out. Oh my god!\"","\"These two Dragon Country men are like Asuras crawling out of hell! Gods of death!\"","\"The odds were one to five. I bet five hundred dollars on Jesse's side. I'm rich! Hahaha!\"","\"I bet two thousand! One to five means ten thousand dollars! Hell yeah!\"","\"That Eastern girl bet ten million dollars! Multiplied by five... that's fifty million! Fifty million dollars!\"","\"If I had known, I would have bet on these two Dragon Country men too...\"","\"From today on, San Francisco's underground world will have to remember these two names...\"","\"..........\"","Amidst the chaotic chatter, a gang member who seemed to know a bit about Eastern culture suddenly stood up, looking at Yun Cheng and Chu Yang with fanatical zeal.","\"I recognize this kind of teamwork. I've seen it in the East before. This is authentic Dragon Country martial arts. These two aren't ordinary people; they are true Dragon Country martial artists!\"","\"Did you guys clearly see the symbol on their chests? That dragon. In the East, the dragon is a symbol of supreme power, so these two should be called... the Black and White Fiends!\"","\"Yes, yes, yes! The Black and White Fiends!\"","\"That nickname is too fitting!\"","\"From today on, everyone will remember this name, the Black and White Fiends!\"","\"...\"","Liu Yutong: ???","As one of the few who could fully understand the foreign language, the corners of her mouth could not help but twitch slightly upon hearing them forcibly bestow such a melodramatic nickname upon Yun Cheng and Chu Yang.","What the hell? The Black and White Fiends? What kind of nonsense was this!","On the other side, Rossi's face was as dark as it could be, even turning a bit purple.","He never expected that the fighters he had spent a fortune to hire would lose so completely!","And that wasn't even the worst part. The worst part was that he had suffered a massive loss this time!","With a fifty-million-dollar payout, even with Miles and other bettors sharing the burden, he would have to shell out at least ten million dollars himself!","Beside him, Miles's expression was equally ugly. Now, not only had they lost face big time, but they also had to throw in a huge sum of money.","What alarmed him even more was the cold, efficient, almost militaristic fighting style displayed by these two Easterners, as well as the terrifyingly calm Eastern woman behind them who could casually throw down a ten-million-dollar bet.","He truly hadn't expected that the Eastern nation, which prided itself on peace, also had such a powerful gang.","With Jesse having such strong reinforcements, Rossi was probably going to have a hard time today.","\"Trash! You're all useless trash!!\"","\"I spent so much money! So many resources! And this is how you repay me? Go to hell, all of you!!!\"","Blinded by rage, Rossi made a crazy move that left everyone in the venue utterly dumbfounded!","Just as several medics were hurriedly carrying Bone Crusher and Iron Fist out of the octagon...","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Several deafening gunshots suddenly rang out from the direction of the second floor.","Everyone looked up in terror, only to see Rossi with a ferocious expression, gripping a silver Desert Eagle pistol in his hand, its muzzle still smoking.","Several large, bloody holes instantly appeared in the chests of Bone Crusher and Iron Fist on their stretchers. Now, they were dead beyond any doubt.","The entire venue was dead silent. Everyone was stunned by Rossi's insane action.","Even Miles, the second-in-command of the Hells Angels, was startled and angrily rebuked, \"Rossi, you're crazy!\"","Rossi whipped his head around, his gun muzzle almost pointing at Miles's face. \"Going too far? My fighters lost, and I lost tens of millions of dollars! I might even lose the chance to compete for the head of the family, and you're telling me I'm going too far?!\"","\"If you hadn't suggested that two-on-two nonsense, would I have lost?\"","\"You should bear this loss!\"","\"What did you say?!\"","Miles's face darkened further. The Hells Angels members behind him immediately stepped forward, their hands resting on their waists.","The atmosphere instantly became explosive!","\"Rossi, what are you trying to do?!\"","Just then, a middle-aged man stood up and shouted for him to stop.","This man was none other than Antonio, one of the elders of the Corraro family and the most prestigious one at that.","\"Put the gun down!\"","Rossi gritted his teeth. \"Uncle Antonio, I...\"","\"I said, put the gun down!\"","Antonio said coldly, \"According to the rules, guns are forbidden today. Did you forget?!\"","\"By doing this, you are only bringing shame to the Corraro family. Everyone here is watching. Where are we supposed to hide our faces?\"","Under the icy glares of several elders, Rossi ultimately and very reluctantly handed the Desert Eagle over to someone else.","But he didn't forget to throw harsh words at Jesse: \"My dear nephew, don't think you're safe just because you won the first round. I won't give you another chance later!\"","Jesse showed no weakness. \"My dear uncle, I return those words right back to you. With my great-grandmother holding down the fort here, you are destined to have no chance of making a comeback!\"","Hearing this, Rossi looked at Liu Yutong again, his eyes like daggers fiercely stabbing toward the Eastern woman.","Liu Yutong acted as if she hadn't seen it, ignoring his gaze. Instead, she asked a subordinate in black beside her softly in the Dragon Country language, \"Did you record the footage of Rossi shooting just now?\"","The subordinate nodded. \"Eldest Miss, we have a full high-definition recording, including his roaring before firing and his expression afterward. The clarity is completely sufficient to serve as evidence.\"","Liu Yutong nodded.","With this recording, in case Rossi became desperate from losing and wanted to fight to the bitter end, they could completely pin the deaths of Iron Fist and Bone Crusher on him. After all, he really was the one who shot them dead.","Committing murder in public in the Beautiful Country was enough to lock Rossi up for decades.","This served as a disguised insurance policy for Yun Cheng and Chu Yang. After all, she wasn't sure if Iron Fist had actually died from Yun Cheng's strike. Now that Rossi had fired the finishing shots, it thoroughly cemented his identity as the murderer and spared Yun Cheng and the others from any potential legal risks.","It was worth noting that these kinds of boxing matches in the Beautiful Country weren't entirely legal either.","Therefore, not only was she not angry at Rossi's glare, but she even felt a bit like thanking him.","What a great guy!","After making sure the recording was rolling, she shifted her gaze toward Lan Die's position.","It felt as if the girl was born with a naturally low presence. Surprisingly, no one had noticed her standing right there in the shadow of a load-bearing pillar not far from Rossi.","This was just a precaution. After all, Rossi had actually been carrying a concealed gun. Although he had surrendered it for now, no one was willing to bet that he wasn't hiding a second or even a third weapon.","If that guy really proved to be a sore loser and tried to start a shootout, Lan Die could strike first and take down the ringleader!"]},{"number":683,"title":"Chapter 683: 683, Roller Hank","paragraphs":["Just then, the dealer responsible for settling tonight's bets ran over, sweating profusely. He approached Liu Yutong and asked respectfully.","\"Miss Liu, according to the 1 to 5 odds, the ten million dollars you bet should pay out fifty million dollars. But... but currently, the funds on the books, along with the winnings of other players, only total a little over twenty million dollars. What do you think... should we pay this portion to you first, or wait until Mr. Rossi and Mr. Miles gather the remaining payout and pay it all together?\"","Liu Yutong didn't hesitate at all: \"Give me the part I can get my hands on first, and for the rest, urge them to gather it quickly.\"","Naturally, she had to guard against the other party going back on their word. If they reneged on the debt and swallowed both the principal and interest, it would be a huge loss.","At least she could secure over ten million in profit for now.","\"Yes, yes, Miss Liu, I will handle it immediately!\" The dealer nodded and bowed repeatedly as he backed away.","Soon!","Su Mansu told Liu Yutong that ten million and two hundred thousand dollars had been credited to their card, and the check they had issued earlier had also been taken back.","On the other side.","Rossi and Miles looked grim as they urgently began to raise funds and make transfers.","The main reason they were still willing to fulfill the payout and didn't immediately tear up their agreement was that the competition wasn't over yet, and there was still a chance to turn the tables.","If there was no chance, they would most likely choose to resort to violence directly. After all, what credibility did gangs have?","After the first match ended, the gym staff quickly cleaned the blood in the octagon and rearranged the arena.","According to the agreement, the second match was a slap contest.","The rules were very simple: the contestants stood face to face, taking turns slapping each other in the face. They couldn't dodge, and they couldn't fight back. Whoever fell first or surrendered first lost.","This was a competition purely of strength and strike resistance, and the scene would be very brutal.","However, Rossi was full of confidence.","Because they couldn't dodge in this match, those two monkey-like guys from Dragon Country would be useless no matter how agile they were. In this kind of standing and taking a beating competition, Westerners naturally had an absolute advantage in terms of physique!","Thinking of this, Rossi smiled again: \"Jesse, this round, I will let you know what true brutality is!\"","After speaking, he clapped his hands.","\"Come out! Let these little friends from the East broaden their horizons!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the side door of the gym opened, and a figure slowly walked out.","When this person completely entered everyone's field of vision, the whole audience immediately exclaimed.","It was a behemoth nearly two meters tall and weighing at least one hundred and fifty kilograms!","His body was covered in rolls of fat, and his neck was so thick that his head looked like it was resting directly on his shoulders. He also had huge hands, thick as bear paws, giving off an invisible sense of oppression just by looking at them.","\"It's Steamroller Hank!\"","\"Oh my god, Rossi actually got him!\"","\"I heard that in a slap contest, he once slapped five opponents unconscious in a row, three of whom were slapped into concussions by a single strike!\"","\"Don't you see how big his hands are? With one slap, wouldn't a head be knocked flying?\"","\"Jesse's side is doomed. Although those two guys from Dragon Country can fight, their physiques are not on the same level as Hank's!\"","\"The Black and White Twin Demons are both injured, plus with their small builds, going up to slap faces is just throwing their lives away, right?\"","\"They'll probably have to surrender directly to save their lives...\"","\"...\"","Hank walked to the center of the arena, the shadow cast by his massive body almost covering half of the ring area.","After getting in the ring, he roared like a beast at Yun Cheng and Chu Yang: \"You Dragon Country boys, which one of you dares to fight me!\"","This deterrence was simply too strong!","Jesse couldn't help but look at Yun Cheng and Chu Yang in the ring.","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang's eyes were also full of solemnity.","Although they were good fighters, this kind of pure stationary slap contest tested absolute strength and strike resistance.","With Hank's physique, the force of a single slap could exceed three hundred kilograms. If they took it head-on with their builds, they might really get seriously injured.","However, when they remembered that their side still had a trump card, the solemn expressions on their faces gradually relaxed.","Seeing the intimidating effect of Hank's appearance, Rossi's confidence was mostly restored, and he once again provoked in the direction of Liu Yutong and Jesse.","\"Jesse, my good nephew, you got lucky in the first round. But this second round of slapping isn't about those flashy martial arts. Do you see my man? Steamroller Hank, he has a record of slapping opponents straight into the morgue!\"","\"With just these two Dragon Country boys you found, they definitely won't last two rounds. I bet Hank can make them see God with one slap!\"","As he spoke, he looked again at the Black and White Twin Demons in the ring.","Although these two won the first round, they consumed a lot of energy and had bruises on their faces and bodies. Facing a massive strength-type monster like Hank, they seemed to have no chance of winning at all.","The advantage is mine!","Just then, Liu Yutong suddenly spoke.","\"Mr. Rossi, since you are so confident, then I will bet another ten million dollars! Do you dare to match it?\"","Hiss!","Countless gasps sounded again!","The gang members who had just concluded that Jesse's side was bound to lose instantly turned their eyes to the mysterious Eastern woman on the second floor.","Another ten million?","How much money does she actually have? Could her family really run a money printing plant?","Oh, wait, she just won a huge sum... Never mind then!","Rossi's eyelids twitched. This trick again!","Is this Eastern woman crazy?","Or does she have absolute confidence in her subordinates?","Impossible! Absolutely impossible!","Hank is a monster he specially brought in from Nevada. No matter how good those two guys from Dragon Country are at fighting, they have absolutely no chance of winning in this kind of pure strength confrontation!","She must be bluffing!","Yes! Just bluffing!","Rossi looked at Miles beside him, who had almost fought with him earlier.","\"Hey, brother Miles, did you see that? That arrogant Eastern chick is giving us money again! A whole ten million! What we lost just now, this time we can win it back with interest. Hank's strength is very high, and those two Dragon Country boys are definitely no match! How about it, want to cooperate again? If we win, we split it fifty-fifty!\"","Miles, biting down on his freshly lit cigar, narrowed his eyes and looked at Hank, who was like a mountain of meat in the ring, and then looked at the two Black and White Twin Demons from Dragon Country, beginning to weigh his options.","The performance of the Black and White Twin Demons in the first round indeed exceeded most people's expectations, but a slap contest is completely different. You can't move, and there is no two-on-one situation.","Maybe it's really doable.","But he was still a bit uneasy and asked in a deep voice: \"Rossi, are you sure your man is fine? I can't afford to lose again.\"","\"Absolutely no problem!\" Rossi said confidently."]},{"number":684,"title":"Chapter 684: 684, Hell Giant","paragraphs":["\"Hank is a secret weapon I specifically brought in from Nevada. His hands could slap a brown bear unconscious! Those two Dragon Kingdom kids combined don't even weigh half as much as him. This is just giving away free money!\" Rossi bragged.","Miles stared at Rossi for a few seconds before finally nodding. \"Alright, Hells Angels, we'll call with another five million.\"","Rossi was overjoyed and immediately shouted at Liu Yutong and her group, \"Jesse, and you, rich little Eastern chick, we'll call! Fifteen million dollars!\"","The entire venue was in an uproar once again!","The stakes had skyrocketed to over twenty million dollars, a figure that exceeded the annual income of many gangs, enough to drive anyone mad.","Liu Yutong merely gave a slight nod, gesturing to Jesse beside her.","Jesse had completely bet his life, fortune, and future on Liu Yutong at this moment. With his great-grandmother backing him up, what did he have to fear?","He immediately shouted across the room, \"Since you're putting up fifteen million, I'll add another five million. A total bet of thirty million dollars, it's a deal!\"","\"Alright! You've got guts!\"","Rossi seemed to already see the gleaming stacks of dollar bills waving at him. As long as he won this round, he could at least make back half of the money he had lost earlier.","\"So, Jesse, hurry up and have the Black and White Demons pick someone to go up! I can't wait to see Hank teach them that in the face of absolute power, all struggles are futile!\"","\"Hahahaha...\"","The gang members below the stage also started jeering.","\"Hurry up! Let's see if the Black and White Demons can withstand a single slap from Hank.\"","\"Don't tell me they've chickened out? They were so good at fighting just now, but they can't handle a real tough guy?\"","\"Haha, they probably went weak in the knees just seeing Hank's hands!\"","\"Stop dawdling, get on with it!\"","\"...\"","However, Yun Cheng and Chu Yang's actions caught everyone by surprise.","Under everyone's watchful eyes, Yun Cheng and Chu Yang actually walked off the ring without any hesitation.","The gang members in the boxing gym were all dumbfounded.","\"Huh?\"","\"Why are they coming down?\"","\"Not fighting?\"","\"Are they really scared?\"","\"Holy crap! No way, right? The Black and White Demons fleeing before the battle?\"","\"Hahaha... They're definitely scared of Hank the Steamroller!\"","\"Looks like the title of Steamroller is more intimidating than the Black and White Demons!\"","\"Jesse is dumbfounded this time. The money is bet, and his guys ran away.\"","\"Hahaha...\"","\"...\"","Seeing this, Rossi laughed even more triumphantly. \"Look! Look at the experts you brought in. Is this the courage of you Dragon Kingdom people? Tucking your tails and running when you see a true powerhouse? Jesse, and that little Eastern chick, if you surrender now, maybe I can still leave you some dignity, hahaha...\"","Jesse looked at Yun Cheng and Chu Yang walking back. Although he knew his great-grandmother definitely had a plan, he couldn't help but feel a bit nervous.","Were they really scared? Was Great-Grandma just trying to scare them off with a high-stakes bet?","Liu Yutong ignored them, instead asking Yun Cheng and Chu Yang with a bit of heartache, \"Are you guys okay? Are you badly hurt?\"","Yun Cheng and Chu Yang shook their heads simultaneously. \"Eldest Miss, we're fine.\"","Liu Yutong was still worried and said to Su Mansu, \"Get a few good doctors over here.\"","She knew these two guys didn't want to go to the hospital because they wanted to watch the upcoming match, so she would just have some doctors come over to examine and bandage them up.","Su Mansu: \"Yes, Boss!\"","A wave of warmth welled up in Yun Cheng and Chu Yang's hearts. The Eldest Miss still cared about them so much, asking about their injuries first thing and finding them doctors... They would gladly die for her!","After briefly settling the two of them, Liu Yutong then turned her head to look at the tall figure in the ring.","Her red lips parted slightly.","\"For this round, we're swapping fighters.\"","As soon as she said this, the entire venue was stunned.","Swapping fighters?","Who else could they swap in?","Do you still have someone under you who can fight Hank the Steamroller?","Stop joking!","Although the men in black under your command look tough, they might not be as strong as the Black and White Demons. Wouldn't calling them up just be serving them on a silver platter?","Could there be someone else?","Just as everyone was confused and making guesses.","Liu Yutong slowly called out a name: \"Ji Yu! Come out!\"","This shout, for some reason, suddenly gave people a strange feeling. It didn't sound like she was calling a person's name, but rather like she was casting a spell, using an incantation to awaken a slumbering ancient behemoth.","Speak of the devil.","Suddenly!","Bang!!!","The main doors of the boxing gym let out a loud bang and burst wide open, startling the crowd into a shudder.","When they clearly saw the figure that appeared behind the doors, all sounds instantly vanished, leaving only extreme shock in their eyes!","That was a human they had never seen before! An exceptionally gigantic human!","As this human bent down to walk into the boxing gym, everyone immediately felt that the word \"giant\" had materialized.","This tall man with Eastern features was clearly over two meters and ten centimeters tall; he could even grab the second-floor railing just by reaching out his hand.","The only time they had seen a man this tall before was on a basketball court, and that giant was also a Dragon Kingdom native.","This wasn't even the most shocking part.","When this giant began to unbutton his oversized black suit and shirt, just like Yun Cheng and Chu Yang had done earlier, a scalp-numbing sense of oppression immediately rushed over them.","A massive body, seemingly forged from steel, was revealed before everyone's eyes.","It wasn't that slightly bloated, fat build like Hank's.","This was pure to the extreme, unbelievably formidable muscle!","His inverted-triangle torso was so broad it almost felt unreal, like a thick, heavy city wall. His two massive pectoral muscles bulged high like twin giant shields, sharply defined. His abdominal muscles were like orderly arranged iron plates. Most notably, his two heavily muscled arms were even thicker than a normal adult man's thighs!","He merely stood there quietly. He didn't need to roar or strike any exaggerated poses. Just by displaying his body, he could define exaggerated terms like \"absolute power\" and \"human tank\"!","In front of him, Hank the Steamroller, who had just been acting so majestic and looked like a mountain of flesh, suddenly appeared petite.","Hank swore that this was the first time in his life he had to crane his neck so far back in the ring just to clearly see his opponent's face.","Beyond that, a sense of fear stemming from biological instinct toward a being more powerful than himself surfaced in his heart...","In the boxing gym, a deathly silence lasted for a full four or five seconds.","Then, those gang spectators could no longer suppress their emotions and began to exclaim in shock once again!","\"Holy mother of god!\"","\"God! What am I looking at? Is that even human?!\"","\"A giant! It's a fucking Eastern giant!\"","\"After the Black and White Demons, now there's a giant from hell?\"","\"These muscles, this physique, am I sure I'm not dreaming? Am I not dreaming up a giant scene from a movie?\"","\"Hank doesn't seem that big in front of him anymore, does he?\"","\"Yeah! Look at those arms, those hands. Hank's bear paws actually look like toys compared to his!\"","\"Where on earth did Jesse find these monsters? Each one is more terrifying than the last!\"","\"How the hell is this even a match!\"","\"Rossi is finished!\"","\"...\"","As it turns out, smiles do not just vanish into thin air; they merely transfer from one person's face to another's in an instant.","The wild, arrogant laughter that had just been on Rossi's face gradually shifted onto Jesse's with the appearance of this Eastern giant.","\"Hahaha! Look closely, Uncle! This is Great-grandmother's trump card, the Hell Giant! Let's see if you can handle this!\"","Hearing the roaring laughter of his nephew, Jesse, Rossi did not even have the mood to talk back. He just stared gloomily at the Eastern giant, comforting himself with the thought that the opponent was merely large in size. Perhaps he was all bark and no bite, only good for scaring people.","He was completely backed into a corner now. If he lost this round too, not only would he be unable to cover the losses, but he wouldn't even be able to pay off his debts if he sold himself on the streets.","Most importantly, his nephew Jesse probably would not give him another chance to turn things around. What awaited him was a thorough purge within the family.","He could only pin his last shred of hope on Hank.","\"Hank! Go all out! This big guy just looks intimidating! He has no match experience, and his technique and stamina definitely cannot compare to yours! Take him down! You are the strongest!\"","Hearing his boss's shouts from the stage, Hank finally snapped out of the massive psychological shock brought on by Ji Yu, and nodded toward the second floor.","Ji Yu turned slightly toward where Liu Yutong was standing, bowed his head slightly, and called out, \"Miss!\"","Liu Yutong immediately gave him his orders: \"Ji Yu, end the fight as quickly as possible, but no killing.\"","She wanted to end the fight quickly because she did not want to see Ji Yu get hurt, and no killing was to avoid any risks.","Hearing this, a look of confusion appeared on Ji Yu's face.","The Miss said to finish it quickly on one hand, but not to kill on the other. Did that not feel a bit contradictory?","Would ending it quickly not mean going all out? But if he could not kill, he could not use his full strength...","He scratched his large head with his hand and started using the multiplication table to calculate the right amount of force.","\"One times one is one, one times two is two... three times nine is twenty-eight...\"","Seeing this, Yun Cheng shouted, \"Ji Yu, the Miss means you just need to beat him until he sees his great-grandmother! But you cannot actually send him to the afterlife to accompany his great-grandmother, understand?\"","Ji Yu's eyes lit up, an expression of sudden realization appearing on his face. He nodded his big head vigorously and said, \"Okay, Brother Yun! I understand!\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","Seriously, was her explanation just now really that complicated?"]},{"number":685,"title":"Chapter 685: 685, The Slap of the Hell Giant","paragraphs":["Thump!","Thump!","Thump!","Ji Yu strode toward the ring. With every step he took, a loud noise echoed, giving the illusion that the floor could barely withstand his weight.","When he stepped into the ring and stood opposite Hank, the scene suddenly became highly visually impactful, even carrying a hint of absurdity.","Hank was already massive, but standing in front of Ji Yu, he was completely outmatched. Especially Ji Yu's terrifyingly muscular physique—compared to Hank's fat body, the sense of oppression was countless times stronger.","The referee caught between these two giants looked up, swallowed hard, and announced with difficulty.","\"The... second round, the slap competition begins!\"","Subsequently, Hank and Ji Yu used an internationally recognized method—rock-paper-scissors—to decide who would slap first.","Hank won and got the first strike.","The guy held nothing back. With a roar, he swung the right arm that had knocked out countless opponents and slapped fiercely at Ji Yu's left cheek!","Smack!","An extremely loud slapping sound rang out.","Ji Yu's head was slapped slightly to the right at a very small angle.","And then...","There was no then.","Under the gaze of all the audience, Ji Yu slowly turned his head back to face Hank. On his chiseled face, aside from his left cheek being slightly red from the slap, there was no swelling and no bleeding. He looked almost completely fine.","He even blinked and said to Hank in a muffled voice, \"You're a little stronger than my mom.\"","Hank: \"???\"","He didn't understand what the other party said.","But that was no longer important. What was important was that he found his full-strength strike hadn't even broken the opponent's defense?","The opponent's face was as hard as if it were made of a special alloy. It was absurd!","Ji Yu blinked at Hank again and said, \"My turn.\"","Saying that, he slowly raised his right hand.","On the second floor.","Seeing this scene, Chu Yang covered his swollen half-face and pointed at Ji Yu below, saying to Yun Cheng, \"Brother Yun, listen to this. Is Ji Yu even speaking human language? I got punched by that guy earlier and swelled up like a pig's head. But look at him, taking such a heavy slap solidly and acting like nothing happened.\"","\"Comparing oneself to others will only make you mad!\"","Yun Cheng glanced at him sideways. \"Why are you comparing yourself to Ji Yu? He can barely be considered human anymore. Just relax.\"","Chu Yang nodded in deep agreement and sighed, \"You're right, I can't compare with this guy. I really wonder what he ate to grow this big. With this size and strike resistance, it's not something a carbon-based lifeform should have. I reckon the only thing left that can subdue him is heavy artillery.\"","\"Brother Yun, do you think when Ji Yu slaps him later, that Roadroller will spin right up into the sky and out of the arena? The Young Lady specifically ordered not to kill anyone. Ji Yu really has to hold back. If he loses control, he might actually send him to meet his maker.\"","Yun Cheng: \"Don't worry. Ji Yu might not be great in other aspects, but his execution is strong. He'll hold back.\"","While the two were whispering their complaints, the audience below couldn't help but exclaim as well upon seeing this.","\"My God! Hank's full-strength slap, and this guy's face didn't even turn red?\"","\"What is this eastern giant made of? Steel?\"","\"His skin must be bulletproof! It's so thick!\"","\"This is the Hell Giant!\"","\"...\"","Meanwhile.","Seeing that Ji Yu was fine after taking the slap, Liu Yutong breathed a slight sigh of relief. Even though she had great confidence in Ji Yu's strength, she still didn't want to see him get hurt.","To be precise, she didn't want to see anyone from the Ten Thousand Dragons Association get hurt.","After confirming Ji Yu was indeed fine, Liu Yutong said directly to Jesse, \"Go contact the local police chief. Tell him that you bet ten million dollars in a slap competition under his name.\"","Hearing this, Jesse froze for a moment. \"Great-grandmother, didn't you place that bet?\"","Liu Yutong: \"Just do as I say. Oh, and arrange for this slap competition to be notarized or something to ensure the match is legal.\"","With things spelled out to this extent, even if Jesse was stupid, he understood what she wanted to do. He nodded immediately. \"Yes, Great-grandmother! I'll get it done right away!\"","The United States already had these kinds of competitions, so applying for it wouldn't be difficult, especially when the local police chief had placed a bet.","Of course, after winning the match, the chief wouldn't get the principal amount; he would only get the winnings.","As for whether the losing side could afford to pay, that wasn't her business.","Whoever the creditor is can go collect it themselves.","Anyway, in the first round, she had successively gained tens of millions of dollars, almost emptying the pockets of Rossi and that Miles, even leaving them deep in debt.","This was the consequence of overconfidence. They thought they would definitely win the second round and recoup their losses, but little did they know the second match would be their true nightmare!","As for why she had Jesse do this.","It was simple. First, it would help Jesse build some special connections in the future. Second, it was inappropriate for her as a foreigner. Third and most importantly, she was a law-abiding citizen, even when abroad.","In short, Jesse did all this; it had nothing to do with her. She never thought of bribing anyone.","As for the Bai family donating money, that was completely aboveboard and not a violation of the rules.","After Jesse left, Liu Yutong gave instructions to Su Mansu, \"Right now, immediately use our identity as special investigation consultants to contact the San Francisco Police Department. Report to them that while legally investigating relevant clues, we accidentally discovered and locked onto a major suspect involved in the case who is responsible for murder, and have them send people over immediately to make an arrest.\"","As a law-abiding businesswoman, even overseas, she had to be good at utilizing local laws and judicial forces to punish vicious criminals.","Su Mansu understood implicitly and immediately nodded. \"Yes, boss! I'll do it right away!\"","...............","After arranging everything, Liu Yutong turned her head to look at the stage.","At this moment, when the audience saw this Hell Giant from the East raise his hand, they instinctively held their breath.","Roadroller Hank also took a deep breath, gripping the table in front of him tightly with both hands, his whole body's muscles tense, ready to take the slap.","Although he was indeed a bit afraid of this eastern giant in his heart, he still had confidence in his strike resistance. After all, he had participated in many slap competitions and had rich experience in taking hits.","Under the gaze of countless eyes, Ji Yu's right arm reached its highest point, and then swung down with terrifying kinetic energy!","Whoosh!","The wind from the palm even created the sound of rushing air.","Hank widened his eyes, watching the giant palm getting closer and closer. The fear in his heart instantly skyrocketed, making him almost unable to breathe!","The next second.","Bang!!!!","A loud noise, much like a tire suddenly exploding, violently erupted inside the octagon!","Under the horrified gazes of everyone present, the previously unshakable Hank the Steamroller had his head violently snap to the side at a grotesque angle. The heavy flesh on his face rippled violently like waves, and his eyes instantly rolled back into his head. Even the mouthguard clenched between his teeth shattered to pieces, flying out along with several of his teeth.","At the same time, his massive, heavy frame lifted off the ground. He flew sideways through the air as if he had just been hit by a heavy truck.","Thud!","Hank's enormous body slammed heavily onto the ground. Without even letting out a scream, he passed out cold, lying completely motionless.","Half of his face was already a bloody, mangled mess, completely unrecognizable from how he looked just moments ago.","The entire gym instantly fell dead silent.","One slap!","Just a single slap!","And Hank, a professional slap-fighting competitor nicknamed the Steamroller, was knocked out cold and left completely disfigured right on the spot!","What kind of monstrous strength was this?","Was he... even human?"]},{"number":686,"title":"Chapter 686: 686, Completely Insane","paragraphs":["Just as everyone was still immersed in the shock brought by that earth-shattering slap, Ji Yu made a new move in the ring.","Like a moving hill, he strode toward Hank, who was slumped at the edge of the ring, his fate unknown.","This sudden action scared the referee half to death; he thought the Hell Giant was going to take the opportunity to finish him off.","Yet, he didn't dare to make any move to stop him.","However, Ji Yu did not make any aggressive moves. He stopped beside Hank, bent his massive body, and poked the other man with a finger, as if confirming something.","Seeing that the other party still didn't move, he couldn't help but look down at the large hand that had just delivered the slap, carefully examining his palm.","Then, he raised his head, looked toward the second floor where Liu Yutong was, and scratched his head with an honest and simple-minded expression.","\"Miss, it looks like he's seeing his great-grandmother. Maybe she wanted to have a chat with him, and it's taking a bit long...\"","Liu Yutong: \"...\"","Yun Cheng: \"...\"","Chu Yang: \"...\"","Yun Cheng silently turned his head away, the corner of his mouth twitching wildly. This guy... was just too much.","Chu Yang looked down at Ji Yu, who looked incredibly intimidating yet inexplicably goofy, and couldn't help but quip, \"Well, if anyone ever says Ji Yu is just dumb again, I'll be the first to fight them! This bro clearly put all his damn talent points into strength and defense!\"","While the two of them bantered back and forth, the audience below finally recovered from the absolute shock of that slap.","\"Hank must weigh at least a hundred and fifty, maybe even two hundred kilograms, right? And he just got slapped flying like that? How much force was that?\"","\"At least five hundred pounds! No, eight hundred! Maybe even more!\"","\"The Hell Giant is terrifying! From now on, anyone who dares to mess with this group of Dragon Country people will have to think about the Hell Giant's slap!\"","\"What is the background of this Eastern woman? First the Black and White Twin Demons, and now the Hell Giant. Are all Dragon Country people this ferocious? It feels so surreal!\"","\"I heard this group of Dragon Country people belongs to an extremely powerful major gang over there. It's normal for them to be a bit fierce.\"","\"That Dragon Country woman is absolutely the gang queen of Dragon Country!\"","\"Rossi lost both rounds. He's totally finished now!\"","\"...\"","On the second floor, several elders of the Corraro family looked at each other, their eyes full of shock.","Antonio's hand holding his wine glass trembled slightly, not even noticing the spilled wine. He looked at another elder beside him and asked, \"Carl, have you ever seen a human like this?\"","Carl Corraro, an early professional boxer in the family, also shook his head with a solemn expression at this moment: \"I've boxed for nearly twenty years. The tallest and strongest guy I've ever seen was a Russian giant named Vasily, who was two meters and nine centimeters tall. But compared to the Hell Giant down there, he falls short. Especially the Hell Giant's muscle density and explosive power—it's just too strong!\"","\"For such a terrifying giant to appear among Easterners is extremely rare, perhaps even unheard of.\"","\"It seems we can't underestimate Easterners anymore, especially those from Dragon Country.\"","Antonio looked in the direction of Liu Yutong. \"This Eastern girl and these subordinates of hers are not ordinary gang members. I heard Jesse say they are called the Myriad Dragon Society. I'm really curious now about how strong the overall strength of the Myriad Dragon Society actually is, and whether they can compare to our Mafia.\"","\"They probably can't compare. You have to remember that our family is just a branch of the Mafia.\"","\"Regardless, Jesse has good luck to have found such a powerful backer.\"","\"Then Rossi...\" Carl hesitated to speak.","Antonio sneered, \"He chose this himself. If he had admitted defeat earlier, he might have been able to make a graceful exit. But now, he has no chance.\"","Everyone followed his gaze to the VIP box where Rossi was.","At this moment, Rossi Corraro's entire face had twisted and contorted to the extreme.","\"Impossible! How could Hank lose? How could he possibly lose!\"","He turned abruptly and looked at Miles beside him, whose expression was equally gloomy. \"Miles, did you see that? This Dragon Country monster must have used some cheating methods! This match is unfair!\"","Miles was also feeling frustrated and distracted at this moment.","He was originally invited by Rossi to support him. If Rossi could successfully win the match, the Hells Angels Motorcycle Club would be able to sign an alliance agreement with the Corraro family, which represented the Mafia in San Francisco.","Instead, they stumbled twice in a row at the hands of an Eastern girl.","Not only did they not gain a single benefit, but they also lost Iron Fist, a capable fighter, as well as a large sum of money in vain. It was an absolute disaster!","But compared to Rossi, who was about to go crazy, Miles still retained the last trace of a gang boss's calmness.","\"Rossi, calm down. A loss is a loss. So many people here watched it happen, and you set the rules yourselves. What's the point of saying all this now?\"","\"Calm down? How do you expect me to calm down?\"","Rossi suddenly flew into a rage, grabbing Miles by the collar and saying hysterically, \"Do you know what losing this round means for me? It's thirty million dollars in total! I couldn't pay it off even if I went completely bankrupt! And there's the control of the family. Now that Jesse has such strong outside help, will he leave me any way out in the future? I'll be crushed under his foot like a stink bug!\"","Miles's face darkened. \"Let go! Rossi, this is your own problem!\"","\"Trying to pass the buck, huh?\"","Rossi suddenly let out a sinister laugh. \"Miles, don't forget, you were the one who suggested the two-on-two in the first place. Now that we've lost, you want to wash your hands of it?\"","Miles frowned. \"What do you want?\"","A flash of madness crossed Rossi's eyes. \"It's very simple. We must get back all the money we lost. Let's join forces and take them out right now!\"","Hearing this, Miles furrowed his brows even tighter. A trace of impatience and regret flashed through his eyes—regret that he shouldn't have easily trusted Rossi's nonsense and gotten involved in this family feud.","He looked at the only two remaining subordinates behind him, then looked at the surrounding situation, realizing that he was at an absolute disadvantage here.","Aside from those neutral gang members, Jesse and Rossi, these two guys from the Corraro family, had each brought dozens of lackeys.","Not to mention that Dragon Country girl, who had also brought twenty men in black. The strength of three of them was obvious to everyone present—they were absolutely terrifying. The other men in black probably weren't weak either.","Gang-on-gang violence and reneging on debts leading to shootouts were common occurrences, but that also depended on the timing and strength.","Now was clearly not the time for a head-on clash.","So no matter how much his heart ached for the money, he could only endure it for now.","It really wasn't that he was being a coward. It was just that he had only brought three lackeys with him this time; one had even been finished off by Rossi, leaving him with only two now.","The reason he brought so few people was entirely because he trusted Rossi too much. He never expected the result to be getting completely crushed by some great-grandmother brought in by Rossi's nephew, Jesse!","If a shootout started now, wouldn't he just be courting death?","If they were going to have a shootout, he should at least wait until he brought his own men, right?","Having figured out his situation, Miles rejected Rossi's proposal without hesitation: \"This bet was an internal affair of your Corraro family from the very beginning. It has nothing to do with me.\"","\"You were too greedy and insisted on betting against that Dragon Country woman. Now that you've lost, you want to drag me down with you? In your dreams!\"","\"If you want to make a move, do it after I leave. Anyway, I won't be keeping you company.\"","Seeing that this guy was backing out, Rossi's eyes grew redder and redder. \"Good, very good... In that case, nobody is going to have it easy!\"","Before his voice died away, Rossi suddenly pulled out another black handgun from the small of his back. Clearly, he had hidden more than one gun today.","Bang!","A gunshot rang out!","Miles lowered his head in astonishment, staring at the bloody hole that had appeared in his chest. He looked up at Rossi in disbelief. \"You... how dare you...\"","Bang! Bang!","Two more shots!","Miles crashed to the floor, landing heavily. His eyes were wide open, staring blankly in death.","A deathly silence fell over the entire room!","Everyone was stunned.","Rossi... actually killed Miles?","The second-in-command of the Hells Angels motorcycle gang was gunned down in public just like that?","\"Boss!\" The two Hells Angels members reacted, roaring as they prepared to fight back.","But Rossi was faster. He turned his muzzle and fired several shots at the two Hells Angels members.","The two men jolted before collapsing into a pool of blood, dead.","In the blink of an eye, he had killed three people in a row!","Rossi Corraro, this red-eyed losing gambler, this family traitor pushed to the brink, had gone completely mad!"]},{"number":687,"title":"Chapter 687: 687, So Ruthless (Two-in-One)","paragraphs":["\"Rossi killed Miles!\"","\"Rossi is crazy! He actually killed the second-in-command of the Hells Angels!\"","\"...\"","With the sudden gunshot, the crowd instantly fell into a panic.","Rossi fired several more shots at the ceiling and loudly warned everyone, \"Nobody move! This is between me, Jesse, and that Dragon Country woman. Anyone who dares to move, I'll kill them!\"","At the same time, his subordinates quickly sprang into action. Some armed men guarded the various entrances and exits of the boxing gym, while others scattered, aiming their guns at anyone who dared to make a move.","The faces of the several elders of the Collaro family turned green, especially Antonio, who was trembling with anger.","They never expected Rossi to be so insane. Not only did he publicly shoot the second-in-command of the Hells Angels, but he even dared to threaten everyone present with a gun, including other members of the family.","Today, regardless of whether they could ultimately deal with Rossi, this matter would not end easily.","The Collaro family and the Hells Angels motorcycle gang would inevitably have a fierce battle sooner or later!","After controlling the scene, Rossi pointed his gun at Liu Yutong and Jesse downstairs.","\"Jesse! And you, you Dragon Country bitch! You thought you could take everything just by winning the match? Keep dreaming!\"","\"Listen up, everyone! Jesse and that Dragon Country woman cheated. They used banned substances. That big guy must have injected stimulants!\"","\"There is only one true winner, and that is me!\"","\"Rossi! Are you out of your mind!\"","Antonio, the most prestigious elder of the Collaro family, stood up again and shouted sternly, \"Put the gun down! Do you know what you've done? You killed the second-in-command of the Hells Angels. You are dragging the entire Collaro family into a war!\"","Hearing this, Rossi laughed maniacally. \"Uncle Antonio, do you think I still care about that now? If I lose, I have nothing! To hell with the family, to hell with the war! I just want to win now!\"","\"Jesse! And you, pretty little girl from Dragon Country! Hand over all your money right now, or I'll shoot you full of holes!\"","Although Jesse was afraid of dying, at the critical moment, he resolutely stood in front of Liu Yutong to shield her from bullets. At the same time, he shouted at Rossi, \"Uncle Rossi, calm down! It's not too late to stop now! As long as you put down the gun, I promise you as the head of the Collaro family that I won't hold you accountable for today, and I can even give you a sum of money to leave...\"","\"Hahaha... Not hold me accountable? Give me a sum of money?\"","Rossi acted as if he had heard the funniest joke in the world. \"My dear nephew, at a time like this, you're actually still acting with me? Still trying to numb me with this nonsense? You'd better think carefully about what posture you should use to kneel down and beg me later, so that I might show mercy and spare your life!\"","As he spoke, the murderous intent in his eyes surged. His finger slowly pulled the trigger, preparing to reward Jesse's thigh with a bullet first.","Of course, he wouldn't kill Jesse for the time being, because the money wasn't in his hands yet.","\"Mr. Rossi.\"","Liu Yutong suddenly pushed Jesse aside and said, \"Do you know there is an idiom in Dragon Country called 'a cornered dog will jump over a wall'?\"","\"It means that a dog driven to a dead end will jump over a wall to escape, but more often than not, they will choose to bite people recklessly.\"","\"And you are that mad dog right now!\"","\"You think you can turn the tables by killing Miles and holding the whole place hostage? You think violence can solve everything? You are taking things too much for granted!\"","\"Shut up! You damn Dragon Country bitch!!\"","Rossi was completely enraged. He abruptly raised the muzzle of his gun, aiming directly at the center of Liu Yutong's forehead, and roared, \"Believe it or not, I'll blow your head off right now! I'll make you shut that mouth forever!\"","Facing Rossi's death threat, Liu Yutong still showed no fear. \"You can try.\"","She held up two fingers. \"But I want to remind you of two things.\"","\"First, there aren't many bullets left in that pistol of yours, are there? How many shots did you just fire at the ceiling? How many rounds did you use to shoot Miles and the others? Are the remaining bullets enough for you to kill everyone here?\"","\"Second, guess whether you'll die first when you fire at me?\"","\"What do you mean?\"","Rossi's body stiffened abruptly, and he whipped his head around.","Right at the moment he turned his head!","Swish!","A dark figure darted out from the shadows like lightning!","It was Lan Die!","Like a real butterfly, she arrived silently behind Rossi, holding a dagger against his carotid artery.","\"Don't move.\" Lan Die's voice was very soft, but it made Rossi feel as if he had plunged into an ice cave.","He didn't dare to move, he really didn't dare.","He could feel the chill of the blade piercing his skin. As long as he moved even a little, or even breathed a bit heavily, that sharp blade would slit his throat without hesitation.","Everyone was stunned by this sudden reversal.","Rossi, who was just arrogantly invincible and in control of life and death, turned into meat on someone else's chopping block in the blink of an eye, his life and death resting solely on another's whim.","That strange Eastern girl who suddenly appeared, when did she sneak up beside Rossi? Why didn't anyone notice?","\"Is... is she a ninja?\"","\"Idiot! Ninjas are from Japan. This must be a legendary assassin from Dragon Country! I've heard that some ancient or powerful gangs in Dragon Country specially train these top-tier assassins who come and go without a trace, tasked with carrying out the most dangerous assassinations!\"","\"To even have assassins, this Ten Thousand Dragons Gang... is definitely one of the top and most terrifying gang forces over in Dragon Country!\"","\"Yeah! They have the Black and White Twin Demons, the Hell Giant, and the Shadow Assassin. Every single one of them is a monster!\"","\"Rossi has really kicked an iron plate this time!\"","\"...\"","Just as the situation was somewhat at a stalemate, the piercing sound of police sirens suddenly came from outside the boxing gym!","Wee-woo! Wee-woo!","A large number of police cars roared in, followed by riot-control vehicles and SWAT assault vehicles, instantly surrounding the entire boxing gym.","\"Listen up, people inside! This is the San Francisco Police Department. You are surrounded! Drop all your weapons immediately, put your hands on your heads, and walk out slowly! Repeat, drop your weapons immediately, put your hands on your heads, and walk out slowly!\"","The shouting from the megaphone immediately echoed into the boxing gym, causing an instant commotion among the crowd.","\"Police? Why are the police here?\"","\"Quick, hide the guns!\"","\"...\"","Hearing this voice, Rossi's eyes instantly lit up. It was actually an acquaintance.","Instantly, his confidence returned. He immediately strained his voice and shouted toward the door, \"Bob! Officer Bob! It's me, Rossi Collaro. Come in and save me! There are people committing armed assault here. They killed Miles and want to kill me too!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the doors of the boxing gym were... well, the doors were already gone.","A slightly chubby middle-aged white man in a sheriff's uniform rushed in with over twenty fully armed police officers, immediately raising their guns and aiming at the surroundings.","\"Nobody move! Keep your hands where we can see them! Or we will open fire immediately!\"","Faced with the heavily armed police, the gang members obediently raised their hands in surrender!","After all, ignoring a police warning in the States would truly get them shot full of holes.","After successfully securing the scene, Chief Bob finally looked over at Rossi and the corpse beside him, visibly frowning.","\"Rossi, what is going on here?\"","\"Officer Bob, you're just in time!\" Rossi hastily pointed behind him. \"There's a female assassin from Dragon Country behind me, and she's trying to kill me. Hurry and save me!\"","Hearing this, Chief Bob's frown deepened. He looked at the empty space behind Rossi and said in a displeased tone, \"Rossi, are you making fun of me? Where is there anyone behind you?\"","Rossi froze and quickly turned his head, only to realize that the ghost-like female assassin was gone. He hadn't even noticed when she disappeared.","But he had no time to dwell on that now. He immediately turned and pointed at Liu Yutong and Jesse, twisting the truth: \"It's that Dragon Country woman! And Jesse! They killed Miles and my men! They are thugs!\"","He then pointed at Ji Yu on the stage. \"And that big guy too! He used illegal drugs to participate in the match and severely injured Hank. Arrest them quickly!\"","Chief Bob followed Rossi's finger and saw Liu Yutong, who was subtly being protected in the center of the crowd. His gaze paused noticeably, and an unexpectedly polite expression appeared on his face.","Is this the Dragon Country citizen the commissioner ordered us to protect?","Her appearance and aura are indeed extraordinary!","Rossi didn't notice Chief Bob's expression and continued to clamor frantically, \"Chief Bob, hurry! Arrest all of them! Especially that Dragon Country woman! I want to press charges for attempted murder! I want her to rot in prison for the rest of her life!\"","Chief Bob didn't take immediate action. Instead, he turned and instructed the officers behind him, \"Collect the evidence and call an ambulance!\"","\"Yes, sir!\"","Several officers immediately sprang into action, evacuating unrelated personnel and locking down the scene.","Seeing this, Rossi thought Bob was just following procedure and secretly rejoiced. As long as they went to the police station, he had plenty of ways to manipulate things. After all, he and Bob had been cooperating for years, and he had given him no shortage of perks.","However, in the next second, Chief Bob's actions left him completely stunned.","Chief Bob walked up to Liu Yutong, his attitude surprisingly polite, even carrying a hint of sycophancy. \"Miss Liu, you weren't too frightened, were you? Are you injured?\"","\"???\"","Rossi's heart instantly ran cold, and he suddenly had a strange illusion that the sky was falling.","Liu Yutong shook her head slightly. \"I'm fine. Thank you for arriving so quickly, Chief Bob.\"","\"It's only right. This is our duty.\"","Chief Bob once again expressed his apologies to this major VIP. \"Miss Bai has already communicated with us. You and your team are now officially hired as special investigative consultants for our police department, assisting us in fully investigating the attack on the Dragon Country entrepreneur, Bai Jingchen. We never expected that you would encounter a violent attack by gang members during your investigation. This is truly a dereliction of duty on our part.\"","Special investigative consultants?","Rossi was completely dumbfounded hearing their conversation.","Wasn't that Dragon Country woman gang backup hired by Jesse? How did she suddenly become a special investigative consultant for the police?","\"Bob! What nonsense are you spouting?\"","Sensing something was wrong, Rossi couldn't help but roar, \"She is a gang member! Look at her subordinates, the Black and White Twin Demons, the Hell Giant... Do any of them look like good people? You've been tricked by her!\"","Chief Bob turned his head, the smile on his face instantly vanishing, replaced by a stern, strictly business expression. \"Rossi Collaro, we now have sufficient evidence that you are suspected of illegal possession of firearms, armed assault in public, and multiple serious counts of murder!\"","With that, he waved his hand. \"Arrest him!\"","Two officers immediately stepped forward, expertly taking Rossi down. One put him in a chokehold while the other handcuffed him.","\"No! Bob! You must have made a mistake!\"","Lying on the ground, Rossi struggled desperately and shouted, \"We've cooperated for so many years, I've given you so much money, and now you want to arrest me!\"","Chief Bob's face instantly darkened, and he said sternly, \"Rossi, watch your words! Our police procedures are strictly in accordance with the law, and we never accept any form of bribery! If you continue to make such baseless accusations and slander law enforcement officers, you'll only add another charge to your list!\"","\"You...\" Rossi trembled with anger.","Suddenly, as if realizing something, he whipped his head toward Liu Yutong, his eyes full of venom. \"It's you! You must be behind this! You bribed Bob, you damn Dragon Country bitch!\"","Liu Yutong's eyes turned icy.","This Westerner was truly foolish to the extreme. Didn't he know that some things couldn't just be blurted out in public?","If he hadn't spoken out of turn, perhaps Chief Bob would have given him a little leeway for old time's sake.","Now that he had made such a scene, Bob would likely take care of him ruthlessly just to completely sever ties and protect his own career.","More importantly, this guy actually dared to insult her... She was never one to hold a grudge.","Liu Yutong took two steps forward, approaching Rossi, who was being held down by the officers and still struggling and cursing on the floor.","\"Mr. Rossi, I will say this one more time. In Dragon Country, three things are very important: hierarchy, rules, and face.\"","\"You speaking disrespectfully to an elder like me shows a lack of respect for hierarchy!\"","\"You breaking the rules of the match and committing armed assault shows a lack of respect for rules!\"","\"You being a sore loser and trying to flip the table shows a complete lack of face!\"","\"Also, you have insulted me multiple times...\"","Liu Yutong leaned in slightly and whispered to Rossi, \"So, I am going to teach you a lesson, to make you remember just how important these three things are.\"","With that, she straightened up, turned, and looked at Chief Bob. \"Chief Bob, the suspect is quite agitated and might engage in self-harm. Please make sure you keep him restrained.\"","Chief Bob understood perfectly and gave the officers a pointed look.","The two officers immediately applied more force, pinning down Rossi's limbs.","Rossi continued to struggle desperately. \"Let me go! You bastards! You Dragon Country bitch! I'm going to ruin you! I'll torture you to death! I will definitely make you pay...\"","Before he could finish cursing, Liu Yutong suddenly raised a foot and brought the heel of her stiletto viciously down onto a very vital part of Rossi's anatomy!","\"Ahhh!!!\"","A blood-curdling scream, so agonizing it hardly sounded human, instantly echoed throughout the entire boxing gym!","Rossi's face instantly twisted and deformed, his eyes bulging. His body arched up like a cooked shrimp as he frothed at the mouth, his entire body convulsing uncontrollably.","The gang members, who were lining up to leave as instructed by the police, stared at the scene in stunned disbelief. The male gang members in particular felt a sudden chill in a certain sensitive area down below.","This woman was absolutely ruthless!"]},{"number":688,"title":"Chapter 688: 688, Dark Phoenix","paragraphs":["Liu Yutong, however, acted as if she had merely stepped on two small pebbles by accident. Completely unbothered, she calmly retracted her foot.","\"Sheriff Bob, see, didn't I tell you this suspect has some mental issues? First he slandered you by claiming you took bribes, and now he's self-harming. It would be better to send this kind of person to a psychiatric hospital, don't you think?\"","Sheriff Bob: \"...\"","Sheriff Bob instinctively squeezed his legs together and immediately shouted at the other officers, \"What are you standing around for? Hurry up and get the suspect into the ambulance! He might be having a sudden psychotic episode. Once he's stabilized, contact the psychiatric hospital to take him in!\"","Several officers quickly stepped forward and clumsily carried the unconscious Rossi out.","Throughout the entire process, not a single officer raised an objection to Liu Yutong's kick.","In fact, a few officers tacitly turned sideways, pretending they hadn't seen anything, and even their body cameras conveniently failed to record that segment.","Naturally, this scene was also witnessed by the gang members. Recalling the events that had just unfolded, a chill ran down their spines.","Rossi knew the sheriff leading the team; they could even tell that Rossi had deep ties with him. Yet, in the end, the sheriff gave Rossi no face at all. He was even exceptionally respectful to that Eastern girl, deliberately pretending not to see it even when she stomped down on him.","Just how much power did she have? How deep was her background? To make the police cooperate to such an extent?","Could it be that the sky over San Francisco was truly about to turn black?","\"I... am I seeing things? Did she just...\"","\"Shut up!\"","The person next to him hurriedly covered his mouth, warning in a low voice, \"Didn't you see the cops kept their mouths shut? This woman, we can't afford to provoke her!\"","\"No wonder Jesse called her great-grandmother. She's practically a mafia godmother!\"","\"The Collaro family will be Jesse's domain from now on. With this woman backing him, who would dare to disobey?\"","\"Miles from the Hells Angels is dead, and Rossi has been turned into a cripple... San Francisco is about to undergo a massive shift in power!\"","\"...\"","Amidst the whispers, Liu Yutong spoke to Sheriff Bob once more, \"Sheriff Bob, I'll leave this place for you to handle. Regarding the clues about the attack on President Bai, my team will continue to assist you with the investigation.\"","\"Oh, right, my subordinates noticed earlier that a few armed men took advantage of the chaos to flee through the side door. They are likely Rossi's accomplices. I hope Sheriff Bob can deploy your forces as soon as possible to arrest them and bring them to justice.\"","\"No problem, please rest assured, Miss Liu!\"","Sheriff Bob immediately guaranteed, \"Fighting crime and maintaining law and order is our duty! We will definitely pursue them with all our might and won't let a single one slip through the net!\"","\"Our police force would also like to sincerely thank Miss Liu and your team once again for the assistance provided during the investigation of this case. If there is anything you need our cooperation and support with in the future, please feel free to contact us directly at any time.\"","He didn't dare to be anything but polite.","The higher-ups had put pressure on them regarding the attack on Bai Jingchen, so they had to take it seriously!","Besides that, their police station had received an astonishing amount of donations, as well as over ten million dollars in winnings. Because the proper procedures were followed, this money was completely legal, and he had a share in it too.","Although he hadn't gotten his hands on it yet, it didn't matter. Rossi was still alive, and all of his assets would be legally compensated to the chief. As for the Hells Angels, death didn't mean debts were wiped clean; what needed to be paid still had to be paid!","Liu Yutong nodded slightly and looked at Jesse. \"Can you handle the rest?\"","Jesse, now thoroughly subdued by Liu Yutong's methods, nodded hastily and said, \"Rest assured, Great-grandmother, I will handle the family's internal affairs properly and never allow anything like this to happen again!\"","\"That's good.\"","Liu Yutong turned around and led Yun Cheng, Chu Yang, Ji Yu, and the other core members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Association out of the boxing gym, under countless gazes full of awe.","Outside the door, a fleet of black Lincolns had been waiting for a long time.","Before getting into the car, Liu Yutong seemed to remember something. She turned her head and said to Su Mansu, \"Contact the hospital and ask about Uncle Bai's condition.\"","\"Yes, boss.\"","...","After the dust settled.","The events that had taken place in the boxing gym quickly fermented and spread wildly throughout San Francisco's underworld in various exaggerated versions.","\"Hey, did you hear? The Collaro family had internal strife last night. Rossi of the Collaro mafia family was crippled by a mysterious Dragon Country woman!\"","\"It's true. I have a buddy who was there. He said Rossi got kicked straight in the... well, you know, exploded! Super brutal!\"","\"I heard the cops were standing right there and didn't even dare to make a peep!\"","\"And apparently, one of the Hells Angels bosses was taken out by her too.\"","\"Wasn't that Rossi's doing?\"","\"Come on, you believe that crap? It must have been that Dragon Country woman! Rossi doesn't have the guts. That woman definitely used some tricks to pin the blame on Rossi!\"","\"Terrifying! What's the background of that Dragon Country woman? Does anyone know?\"","\"Seems like it's a super gang from Dragon Country called the Ten Thousand Dragons Association. Not sure about the specific details, but they all love wearing black suits.\"","\"Yeah! And the people in that Dragon Country gang are extremely ruthless, like the Black and White Fiends, the Hell Giant, the Shadow Assassin... Every single one of them is a ruthless character who kills without blinking an eye!\"","\"Hiss... just hearing these nicknames is scary enough!\"","\"By the way, does that female Dragon Country godmother have a nickname? What is it?\"","\"Apparently she doesn't have one.\"","\"She doesn't? Are you kidding me? Such a powerful gang leader doesn't have a nickname?\"","\"Black... boss... female... Easterner... I heard that in Eastern mythology, there is an extremely noble and powerful divine bird called the Phoenix.\"","\"Phoenix? I know that! That chick from X-Men who breathes fire, but her hair is red.\"","\"You're talking about Jean Grey, but what does she have to do with this? This Dragon Country woman can't breathe fire...\"","\"They like the color black, and the Dragon Country gang boss is a woman, so how about Black Phoenix?\"","\"Hey! That's a good nickname. Sounds powerful and mysterious... and the point is, it's dark enough!\"","\"It's definitely way cooler than Godmother or Queen! Godmother sounds like an old Italian lady, and Queens are everywhere, but the moment you hear Black Phoenix, you know she's from the East—mysterious, beautiful, and dark. She can burn you until there's not even ash left, and then have the cops call an ambulance for you!\"","\"...\"","Once she had a nickname, the rumors became even more outrageous.","\"Hey man, listen to the latest! Last night at the Collaro family's boxing gym, the Black Phoenix from the East descended! She brought her Hell Giant and Black and White Fiends, and swept through the entire mafia family! That idiot Rossi tried to resist, and she crippled him with one kick! Even the top cop Bob had to shine her shoes!\"","\"San Francisco's underworld is probably going to be ruled by the Black Phoenix now!\"","\"...\""]},{"number":689,"title":"Chapter 689: 689, Is There Another Mastermind Behind the Scenes","paragraphs":["A few days later, outside the intensive care unit at San Francisco General Hospital.","Liu Yutong stood before the observation window, gazing through the glass at Bai Jingchen, who lay in the hospital bed covered in tubes.","Whenever she had free time these past few days, she would come to check on him, but President Bai remained in critical condition.","As for Bai Shisui, she had barely left the hospital at all.","Although she had long stopped crying, her eyes were swollen like walnuts, and she had visibly lost weight.","\"Is there still no improvement?\" Liu Yutong asked the attending doctor as he walked over.","The doctor took off his mask and shook his head. \"The situation is very complicated. Although the bullet was removed, we cannot control the infection, and his kidney function is beginning to fail. We have used the best antibiotics and equipment available, but the patient is older, and his underlying health was compromised by overwork in his early years... Now, we can only wait and see if he can pull through on his own.\"","Liu Yutong said, \"No matter what, please do everything in your power. Use the best medicine, the best treatment plans—money is not an issue!\"","\"We will absolutely do our best,\" the doctor replied.","After the doctor left, Liu Yutong walked over to the bench and sat down.","Bai Shisui seemed to have found a pillar of support. She rested her head on Liu Yutong's shoulder and sobbed softly. \"Sister Yutong, I am scared... If my dad dies, what am I going to do?\"","\"Do not talk nonsense. Uncle Bai will pull through.\"","Liu Yutong wrapped an arm around her shoulders and comforted her, \"You have to believe in your dad. He is Bai Jingchen. A man who has weathered so many storms will not just fall like this.\"","Just then, Zhao Tianyi hurried over from the other end of the corridor.","Seeing Liu Yutong, he quickly stepped forward and whispered, \"Eldest Miss, there has been a development.\"","Liu Yutong patted Bai Shisui's back. \"Shisui, rest here for a bit. I need to go handle something.\"","The two walked to the waiting area at the end of the hall.","Zhao Tianyi began his report. \"Jesse is now fully in power. Through the family's channels, he bribed a mid-level boss within the Snake Head Gang. He got word from him that the attack on President Bai was indeed executed by the Snake Head Gang, but the mastermind...\"","He paused before continuing, \"...might be connected to Zhao Weixiang.\"","Liu Yutong's gaze sharpened. \"Zhao Weixiang? Is he not hiding out in a casino in Los Angeles? How could he be involved with Uncle Bai?\"","\"That is exactly what is so puzzling.\"","Zhao Tianyi pushed up his glasses and continued, \"That Snake Head Gang boss said they took the job through a middleman. Jesse's people caught the middleman, too. He confessed that the employer is from our country, specifically from the Port City area...\"","Liu Yutong asked, \"Are you saying the true mastermind behind the attack on Uncle Bai is not the Snake Head Gang?\"","Zhao Tianyi nodded. \"It is highly likely. The Snake Head Gang has not made a serious move against President Bai in all these years, which shows they fear him. For them to suddenly strike now, I am guessing whoever is behind this promised them some major benefit, prompting them to take the risk. They might have even prepared a scapegoat. If we had not intervened in time, this case probably would have been hastily written off as a gang vendetta.\"","\"Then what is the deal with Zhao Weixiang? How did that guy hook up with the Snake Head Gang?\" Liu Yutong asked again.","Zhao Tianyi had clearly given this some deep thought. \"I suspect Zhao Weixiang might actually be one of the financial backers or bosses behind the Snake Head Gang himself, perhaps even holding some degree of authority. Otherwise, it is hard to explain how he spends all day in casinos, throwing money around so lavishly, yet never seems to run out of cash. The businesses the Snake Head Gang runs are highly lucrative.\"","\"Eldest Miss, we need to catch this guy as soon as possible. He is too much of a troublemaker!\"","\"Later, use your status as a special advisor to ask the police officer in charge of this case about their progress. Apply some pressure. Their investigation is far too slow,\" Liu Yutong said coldly.","Speaking of this, she suddenly remembered something else. \"Right, I will give you a list later. It mainly contains the names of political figures, mostly candidates currently running for office or intending to run. Give it to Jesse. Tell him to use the family's resources and funds to find ways to befriend these people. He can invest a bit more generously if needed.\"","Zhao Tianyi instantly guessed her intention. \"Political donations?\"","\"Exactly!\" Liu Yutong nodded.","In the States, everyone from local council members to governors, congressmen, and even the President has to be elected, and elections require massive amounts of funding.","Political donations are one of the legal channels. As long as they are declared according to regulations, both businesses and individuals can donate to candidates. These donations help them run ads, hold rallies, and build campaign teams.","If they successfully take office, they naturally will not forget the financial backers who fully supported them.","Jesse's Collaro family, despite having somewhat of a mafia background, had its power mostly confined to the San Francisco area and could never quite make it onto the grand stage.","True mafia families had long stopped relying on street violence to survive. Their networks of connections had already infiltrated political and business circles, giving them immense influence.","To put it bluntly, if a real mafia family wanted to crush gangs like the Snake Head Gang or the Hells Angels, all they would need to do is lift a finger and make a few phone calls.","If Jesse wanted to grow quickly, or even become a true mafia godfather one day, he had to aim high.","With Jesse's current status, if he tried to cozy up to those big shots, they probably would not even give him the time of day. Therefore, the list she provided consisted entirely of figures who were on the rise—people desperately in need of funds but not yet famous.","Of course, these currently obscure figures were destined to become political stars and major players in the future.","Because she was the one who provided the list.","Zhao Tianyi understood perfectly. \"I get it. Jesse is now the head of the Collaro family. It is most appropriate for him to step forward and manage these relationships. Not only will it expand his network, but it will also pave the way for our syndicate's future operations in the States.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"That is exactly the idea.\"","\"Remember, everything must be legal and compliant!\"","\"Understood!\"","Zhao Tianyi pulled out another photograph and handed it to Liu Yutong. \"This is a record Jesse pulled from the immigration bureau through his connections in the police department. When Zhao Weixiang entered the country three months ago, the person who picked him up at the airport was a man named Chen Ming. And this Chen Ming is the deputy director of logistics for the Bai Group's US branch. He has been working at the Bai Group for eight years.\"","Liu Yutong took the photo, which showed an ordinary-looking middle-aged man. \"Chen Ming... Does this person have any special background himself?\"","\"His personal background is very ordinary. He comes from an average family, and his abilities are above average.\"","Zhao Tianyi pushed up his glasses and said with a hint of amusement, \"But his wife is a relative from President Bai's wife's side of the family. In other words, he has ties to Madam Bai's maiden family.\"","Liu Yutong suddenly realized something. \"Right before Uncle Bai's accident, he was just preparing to transfer thirty percent of his shares to me...\"","\"Miss, a thirty percent stake is worth over two billion dollars. This amount of wealth is enough to make many people green with envy, or even drive them to desperate measures. If Chairman Bai were no longer around, there is a real possibility that this gift agreement could be contested or even overturned,\" Zhao Tianyi said meaningfully.","Liu Yutong's gaze instantly sharpened. \"Go about your business for now. I'll have Assistant Su send you the list later.\"","\"Understood, Miss.\"","Zhao Tianyi nodded, took his briefcase, and turned to leave.","Liu Yutong composed her emotions and made her way back to the corridor outside the intensive care unit.","Before she even got close, she noticed two more figures by the bench. With red-rimmed eyes, they were speaking in hushed tones to Bai Shisui.","One was a woman of about fifty, dressed in luxurious clothes but looking rather haggard.","The other was a man in his forties, slightly stout, who wore an equally sorrowful expression.","........"]},{"number":690,"title":"Chapter 690: 690, Doubt, Ready to Depart (Two-in-One)","paragraphs":["The two people were Bai Shisui's mother, Zhou Meizhen, and her uncle, Zhou Yan.","Just as they were wiping away their tears and discussing Bai Jingchen's condition, they saw Liu Yutong walking over.","Zhou Meizhen wiped her eyes and looked the unfamiliar yet elegant girl up and down. \"And you... are?\"","\"Mom, this is Liu Yutong, my good friend,\" Bai Shisui introduced her, then turned to Liu Yutong. \"Sister Yutong, these are my mother and my uncle.\"","Liu Yutong greeted them politely, \"Mrs. Bai, Mr. Zhou, hello.\"","Zhou Meizhen's gaze lingered on the dark gold dragon-shaped badge on Liu Yutong's left chest for a few seconds before she replied, \"Hello, hello!\"","Zhou Yan chimed in, \"Miss Liu is certainly young and promising. I heard from my brother-in-law earlier that you run a massive business back home and have even expanded overseas. We are incredibly grateful for your help and care during my brother-in-law's accident. The Zhou family cannot thank you enough!\"","\"You're too kind, Mr. Zhou. It's the least I could do,\" Liu Yutong replied.","Zhou Meizhen didn't seem to want to dwell on the topic and turned to ask Bai Shisui, \"What did the doctor say? How is your father doing now?\"","Bai Shisui repeated the doctor's diagnosis. As Zhou Meizhen listened, she started wiping away tears again. \"What are we going to do? If something terrible happens to your father, how will the two of us manage such a massive family business...\"","\"Mom, don't say that. Dad will get better,\" Bai Shisui comforted her, fighting back her own tears.","Zhou Yan quickly added his own comfort from the side, \"My brother-in-law is a good man, and heaven watches over good people. He's survived a lot; I'm sure he'll pull through this time too.\"","Then, he smoothly changed the subject. \"But you have a point, sis. The Bai Group is a huge operation. If anything unexpected does happen to him, you and Shisui really need to think things through. But don't worry, with me here, I'll do everything in my power to manage the group and make sure nothing goes wrong.\"","Liu Yutong stood quietly to the side, taking in their conversation and expressions.","Zhou Meizhen's worry for her husband's condition seemed genuine, but her brother, Zhou Yan, clearly wanted to take over the management of the Bai Group. He probably didn't even realize how blatantly obvious his words sounded.","However, instead of finding her brother's words inappropriate, Zhou Meizhen nodded in agreement and said to her daughter, \"Your uncle is right. In times like this, our own family is the most trustworthy. Shisui, you need to listen to your uncle more from now on. He's been with the company for so many years; he knows more than you do and has a wealth of experience.\"","Bai Shisui looked as if she wanted to say something, but seeing her mother's haggard face, she ultimately nodded. \"I know, Mom.\"","Just then, Zhou Yan put on an expression as if he had just remembered something and suddenly asked Liu Yutong, \"By the way, Miss Liu, I heard my brother-in-law mention that he wanted to transfer some shares to you? That can't be true, can it?\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, there was a second of dead silence.","Zhou Meizhen's expression instantly changed, clearly becoming wary of Liu Yutong.","Liu Yutong's expression remained normal as she answered frankly, \"Uncle Bai did have that intention. He said it was part of our partnership.\"","Zhou Meizhen said, \"Thirty percent of the shares... Miss Liu, please don't blame me for speaking bluntly as your elder, but my husband's decision seems a bit hasty. The Bai Group is the lifeblood of both the Bai and Zhou families. We won't easily hand it over to an outsider.\"","\"Mom!\" Hearing this, Bai Shisui hurriedly interjected. \"This was Dad's decision! Besides, Sister Yutong isn't an outsider. She's truly amazing. Dad said it himself—she's a benefactor who can help the Bai family!\"","\"Even if she is a benefactor, we can't just hand over shares like it's child's play, can we?\" Zhou Meizhen retorted.","Zhou Yan stepped in to smooth things over. \"Miss Liu, please don't misunderstand. My sister isn't questioning your abilities. It's just that a share transfer involves the very foundation of the group, and given my brother-in-law's current condition, shouldn't we wait until things are clearer before discussing this?\"","Liu Yutong looked at the siblings before her and suddenly smiled.","The smile was faint, but it carried a condescending sense of pressure that inexplicably made Zhou Yan's heart flutter with panic.","\"You worry too much, Mr. Zhou. I never intended to take shares in the Bai Group for nothing. You're right; it's too early to talk about this now. The most pressing matter is to catch the culprit who hurt Uncle Bai.\"","Zhou Meizhen strongly agreed with this. \"You're absolutely right about that. The most important thing right now is catching the culprit. Everything else can be put on hold.\"","\"Shisui, stay here and keep your mother company. I have some matters to attend to.\"","Liu Yutong didn't want to waste any more breath arguing with them. She politely said her goodbyes and turned to leave.","She hadn't gone far before the voices of Zhou Meizhen and her brother drifted faintly over to her.","\"Shisui, don't blame your mother for speaking her mind. Your dad is lying in there, his fate uncertain. How can the two of us shoulder such a massive estate and such a huge group all on our own? You're still young and inexperienced. You don't know how complicated people's hearts can be.\"","\"Mom, I know I don't have the capability, but Dad said Sister Yutong is...\"","\"Shisui, it's not that your uncle wants to burst your bubble, but these outsiders can talk a good game while calculating everything to their own advantage. All they see is profit. Why would they genuinely care about the Bai Group? For all we know, they could hollow out your father's life's work in just a few years.\"","\"Your uncle is right. In this world, who else but your own family will truly look out for you? When your dad built this from scratch, our Zhou family contributed too. Your grandfather passed away early, and your uncle has been like a real brother to your dad. He's worked diligently in the company for over a decade. Which part of the business isn't he familiar with? At a time like this, if you don't rely on your uncle, on your own family, are you going to rely on an outsider?\"","\"Sis, don't say that. I'm just trying to help you and Shisui.\"","\"But Shisui, your uncle still wants to speak to you from the bottom of his heart. The group might look glamorous right now, but who knows how many eyes are secretly eyeing it from the inside? Among those founding members who built the empire with your dad, how many are easy to deal with? Not to mention the fierce competitors circling outside. If you were to take over, could you keep them in line? I've been with the company for years, so I at least have some authority. I can help you hold down the fort and ensure a smooth transition. Once you've gained enough experience, it won't be too late for you to take the reins.\"","\"But Dad said before that the group's management needs to be modernized, that we can't run it like a family business...\"","\"Silly child, those are just grand theories your dad liked to talk about. When it really comes down to it, blood ties are the most reliable. Think about it: if you hand the company over to an outsider, you wouldn't even know if they sold you out one day. Your uncle is your own flesh and blood. Would he harm you? Would anyone else in our Zhou family harm you? This is when you need help the most. If your own family doesn't step up, are we supposed to just watch as your dad's assets get carved up by others?\"","\"Shisui, have you been listening to some gossip? Do you have a problem with your uncle or the rest of the Zhou family?\"","\"Uncle admits that sometimes I'm a bit strict with my subordinates at work, but that's for the good of the company. Now that my brother-in-law has collapsed, I'm more anxious than anyone. We are family, we rise and fall together!\"","\"Uncle will help you stabilize the situation. When your dad wakes up in the future, or when you truly grow up and can take charge on your own, won't this company still belong to my sister and you? Could your uncle possibly seize it for himself? Am I that kind of person?\"","\"...\"","Under the bombardment of sincere family cards played by her mother and uncle, Bai Shisui was visibly shaken, her inner defenses softening.","Perhaps at a critical moment like this, it would be better to listen to her mother and uncle's arrangements?","But if so, what about Sister Yutong's shares...","\"Mom, Uncle, I didn't mean it that way. I just feel so much pressure, and besides, Sister Yutong has been really good to me...\"","\"Miss Liu is indeed a capable person, Mom can see that.\"","\"But she is an outsider after all, and a young woman. She has her own business. She can help you for a while, but can she help you for a lifetime? The most crucial thing is that thirty percent of the shares.\"","\"Suisui, it's not that Mom is stingy, but that's your dad's life's work. How can it be given away so casually? When your dad wakes up, we must have a good talk about this. Until then, company matters should be discussed behind closed doors by our own family.\"","\"My sister is right. We will remember Miss Liu's kindness and repay her as we should, but business is business, and the two cannot be mixed.\"","\"Suisui, the most important thing for you right now is to take good care of yourself and watch over your dad. Uncle will handle the company's affairs.\"","\"I understand, Mom, Uncle. I'll have to trouble you both to take care of the company's affairs for now.\"","\"That's right! We're family, there's no need to speak like strangers.\"","\"Don't worry, Suisui. With Uncle here, the sky won't fall.\"","\"...\"","On the other side, at the corner of the corridor.","Liu Yutong quietly listened to the entire conversation of Bai Shisui's family and couldn't help but shake her head.","\"This silly girl, if she continues to be emotionally blackmailed like this, the Bai Group will probably really change its surname to Zhou.\"","She could tell that Madam Bai was clearly the kind of woman deeply influenced by traditional family concepts, with a tendency to excessively support her younger brother.","Her concern for her husband's injuries was genuine, and her love for her daughter was real, but her desire to support her maiden family and promote her brother and other Zhou family relatives was also real.","Moreover, judging from the attitude of her brother Zhou Yan towards her, her status in her maiden family was probably comparable to an empress dowager holding supreme power in ancient times.","Long-term flattery from her maiden family, combined with her status as the eldest sister, naturally made her lean more towards them.","Otherwise, the Bai Group wouldn't have been stuffed with so many people from the Zhou family.","She could even guess another reason why Uncle Bai gave her the shares: he needed to use her hands to clear out this bunch of bloodsuckers.","It was also a way of paving the path for Bai Shisui in advance.","Although Uncle Bai only had one daughter, Suisui, and no sons, it absolutely didn't mean he could accept the Bai Group being renamed the Zhou Group. Couldn't a daughter be an heir?","Of course, these were just her guesses for now, but she felt she was pretty close to the mark. Even Uncle Bai's attack was likely connected to the Zhou family—though Madam Bai most probably didn't know about it.","As soon as Liu Yutong arrived downstairs, she said to Yun Cheng, \"Immediately arrange for someone to look into Madam Bai's maiden family, especially her brother Zhou Yan, and other Zhou family members in the Bai Group or those with close ties to them. Focus on all their movements, financial transactions, and suspicious contacts in the last month—no, the last three months.\"","\"Does the young lady suspect them?\" Yun Cheng asked.","\"It's not just suspicion, but also intuition. Earlier, Zhao Tianyi reported a clue to me: the person who picked up Zhao Weixiang at the airport when he entered the country was Chen Ming. This Chen Ming has marriage ties with the Zhou family. The Zhou family has plenty of motive to collude with the Snakehead Gang. For example, to stop the share transfer, or even take the opportunity to completely take over the Bai Group.\"","\"Do you need me to notify the police?\"","\"Not for now. There isn't enough evidence. Let's go meet Zhao Weixiang first. As long as we catch him, we'll have everything.\"","Speaking of this, Liu Yutong suddenly remembered something else. \"By the way, how is our application for a firearms license going?\"","\"It's been approved. With our status as special consultants to the San Francisco Police Department, we can legally equip and use designated defensive weapons while carrying out our investigation tasks. The guns have already been picked out. Do you want to go take a look, Miss?\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"Let's go!\"","...","A private shooting range in the suburbs of San Francisco.","Chu Yang stood at the shooting stall, playing with a Glock 17 pistol in his hand. He skillfully checked the firearm, loaded the magazine, and chambered a round, the whole process flowing smoothly like water.","The target in front of him was a silhouette target twenty-five meters away.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Five gunshots rang out, the empty casings clinking as they hit the ground, leaving a faint smell of gunpowder lingering in the air.","The target monitor showed that all five bullets had hit the bullseye, scoring ten rings each, with the bullet holes grouped tightly within the size of a fist.","\"Beautiful!\"","\"Mr. Chu, your marksmanship is truly incredible. It's really hard to imagine how you trained your shooting skills in a place with strict gun control like the Dragon Kingdom,\" a local detective watching from the side couldn't help but praise.","Hearing the translation, Chu Yang ejected the magazine, checked the chamber, and casually replied, \"I just play a lot of video games.\"","He didn't tell the truth about having served in the military, nor did he mention that his actual specialty wasn't handguns, but mid-to-long-range sniper rifles.","Today, a total of three plainclothes detectives accompanied Liu Yutong's team to the shooting range. The team leader was a white detective named Davis, and the other two were a Latino officer and a Black officer.","They were sent by the police department's special investigation unit to assist with the operation. On one hand, they provided law enforcement support; on the other hand, they were there to monitor whether this foreign consultant team was acting within legal boundaries.","Of course, this was also something Liu Yutong had actively requested.","With police personnel present to witness the entire process, the legality of their actions would be completely foolproof, and it would also prevent the other party from turning against them and denying everything if something went wrong later.","Detective Davis looked at Chu Yang's shooting score and walked over to Liu Yutong. \"Miss Liu, your team is indeed professional. However, I must remind you once again: although you have a temporary firearms license now, the main purpose of this operation is investigation and evidence collection, not a firefight. If we determine the suspect's location, we will call for backup. You must absolutely not act on your own.\"","Liu Yutong had just changed into a black tactical suit, her long hair tied up in a neat high ponytail, making her look strikingly heroic. Holding a compact pistol in her hand, she aimed at the target and said, \"Don't worry, Officer. We are all law-abiding citizens and a legitimate company!\"","\"That's for the best,\" Davis nodded, but he still couldn't help taking a few more glances at Liu Yutong.","This Eastern girl was too special. At such a young age, she possessed the composure of someone who had long held a position of power. Her facial features were even more exquisite than those of celebrities, and she had a pair of eyes that seemed capable of seeing through everything.","Moreover, every single one of her subordinates was an incredibly formidable and ruthless figure. They treated her with the utmost respect, and even the top brass at the police department were exceptionally polite to her.","Could someone like this really be a legitimate businessperson?","Davis couldn't help but recall the rumors circulating in San Francisco's underground world. This Miss Liu had a very resounding nickname: Black Phoenix. And then there were the Hell Giant, the Black and White Fiends, the Shadow Assassin...","Not to mention the catchphrase Miss Liu and her subordinates constantly repeated: \"We are legitimate businesspeople, a proper company!\"","Doesn't the saying go: the more you lack something, the more you emphasize it?","\"Miss, try this one.\"","Chu Yang walked over and handed her a SIG Sauer P226. \"The recoil is smoother, the accuracy is high, and it fits your hand perfectly.\"","Liu Yutong took the handgun, checked its condition using the method Chu Yang had taught her, and then raised it to aim.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Three shots rang out: two hit the eight-ring, and one hit the bullseye.","\"Not bad, Miss Liu!\"","The young Officer Kevin praised, \"Many people can't achieve a score like that with a P226.\"","Liu Yutong smiled. \"I just got a little lucky.\"","Afterward, she tried out other firearms at the shooting range, purely for fun, wanting to experience them all.","Just as she was about done, she received a message from Jesse.","After reading the message, she looked up at everyone present.","\"Everyone, get ready to move out.\"","\"The operation begins now!\""]},{"number":691,"title":"Chapter 691: 691, Met the Unlucky Guy Again.","paragraphs":["Early the next morning, the convoy set off.","The sky was gray and overcast, looking as if it could rain at any moment.","The convoy consisted of over a dozen black Lincolns. Liu Yutong sat in the backseat of the middle car, while the other vehicles carried core members of the Wanlong Syndicate and plainclothes police officers.","Yun Cheng sat in the passenger seat. Having just finished a phone call, he turned around and reported, \"Miss, the hospital just called. President Bai's vital signs have stabilized for now and haven't deteriorated any further.\"","Liu Yutong nodded slightly without speaking, merely leaning back against the seat with her eyes closed to rest.","After the convoy had traveled for a while, Yun Cheng's phone rang. It was a call from Ma Da.","Even without the speakerphone on, Liu Yutong could faintly hear Ma Da's loud, blustering voice.","\"Holy crap! Holy crap! Brother Yun! You guys look way too cool over there! I heard you even brought the big guns? I want to be part of a huge scene like that too!\"","\"Give it a rest, Ma Da! With your build, you'd only drag us down if you came. Besides, don't we need someone to keep an eye on the massive mess back home? The Miss leaving you to guard our home base shows she trusts you.\"","\"Sigh! I know, but it's still such a pity!\"","\"I've heard all about it back here in the country. The Miss has made quite a name for herself over in America. What do those gangs call her again... Oh right, the Dragon Godmother... and the Black Phoenix. I gotta say, these foreigners aren't half bad at coming up with nicknames; they're almost as good as mine.\"","Liu Yutong kept her eyes closed, but the corner of her mouth twitched slightly.","\"Where did you hear all this nonsense?\"","\"That kid Jesse told me! He said the reputation of our Wanlong Syndicate brothers has spread all over abroad. Brother Yun, Chu Yang, do you two have nicknames too? The Black and White Demons or something?\"","\"Umm...\"","\"That is so cool! If I went, I'd definitely get a nickname too.\"","\"Sunny Pigsy?\"","\"Screw you!\"","\"Just wait until I lose weight, I'll shock you all!\"","\"But seriously, these nicknames sound pretty badass, especially Black Phoenix. How domineering is that! When our Wanlong Syndicate expands internationally in the future, the Miss's title can totally be used as our trademark...\"","\"...\"","Listening to her subordinates get more and more excited, even starting to discuss absurd topics like how to brand the nickname, Liu Yutong finally couldn't help but speak up.","\"Are you done chatting?\"","The other end of the line instantly went dead silent.","\"M-Miss! You're there too?\"","\"Do you have a lot of free time?\"","\"No, not at all, I'm very busy! I'm heading to the construction site right now to check on the headquarters' progress!\"","\"You get back to your business, Miss. Wishing you a swift victory! Take down that Zhao Weixiang! I'm hanging up!\"","Beep... beep...","The call was hastily disconnected.","A moment later.","Chu Yang, who was driving, carefully peeked at Liu Yutong through the rearview mirror and said, \"Actually, Miss, your nickname does sound pretty majestic...\"","Yun Cheng glared at him.","Liu Yutong closed her eyes again. After a long while, she finally said, \"Focus on driving, unless you want to be sent back home to move bricks.\"","Chu Yang instantly shut his mouth, kept his eyes on the road, and focused on driving.","Just as the car pulled up to an intersection to wait for a red light, Yun Cheng spotted a somewhat familiar figure.","\"Huh, isn't that the runaway?\"","Hearing this, Liu Yutong also opened her eyes and looked out the window.","Outside a burger joint, A'wei, sporting dyed blonde hair and a Stars and Stripes t-shirt, was walking out holding a freshly bought burger and a large cup of cola.","\"Thank God... no, thank America! Thank the kind people of this free land! I finally have something to eat!\"","After racking up a massive fifty thousand dollar medical debt, he had started wandering the streets. He had been starving for days, basically relying on digging through trash cans for food every day.","Early this morning, an old lady out for her morning exercise took pity on him and gave him twenty bucks, finally giving him enough money to buy a burger combo.","In that moment, A'wei felt as if he had seen an angel!","No, it was the Statue of Liberty smiling down at him!","\"Look at this! This is class! This is civilization!\"","\"Back home, who would give twenty dollars to a stranger for no reason? Only here! In this land full of love and care!\"","A'wei tore open the burger wrapper, opened his mouth wide, and took a vicious bite.","\"Mmm!\"","He was so satisfied he almost groaned, and tears actually streamed down his face.","\"Delicious! So delicious! This is what real human food tastes like! Back home, how could I ever eat such a massive, hearty beef burger? And so cheap! Twenty dollars buys all this! The taste of freedom... the taste of dreams... ah!\"","He chugged a huge mouthful of ice-cold cola and let out a loud burp.","\"Burp! So refreshing!\"","\"I knew it! When the heavens are about to place a great responsibility on a man, they first test his resolve and exhaust his muscles. All those hardships before were just a test; a test from God—oh no, from the Statue of Liberty!\"","\"Even though I owe the hospital fifty thousand dollars, even though I was beaten black and blue, even though I'm still an illegal immigrant—I have freedom! I have dreams! I have the boundless opportunities of this land! As long as I work hard, washing dishes, working construction... one day I'll pay off my debts, get a green card, live in a big house, and drive a big car! I'll show everyone back home who looked down on me that I, A'wei, have stood up in the free world!\"","Just as he was completely immersed in the beautiful future he had envisioned, the urgent sound of footsteps suddenly echoed from down the street!","\"Stop! Police! Don't move!\"","\"They're up ahead! After them!\"","Three or four gang members were running desperately toward him, chased by seven or eight uniformed police officers. The leader was one of Sheriff Bob's deputies, and they were executing an operation to capture Rossi's remaining cronies.","These unlucky gang members were Rossi's confidants. After hiding for days, they had still been discovered.","A'wei, in the middle of eating his burger, looked up in bewilderment at the commotion.","The fleeing gang members also froze for a second when they saw him.","One of them, seeing A'wei's shifty-eyed appearance and noticing he was of Dragon descent, subconsciously assumed he was a spy planted by that Dragon country woman. He couldn't help but curse, \"Fuck! It's an ambush!\"","\"He's just one guy, push through!\"","A'wei didn't even have time to react before he was bowled over by the burly gang members. The burger and cola in his hands were knocked flying, splashing all over him.","\"My burger, my cola!\" A'wei screamed in heartbreak.","The gang members couldn't care less about him; they turned and sprinted down an alley.","The police arrived right at that moment, just in time to see A'wei climbing up from the ground, looking both completely bewildered and heartbroken.","\"They have an accomplice! Grab him!\" a police officer shouted.","A'wei's inherently sketchy appearance made him look incredibly suspicious no matter how you looked at him. But the most crucial part was that the police found contraband among the items dropped on the ground.","In truth, the contraband had accidentally fallen from the gang members when they crashed into him.","But the police couldn't care less about any of that; having the evidence was enough for them.","\"I'm not... I...\"","Just as A'wei tried to explain, he saw the officer pull out a stun baton.","Bzzzt—!","Blue electrical arcs flashed through the air!","\"Ah—!\"","A'wei's body convulsed violently. His eyes rolled to the back of his head, and before he could even form a complete sentence, he collapsed to the ground, foaming at the mouth.","Watching this scene unfold from their car, Yun Cheng and the others all wore peculiar expressions.","\"This guy is way too unlucky, isn't he?\"","\"Hahaha... The cops around here sure don't mess around. They went straight for the baton.\"","\"How do you guys think he's going to end up?\"","\"I heard that the homeless in this area tend to just disappear every three to four years on average. Is that true?\"","\"...\"","\"You can survive the calamities sent by Heaven, but you cannot escape the doom you bring upon yourself!\""]},{"number":692,"title":"Chapter 692: 692, Unease","paragraphs":["Los Angeles, San Manuel Casino VIP Room.","After Zhao Weixiang pushed his last chip into the pot, his fingers trembled uncontrollably.","The dealer revealed the hole cards—a straight flush. The stack of chips in front of him shrank once again.","The old white man sitting across from him unhurriedly raked in the chips. He was a regular at the casino and the boss of a local real estate company.","Mr. Zhao, it seems your luck isn't too good tonight?","The wheel of fortune turns, Zhao Weixiang replied, feigning indifference as he picked up his glass and downed his drink in one gulp.","The whiskey burned his throat, but it could not suppress the inexplicable unease in his heart.","This inexplicable palpitation and irritability had lasted for several days.","A few days ago, he had heard some gang-related news from San Francisco.","If it were just a turf war between ordinary gangs, he wouldn't have cared much. After all, such things were common in the States.","What really caught his attention was the woman nicknamed Black Phoenix.","Black Phoenix, Hell Giant, Black and White Fiends... why do they feel so familiar? Zhao Weixiang muttered to himself, pouring another glass of liquor.","What did you say? the old man asked.","Nothing.","Zhao Weixiang stood up to take his leave. Let's call it a night.","After he left the private room, several burly bodyguards immediately followed, protecting him in the center as they took the elevator straight to the underground parking lot.","Soon, escorted by his bodyguards, he returned to a highly private villa located in downtown Los Angeles.","As soon as he got home, his phone rang.","Speak!","We have concrete news from San Francisco. Jesse of the Corraro family has taken full control, and Rossi has been captured. That Oriental woman nicknamed Black Phoenix is named Liu Yutong. She is twenty years old and comes from the Dragon Kingdom.","I knew it was her! Zhao Weixiang's pupils shrank abruptly.","I heard she has influence in both the underworld and the legal world in the Dragon Kingdom. On the surface, she's a legitimate entrepreneur, but her power is immense. Moreover, her subordinates are each more formidable and ruthless than the last. This time in San Francisco, she crushed Rossi and the Hells Angels with overwhelming force.","What is her relationship with Bai Jingchen?","On the day Bai Jingchen was attacked, this Liu Yutong happened to be in San Francisco. After Bai Jingchen's incident, it seems she has been secretly investigating alongside the police. I feel it's only a matter of time before she traces it back to us.","Hearing this, Zhao Weixiang flew into a rage. Idiots! Couldn't you have cleaned up the mess?","For the first time, he regretted planning the attack on Bai Jingchen. It wasn't because he feared Bai Jingchen that much, but because he never expected it would draw this jinx over from across the ocean!","No one knew better than him how troublesome and terrifying a woman Liu Yutong was.","This woman was absolutely the most monstrous person he had ever dealt with, and this didn't just refer to her looks.","Dealing with her always gave him a sense of powerlessness, as if she could see right through him and every scheme fell exactly within her expectations.","Then there was the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang. On the surface, they wore the cloak of a legitimate enterprise, acting by the rules and keen on acting courageously for a just cause. But when you actually provoked them, you would discover the terrifying violence hidden beneath those black suits.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, he really did not want to go up against this woman.","But now, it was too late to say anything.","The person on the other end of the phone also grew agitated upon hearing this.","How do we handle it? This has blown up. The police, the embassy, and the media are all paying attention. I'm currently trying to clean up our tracks and cut ties as much as possible.","Although Zhao Weixiang was angry, he could only suppress his fury.","How is Bai Jingchen doing now?","He's not dead yet, but he might as well be. He's had two surgeries, and I heard the chances of him waking up are less than thirty percent.","Isn't this exactly what you wanted? With the Bai family in chaos, our transportation routes on the West Coast will be rid of their biggest stumbling block.","Zhao Weixiang fell silent.","According to his expectations, this was naturally the most ideal outcome.","The little money he had embezzled from the Dragon Kingdom was not enough for him to squander in the States.","Casinos, luxury mansions, bodyguards, women... each was like a black hole frantically devouring his funds. He needed a stable source of income, and the human smuggling networks, illegal labor markets, and even organ trafficking controlled by the Snakehead Gang were all highly lucrative.","It took him a long time of maneuvering to successfully become a partner of the Snakehead Gang. Of course, he never showed his face directly; he only hid behind the scenes, providing strategies, money laundering channels, and plotting the elimination of targets who got in the way.","Bai Jingchen was one of those targets.","The plan went smoothly.","They first released fake news to lure Bai Jingchen to an abandoned warehouse in the dock district. The ambushers were all unfamiliar faces using untraceable black market firearms, and they had even prepared a scapegoat.","Once the heat died down, he would even have the chance to reach into the Bai Group. Although the guy who contacted their Snakehead Gang used multiple proxies and fake identities, what Zhao Weixiang excelled at most was digging out the identities of the people behind the scenes through money and his network of connections.","Zhao Weixiang did not tell anyone about this clue he had found.","Because this clue was extremely valuable. He had even fantasized that when the time was right, he could use it as leverage to completely clear his name and shake off his status as a wanted man.","What a tightly interlocked and promising plan.","But now, it was all ruined!","Because Liu Yutong was here.","This woman must be coming for him! With her abilities and style of doing things, following the clues to discover that the attack on Bai Jingchen was related to Zhao Weixiang was only a matter of time!","Boss Zhao, the big boss is very dissatisfied with how things are developing. He asked me to tell you that if this matter gets messed up in the end, you will have to bear all the responsibilities and consequences! Also, the big boss said that we are currently short on goods, and the deadline for the next batch is tight. You must find a way to replenish the goods on time. If he doesn't see the goods immediately... you know the consequences.","The threat was self-evident.","Zhao Weixiang knew what that batch of goods was—a batch of healthy smuggled victims, especially those from the East, were very valuable.","Rest assured, I will deliver the goods on time, but after that, I need to leave Los Angeles for a while.","That's fine. The big boss said that a residence and a new identity have already been arranged for you in Miami. Once the heat dies down, you can come back.","The call disconnected.","Zhao Weixiang put down his phone, only to realize his palms were covered in sweat.","The sense of unease in his heart grew stronger and stronger.","He walked over to the liquor cabinet and poured himself another glass of whiskey. The amber liquid swirled in the glass, reflecting his twisted face.","Liu Yutong!","And the Ten Thousand Dragons Gang!","You all really linger like ghosts that refuse to disperse!","Fine then...","This is not the Dragon Kingdom with its strict gun control laws!","Since you dared to chase me all the way here, then be prepared to stay on this land of the free forever!"]},{"number":693,"title":"Chapter 693: 693, The Truth from Eleven Years Ago (Two-in-One)","paragraphs":["Zhao Weixiang hadn't left the house for the past two days, constantly reviewing all the intelligence he had received recently.","That woman's methods were indeed formidable. After Bai Jingchen was attacked, she didn't choose to strike back directly right away; instead, she donated a massive sum to the local police through the Bai Group, quickly establishing connections with local law enforcement.","\"What a brilliant move!\" Zhao Weixiang had to admit that this woman was highly experienced in handling such matters, always able to accurately find an entry point to build relationships with the authorities.","Her methods were surprisingly similar to his former mentor's.","His mentor was the same way, skilled at pulling strings, weaving webs, and connecting everyone together.","\"Boss! The target has arrived in Los Angeles with an entourage of about thirty people,\" a subordinate reported.","Thirty people.","Zhao Weixiang took a deep drag from his cigar and slowly exhaled the smoke.","Thirty might not sound like a lot, but he knew how high the caliber of the Myriad Dragon Society was, and how strong their forces were. Especially that leading woman—even before meeting her face to face, he could feel an invisible pressure just from the intelligence reports.","Liu Yutong!","This name had once been his nightmare during his days in the Dragon Kingdom.","At first, he too thought she was just a little girl he could easily manipulate, but gradually, he realized how horribly wrong he was.","Zhao Weixiang turned around. Standing in the suite's living room were five people—a mix of foreigners and those of Dragon descent. They were all top-tier fighters he had recruited in the US, acting as his trusted aides here.","The first to speak was a bald, burly man nicknamed Razor. A scar ran down his left cheek from the corner of his eye to his mouth, making him look extremely ferocious.","\"Boss, everyone is here. We've also stationed over thirty brothers downstairs, fully armed. We'll make sure they don't make it back alive this time.\"","Zhao Weixiang nodded and asked, \"Over in San Francisco, you've all heard about what happened with the Corraro family, right?\"","A tall, skinny white man licked his lips and spoke up, \"Heard a bit about it. That guy Rossi actually went down, lost tens of millions, and his ace fighter was beaten to death on the spot. But the Corraro family is just an insignificant branch of the Mafia; their reach shouldn't extend to us here, right?\"","Razor also grinned and added, \"I also heard that the young head of the Corraro family acknowledged that Dragon Kingdom woman as his great-grandmother. Talk about throwing away every shred of Mafia dignity.\"","Great-grandmother.","When Zhao Weixiang heard this title, he almost died laughing.","What kind of bullshit title was that!","Of course, none of that was the main point.","\"Liu Yutong's subordinates are all fierce fighters. Black and White Fiends, Hell Giant... you should have heard these nicknames by now. Do not underestimate them.\"","Razor replied, \"No matter how good they fight, they're still flesh and blood. In the face of absolute firepower, even a T-Rex would have to hit the dirt.\"","Zhao Weixiang naturally knew they had guns, and quite a few of them.","Getting hold of these weapons in the US wasn't difficult, but for some reason, the unease in his heart only grew stronger.","Could it be that Liu Yutong and her people also got their hands on guns, or even heavy firepower?","But they shouldn't have any experience using firearms, right?","He didn't dwell on it too much. He would face whatever came his way. Even if the other side had secured guns, they wouldn't necessarily gain the upper hand in a shootout.","After arranging some upcoming tasks, Zhao Weixiang poured himself another glass of wine and half-reclined on the sofa, his mind drifting back to an incident that happened over a decade ago.","Back then, he was just a low-level thug, scraping by selling pirated discs under his boss at the time, Brother Pi.","That night, Brother Pi received a phone call. His expression turned extremely strange, and then he took a few of his core men to an old district in the west of the city, which had now been redeveloped into a high-end residential area.","He remembered it was drizzling that night, with hardly any streetlights. After finishing a delivery, he urgently needed to use the restroom. When he came back, his boss and the others were gone, off doing who knew what.","Then, while waiting by the car, he suddenly heard a commotion coming from a small riverbank not far away.","When he ran over in the dark to check, he saw a man in a police uniform lying in a pool of blood, a knife sticking out of his abdomen.","Zhao Weixiang recognized that face.","It was Chief Inspector Gao from the local police station. He had a great reputation, had solved many cases, and was always amiable with the common folks.","Zhao Weixiang was still mixing it up on the streets back then. Once, after getting into a fight, he was taken to the station, and it was Chief Inspector Gao who took his statement. Unlike the others, Gao didn't yell at him; instead, he poured him a cup of water and advised him that a young man should walk the straight and narrow.","Zhao Weixiang had scoffed at it at the time. In that era, many believed that the bold ate their fill while the timid starved to death, and he was no exception.","But somehow, he had remembered that face.","And yet, not long after, that same face lay pale and lifeless in a pool of blood.","His first reaction had been to call the police, but Brother Pi, who had hurried back, pinned him down and warned him not to be a busybody.","However, not long after, Brother Pi met with an accident. They said it was a car crash, but Zhao Weixiang knew it wasn't that simple.","Because that night, he had seen more than just Chief Inspector Gao; he had seen another figure.","When that person saw him approaching, they grabbed a knife and ran. He had only caught a glimpse of their back.","But later on, he still managed to recognize who that person was.","It was none other than the future boss of the Yilian Syndicate.","After that, the underworld of Pearl City underwent a bloody purge. Several syndicate bosses mysteriously disappeared or died violently, and the fastest-rising power was a new faction named the Yilian Syndicate.","Liu Lei, the boss of the Yilian Syndicate, relied on his ruthless methods to turn the syndicate into the largest gang in Pearl City in just a few short years.","Strangely enough, after the Yilian Syndicate grew powerful, public security in Pearl City actually improved significantly. As someone from the underworld, Zhao Weixiang had deeply experienced the chaos from over a decade ago.","Robberies! Brawls! Thefts and so on were everywhere!","It wasn't until the Yilian Syndicate emerged that many people didn't dare to be so high-profile anymore, terrified of being targeted.","Of course, that wasn't the main point. The main point was that he always felt Liu Lei's actions were about more than just expanding the Yilian Syndicate's territory.","Later, by a stroke of luck, Zhao Weixiang met a mentor who worked as a broker. He gradually made a name for himself and started having his own plans.","As one of the witnesses from that night, he absolutely refused to believe that Chief Inspector Gao was simply stabbed to death by a random thug while on duty.","He had secretly investigated the matter and dug into Liu Lei's background, ultimately discovering something astonishing.","The relationship between Liu Lei and Chief Inspector Gao was not that simple.","Liu Lei had secretly arranged for people to take care of Chief Inspector Gao's daughter, Gao Min, on multiple occasions. At first, Zhao Weixiang thought he was just doing it out of guilt, considering Gao's death was directly tied to him.","But the deeper he dug, the more he felt something was wrong. Gao Min and Liu Lei were actually true father and daughter.","And then, he came to a bone-chilling conclusion.","Liu Lei was probably not just a simple gang boss, and his sweeping of other gangs wasn't purely about grabbing territory. It felt more like some kind of revenge. Perhaps Liu Lei himself hadn't anticipated Inspector Gao's death, and only went completely crazy afterward, indiscriminately purging those gang leaders.","During that time, almost everyone in the underworld was fearing for their lives.","At the same time, Liu Lei's massive moves completely earned the trust of the people behind him.","After all, taking out a police inspector and sweeping through so many underworld bosses—wasn't that enough to be trusted?","But Zhao Weixiang knew that Liu Lei didn't really want to do this. He was just influenced by hatred and simply decided to go completely dark.","From Liu Lei's relationship with Gao Min, one could deduce just how close he was to Inspector Gao.","Based on what he saw that night and the clues he gathered later, Zhao Weixiang guessed that it was highly likely Inspector Gao told Liu Lei to leave first to avoid exposing his identity, and Liu Lei chose to believe that he could hold out...","To be honest, Zhao Weixiang quite admired this kind of policeman, someone who truly achieved self-sacrifice and selflessness...","Of course, Zhao Weixiang never revealed this information to a second person. If it had been leaked, Liu Lei wouldn't have had to wait years to be taken out; he would have been dead long ago.","He always kept this trump card hidden, thinking that if something happened one day, he could use it, or use it to connect with that network and skyrocket to become the king of the underworld in Pearl City.","Unfortunately, just as he was biding his time, planting his people in the Yilian Society, the Yu Group, and around Lin Muyang... or making plans to trap them in his schemes, he met Liu Yutong.","At that time, Zhao Weixiang truly felt a deep sense of bitter rivalry, wondering why he had to exist in the same era as her.","He didn't think his methods were inferior, yet every time he made a move, she always managed to one-up him. It gave him the feeling that she knew exactly what he was thinking.","That feeling made him incredibly frustrated.","At the time, he could have played his trump card and fought Liu Yutong to the bitter end, but ultimately, he chose to flee early and came to the United States.","This was mainly because he was indeed a bit afraid of dying...","After arriving here, he still couldn't figure out where he had lost, especially after getting the news that Liu Yutong had flown to the West. He couldn't understand why she insisted on wiping him out completely, even chasing him all the way to the States.","Until he received a definitive piece of news.","Liu Yutong and Gao Min were actually biological sisters.","Liu Lei, the Yilian Society, Inspector Gao, Gao Min, Liu Yutong...","He should have realized it sooner.","No wonder this woman could navigate both the lawful and criminal worlds with such ease. This was the root of it all.","Time slipped away bit by bit.","As the time for the delivery approached, his trusted subordinate, Razor, came over to report some news.","\"Boss, Liu Yutong's people have checked into a hotel downtown. A few of them wearing black suits went straight into the Los Angeles Police Department.\"","\"The police department?\"","\"Yes, they were in there for almost an hour before coming out.\"","\"Our guys tailed them. After they came out, those people drove around for a few blocks and finally went into that hotel. They should be regrouping there.\"","\"She's going through the proper channels,\" Zhao Weixiang said suddenly.","\"The proper channels?\" Razor was confused.","Zhao Weixiang snorted coldly. \"This is an old habit of hers. When this woman does things, she always keeps it legal and compliant on the surface. She has absolutely no bottom line as a gangster. Even after coming to the States, she's still pulling this stunt!\"","Razor asked, \"Then... Boss, should we make the first move?\"","Zhao Weixiang shook his head. \"No. I don't believe she doesn't know we sent people to tail her. Since she dares to show up so openly now, she must have dug a trap waiting for us to jump in. If we make a move now, we might end up wanted across the whole United States.\"","He actually guessed right. Among the people Liu Yutong brought, there were indeed plainclothes police officers. This was also one of the reasons why she didn't hide her whereabouts.","Except perhaps on the turf of the United States' next-door neighbor, normally, if you dared to assault a police officer, it would never end well.","Razor frowned. \"Then what do we do? Just wait for her to come knocking on our door?\"","\"Wait?\"","Zhao Weixiang sneered. \"Of course not. If she wants to play by the rules, we'll give her something outside the rules.\"","\"The Snakehead Gang, are the goods ready?\" he asked.","Razor nodded. \"They're ready. There are nineteen 'piglets' in this batch, all recently scammed over. There are also some that our bail company paid to bail out of jail; if they can't pay back the money, they have to compensate with the valuable parts of their bodies according to the agreement. Right now, they are all locked up in that old cannery in the South District. According to the original plan, they will be loaded into trucks at dawn and shipped to Sin City to be resold.\"","Zhao Weixiang grunted in acknowledgment, then suddenly asked, \"The boss of the Snakehead Gang, has he always wanted to hook up with Mr. Jiang's network?\"","\"Yes, they want to do transnational business, so they definitely want to connect with Mr. Jiang's channels over in East Asia. But Mr. Jiang's side has never agreed, thinking their scale is too small and their methods too rough,\" Razor said.","\"That's perfect. Tell them there's a change of plans. The goods won't be shipped away; dispose of them on the spot.\"","Razor was taken aback. \"Dispose of them? Boss, those are nineteen 'piglets' who signed indentured contracts. We could make a fortune just by reselling them...\"","\"Is money more important, or is your life?\"","Zhao Weixiang looked at him coldly. \"Since Liu Yutong came this time to investigate us under the guise of Bai Jingchen's case, let's give her an opportunity. If the Snakehead Gang's hideout just happens to be discovered at this time, and there just happens to be a batch of victims locked inside waiting to be rescued...\"","Razor's eyes lit up. \"You mean, let Liu Yutong and her people go rescue them?\"","Zhao Weixiang shook his head and corrected him, \"You're wrong. It's to let Liu Yutong and her people step into a trap.\"","\"The cannery is the main lair of the Snakehead Gang. Leak this information out, and also leak the news that I will be heading there too. If Liu Yutong receives the tip, with her style, she will definitely lead her people to pounce on it.\"","\"The three streets surrounding the cannery are an abandoned industrial zone. There are no residents and no surveillance cameras. Our men will lie in ambush at the vantage points in advance. Wait until her people go in to save the hostages, then seal the doors shut, and then...\"","He raised his hand and made a shooting gesture.","Razor gasped. \"Boss, those are over twenty civilians. If they all get wiped out inside...\"","\"Who said they all have to be wiped out?\"","Zhao Weixiang smiled, a smile that exuded a bone-chilling coldness. \"Leave one or two injured as witnesses. When the police arrive, what will they see? They will see Liu Yutong leading a group of armed personnel breaking into a private factory, engaging in a fierce firefight with the Snakehead Gang, ultimately causing massive civilian casualties.\"","\"When that time comes, no matter what connections she has hooked up with over here, she won't be able to explain her way out of it.\"","Razor suddenly understood. \"I get it! Boss, this is a brilliant move! You not only eliminate your opponent but also shift the blame cleanly. However... what about Boss Wang of the Snakehead Gang? We have a long-term partnership with them. If we play them like this, won't we offend him to death?\"","Who knew that Zhao Weixiang would say without a care, \"Bai Jingchen's case has caused such a huge uproar and has had such a terrible impact. Someone with enough weight needs to take the fall, right?\"","Razor felt an inexplicable chill in his heart.","It was only then that he truly realized his boss could not care less about how long they had worked together or how deep their ties went.","Everyone, likely including himself, Razor, was nothing more than a pawn that could be discarded at a moment's notice.","\"Go make the arrangements.\"","Zhao Weixiang waved a hand and leaned back into the sofa. \"Remember, the information you leak must be absolutely real. Do not deliberately fake anything, or the other side will not fall for it!\"","\"Understood!\""]},{"number":694,"title":"Chapter 694: 694. Master-Apprentice Duel.","paragraphs":["Zhao Weixiang was a meticulous guy. No matter what kind of opponent he faced, he always paved a way out for himself first.","He then picked up his phone and dialed a number he had not contacted in a long time.","The phone rang seven or eight times before it was answered. A hoarse male voice came from the other end.","\"Who is it?\"","\"Master, it's me,\" Zhao Weixiang said.","There was a few seconds of silence on the other end, followed by a sigh.","\"Ah Xiang... I thought you were dead long ago. It's truly a pity that you are still alive.\"","\"Thanks to you, I am still alive, and living quite well. Master, I want to see Mr. Jiang.\"","The hoarse voice on the other end laughed, laced with a touch of sarcasm.","\"Ah Xiang, have you been out there so long that you forgot who you are? Do you think Mr. Jiang is someone you can just see whenever you want?\"","\"After what you did, fraudulently using Mr. Jiang's channels, you should be glad he hasn't come after you. Don't push your luck.\"","\"I am not here to talk about the channels. I have something in my hands that I want to give to Mr. Jiang personally.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Eleven years ago, a police officer surnamed Gao...\"","Zhao Weixiang only said half of the sentence, confident that the other party would understand.","The other end of the line noticeably quieted down.","A few seconds later, the voice sounded again, colder than before.","\"Ah Xiang, some things cannot be spoken of recklessly. That case was closed a long time ago, and the murderer died in an accidental car crash.\"","Hearing this, Zhao Weixiang smiled. \"Is that so? But how come I heard that there was someone else behind the stabbing of Inspector Gao back then? For instance, I heard with my own ears that Mr. Jiang was the one who ordered it?\"","As soon as these words came out, the other end immediately flew into a rage.","\"Bullshit!\"","\"Zhao Weixiang, I am warning you, don't court death!\"","\"Master, I have already fled to the States. Do you think I am still afraid of death?\"","\"Oh right, I almost forgot to tell you. I was one of the witnesses that night. Please do not think for a second that what I have in my hands is fake.\"","\"My demands are not high. As long as Mr. Jiang gives me a sum of money and arranges for my safe departure from the States to a country with no extradition treaty, in exchange, I can hand over everything I have.\"","Heavy breathing came from the other end of the phone, as if suppressing anger.","After a long time, the hoarse voice sounded again.","\"Ah Xiang, I trained you. I know you. You definitely have backups, right?\"","\"Master, you have misjudged me. I am a very trustworthy person. I am not like you, who could personally send a brother who took the fall for you to the bottom of the river.\"","\"I have photos, a list of the people involved in that incident back then, and records of financial transactions... It is enough to put Mr. Jiang behind bars for the rest of his life, or maybe even get him a bullet to the head.\"","\"Where did you get all this stuff?\"","\"I collected it little by little over the years, of course.\"","\"From the night I saw what happened to Inspector Gao, coupled with the fact that my boss Brother Pi and the others all died in accidents one by one, I knew this matter was not simple. Fortunately, I was lucky. I was just a rookie who had just started out, so I was not on Mr. Jiang's list. Otherwise, I would have died in an accident long ago, wouldn't I?\"","\"But this incident also served as a wake-up call for me, so I investigated it privately. And let me tell you, I really dug up quite a lot. Originally, I did consider handing over what I found to you in exchange for working for Mr. Jiang, but alas... That is why I say I was lucky I didn't hand it over.\"","\"Master, I know you are just a messenger. Please pass a message to Mr. Jiang for me. Liu Yutong has already arrived in Los Angeles. She is Liu Lei's daughter and the biological younger sister of Inspector Gao's adopted daughter, Gao Min. She came to the States just to catch me and dig out the mastermind behind the murder of Inspector Gao.\"","\"They won't be able to find anything.\"","\"Master, you are still too absolute with your words.\"","\"If Liu Yutong continues to follow the clues, she will eventually trace it to Mr. Jiang, or... more simply, what if I just give the evidence directly to her?\"","The other end was silent for a full minute before speaking.","\"How do you want to make the trade?\"","\"Three days from now, at the Los Angeles Port, Pier Seven, at ten o'clock at night.\"","\"I want to see Mr. Jiang in person. As long as I see him in person, I will hand over the things face to face, and then get on a boat and leave.\"","\"What if Mr. Jiang does not agree?\"","\"Then I will have no choice but to give the stuff to Liu Yutong. I am going to die anyway, so dragging someone down with me would not be bad.\"","\"Oh right, Master, just a quick reminder. This woman Liu Yutong, I have crossed paths with her. She is far more formidable than me, and of course... more formidable than you were back then.\"","\"I understand. I will pass it on.\"","\"Thank you, Master.\"","After saying that, Zhao Weixiang hung up the phone directly, casually tossed it onto the table in front of him, and fell deep into thought once again.","This phone call was his last way out.","If he could not get rid of that woman Liu Yutong in Los Angeles, he could only use this trade to get a new identity, fly far away, and start over in a place where no one knew him.","Of course, if his master failed to get Mr. Jiang to agree.","Then, the Snakehead Gang's cannery would be the site of his final showdown with Liu Yutong.","Either she dies.","Or he perishes.","There was no third possibility.","............","On the other end of the phone, the man Zhao Weixiang called Master was actually named Wu Kun.","At this moment, he was sitting in a luxurious office in Harbor City overlooking Victoria Harbour, his face livid.","Zhao Weixiang was someone he had personally trained back in Pearl City. This kid was clever, ruthless, and patient enough; he was the most outstanding among his many proteges.","Later, the situation in Pearl City changed rapidly, and the Yilian Society rose to power. Mr. Jiang, who was backing him, also needed to adjust his development strategy. Zhao Weixiang, an ambitious and no longer obedient hidden chess piece, became useless.","Useless chess pieces should be disposed of.","However, what he didn't expect was that this kid was highly alert and actually ran away ahead of time, leaving the people he arranged to hit dead air.","Later, as Mr. Jiang's business grew bigger and bigger, he mainly developed in Harbor City. The reason he chose Harbor City was that the controls here were not as strict as on the mainland. If something happened, he could run away at any time through some special channels, which was at least much more convenient than the mainland.","As for the old people and past events in Pearl City, they were gradually forgotten.","But who would have thought that Zhao Weixiang would return to Pearl City to establish his own faction, doing better and better...","If he hadn't encountered the extraordinarily monstrous Liu Yutong, he might really have become a top legendary figure in Pearl City, dominating a region.","After falling to a disadvantage in the struggle, he was still as cautious as ever and ran away ahead of time again.","What made Wu Kun even more furious was that Zhao Weixiang was so bold that after fleeing abroad, he dared to falsely use Mr. Jiang's name to strike a deal with the Snakehead Gang, quietly running illegal businesses.","He only found out about this later.","This guy's guts were simply too big!","The most critical thing was that this rebellious disciple actually kept a hidden card, using that old case from eleven years ago to blackmail him and Mr. Jiang.","It should be known that he and Mr. Jiang had long been deeply tied together. As a broker, he was not just an ordinary middleman; he was the spokesperson for a major boss.","They were truly bound together—sharing both in glory and in ruin.","Wu Kun took a deep breath, quelled the anger burning in his chest, and began to recall the case from back then.","The incident with Inspector Gao was indeed one of the very few, and undeniably the most severe, blemishes in Mr. Jiang's early rise to power.","Everyone directly involved had been dealt with afterward, and the relevant files had long since been sealed.","Zhao Weixiang was nothing more than a rookie nobody at the time; how could he possibly have gotten his hands on any evidence?","But Wu Kun did not dare to gamble.","Especially when it came to this disciple he had trained with his own hands—his most cunning pupil at that—he could not risk betting that the man was bluffing.","It was better to assume the threat was real.","After pondering for a long time, Wu Kun finally made a decision: he would hold off on reporting the situation with Zhao Weixiang to Mr. Jiang for now.","The reason was simple, yet pressing.","Mr. Jiang was currently in the mainland, conducting inspections under his new guise as a patriotic Hong Kong businessman, preparing to invest in a massive private hospital chain project.","Many people had played this exact game before. They would accumulate capital through illicit means in their early years, funnel it to Hong Kong or overseas through back channels, adopt a new identity, and then return to the mainland to invest with the grand posture of a triumphant homecoming. Not only did this perfectly launder the dirty money, but it also guaranteed them the highest tier of hospitality and the chance to network with powerful government officials. It was a masterful stroke that killed many birds with one stone.","Right now was the absolute most critical phase of the project negotiations, and Mr. Jiang needed his image to remain completely spotless.","Bringing up an old case that could potentially implicate Mr. Jiang at a time like this would be nothing short of asking for a death wish.","He knew Mr. Jiang's temper better than anyone.","I will wait until the hospital project is officially finalized, then find a suitable moment to tell him.","Wu Kun muttered to himself, As for that traitorous disciple Zhao Weixiang, I should be the one to finish him off with my own two hands!"]},{"number":695,"title":"Chapter 695: 695, Armed to the Teeth.","paragraphs":["Three kilometers outside an abandoned cannery in the Westside of Los Angeles, Liu Yutong's convoy remained hidden, choosing not to act rashly.","\"Jesse's informant confirmed that the Snakehead Gang is going to transfer about twenty trafficked victims tonight. It's highly likely that Zhao Weixiang will show up in person.\"","After reporting the information, Yun Cheng asked, \"Miss, should we make our move?\"","Liu Yutong replied, \"Zhao Weixiang is a very cautious man. Back in Pearl City, the fact that he managed to flee before the police could track him down proves he won't easily put himself at risk. Until he shows his face, there's no need for us to clash head-on with the Snakehead Gang.\"","\"What do you suggest, Miss?\"","\"Punishing the wicked and eradicating evil is a job for the local police,\" Liu Yutong said.","Even though she had orchestrated a massive operation, mobilizing the core elites of the Wanlong Society to capture Zhao Weixiang, she was genuinely unwilling to let her brothers and sisters engage in a bloody shootout with a local gang in a foreign land.","Even if she knew nothing about warfare, she was well aware that launching a frontal assault on an armed gang stronghold would likely result in casualties.","If anyone lost their life, she wouldn't be able to accept it, nor could she ever face their families.","Let the local police take the lead and charge the front lines. All she needed was an opportunity to capture Zhao Weixiang.","In short, if Zhao Weixiang didn't show himself, neither would she.","Although Yun Cheng felt it was a bit of a pity—he genuinely wanted to use some heavy firepower to duke it out with those guys, just thinking about the scene was thrilling—he still deeply respected the Miss's decision and was even quite moved by it.","The Miss always put their safety first, which was exactly why they were willing to follow her to the death.","\"Yun Cheng, contact Su Mansu. Have her reach out to a few mainstream local media outlets in Los Angeles, as well as the Dragon Country press station in the US. Tell them we've received reliable tips that the Snakehead Gang is illegally detaining our compatriots in an abandoned cannery, suspected of human trafficking. Invite them to witness the police rescue operation from start to finish.\"","\"To pressure the police?\"","\"Not pressure. With the media present, the gang won't dare to publicly massacre the hostages. Even if the Snakehead Gang wants to make a move, they'll have to weigh the consequences—unless they truly consider themselves terrorists and have a death wish.\"","\"Also, sync up the information with Detective Davis. Tell them we've pinpointed the exact location where the hostages are being held and urge them to send more backup. As per their request, we will only provide necessary flanking and intelligence support from the perimeter.\"","\"So you want the police to act as the vanguard, Miss, while we stay hidden in the shadows, waiting for the right moment to strike and capture Zhao Weixiang when he's forced out or reveals himself?\"","\"Exactly!\"","Liu Yutong nodded, then looked at Chu Yang. \"Chu Yang, you have special ops experience. You'll be the main commander for this operation. You will arrange everyone's specific actions from here on.\"","\"Understood, Miss!\"","Chu Yang didn't make excuses and quickly got into the zone.","He had already studied the topographic maps of the area and had even scouted the vicinity during the day. He already had a battle plan in mind.","\"Brother Yun, take five men and secretly infiltrate the third to fifth floors of that abandoned office building on the east side. Bring high-powered binoculars and thermal imagers. Establish a concealed observation post to monitor the entire factory area and all surrounding movements, especially any unusual personnel flow.\"","\"Lan Die, take ten people and guard the vicinity of the old passage connecting to the main road on the south side. Use the terrain to set up an ambush. You're responsible for intercepting any targets that might flee in that direction, or initiating a pursuit.\"","\"Ji Yu, you and the remaining personnel will protect the Miss. At the same time, keep an eye on our rear and flanks. Be on alert in case any gang members try to circle around from behind.\"","\"I will personally follow the police tactical team closer to the front lines. Once I gather firsthand intelligence, I'll sync it to everyone in real-time via the walkie-talkie.\"","\"Understood!\" everyone replied.","Chu Yang looked at the group and emphasized once more, \"Everyone remember, the core mission the Miss gave us is to capture Zhao Weixiang alive, not to get into a firefight with the Snakehead Gang. Unless the enemy shoots first, no one is allowed to open fire preemptively. Also, put on all the gear we just acquired.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, several Wanlong Society members carried a few large black cases down from the vehicles and placed them on the ground.","Upon opening the cases, they revealed neatly arranged heavy body armor, tactical helmets equipped with night vision and communication modules, cut- and puncture-resistant gloves, and tactical vests with ballistic protection plates.","Chu Yang gave them a brief introduction to this equipment, which had cost a fortune.","\"These are premium goods bought with heavy cash. For instance, this is Level IV body armor, capable of withstanding a direct hit from a 7.62mm rifle round. The helmets are military-grade; they can easily block shrapnel and close-range handgun bullets. Every tactical vest is equipped with a quick-response first-aid kit, non-lethal flashbangs and tear gas, as well as multiple spare magazines...\"","\"All the gear was procured according to the Miss's highest standards. The safety is beyond question. As long as your luck isn't terrible enough to get shot in an unprotected area, or you don't take a direct hit from a cannon, you'll generally be fine.\"","\"If some unlucky bastard really gets blasted by an RPG, I only have one piece of advice: catch the rocket barehanded and throw it right back at those sons of bitches!\"","\"Hahaha...\"","Hearing this, the group's initially tense nerves noticeably relaxed.","To be honest, the thought of potentially engaging in a live-fire shootout with a gang inevitably made some of them a bit nervous.","Who would have thought that people who had never even touched a gun back in their home country would suddenly be thrust into a gunfight? It would be a lie to say they weren't nervous. However, as the elites among the elites of the Wanlong Society, they had their pride. They wouldn't show fear on the surface, nor would they back down.","Now, seeing that the Miss had prepared so much excellent—even slightly absurd—protective gear for them, whatever little tension and worry they had vanished into thin air.","Just the heavy body armor alone had a market value approaching ten thousand dollars. Add in the helmets, vests, and various attachments... the gear each person wore was worth tens of thousands of dollars, making them comparable to human fortresses.","With such thorough preparation, if they still accidentally died, they really could only blame their own terrible luck.","After seeing them change into their gear, Liu Yutong was still a bit uneasy and emphasized her point again.","\"Everyone needs to be careful. No matter how good the gear is, you must not act impulsively. Play it safe and stay hidden if you can. Above all, no one is to get hurt. Each of your lives is worth more than anything else.\"","Yun Cheng and the others felt a warmth in their hearts and replied in unison, \"Understood!\"","Chu Yang picked up a tactical vest, slipped it on, and stretched his limbs. He sighed with emotion, \"This is even better than what I wore back in the military. This level of protection feels like wearing an iron shell.\"","\"That's exactly the effect we want.\"","Liu Yutong gave her final instructions, \"Remember, try to take them alive, especially Zhao Weixiang.\"","\"Yes, Ma'am!\" the crowd responded.","About half an hour later, a convoy consisting of multiple patrol cars and SWAT vehicles from the local police department arrived at the perimeter of the cannery. Forty to fifty fully armed officers quickly stepped out and established a perimeter using their vehicles for cover.","Detective Davis once again located the group from the Wanlong Syndicate hiding a short distance away.","When he saw them, he was startled at first, and then couldn't help but mutter \"Good lord!\" a few times.","The twenty or so people standing before him were almost uniformly dressed in pure black heavy body armor and tactical helmets... This gear was clearly not civilian-grade.","It was leagues better than what he was wearing.","If he hadn't recognized Liu Yutong, he would have instantly drawn his weapon and called for SWAT backup. Were these guys some top-tier mercenaries or what?","Chu Yang turned his head, the dark goggles on his helmet making him look like a Terminator.","\"Detective Davis, we are ready on our end. We can coordinate with your operation at any moment.\"","Davis: \"...\"","He looked over the group's equipment once more, finally unable to hold back as he spoke in a rather sour tone.","\"Buddy, we're just taking down a street gang. You guys are geared up like you're going to war with aliens. Is this really necessary?\""]},{"number":696,"title":"Chapter 696: 696. The Snakehead Gang Trapped in an Encirclement.","paragraphs":["Seeing Davis's surprised expression, Liu Yutong walked over from behind and said to him, \"Officer, I just made some minor preparations to ensure the safety of my people.\"","\"You call this minor preparations?\"","Davis pointed at the absurdly thick armor plate on Chu Yang's chest and said loudly, \"Level IV body armor, and that helmet, is it OPS-Core? The kind with omnidirectional noise-canceling communication and augmented reality displays? Our department doesn't even have these, and the SWAT team only has a few. Now every single one of you has one, and you call this a minor preparation?\"","Yun Cheng chimed in with a sharp remark, \"Our young lady said that staying alive is what matters, money is not an issue.\"","\"This isn't about money!\"","Davis was practically going crazy. \"With this gear of yours, it's more than enough to go to the neighboring country and hunt down drug lords!\"","Chu Yang stepped forward, patted Davis on the shoulder, and comforted him, \"Detective, relax. It's just that our gear is a bit better than yours, no need to get so worked up.\"","Davis: \"I'm not getting worked up. I'm just saying, why can't I meet such a great boss!\"","Liu Yutong smiled faintly and said, \"Do you want it? If you do, there's an extra set in this box. I can give... no, donate it to your police department.\"","\"Give it to me... I mean, donate it to me?\"","Davis's expression instantly turned serious. \"Miss Liu, this doesn't quite follow protocol. Our police force has strict discipline; we can't just casually accept equipment gifted by others...\"","Even as he spoke, he couldn't help but look at the brand-new set of gear in the box. His tone suddenly shifted, \"However, Miss Liu is so enthusiastically supporting our law enforcement work, actively providing necessary equipment to assist the police in rescuing victims more safely and effectively, and cracking down on crime... This spirit of international law enforcement cooperation is truly admirable! In that case, I won't decline.\"","As if afraid Liu Yutong would change her mind, he immediately started changing into the gear.","At a critical moment like this where a firefight could break out at any second, better equipment meant a higher chance of survival. It would be foolish not to use it!","After changing into the gear, Davis looked at his high-end outfit, identical to those of the men in black. He visibly felt much more energized, and that slight feeling of unfairness in his heart vanished into thin air.","\"The operation plan remains the same. We will lead the main assault, and you will provide support in the designated area. Unless absolutely necessary, do not cross the police line to initiate fire.\"","\"OK!\" Chu Yang nodded.","After giving the instructions, Davis turned around with Chu Yang and marched proudly toward the front lines.","Yun Cheng and the others also prepared to move according to the plan. Perhaps because it was their first time wearing such heavy combat suits, everyone was slightly unaccustomed to it, and someone couldn't help but complain a bit.","\"Brother Yun, the heat dissipation on this vest seems average... it's a bit stuffy.\"","\"Just bear with it. The young lady said life is more important than comfort. Do you want to feel a cool breeze through a bullet hole, or stay alive and feel a little stuffy?\"","\"Uh... actually, being a bit stuffy is pretty good...\"","...","Outside the cannery, after the police shouted warnings several times to no avail, they decisively launched the operation.","Dozens of fully armed police officers formed up and launched an assault on the cannery's main building.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Tongues of fire also spewed from the windows on the second floor of the cannery as they fired wildly outside, trying to stop the police advance.","At this moment, inside the factory, Wang Hai, the boss of the Snakehead Gang, was swearing fiercely at his subordinates.","\"Damn it! How did the cops find out about this hideout? And those reporters, fuck! Who brought the reporters here!\"","Through the window, they could see at least four or five media broadcast vans parked outside in the distance.","A pockmarked lackey asked tremblingly, \"Boss, what do we do now? Kill the hostages?\"","\"Kill your ass!\"","Wang Hai slapped him across the face and roared, \"Can't you see the reporters are here? Do you want the whole United States to know we massacred twenty civilians? How would we be any fucking different from terrorists then?\"","\"Then... then surrender?\"","\"Surrendering means spending the rest of our lives in prison. How many years do you think we'll get for the things we've done?\"","Wang Hai scratched his head in frustration, suddenly remembering something. \"Where is Boss Zhao? Didn't he say he was coming over tonight? Hurry and tell him to send backup!\"","\"Boss Zhao called just now and said the situation has changed, telling us to handle it ourselves.\"","\"Fuck! That bastard! He definitely knew the cops were coming and slipped away first!\" Wang Hai gritted his teeth in anger.","Just then, another shout came from outside.","\"Listen up, people inside! You are surrounded! Release the hostages immediately, drop your weapons, and walk out of the building with your hands behind your heads!\"","Wang Hai was now completely caught in a dilemma. He hadn't received even a whisper of a warning before his lair was surrounded by the police.","This meant there was a mole among them.","Of course, now was not the time to catch the mole, but to figure out how to fight their way out.","Thinking of this, a ruthless glint flashed in Wang Hai's eyes.","\"Brothers, herd all those hostages to the entrance of the west warehouse! Make them block the door and hold off the cops! Pick one and bleed him a little to warn the police outside not to act rashly.\"","\"The rest of you, follow me and retreat from the east side!\"","\"As for that bastard Zhao Weixiang, once I escape, I'll settle the score with him!\"","The thugs immediately used their guns to herd the group of human trafficking victims toward the west warehouse.","In the crowd, a blond young man with bandages still wrapped around his head had an expression worse than if he were crying.","He was none other than Ah Wei, who had previously shouted \"Long live freedom\" by the sea.","He was now thoroughly doubting his life choices.","A while ago, he was first beaten into the hospital by a group of black men, racking up over fifty thousand dollars in medical bills. Then, while eating a burger on the street, he was tased by the police who mistook him for a gang accomplice. After finally being bailed out of the police station, he discovered that the people who bailed him out were actually a gang specializing in illegal underground businesses...","He truly felt like a rag that fate had repeatedly wrung out and then casually tossed aside when it was ruined. He was incredibly unlucky and utterly miserable!","Just as he was on the verge of despair, he suddenly heard the voices of people from the Dragon Kingdom outside, and his eyes instantly lit up.","Reporters from the Dragon Kingdom! The voice of the motherland!","Ah Wei's eyes grew moist.","At this moment, freedom and opportunities were all bullshit!","The motherland was the best after all!","\"Police brothers, reporter brothers, I am from the Dragon Kingdom! I am from the Dragon Kingdom! Hurry and save me!\"","This shout startled the other victims beside him and also caught the attention of the Snakehead Gang members.","\"Fuck! What the hell are you yelling for!\" A gang member slammed the butt of his rifle into him.","Ah Wei seemed to be risking it all this time, or rather, his mental state was already semi-collapsed. Even after being hit, he still dared to continue shouting outside.","\"Help! I am a citizen of the Dragon Kingdom! I am being illegally detained! These bad guys want to kill me! Motherland, save me! Boohoo...\"","He spoke in the Dragon Kingdom language; this was the first time he had spoken it since coming to the United States.","The reporters outside the warehouse clearly heard it, and their cameras immediately turned toward the source of the sound.","\"Damn it, you're asking for it!\"","The thug immediately raised his gun and fired a shot right into Ah Wei's kidney.","Bang!","\"Ahhh!!!\"","Ah Wei shrieked like a stuck pig, clutching his side with both hands.","\"My kidney! My kidney!\"","\"I worked so hard to finally make it to America, and before I could even start my new life, my kidney is gone, boohoo...\"","He was pretty tough, though. After he was shot, the men from the Snakehead Gang simply tossed him out the front gates.","Soon, paramedics arrived and loaded him onto a stretcher.","However, that single gunshot from the Snakehead Gang completely infuriated the police and all the reporters on the scene.","The police perimeter rapidly tightened, and all sorts of reinforcements were continuously pouring in..."]},{"number":697,"title":"Chapter 697: 697. The Opportunity to Take Action Has Arrived","paragraphs":["Not far from the cannery, a black commercial van with its headlights off was parked near the water.","Zhao Weixiang stared intently at the walkie-talkie, his face frightfully gloomy as he listened to the incoming messages.","\"Liu Yutong... what a clever trick.\"","He had carefully set up this trap to lure Liu Yutong into leading a direct assault on the cannery herself, allowing his ambushing men to take a cheap shot at her. Even if they couldn't kill her, they could still cause her massive trouble.","But he never expected that Liu Yutong wouldn't play by the rules at all.","This woman actually leaked the intel directly to the police and the media!","Now, the Snakehead Gang had truly become sitting ducks.","With the police making a big show of rescuing the hostages and the media broadcasting it live, would the men he arranged nearby still dare to make a move under such circumstances?","Once they made a move, it would be considered assaulting the police and an act of terrorism. The entire country would put them on the wanted list!","\"Boss, what do we do now? Boss Wang's side is about to cave in!\"","\"Our squad is still ambushing in the abandoned office building on the east side of the cannery. Should we strike?\" Razor reported the situation on the scene over the walkie-talkie.","\"Strike how? The factory is full of police and media right now. The moment you open fire, it becomes open assault on the police. By then, we'll be like rats crossing the street, chased and beaten by everyone!\"","\"We absolutely cannot make a move at this time!\"","Zhao Weixiang looked through the car window at the firelight on the distant horizon, his mind racing.","Although the appearance of the police and reporters disrupted his plans, it wasn't completely without a turning point.","As long as Boss Wang could hold on, use those hostages to stall the police, and then seize the opportunity to take hostages to break out and escape, he could draw away most of the police force.","According to Razor's situation just now, their ambush position had not been discovered by the police, because the police's attention was all on the cannery. Who would have thought there were still enemies hiding in the building to the back and side.","Once the police were all lured away, maybe Liu Yutong would show up, and then he could give her a surprise!","Didn't expect that, did you?","Although you used the police and reporters to disrupt my plan, I can still be the hunter in the shadows, waiting to devour you.","Thinking of this, Zhao Weixiang ordered into the walkie-talkie, \"Keep laying low! Pay close attention to the situation on the streets around the cannery. The moment you see Liu Yutong's people appear, strike immediately and take her out at all costs!\"","\"Yes, Boss!\"","Meanwhile, inside the abandoned office building on the east side of the cannery.","Yun Cheng was leading five members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, lying in wait by the windows on the fourth floor. They held high-powered binoculars and thermal imaging cameras in their hands, closely monitoring the surrounding activities.","\"Brother Yun, don't you think the eldest miss's move is absolutely brilliant?\"","\"The police act as the vanguard, the reporters act as the audience. It's hard for the Snakehead Gang not to die!\" a man in black said with a laugh.","Yun Cheng adjusted the thermal imager and said, \"The eldest miss has always been watertight in her actions. This way, we don't have to take risks, and we can force out that old fox Zhao Weixiang. Why not do it?\"","\"It's just a bit of a pity. I really wanted to have a shootout with those gangsters! I feel terrifyingly strong right now!\"","\"Hey, what do you guys think, if a fight really breaks out later, what tactics should we use?\"","\"That's easy. Haven't you played CF or CS? Grenades, flashbangs, smoke grenades, throw whatever you have. Once you're done throwing, just grab your gun and charge in. That's it.\"","\"Your tactics are way too reckless!\"","\"...\"","\"Stop bickering. Zhao Weixiang is definitely nearby. There will be plenty of opportunities for you to get your fill later. Pay attention, are there any abnormal movements on the thermal imager?\" Yun Cheng interrupted their chatter.","Several people carefully observed the surrounding streets but did not find anything unusual.","Just as Yun Cheng was about to tell everyone to continue monitoring, he suddenly heard a slight noise coming from above.","He immediately raised his hand in a gesture for silence, then asked softly, \"Did you guys hear anything?\"","Everyone shook their heads.","\"Could it be the sound of rats?\" a man in black asked.","After all, this dilapidated building hadn't been lived in for a long time, so it was normal for rats to pass by.","Yun Cheng thought about it and agreed. Logically, no one would come to their position; it might really be rats.","Upstairs, on the sixth floor.","Razor led seven or eight people, also in different positions and rooms, using binoculars to observe the roof of the warehouse opposite the building, as well as the situation on the surrounding streets.","\"Boss, could there be anyone in this building?\" an underling observed for a while and couldn't help but ask. His right eyelid had been twitching all night, and he felt uneasy.","\"Who the hell would be here! This dump has been abandoned for years; even rats don't come here. Hurry up! Set up the equipment and see what the situation is with the police now. Also, if you see that Liu Yutong appear, take her out!\"","\"Yes, boss!\"","The two groups, one above and one below, were both secretly observing the street situation, neither discovering the other.","However, right at this moment, a dramatic scene occurred.","While Yun Cheng was observing, a burst of static suddenly came through his earpiece.","Then, a strange voice cut in: \"Pizza Two, where are you? Is the movie over?\"","Yun Cheng froze.","What the hell was this? Pizza? Movie?","He subconsciously glanced at his walkie-talkie. Was there a problem with it? Why was a stranger speaking?","Before he could figure out what was going on, another voice sounded: \"Pizza One, this is Pizza Three, it's not over.\"","Yun Cheng: \"???\"","What in the world?","The next second, he suddenly realized—their frequencies had crossed!","The walkie-talkies they used had a frequency-hopping function and no fixed channels. Obviously, they had just accidentally cut into someone else's communication line.","And listening to the content, the other party was definitely not one of their own; they had never set up any secret codes.","After figuring it out, he immediately became excited. He gave a look to the Ten Thousand Dragons Society members beside him, then cleared his throat and spoke into the walkie-talkie with a slightly hoarse voice.","\"Pizza Three, this is Pizza... uh, Pizza Special Agent. The boss has new instructions. The movie has been rescheduled. We are wrapping up now.\"","He was completely making it up, because he had no idea what their code words meant.","But unexpectedly, the other party actually believed it!","\"Pizza Special Agent? Holy shit, when did the boss send a special agent?\"","\"Oh right, what's the password?\"","Yun Cheng's heart tightened.","Password? How would he know any password!","Just as he was thinking about how to bluff his way through, an angry curse from what seemed to be the man leading the team suddenly came through.","\"Fuck! Keep your voices down! I can hear you talking on the walkie-talkie! What Pizza Three and Pizza Four, shut the hell up!\"","It turned out that Razor had also heard the conversation on the walkie-talkie, and he thought it was his subordinates chatting idly on the radios.","After all, they were just a bunch of ordinary gang members. Why would they consider things like anti-surveillance, nor would they think that outsiders could cross into their channel.","With Razor's roar, the channel instantly went quiet, and no one made another sound.","Yun Cheng's only priority right now was finding out where this group was hiding, as he was almost certain they were Zhao Weixiang's men.","Now that they had finally shown their true colors, he couldn't let this opportunity slip by.","After a brief moment of thought, an idea came to him. Mimicking Razor's impatient tone, he started barking into the walkie-talkie.","\"Damn it, weren't you all having a great chat just a minute ago? Why is everyone suddenly mute?\"","Without giving them a chance to respond, he immediately followed up in a commanding tone, \"Cut the crap! Hurry up and report your location and current situation!\"","This tactic of cursing while demanding answers worked surprisingly well.","Almost instantly, a panicked voice replied from the other end of the radio.","\"W-we're on the sixth floor of the abandoned office building on the east side. We have a clear view of the entire factory area. The police have already breached the perimeter, and Boss Wang's side is about to cave... We haven't spotted the target yet.\"","Yun Cheng's heart skipped a beat at this response.","The sixth floor?","He and his men were on the fourth floor. There really were people upstairs—it wasn't just rats scuttling around.","It seemed his guess was spot on; this group was definitely working for Zhao Weixiang.","With this in mind, Yun Cheng immediately keyed the walkie-talkie and issued another order.","\"Listen up, everyone. There's been a change of plans. Fall back and assemble on the third floor. I repeat, assemble on the third floor! I have an important task to assign!\"","He was going to trap them like rats in a barrel.","Up on the sixth floor, in a room facing south, Razor froze.","Assemble on the third floor? An important task?","He was right there with the team, so why was another version of himself giving orders over the radio?","Something was wrong!","Razor's expression darkened. He immediately grabbed his radio and yelled, \"You're not one of us! Who the fuck are you?\"","Hearing this, Yun Cheng knew his cover was blown, so he dropped the act entirely.","\"I'm your daddy!\"","With that, he switched off the walkie-talkie and turned to the members of the Wanlong Syndicate. \"Our chance is here. Get ready to move!\""]},{"number":698,"title":"Chapter 698: 698, Equipment Overwhelming from a Whale Player","paragraphs":["Yun Cheng turned off the walkie-talkie, a cold sneer appearing on the corner of his mouth.","\"Brothers, that gang upstairs is about to come down. Get ready, everyone!\"","The five members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society nodded excitedly and began checking their equipment.","\"Brother Yun, how are we fighting this?\" a man in black asked, his eyes lighting up.","They originally thought they were just along for the ride this time, but to their surprise, they actually caught a real opportunity.","Yun Cheng thought for a moment and suddenly smiled.","\"Didn't you guys mention it earlier? Let's just play it like a video game.\"","\"Huh?\" Everyone looked astonished.","\"We were just joking earlier!\"","\"Brother Yun, you can't be serious, right?\"","Yun Cheng didn't waste words and directly laid out the tactics: \"Listen up. Later, we'll launch a direct assault. Throw flashbangs and smoke grenades first—throw whatever we have to create chaos.\"","\"Then, two of you will flank from the left, two from the right, and I'll lay down suppressing fire from the front.\"","\"Shoot on sight, don't hesitate. With the gear we're wearing, as long as we're careful, there won't be any problems. Charge in boldly!\"","\"But there's one thing to note: try to leave them alive. Don't actually go for headshots on sight like in a game. We need them alive to find out where that bastard Zhao Weixiang is.\"","The crowd was left dumbfounded.","\"Brother Yun, why do these tactics sound a bit familiar?\"","\"What did you expect? I am the sniper god of the Transport Ship map, after all.\"","\"...\"","Everyone fell speechless for a moment, but inexplicably felt... it seemed like these tactics might actually work?","Anyway, with such a massive equipment advantage, they would win no matter how they fought.","So they might as well just wing it!","The six men quickly split up to take action.","Core member Huzi stayed on the fourth floor. He violently kicked over an abandoned iron cabinet, creating a loud crash, while shouting at the top of his lungs in the Dragon Kingdom language: \"Listen up, people upstairs! You are completely surrounded! Put down your weapons! Anyone who resists will be executed on the spot!\"","Upstairs, on the sixth floor.","Razor and his eight subordinates were all startled by the sudden commotion.","\"There's someone downstairs!\" a gang member yelled in panic.","\"Damn it, it really is an ambush!\" Razor's expression changed instantly.","\"They sound like people from the Dragon Kingdom. Are they Liu Yutong's men? How did they know we were here?\"","\"Didn't some idiot report our position on the walkie-talkie just now? We should have shot him!\"","\"Boss, what do we do? Fight or retreat?\"","Razor's eyes turned ruthless. \"Retreat? Retreat where? They've blocked the way down. Are we supposed to jump off the building? Kill them! The boss said at all costs!\"","Just as he finished speaking.","Whoosh!","A round object flew up from the corner of the stairs and landed in the middle of the sixth-floor corridor.","\"Grenade!\" someone screamed.","Boom!","It wasn't an explosion. After a loud bang, a blinding ball of white light instantly burst open!","It was a stun grenade!","\"Ah! My eyes!\"","\"Fuck! I can't see anything!\"","Several of Razor's subordinates caught the flash head-on. They clutched their eyes and screamed, their ears ringing, instantly losing their sight and hearing.","\"Go!\"","Yun Cheng immediately waved his hand and rushed out of the stairwell with two Ten Thousand Dragons Society members. Wearing tactical goggles equipped with anti-glare functions, they were completely unaffected.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","After a burst of wild shooting, three gang members who were still in a dazed state were shot in their thighs and bodies, crying out in pain as they fell to the ground.","Razor actually reacted quite fast. The moment the stun grenade went off, he instinctively dove into a nearby room. Although he was severely shaken, he still managed to barely stay conscious.","When he heard footsteps approaching, he relied on his instincts, raised his AK, and pulled the trigger toward the doorway, blindly spraying bullets regardless of whether anyone was there.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Yun Cheng pressed his body sideways against the wall at the top of the stairs and made a hand gesture to the brothers beside him. Then, throwing caution to the wind, they hurled whatever they had—flashbangs, smoke grenades, frag grenades—all at once toward the areas where they sensed people.","Hiss~~~~","Thick white smoke quickly spread out, enveloping the entire stairwell.","\"Cough, cough... what is this?\"","\"I can't see anything!\"","\"Enemy attack! Enemy attack!\"","Razor forced his eyes open, but his vision was blurry. He could only see the vast expanse of white smoke and faintly flickering silhouettes.","Just as he was about to raise his gun to shoot, he heard several highly excited voices coming from the smoke.","\"Fire in the hole!\"","This was followed by a messy chorus of shouts.","\"Enemy spotted at Point B!\"","\"I'll hold A Long!\"","\"Come mid and sniper duel if you have the guts!\"","\"...\"","Razor: \"???\"","What the hell was this? Were they treating this like a video game?","For the next thirty seconds, the scene became exceptionally chaotic.","Although these Ten Thousand Dragons Society members lacked actual combat experience, their equipment gave them far too great an advantage. Bullets hitting their heavy body armor felt like mere tickles, and coupled with their tactical helmets and goggles, they held the absolute upper hand in this chaos.","On the other hand, Razor's men were all wearing ordinary clothes, lacking even a decent bulletproof vest.","It wasn't that their boss couldn't acquire such gear, but rather that in their boss's eyes, the lives of these lackeys probably weren't even worth the cost of a bulletproof vest.","If people died, he could just recruit more. In this place where firepower was truth, there was never a shortage of guys wanting to join a gang.","The resulting consequence was a one-sided steamrolling by pay-to-win players.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","A few bullets struck the members of the Ten Thousand Dragons Society, sparking slightly and leaving a few white marks.","At first, the man in black who got shot was scared to death, but after realizing he was fine, he gradually grew arrogant.","\"Hehe, buddy, it's my turn to hit back, right?\"","He then fired back, and his opponent dropped straight to his knees, instantly losing all combat capability.","When those gang members saw this scene, their eyes nearly popped out of their sockets.","\"What the fuck kind of monsters are these!\"","It wasn't that they hadn't engaged in shootouts in the Beautiful Country, and they had seen plenty of ruthless people, but they had never seen or fought a battle where they were at such a complete equipment disadvantage. Bullets hit the enemy and they acted like nothing happened. How the hell were they supposed to fight this!","\"Boss, they're wearing heavy body armor! Our bullets can't pierce it!\" a lackey said in terror.","Only then did Razor clearly see that the group of men in black opposite them had gear so luxurious it was almost blinding.","Full-face tactical helmets, Level IV heavy body armor with plates that were clearly military-grade ceramic composites, guns equipped with holographic sights, tactical flashlights, and even laser pointers...","This was more luxurious than police gear; it was practically catching up to special forces equipment.","\"Retreat! Quick, retreat!\" Razor wasn't an idiot. Continuing this obviously asymmetrical battle would only lead to death. He simply shouted and turned to run toward the other side of the corridor.","But more than half of his subordinates had already fallen, and the rest were pinned down tightly by the Ten Thousand Dragons Society men. They had no chance to escape.","Yun Cheng saw that someone wanted to escape, immediately unclipped a stun grenade from his tactical vest, and hurled it forcefully through the doorway.","Although the distance was a bit far, one had to remember that he used to be able to throw a liquor bottle sixty or seventy meters with ease. Tossing the stun grenade right next to the fleeing group was a piece of cake.","Bang!","Another flash of blinding white light illuminated the area.","Taking advantage of the enemy's disorientation, Yun Cheng and his men unleashed another barrage of suppressing fire. Once they had the upper hand, Yun Cheng lunged forward, kicked the gun out of the leader's hand, and pressed his own muzzle firmly against the man's forehead.","\"Nobody fucking move! Twitch and you're dead!\"","Staring down the dark barrel of the gun, Razor and his lackeys had no choice but to obediently put their hands on their heads and surrender.","From start to finish, the entire firefight had lasted less than two minutes.","Out of the eight ambushing gunmen, five were wounded and incapacitated, one kicked the bucket, and only two were lucky enough to escape unscathed. Now, all of them were completely under control.","Yun Cheng crouched down in front of Razor and demanded, \"Where is Zhao Weixiang?\"","Razor looked up. Seeing the top-tier tactical gear Yun Cheng and his men were sporting left a bitter taste in his mouth.","\"Are you guys... really from the Wanlong Syndicate?\"","Yun Cheng nodded. \"Yes!\"","With a mix of bitterness and envy, Razor muttered, \"Your boss treats you really well.\"","It was true!","One only had to look at their luxurious equipment to know. Who wouldn't be fiercely loyal to a boss like that?","\"The Eldest Miss naturally treats us well, there's no doubt about that!\"","Yun Cheng pressed again, \"Where is Zhao Weixiang? Tell me!\"","Razor shook his head. \"I don't know where the boss is either. He never tells us his location. He only gives us orders and tells us to meet up at a designated spot once the mission is done.\"","\"Where is the rendezvous point?\"","\"In the basement of 147 Grant Street...\"","Yun Cheng made a mental note of the address, then turned to instruct the rest of his team. \"Clean up the battlefield and tie up all the prisoners. Leave two men behind to keep an eye on them until the police arrive. The rest of you, follow me to Grant Street.\""]},{"number":699,"title":"Chapter 699: 699, It Was Me Who Leaked the Information.","paragraphs":["The battle over at the cannery was gradually drawing to a close.","Under the heavy suppressive fire of the police, the Snakehead Gang's resistance quickly collapsed. Most of them chose to surrender, while a few members who put up a stubborn fight were shot dead on the spot.","All eighteen hostages were rescued. Although they were frightened, there were no casualties.","The media reporters captured the shocking moments of the police breaking down the doors and heroically rescuing the hostages, and also recorded the pathetic sight of the Snakehead Gang members raising their hands in surrender.","Detective Davis, who led the team, became an instant hero—at least, that's what tonight's news headlines would say.","After the battle ended, Chu Yang withdrew from the battlefield and returned to Liu Yutong's side.","\"Miss, the cannery has been taken care of. The Snakehead Gang's boss, Wang Hai, was killed. The rest either surrendered or were captured, and all the hostages are safe and sound.\"","Liu Yutong gave a slight nod. \"What about Zhao Weixiang?\"","\"Brother Yun caught Zhao Weixiang's trusted lieutenant and got their gathering point out of him. Brother Yun has taken some men over there.\"","\"Tell Yun Cheng that if he doesn't find anything there, he should pull back,\" Liu Yutong said.","Chu Yang was taken aback. \"Do you mean the intel might be fake, Miss?\"","\"I don't know if it's fake or not, but I feel that if Zhao Weixiang knows things went south here, he definitely wouldn't go to that gathering point. He might not have even planned to go there from the very beginning.\"","Her guess was quickly proven right; Yun Cheng arrived there only to find it empty.","There were only two delirious junkies in the basement, with no trace of Zhao Weixiang at all.","..........","Los Angeles Port, Pier Seven.","An inconspicuous white speedboat was quietly moored on the water. Standing on the deck was a woman with a graceful figure, wearing a red dress.","The woman was none other than Hong Jiao.","Hearing footsteps from the shore, she turned her head and saw Zhao Weixiang walking toward her. A hint of a smile appeared on her face.","\"What took you so long? I thought you were caught by them.\"","Zhao Weixiang boarded the speedboat, casually threw his backpack onto the deck, and loosened his tie. \"They won't catch me that easily. Razor and those useless fools were just perfect for buying me some time.\"","Hong Jiao raised an eyebrow, turned, and walked into the cabin. She picked up a bottle of red wine and poured two glasses. \"You just abandoned them like that? They were your most loyal subordinates here in the States.\"","\"What use is loyalty? When they are no longer useful, they should be decisively discarded.\"","Zhao Weixiang took the wine glass and downed it in one gulp. \"Let me tell you, in this place, being soft-hearted is a dead end.\"","Hong Jiao didn't reply. She just took small sips of her wine, looking out at the pitch-black sea. The dim lighting in the cabin cast shadows on her face, leaving half of it in light and half in darkness, making her emotions unreadable.","The speedboat slowly pulled away from the pier, heading in the direction of other coastal cities.","Zhao Weixiang leaned back in his chair and closed his eyes, seemingly a bit tired.","Hong Jiao looked at him quietly and suddenly spoke up, \"You promised me that once we escaped to a safe place, we would find a small town where no one knows us and spend the rest of our lives there. Does that still count?\"","Zhao Weixiang opened his eyes and looked at the woman in front of him.","This woman had followed him for many years. She had taken knives for him, taken the blame for him, and had no less blood on her hands than he did.","He had indeed promised that when all this was over, he would take her far away, live incognito, but he had just never followed through.","After a few seconds of silence, he slowly spoke, \"In a few days. In a few days, we'll transfer to a larger ship and go to South America. No one knows us there. When the time comes, I'll buy a small estate facing the sea.\"","Hearing this, Hong Jiao nodded, the last glimmer of light in her eyes completely extinguishing.","She had heard this kind of excuse too many times.","She could no longer bring herself to believe him.","Little did she know, Zhao Weixiang was actually telling the truth this time. As long as that Mr. Jiang helped him secure a new identity and gave him enough money to squander for the rest of his life, he truly intended to live incognito and become an ordinary person.","After hustling for so many years, he was genuinely tired.","Zhao Weixiang stood up, walked behind Hong Jiao, reached out to wrap his arms around her waist, and rested his chin on her shoulder. \"You've worked hard all these years. Once we settle down, we'll get married, have a child, and live a good life.\"","Hong Jiao's body stiffened slightly for a moment, but quickly relaxed.","Then she turned her head and planted a gentle kiss on Zhao Weixiang's cheek.","\"Okay.\"","Zhao Weixiang smiled, let go of her, walked over to the simple cot in the cabin, and lay down. \"I'm going to sleep for a bit. Wake me when we get there.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Hong Jiao nodded, downed the rest of the red wine in her glass, and carefully steered the wheel, gradually slowing down the boat's speed.","Once Zhao Weixiang was truly fast asleep, she pulled a phone from her pocket and quickly typed a line of text on the keypad with her fingers.","[Pier Seven, heading south — Hong Jiao.]","After typing it out, she hesitated for a moment before pressing the send button.","Immediately after, she threw the phone straight into the sea.","Having done all this, Hong Jiao stared out at the pitch-black sea. A single tear slipped silently from the corner of her eye, carried away by the wind...","..........","Outside the cannery.","Liu Yutong was chatting with Detective Davis about the battle at the cannery.","\"The Snakehead Gang's boss, Wang Hai, resisted arrest and was killed. Three were shot dead, twelve were arrested, and nineteen captives were rescued. Three of them are injured but their lives are not in danger. Our police force sustained two minor injuries, and no one was killed.\"","Detective Davis breathed a sigh of relief and laughed. \"This might be our police force's most successful anti-gang operation in recent years. I must also thank you and your people for your support, Miss Liu!\"","\"It was the least we could do,\" Liu Yutong said.","When the topic reached this point, Chu Yang suddenly chimed in, \"Officer Davis, when are you going to give our Ten Thousand Dragons Association a pennant for our courageous deeds?\"","Davis was taken aback. \"A pennant? What's that?\"","Chu Yang explained, \"In our country, a pennant is a symbol of friendly cooperation between the police and the public. It reflects a spirit of harmonious co-governance and fearless bravery...\"","Detective Davis: \"...\"","\"That sounds quite nice. I can submit an application to my superiors.\"","\"Oh, well, thank you so much!\"","\"........\"","Liu Yutong was just about to speak when her phone suddenly vibrated.","She took a glance at the text message, put her phone away, and looked at Davis without a change in expression. \"Officer Davis, we have some other business to attend to, so we'll be taking our leave now. When we're in San Francisco, I'll treat you and your colleagues to a meal.\"","Davis nodded. \"Alright, thank you for your generosity, Miss Liu!\"","The moment Liu Yutong turned around, she said to Yun Cheng and Chu Yang, \"Immediately find a few speedboats and a helicopter. Zhao Weixiang is on a boat, leaving from Pier Seven and heading south. We can't let him get away.\"","Yun Cheng paused for a moment. \"Who provided this information? Is it reliable?\"","\"The information should be reliable. Hurry and find the boats,\" Liu Yutong said.","\"Understood!\"","The convoy roared toward the port.","On the way, Chu Yang couldn't help but ask, \"Miss, who sent that text message?\"","Liu Yutong thought for a moment and said, \"Probably someone who has given up all hope.\"","That was the only reason she could think of.","Otherwise, how could a woman like Hong Jiao betray Zhao Weixiang?","Chu Yang seemed to only half-understand, but he did not press the matter.","They chose not to notify the police for this operation, as they absolutely had to bring Zhao Weixiang back to their home country. If the local police caught him, they might not be able to take him away.","For one thing, there was no extradition treaty. For another, Zhao Weixiang had also broken the law locally in the US, so the authorities there would definitely prioritize trying him first, only deporting him after he had served his prison sentence.","That was why she decided to take action herself: to capture the man and bring him back home to stand trial.","Soon, fueled by the superpower of money, five speedboats and two helicopters were quickly deployed, launching a search across the waters south of Pier Seven.","By the time the helicopters spotted their target, the speedboat was already approaching the edge of international waters.","\"Vessel ahead, this is the Coast Guard! Stop your boat immediately for inspection! I repeat, stop your boat immediately for inspection!\"","The loudspeaker from the helicopter echoed across the surface of the sea. Their equipment did look a bit like SWAT gear, so they simply borrowed the title to force the other party to stop.","Of course, they shouted this in hopes that the target would not resist, because they needed to capture him alive.","Inside the cabin, Zhao Weixiang was jolted awake by the sirens.","When he looked up and saw the helicopters circling in the sky and the speedboats rapidly approaching his position, his face instantly turned incredibly dark.","\"What is going on? Why are the police after us?\"","Just then, Hong Jiao said calmly, \"I was the one who told them our location.\"","Zhao Weixiang: \"???\""]},{"number":700,"title":"Chapter 700: 700. Have the Gardenias Bloomed (Two-in-One) [Thanks to Xiao Chen Hen Hou Liao for the Grand Master Certification]","paragraphs":["\"What is going on? Why are the police chasing us?\" Zhao Weixiang's face changed drastically as he saw the pursuing helicopters and speedboats.","Hong Jiao stood beside him, her expression calm as she said, \"I leaked the information.\"","Zhao Weixiang snapped his gaze to her, grabbing her by the collar. With bloodshot eyes, he demanded, \"Why? Why?\"","Hong Jiao only said three words, \"I am tired.\"","After all these years and multiple escapes with absolutely no hope in sight, she just could not hold on anymore.","Hearing this, Zhao Weixiang froze. The anger on his face gradually turned into a smile, a smile full of irony, though whether directed at Hong Jiao or himself was unclear.","\"Good, very good!\" He turned and strode toward the back of the cabin.","Thinking he was going for a weapon, Hong Jiao subconsciously took a half-step back.","But what Zhao Weixiang opened was not a weapons case. It was a hidden compartment disguised as floorboards, containing a set of diving gear and a black waterproof backpack.","\"You...\" Hong Jiao obviously had not expected this man to be so calculating, actually having a backup plan.","If he jumped into the sea wearing diving gear in the dead of night, it would be impossible to find him.","However, to her surprise, Zhao Weixiang did not choose to put on the diving gear and leave alone. Instead, he threw the waterproof backpack and diving equipment in front of her. Without any explanation, he said directly, \"Two nautical miles ahead is an uninhabited reef island. Inside the backpack are a new identity, cash, and a satellite phone. When you get there, call the number I saved in it, and someone will pick you up.\"","Hong Jiao looked at him, then at the single set of equipment before her, suddenly feeling a deep sense of irony.","This man, who had never truly trusted anyone, was now giving her the only chance of survival. What was the meaning of this?","Seeing her dazed, Zhao Weixiang let out a soft chuckle and said, \"I just do not want to run anymore.\"","Then he grabbed the diving gear and shoved it into her arms. \"Put it on!\"","\"No! I won't!\"","\"Put it on!\"","\"Do you think surrendering will save your life? You have no less blood on your hands than I do; going in means the death penalty or life imprisonment! Hong Jiao, when you get to your new place, remember to live well.\"","Holding the heavy equipment, Hong Jiao's body trembled slightly. Only now was she truly certain that he was genuinely leaving the only way out for her.","She looked up at Zhao Weixiang again. This man she had followed for over a decade actually had a rare trace of sincerity in his eyes at this moment.","Maybe... this time he was sincere?","\"Hurry! Stop talking nonsense! Put it on and go!\" Zhao Weixiang urged. The speedboats were not far away now.","He grabbed her arm and dragged her to the side of the boat. \"I told you to go, so go! Remember, swim east, and whatever you do, do not look back!\"","Right at that moment.","Whoosh!","A blinding white light suddenly exploded above the speedboat, followed by a deafening blast!","A stun grenade!","Zhao Weixiang and Hong Jiao simultaneously felt their vision go completely white. Their ears rang incessantly, and they instantly lost their balance, falling onto the deck. Even the speedboat began to rock violently.","\"Drop your weapons! Put your hands on your heads! You are surrounded!\"","This time, the voice from the megaphone spoke in the Dragon Kingdom's language.","Zhao Weixiang struggled to look up. Through his blurred vision, he saw that three black speedboats had tightly surrounded them in a triangular formation. Standing on each speedboat were several figures dressed entirely in black, well-equipped, with the dark muzzles of their guns aimed directly at them.","Overhead, a helicopter hovered, its searchlight illuminating their speedboat as brightly as daylight.","These were actually all Liu Yutong's people!","Zhao Weixiang gave a miserable smile.","He was too familiar with her style: decisive, direct, and leaving no room for escape.","\"Hong Jiao...\"","Zhao Weixiang opened his mouth to say something, but found that Hong Jiao had already struggled to sit up on her own, her face bearing a sense of liberated calmness.","She looked at the men in black around them, then at Zhao Weixiang. \"I am not running anymore. We cannot escape.\"","Zhao Weixiang understood her words, and his tense body suddenly relaxed.","Yes! After running for so many years, he was tired. He had run enough.","Zhao Weixiang dropped the pistol he had just drawn and slowly raised his hands.","\"We surrender.\"","The men in black did not lower their guard. One of the speedboats slowly approached them. Then, three men in black agilely jumped onto the boat. One stood guard while the other two quickly stepped forward, cleanly and efficiently restraining Zhao Weixiang and Hong Jiao, and conducting a thorough search of them.","\"Clear!\" one of the men in black reported.","Soon, the speedboat carrying Liu Yutong also pulled alongside.","Under the escort of Yun Cheng and Chu Yang, she stepped onto the deck of the white speedboat.","Seeing this ridiculously young girl again, Zhao Weixiang still felt a bitter taste in his mouth. He felt he had worked hard enough, yet he could not even match up to a girl so much younger than him. Why? He really could not figure it out!","Liu Yutong first glanced at the two restrained individuals, then said to Hong Jiao, \"Thank you for the coordinates.\"","Hong Jiao raised her head and looked at the excessively young girl in front of her, the one who could completely defeat the man beside her. She suddenly smiled. \"Miss Liu, you really are very beautiful.\"","On the surface, it seemed she was praising Liu Yutong, but in reality, she envied her. She envied the fact that the other girl could live brightly and glamorously in the sunlight.","\"Bring them aboard and escort them back,\" Liu Yutong ordered.","The men in black escorted Zhao Weixiang and Hong Jiao, transferring them to the speedboat used by the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate.","The men in black on the surrounding speedboats also gradually relaxed their guard and began to return one by one.","Everyone was thrilled to have successfully captured a key figure like Zhao Weixiang this time.","Yun Cheng and the others knew very well just how cunning and cautious Zhao Weixiang was. The most important thing was that by capturing him, they could finally find out who murdered their former boss and the cause of Miss Gao Min's father's death, allowing them to avenge the young miss and the former boss!","However, just as they were escorting Zhao Weixiang ashore, an accident occurred.","Bang!","A sudden, jarring gunshot rang out from behind them!","It did not come from the direction of anyone in the Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate, but rather from the pitch-black sea to their side, where a small jet ski had approached them unnoticed.","The bullet's target was very clear: Zhao Weixiang!","\"Watch out!\"","Hong Jiao, who was closest to Zhao Weixiang, violently broke free from her captors the moment the gun went off and threw herself at Zhao Weixiang.","Thud!","Hong Jiao's body jerked violently as she collapsed onto Zhao Weixiang's back, and the two of them crashed heavily onto the hard concrete shore.","\"Ambush!\"","\"Three o'clock, jet ski!\"","\"Protect the young miss!\"","\"Return fire!\"","The Ten Thousand Dragons Syndicate reacted swiftly.","Almost simultaneous with the gunshot, Yun Cheng and Chu Yang roared the order to open fire.","The men in black instantly entered combat mode, aiming their muzzles at the suddenly appearing jet ski and unleashing a frantic barrage of bullets.","There was only a single, indistinct dark figure on the jet ski. Seeing the target fall, the figure did not hesitate for a second, immediately wrenching the steering and speeding away in flight.","Moreover, the jet ski was incredibly fast, clearly having been modified.","\"Chase him!\" Chu Yang was about to lead his men in pursuit.","\"Stop chasing, beware of a diversion!\" Liu Yutong stopped them, then quickly walked toward Zhao Weixiang and the woman who had fallen together.","Fortunately, Zhao Weixiang was unhurt. Unfortunately, a glaring patch of bright red had bloomed across Hong Jiao's chest.","The bullet had entered from her back and pierced straight through her chest.","\"A doctor! Get a doctor!\" Zhao Weixiang's eyes were bloodshot as he roared frantically at the men in black surrounding them.","He tried to cover the profusely bleeding wound with his hands, but he couldn't stop it. Warm blood quickly stained his palms red.","Hong Jiao's face rapidly lost its color, turning an ashen gray. Looking at Zhao Weixiang's anxious, contorted face, she forced a weak smile.","\"Stop yelling... It's no use...\"","\"Why the fuck did you jump in front of me! Who told you to do that!\"","Zhao Weixiang, a man who had always been cold-blooded, completely broke down in this moment. \"You hate me! Didn't you absolutely hate my guts! Why did you take this bullet for me!\"","\"Brother Xiang... do you remember... in Yangcheng, during the winter... you bought a dirty little beggar...\"","\"You bought me... a roujiamo, it was hot... That was the most delicious thing... I've ever eaten in my entire life.\"","Hong Jiao's lips curled upward with great effort, as if she could taste it all over again.","Zhao Weixiang's body was trembling.","\"You said... a girl as pretty as me... shouldn't have to suffer like that... You said... you could make big money, and asked me... if I was willing to go with you...\"","\"I said... yes.\"","As Hong Jiao said this, she coughed violently, bringing up bloody froth.","Seeing her like this, Zhao Weixiang tried to stop her. \"Stop talking, don't say another word. I'm taking you to the hospital right now! You have to hold on! Do you hear me!\"","However, Hong Jiao acted as if she hadn't heard him, continuing to speak at her own pace.","\"Do you know... why... why I agreed back then?\"","\"Because... the way you looked at me that day... was so earnest.\"","\"Later... I finally understood... you weren't just earnest with me... you were earnest about everything... Earnest when deceiving people, earnest when killing people... even earnest when running for your life...\"","\"Zhao Weixiang...\" Hong Jiao called out his name one last time. There was no resentment in her voice, only exhaustion. \"Living like this... aren't you tired...?\"","Zhao Weixiang's vision was completely blurred by tears, and he nodded heavily.","\"I am... so tired...\"","\"So this time, I'm telling the truth... I've thought it through, let's go somewhere no one can find us... buy a house with a yard, and I'll plant... plant gardenias everywhere for you. Isn't that your favorite scent? We...\"","As he spoke, his voice abruptly stopped.","Because he saw Hong Jiao's pupils beginning to dilate. Her fiery red lips moved slightly, producing a sound that was almost inaudible.","\"Have the gardenias... bloomed?\"","\"They've bloomed! They've bloomed! I'll take you there right now!\"","Zhao Weixiang tightly embraced Hong Jiao's gradually cooling body. Holding one of her hands, he said, \"We won't go to South America anymore, we'll go straight to Cancun. We'll go tomorrow—no, we'll go right now!\"","Unfortunately, Hong Jiao did not respond to him this time. The hand he was gripping so tightly finally slipped loose, drained of all its strength.","\"Ah!!!\"","Zhao Weixiang let out a harrowing, inhuman howl. He jerked his head up, his bloodshot eyes locking onto the direction where the motorboat had disappeared. The hatred and madness in his gaze made even the surrounding members of the Wanlong Syndicate shudder!","\"Jiang Yuan! Wu Kun! Fuck your ancestors!!!\"","He struggled to stand up, but was firmly pinned down by the men in black beside him.","Liu Yutong walked over, crouched down, and reached out to check Hong Jiao's carotid artery. She shook her head.","Then she looked up at Zhao Weixiang and asked, \"Do you know who sent the killer?\"","Zhao Weixiang turned his head, his crimson eyes glaring at Liu Yutong, his face twisted with monstrous hatred!","\"I know! Of course I know!\"","\"It's that old dog Jiang Yuan! And his white glove, Wu Kun! They're scared! They're afraid I'll spill all their dirty secrets! Hahaha... Trying to silence me? Keep dreaming!\"","His laughter was shrill and deranged.","\"Liu Yutong!\"","\"Didn't you want to know how your father died? Take me back, take me back alive! I'll tell you everything! The evidence I have, the lists I hold, all of Jiang Yuan's connections in the Dragon Kingdom and Hong Kong, and every dirty deed he's done—I'll tell you everything!\"","\"I just want them dead! I want Jiang Yuan and Wu Kun dead!!!\"","\"I need them to die!!!\"","After venting his rage, Zhao Weixiang looked down again at the woman lying quietly in his arms and wept. \"Why were you so foolish! You could have lived!\"","Liu Yutong stood up, watching the scene before her with mixed emotions.","The sudden appearance of the assassin, Hong Jiao taking the bullet for Zhao Weixiang... everything had happened in an instant, catching them completely off guard.","Jiang Yuan. She committed the name to memory.","\"Clean up the scene and take them with us.\"","\"Cover Hong Jiao with a jacket.\"","One of the men in black fetched a coat from the car and draped it over Hong Jiao.","Zhao Weixiang, now utterly dead inside, no longer struggled. He let the men in black pull him up and escort him to the waiting car. His eyes remained fixed on Hong Jiao's body the entire time, right up until he was put inside the vehicle and cut off from her completely.","After they got into the cars and left.","Even Yun Cheng and Chu Yang remained silent for a long time before finally asking, \"Miss, that assassin just now seemed like a top-tier professional.\"","Liu Yutong nodded. \"It seems Zhao Weixiang's capture is causing some people to lose sleep.\"","\"Jiang Yuan... I think I've heard that name before. He seems to be a major tycoon in Hong Kong,\" Yun Cheng said with a hint of uncertainty.","\"You remember correctly. That's him. He's quite a famous tycoon, said to have a status second only to the four major families of Hong Kong. He's a highly influential 'patriotic' businessman.\" When Liu Yutong said those last few words, her tone dripped with heavy sarcasm.","In her past life, she had heard of this wealthy tycoon Jiang Yuan. According to the original timeline, it would be another dozen years or so before he was finally brought to justice.","This man had always flown the banner of a patriotic businessman while investing everywhere. On the surface, he was funding construction projects, but in reality, he was frantically amassing wealth, swindling investors' money in every possible way, and later even becoming arrogant enough to fund certain rioters.","Eventually, his crimes were exposed, and he was thrown behind bars.","She hadn't expected that in this life, she would actually get the chance to go head-to-head with this guy.","Since that was the case, she would just have to announce ahead of schedule that his time was up!"]}]);
